window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df23"]={"id": "df23", "title": "数值积分、采样器与收敛阶", "focus": "分析 Euler、Heun、Runge–Kutta 与指数积分器的强/弱收敛阶；推导 DPM-Solver 的指数积分结构，给出步长选择与误差累积。", "claims": ["\\text{Euler 强阶 }1/2,\\ \\text{弱阶 }1", "\\text{Heun 强阶 }1,\\ \\text{弱阶 }2", "\\text{指数积分器：}x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int f}x_t+\\int e^{\\int f}g\\,dW"], "topics": ["Euler 方法", "Heun 方法", "Runge–Kutta", "强收敛阶", "弱收敛阶", "指数积分器", "DPM-Solver", "步长选择", "误差累积", "反例：大步长导致分布偏移", "自适应步长", "与少步生成的接口", "代码：Euler/Heun 采样", "代码：收敛阶的数值测量", "与一致性模型的接口", "本章推导链：数值误差的来源"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df23--h-Euler-方法\">Euler 方法<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-方法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接第二部开篇所建立的扩散生成框架。设时间区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。设状态空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>。给定一个概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 及其上的标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^m$</span> 值布朗运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t=\\sigma(W_s:s\\le t)$</span> 为自然 filtration，并假定其满足通常条件（右连续且完备）。</p>\n<p>考虑如下 Itô 随机微分方程（SDE）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t = f(X_t,t)\\,dt + g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,\\ t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n其中漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(x,t)=g(x,t)g(x,t)^\\top\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 为扩散矩阵。</p>\n<p>本节始终假定以下正则性条件成立，并在每个命题前重申所需子集：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)（Lipschitz 与线性增长）</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g&gt;0$</span>，使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|f(x,t)-f(y,t)|+|g(x,t)-g(y,t)|_{\\mathrm{F}}\\le L_f|x-y|,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f(x,t)|^2+|g(x,t)|_{\\mathrm{F}}^2\\le L_f^2(1+|x|^2)$</span>。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\cdot|_{\\mathrm{F}}$</span> 为 Frobenius 范数。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)（初值矩）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H2) 下，SDE 存在唯一强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>（标准结果，证明略，仅作为本节后续估计的出发点）。</p>\n<p><strong>数值格式的定义。</strong> 取步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,1,\\dots,N$</span>。Euler–Maruyama 格式（简称 Euler 格式）定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n+f(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\,\\Delta+g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\,\\Delta W_n,\\qquad X^{\\Delta}_0=x_0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n=W_{t_{n+1}}-W_{t_n}\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Delta I_m)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Delta W_n\\}_{n=0}^{N-1}$</span> 相互独立。记连续插值过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X^{\\Delta}_t$</span> 为分段常值（左连续）：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_n,t_{n+1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X^{\\Delta}_t=X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> Euler 格式是 Itô 型离散化：增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n$</span> 使用左端点值，这与 Stratonovich 型（使用中点值）不同；本节所有强收敛阶结论均针对 Itô 解。此外，Euler 格式不是概率流 ODE 的数值积分器：后者是确定性 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v(x,t)$</span>，其 Euler 离散为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=x_n+v(x_n,t_n)\\Delta$</span>，不含布朗增量；两者漂移项含义不同，不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-格式的一步误差恒等式\">Euler 格式的一步误差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-格式的一步误差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.1.1（一步强误差分解）— 假设 (H1)(H2) — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 SDE 强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 为 Euler 迭代。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_n,t_{n+1}]$</span> 上，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 为初值的 SDE 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{n}_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^n_{t_n}=X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>）满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^n_{t_{n+1}}=X^{\\Delta}_n+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}f(X^n_s,s)\\,ds+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}g(X^n_s,s)\\,dW_s .$$</div>\nEuler 一步为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n+f(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta+g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n .$$</div>\n两式相减得局部截断误差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^n_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\big[f(X^n_s,s)-f(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\big]ds+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\big[g(X^n_s,s)-g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\big]dW_s .$$</div>\n此恒等式为后续强、弱阶分析的出发点：漂移项的误差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 量级的路径积分，扩散项的误差是 Itô 积分，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span> 量级——这正是强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 连续且 Lipschitz，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^n$</span> 存在唯一；上述积分方程由 Itô 公式直接得到。相减为代数运算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强收敛阶-1-2-的陈述与证明\">强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的陈述与证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强收敛阶-1-2-的陈述与证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 23.1.2（强收敛阶）。</strong> 称数值格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X^{\\Delta}_n\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 意义下具有强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;0$</span>，若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>）使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{n\\le N}\\big(\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C\\,\\Delta^{\\gamma}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定理 23.1.3（Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）— 假设 (H1)(H2) — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H2) 下，Euler 格式满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{n\\le N}\\big(\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C\\,\\Delta^{1/2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L_f,T,\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^2)$</span>。即强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）。</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n=\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2$</span>。由命题 23.1.1 的分解，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}$</span> 写成三项之和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=\\big(X_{t_{n+1}}-X^n_{t_{n+1}}\\big)+\\big(X^n_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}\\big).$$</div>\n第一项是“同一初值下真解与 Euler 一步的差”，第二项是“真解从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 出发与从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 出发的差”。对第二项用 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性与 Gronwall 引理（离散形式），可得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}|X^n_{t_{n+1}}-X_{t_{n+1}}|^2\\le C_1\\Delta\\,\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2 .$$</div>\n对第一项，由命题 23.1.1 的恒等式，用 Itô 等距与 Lipschitz 性：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big|\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\big[g(X^n_s,s)-g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\big]dW_s\\Big|^2\n=\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\mathbb{E}\\big|g(X^n_s,s)-g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\big|_{\\mathrm{F}}^2\\,ds\n\\le L_f^2\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\mathbb{E}|X^n_s-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\,ds .$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X^n_s-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\le C_2(s-t_n)$</span>（由 (H1) 与矩有界性），故扩散项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_3\\Delta^2$</span>。漂移项贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{n+1}\\le (1+C_4\\Delta)e_n+C_5\\Delta^2 .$$</div>\n离散 Gronwall 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N\\le C_6\\Delta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_n e_n^{1/2}\\le C\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 强阶不能提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：扩散项的一步误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 量级，这是 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g\\,dW$</span> 的二次变差所致；若改用 Stratonovich 解释或加入 Lévy 区域修正，则另当别论，但本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱收敛阶-1-的陈述与证明思路\">弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的陈述与证明思路<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱收敛阶-1-的陈述与证明思路\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 23.1.4（弱收敛阶）。</strong> 称格式具有弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span>，若对任意多项式增长的光滑检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varphi(x)|\\le C(1+|x|^p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\varphi|,|\\nabla^2\\varphi|$</span> 同阶增长），存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{n\\le N}\\big|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_{t_n})-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_n)\\big|\\le C\\,\\Delta^{\\beta}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定理 23.1.5（Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）— 假设 (H1)(H2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^4$</span> 具多项式增长 — 证明思路。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H2) 下，对上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，Euler 格式满足弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（关键等式）。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 处作 Taylor 展开至二阶，并取条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\cdot\\mid\\mathcal{F}_{t_n}]$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})\\mid X^{\\Delta}_n=x\\big]\n=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi=f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(a\\nabla^2\\varphi)$</span> 为生成元。这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n\\Delta W_n^\\top]=\\Delta I_m$</span>，交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_n}$</span> 独立而消失。另一方面，对真解用 Itô 公式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X_{t_n}=x\\big]=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+O(\\Delta^2).$$</div>\n两式相减，一步弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>；沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 步累积并用 Gronwall，得总弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 弱阶高于强阶是普遍现象：弱误差只要求分布层面的一阶矩匹配，不要求路径层面接近。弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的完整证明需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 余项的一致有界性作逐项估计，此处给出的是可检验的主项结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-线性-SDE-上的阶数验证\">具体例子：线性 SDE 上的阶数验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-线性-SDE-上的阶数验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 23.1.6（Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 型）— 假设 (H1)(H2) 成立 — 验证。</strong></p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。真解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\sigma\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t^2=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>。Euler 迭代为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=(1-\\theta\\Delta)X^{\\Delta}_n+\\sigma\\Delta W_n$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2=\\sigma^2\\Delta\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2k}\n=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\theta}\\cdot\\frac{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2n}}{2-\\theta\\Delta}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta=t$</span> 固定，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2n}\\to e^{-2\\theta t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2-\\theta\\Delta\\to2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2\\to\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})=\\mathbb{E}X_t^2$</span>。误差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，与弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 一致。强误差方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2$</span> 的主项来自扩散离散化，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，与强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Euler–Maruyama 格式以左端点系数离散 Itô SDE，其一歩误差分解为漂移积分误差与 Itô 积分误差，后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 量级，构成强阶上界。</li>\n<li>在漂移与扩散均 Lipschitz、初值二阶矩有限的假设下，Euler 格式的强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，弱收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；线性 SDE 例子给出与理论一致的数值斜率。</li>\n<li>Euler 格式与概率流 ODE 的确定性 Euler 离散在漂移语义上不同：前者离散 Itô SDE，后者离散 ODE；本节结论仅适用于前者，后续 Heun、Runge–Kutta 与指数积分器将在此基础上提升阶数。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-格式的离散-Gronwall-引理与误差递推\">Euler 格式的离散 Gronwall 引理与误差递推<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-格式的离散-Gronwall-引理与误差递推\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节将一步误差拆为漂移积分误差与 Itô 积分误差，并断言二者合并后满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{n+1}\\le(1+C\\Delta)e_n+C'\\Delta^2$</span>。此处把该递推的每一步显式写出，并给出离散 Gronwall 的完整证明，因为后续 Heun 与 Runge–Kutta 的误差分析将反复调用同一工具。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 23.1.7（离散 Gronwall）— 假设：仅需实数序列非负 — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>设非负实数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}_{n=0}^{N}$</span> 与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A,B\\ge0$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_{n+1}\\le(1+A\\Delta)u_n+B\\Delta^2,\\qquad n=0,\\dots,N-1,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_n\\le e^{A n\\Delta}u_0+\\frac{B\\Delta}{A}\\big(e^{A n\\Delta}-1\\big),\\qquad n=0,\\dots,N.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_n=u_n/(1+A\\Delta)^n$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{n+1}\\le v_n+\\frac{B\\Delta^2}{(1+A\\Delta)^{n+1}}.$$</div>\n累加得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_n\\le v_0+B\\Delta^2\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\frac{1}{(1+A\\Delta)^{k+1}}.$$</div>\n几何级数求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(1+A\\Delta)^{-(k+1)}=\\frac{1-(1+A\\Delta)^{-n}}{A\\Delta}$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_n\\le v_0+\\frac{B\\Delta}{A}\\big(1-(1+A\\Delta)^{-n}\\big).$$</div>\n乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+A\\Delta)^n$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+A\\Delta)^n\\le e^{An\\Delta}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1+A\\Delta)^{-n}\\le 1$</span>，得所述上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.1.8（Euler 强误差的显式上界）— 假设 (H1)(H2) — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H2) 下，存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,T,\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^2$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{n\\le N}\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\le C\\Delta .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 23.1.1 的分解，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n=\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}$</span> 写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=\\underbrace{(X_{t_{n+1}}-X^n_{t_{n+1}})}_{(\\mathrm{I})}+\\underbrace{(X^n_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})}_{(\\mathrm{II})},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^n$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 为初值的 SDE 解。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{II})$</span>，由 (H1) 与 Itô 等距，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}|(\\mathrm{II})|^2\\le 2L_f^2\\Delta\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\mathbb{E}|X^n_s-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\,ds+2L_f^2\\Delta^2\\mathbb{E}|X^{\\Delta}_n|^2 .$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X^n_s-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\le C_1(s-t_n)$</span>（由 (H1) 与矩有界），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X^{\\Delta}_n|^2\\le C_2$</span>（对 Euler 迭代用同一 Gronwall 估计），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|(\\mathrm{II})|^2\\le C_3\\Delta^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{I})$</span>，用 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性与标准 SDE 稳定性估计（两解初值差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}|(\\mathrm{I})|^2\\le C_4\\Delta\\,\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^2 .$$</div>\n合并：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{n+1}\\le(1+C_4\\Delta)e_n+C_3\\Delta^2$</span>。由引理 23.1.7，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=C_4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=C_3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_0=0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n\\le\\frac{C_3\\Delta}{C_4}(e^{C_4T}-1)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n\\le C\\Delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（为何强阶不能是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。</strong> 上述证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{II})$</span> 的扩散项贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span>，看似可提升；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{I})$</span> 中的 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(g(X^n_s,s)-g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n))\\,dW_s$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathbb{E}|g(X^n_s,s)-g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)|^2\\,ds$</span>，其中被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s-t_n$</span> 上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(s-t_n)$</span>，积分后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>——这一步并未损失阶数。真正的损失来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{II})$</span> 中漂移项与扩散项的交叉项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\langle\\int f\\,ds,\\int g\\,dW\\rangle$</span> 不为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^n_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 相关，其量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{II})$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}\\cdot\\Delta=\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>，平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^3$</span>——仍不损失。损失实际发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{I})$</span> 的稳定性估计中：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 的差在扩散项上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(g(X^n_s,s)-g(X_{t_n},t_n))\\,dW_s$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 的差通过 Lipschitz 常数放大后，每步放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+C\\Delta)$</span> 累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{CT}$</span>，而每步新增的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 项累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta^2=T\\Delta$</span>，故总误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，开方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。这是 Itô 积分二次变差的结构性后果，不是估计粗糙所致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-格式的-Markov-性与转移核\">Euler 格式的 Markov 性与转移核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-格式的-Markov-性与转移核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Euler 迭代定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的 Markov 链，其转移核是后续弱收敛分析与分布偏移反例的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.1.9（Euler 转移核）。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N-1$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{\\Delta}_n(x,\\cdot)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的概率测度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q^{\\Delta}_n(x,B)=\\mathbb{P}\\big(x+f(x,t_n)\\Delta+g(x,t_n)\\Delta W_n\\in B\\big),\\qquad B\\in\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d).$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{\\Delta}_n(x,\\cdot)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x+f(x,t_n)\\Delta,\\ \\Delta\\,a(x,t_n)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=gg^\\top$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.1.10（Euler 链的 Markov 性）— 假设 (H1) — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X^{\\Delta}_n\\}_{n=0}^N$</span> 关于 filtration <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{G}_n=\\sigma(\\Delta W_0,\\dots,\\Delta W_{n-1})$</span> 是 Markov 链，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})\\mid\\mathcal{G}_n\\big]=(Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi)(X^{\\Delta}_n),\\qquad (Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi)(x)=\\int\\varphi(y)\\,Q^{\\Delta}_n(x,dy).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=\\Phi_n(X^{\\Delta}_n,\\Delta W_n)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_n(x,w)=x+f(x,t_n)\\Delta+g(x,t_n)w$</span> 为 Borel 可测。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{G}_n$</span> 独立，故条件期望只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>，即 Markov 性。转移核的显式形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Delta I_m)$</span> 与线性变换给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.1.11（弱误差的算子表述）— 假设 (H1)(H2) — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>对多项式增长的光滑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t_{n+1},t_n}$</span> 为 SDE 的真转移算子（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(x)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X_{t_n}=x]$</span>）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}\\big[(Q^{\\Delta}_n-P_{t_{n+1},t_n})\\varphi\\big](X^{\\Delta}_n)+\\text{（初值项）},$$</div>\n当初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_0=X_0=x_0$</span> 时初值项为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 望远镜求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\Big(\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})\\Big)$$</div>\n不直接可用，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}$</span> 初值不同。改用条件期望：由 Markov 性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})=\\mathbb{E}\\big[(Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi)(X^{\\Delta}_n)\\big],\\qquad\n\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})=\\mathbb{E}\\big[(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(X_{t_n})\\big].$$</div>\n但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}\\neq X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>，故需插入中间项：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 为初值的真解，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})=\\mathbb{E}\\big[(Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi)(X^{\\Delta}_n)-(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(X^{\\Delta}_n)\\big]+\\mathbb{E}\\big[(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(X^{\\Delta}_n)-(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(X_{t_n})\\big].$$</div>\n第一项即所述算子差；第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X^{\\Delta}_n-X_{t_n}|$</span> 控制，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，求和后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>——这解释了为何弱误差分析必须同时控制算子差与路径差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-一个可检验的恒等式-Euler-格式的矩递推\">一个可检验的恒等式：Euler 格式的矩递推<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-一个可检验的恒等式-Euler-格式的矩递推\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对线性 SDE，Euler 格式的二阶矩满足精确递推，可作为代码中弱误差测量的理论基准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.1.12（线性 SDE 的矩递推）— 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=Ax$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=G$</span> 为常矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span> — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>Euler 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=(I+A\\Delta)X^{\\Delta}_n+G\\Delta W_n$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})^\\top\\big]=(I+A\\Delta)\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[X^{\\Delta}_n(X^{\\Delta}_n)^\\top\\big]\\,(I+A\\Delta)^\\top+\\Delta\\,GG^\\top .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})^\\top=(I+A\\Delta)X^{\\Delta}_n(X^{\\Delta}_n)^\\top(I+A\\Delta)^\\top+(I+A\\Delta)X^{\\Delta}_n(G\\Delta W_n)^\\top+G\\Delta W_n(X^{\\Delta}_n)^\\top(I+A\\Delta)^\\top+G\\Delta W_n(G\\Delta W_n)^\\top .$$</div>\n取期望，交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span> 独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\Delta W_n=0$</span> 而消失；末项期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n\\Delta W_n^\\top]\\,G^\\top=\\Delta\\,GG^\\top$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.1.13（标量情形与弱阶验证）— 假设同上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=-\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\sigma$</span> — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>标量情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_n=\\mathbb{E}(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{n+1}=(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2v_n+\\sigma^2\\Delta$</span>，解得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_n=\\sigma^2\\Delta\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2k}=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\theta}\\cdot\\frac{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2n}}{2-\\theta\\Delta}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\Delta=t$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_n\\to\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，与真解二阶矩一致；误差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，即弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与强阶的对照）。</strong> 同一格式在同一 SDE 上，矩（弱）误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，而路径（强）误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。这一差距不是估计技巧问题：强误差要求逐路径接近，而布朗路径的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[W]_t=t$</span> 在离散化后变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum(\\Delta W_n)^2$</span>，其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span> 量级（由布朗运动的鞅中心极限定理），任何使用左端点系数的格式都无法消除这一路径级偏差。弱误差只要求分布的一阶矩匹配，二次变差的偏差在期望下被平均掉，故阶数提升。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-本节推导链的接口\">本节推导链的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-本节推导链的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的三个对象——一步误差恒等式（命题 23.1.1）、离散 Gronwall（引理 23.1.7）、Euler 转移核（定义 23.1.9）——构成后续各节的公共接口：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Heun 方法</strong>将用一步误差恒等式分析预测–校正结构，其强阶提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的关键在于用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)+g(\\tilde X_{n+1},t_{n+1}))\\Delta W_n$</span> 替代左端点扩散系数，从而把 Itô 积分的左端点偏差降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>；</li>\n<li><strong>Runge–Kutta</strong> 将把转移核的构造推广为多级复合，弱阶分析仍走推论 23.1.11 的算子差路线；</li>\n<li><strong>指数积分器</strong>将把线性部分的精确流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A\\Delta}$</span> 嵌入格式，其误差递推仍由引理 23.1.7 控制，但常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>；</li>\n<li><strong>误差累积</strong>与<strong>大步长反例</strong>将用推论 23.1.11 的望远镜和说明：算子差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[(Q^{\\Delta}_n-P_{t_{n+1},t_n})\\varphi](X^{\\Delta}_n)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 大时不再是小量，分布偏移由此产生。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不展开上述接口的具体推导，仅在此标明符号与结论的衔接点，以保证后续各节不重复引入记号。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-格式的-L-p-强误差与矩稳定性\">Euler 格式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 强误差与矩稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-格式的-L-p-强误差与矩稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下证明了强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。生成动力学中常需对高阶矩作控制（例如得分匹配损失中的加权期望），故本节补足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 版本。为此需在 (H1)(H2) 之外追加一条假设。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶初值矩）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^p&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H3) 下，SDE 强解满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^p]&lt;\\infty$</span>，Euler 迭代亦满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{n\\le N}\\mathbb{E}|X^{\\Delta}_n|^p\\le C_p$</span>（对 Euler 迭代用离散 Gronwall 与 Burkholder–Davis–Gundy 不等式，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_p$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,T,p,\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^p$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.1.14（Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）— 假设 (H1)(H3) — 证明思路。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H3) 下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L_f,T,p,\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^p)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{n\\le N}\\big(\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^p\\big)^{1/p}\\le C\\,\\Delta^{1/2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（关键不等式）。</strong> 沿用推论 23.1.8 的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}-X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=(\\mathrm{I})+(\\mathrm{II})$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{II})$</span> 用 Burkholder–Davis–Gundy 不等式替代 Itô 等距：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big|\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}h_s\\,dW_s\\Big|^p\\le C_p\\,\\mathbb{E}\\Big(\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}|h_s|_{\\mathrm{F}}^2\\,ds\\Big)^{p/2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_s=g(X^n_s,s)-g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)$</span>。由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|h_s|_{\\mathrm{F}}\\le L_f|X^n_s-X^{\\Delta}_n|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X^n_s-X^{\\Delta}_n|^p\\le C(s-t_n)^{p/2}$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶矩用同一 Gronwall），故右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{p/2})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|(\\mathrm{II})|^p=O(\\Delta^{p/2})$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{I})$</span>，用 SDE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 稳定性估计得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|(\\mathrm{I})|^p\\le C\\Delta^{p/2}\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^p$</span>。合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_{n+1}\\le(1+C\\Delta)u_n+C'\\Delta^{p/2},\\qquad u_n=\\mathbb{E}|X_{t_n}-X^{\\Delta}_n|^p .$$</div>\n离散 Gronwall（引理 23.1.7 对任意幂次成立，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{p/2}$</span>）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_n\\le C''\\Delta^{p/2-1}\\cdot\\Delta=C''\\Delta^{p/2}$</span>，开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 次方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶矩的代价）。</strong> 阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=1/2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关，但常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 增长（经 BDG 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_p$</span> 与 Gronwall 指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{C_pT}$</span>）。在生成模型中，若损失函数对样本作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 次幂加权，则采样误差的方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 放大，这是大步长下重尾分布偏移的定量来源之一，具体反例留待第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-格式的局部截断误差与全局误差的关系\">Euler 格式的局部截断误差与全局误差的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-格式的局部截断误差与全局误差的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>强、弱阶的证明均依赖“局部误差累积为全局误差”的机制。此处把该机制写成一条独立命题，以便后续 Heun 与 Runge–Kutta 节直接引用而不重复推导。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.1.15（局部弱误差）。</strong> 对光滑检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，定义 Euler 在网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 处的局部弱误差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_n(\\varphi,x)=\\big(Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi\\big)(x)-\\big(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi\\big)(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.1.16（局部弱误差的阶）— 假设 (H1) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^4$</span> 具多项式增长 — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1) 下，对上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L_f,\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4})$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d}|\\tau_n(\\varphi,x)|\\le C\\,\\Delta^2,\\qquad n=0,\\dots,N-1 .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=gg^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi=f\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(a\\nabla^2\\varphi)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处展开：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Delta I_m)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(Q^{\\Delta}_n\\varphi\\big)(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(x+f(x,t_n)\\Delta+g(x,t_n)\\Delta W_n)\\big]\n=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\,\\mathcal{R}_1(x),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_1$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的三、四阶导数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数界定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{R}_1|\\le C_1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi$</span>，由 Itô 公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi\\big)(x)=\\varphi(x)+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\mathbb{E}\\big[(\\mathcal{L}\\varphi)(X_s)\\mid X_{t_n}=x\\big]\\,ds\n=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\,\\mathcal{R}_2(x),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi$</span> 的时间导数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi$</span> 界定（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(X_s)$</span> 再用一次 Itô 公式），<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{R}_2|\\le C_2$</span>。两式相减，一阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathcal{L}\\varphi$</span> 抵消，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_n|\\le\\tfrac12\\Delta^2(C_1+C_2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.1.17（全局弱误差的累积）— 假设 (H1)(H2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^4$</span> — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1)(H2) 下，Euler 的全局弱误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)\\big|\\le C\\,\\Delta,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,T,\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^2,\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由推论 23.1.11 的望远镜和，全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}[\\tau_n(\\varphi,X^{\\Delta}_n)]$</span> 加上路径差项。由命题 23.1.16，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_n|\\le C\\Delta^2$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C T\\Delta$</span>。路径差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(X^{\\Delta}_n)-(P_{t_{n+1},t_n}\\varphi)(X_{t_n})]$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X^{\\Delta}_n-X_{t_n}|\\le C\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 控制，每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>——这看似破坏弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。但路径差项在望远镜和中实际以差分形式出现：相邻两项的路径差部分相消，净贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（这是弱误差分析中“算子差与路径差不可分离相加”的技术要点，完整逐项估计需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的梯度沿路径作 Itô–Taylor 展开）。此处给出的是主项结构；严格证明中路径差项与局部误差项同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（局部阶与全局阶的错位）。</strong> 局部弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，全局弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 步累积的必然结果。强误差的局部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（开方后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>），全局亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>——强误差的局部与全局同阶，因为每步误差独立累积时方差相加、标准差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{N}$</span> 增长，恰与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 的局部标准差匹配。这一“局部阶 = 全局阶”的现象是强收敛特有的，后续 Heun 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 正来自把局部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-一个具体算例-局部弱误差的显式计算\">一个具体算例：局部弱误差的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-一个具体算例-局部弱误差的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 23.1.18（局部弱误差的精确值）— 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> — 验证。</strong></p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span>。真转移算子：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为初值的 OU 解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 时刻的二阶矩为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(P_{t+\\Delta,t}\\varphi\\big)(x)=e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}x^2+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}\\big(1-e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}\\big).$$</div>\nEuler 转移核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{\\Delta}\\varphi(x)=\\mathbb{E}[(x-\\theta x\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W)^2]=(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2x^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta$</span>。故局部弱误差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau(\\varphi,x)=\\big[(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2-e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}\\big]x^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta-\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}\\big(1-e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}\\big).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 作 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2=1-2\\theta\\Delta+\\theta^2\\Delta^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}=1-2\\theta\\Delta+2\\theta^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^2$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\theta^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。常数项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\Delta-\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(2\\theta\\Delta-2\\theta^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3))=\\sigma^2\\theta\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau(\\varphi,x)=\\big(\\sigma^2\\theta-\\theta^2x^2\\big)\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3),$$</div>\n即局部弱误差确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，且其主项系数显式可算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注。</strong> 该算例同时验证了命题 23.1.16 的阶数与推论 23.1.13 的全局矩误差：全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[\\tau(\\varphi,X^{\\Delta}_n)]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\sigma^2\\theta-\\theta^2(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2]$</span> 在稳态附近为常数，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-格式在得分动力学中的语义边界\">Euler 格式在得分动力学中的语义边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-格式在得分动力学中的语义边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节结论用于扩散生成时，须明确 Euler 离散的是哪一类 SDE，以及哪些量不可由 Euler 路径直接替代。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.1.19（反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的 Euler 离散）。</strong> 设前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)dt+g(t)dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，反向时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反向 SDE</strong> 的 Euler 离散（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为前进方向）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n+\\big[f(X^{\\Delta}_n,T-\\tau_n)-g(T-\\tau_n)^2\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau_n}(X^{\\Delta}_n)\\big]\\Delta+g(T-\\tau_n)\\Delta W_n,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 为反向时间轴上的布朗增量。</li>\n<li><strong>概率流 ODE</strong> 的 Euler 离散为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}=x_n+\\big[f(x_n,T-\\tau_n)-\\tfrac12 g(T-\\tau_n)^2\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau_n}(x_n)\\big]\\Delta,$$</div>\n不含布朗项，漂移系数为反向 SDE 漂移减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla\\log p$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>命题 23.1.20（两者不可混用）— 假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化，得分函数存在 — 证明。</strong></p>\n<p>反向 SDE 的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{\\mathrm{SDE}}=f-g^2\\nabla\\log p$</span> 与概率流 ODE 的速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{ODE}}=f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla\\log p$</span> 一般不相等；仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 时两者相同（此时均为确定性 ODE）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 直接比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{\\mathrm{SDE}}-v_{\\mathrm{ODE}}=-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla\\log p$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p\\neq0$</span>，则差非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（Euler 阶数结论的适用范围）。</strong> 定理 23.1.3 与 23.1.5 针对 Itô SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=fdt+gdW$</span> 的 Euler 离散，适用于反向 SDE 的采样器分析。概率流 ODE 的 Euler 离散是确定性 ODE 的数值积分，其误差分析属经典数值分析（全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，无强/弱阶之分），不可套用本节强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的结论。将反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混同、进而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶归因于 ODE 积分器，是语义错误；本节明确划界：强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 源于 Itô 积分的二次变差，与 ODE 无关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-Heun-方法\">Heun 方法<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Heun-方法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span>。前向 SDE 写作</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span> 为扩散矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},(\\mathcal{F}_t),\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤过概率空间。Euler 近似记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{E}}_k$</span>，满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{E}}_{k+1}=X^{\\mathrm{E}}_k+f(X^{\\mathrm{E}}_k,t_k)\\Delta+g(X^{\\mathrm{E}}_k,t_k)\\Delta W_k,\\qquad \\Delta W_k:=W_{t_{k+1}}-W_{t_k}.$$</div>\n<p>本节引入 Heun 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k$</span> 与两个辅助量：预测点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{k+1}$</span> 与增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{G}_k:=\\sigma(W_s:s\\le t_k)$</span>。为避免与 Euler 节符号冲突，本节所有 Heun 量带上标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{H}$</span>，预测量带上划线。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(H1) 漂移正则性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>；关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}|f(0,t)|\\le K_f$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f(x,t)|\\le K_f+L_f|x|$</span>，线性增长。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2) 扩散正则性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g$</span>；关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|g(0,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le K_g$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g(x,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le K_g+L_g|x|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3) 矩可积性.</strong> 初值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。在 (H1)(H2) 下，Euler 与 Heun 迭代的偶数阶矩在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le N$</span> 上一致有界，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_p$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{k}\\mathbb{E}|X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k|^{2p}\\le C_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1,2$</span>。该性质由线性增长与 Gronwall 引理得到，本节直接引用第 1 节已证的 Euler 矩界并对其预测步作同样估计。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4) 增量独立性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{G}_k$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k\\sim N(0,\\Delta I_m)$</span>，且不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的增量相互独立。这是布朗运动的标准性质，无需额外假设，列出以备引用。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.2.1（Heun 方法 / 显式梯形法）.</strong> 给定初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_0=x_0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N-1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar X_{k+1}=X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+f(X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k,t_k)\\Delta+g(X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k,t_k)\\Delta W_k,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}=X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+\\tfrac12\\bigl(f(X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k,t_k)+f(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})\\bigr)\\Delta+\\tfrac12\\bigl(g(X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k,t_k)+g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})\\bigr)\\Delta W_k.$$</div>\n<p>与 Euler 方法的区别在于：Euler 只用左端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f,g)$</span> 取值，Heun 用左端点与预测右端点的平均。与确定性梯形法（隐式）的区别在于：右端点值由一次显式预测给出，不需求解隐式方程，故 Heun 是显式两阶段方法，每步计算两次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与两次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，但只消耗一份 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>。这一点对 SDE 至关重要：若两阶段各用独立增量，则方法不再是原 SDE 的相容离散，而会引入额外方差。Heun 复用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>，保持与 Itô 积分的相容性。</p>\n<p>下面给出本节主定理：Heun 方法的强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，并在证明中逐步写出关键等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 23.2.2（Heun 强收敛阶）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(T,L_f,L_g,K_f,K_g,C_2)$</span>，使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\in(0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N}\\Bigl(\\mathbb{E}\\bigl|X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k-X_{t_k}\\bigr|^2\\Bigr)^{1/2}\\le C\\,\\Delta.$$</div>\n<p>即 Heun 方法强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 证明分三步：局部截断误差、离散 Gronwall、连续性修正。</p>\n<p><em>第一步：局部误差.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k:=X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k-X_{t_k}$</span>。由 SDE 积分形式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{k+1}}=X_{t_k}+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}f(X_s,s)\\,ds+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_s,s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处展开：由 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性与 Itô 等距，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl|\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\bigl(f(X_s,s)-f(X_{t_k},t_k)\\bigr)ds\\Bigr|^2\\le \\Delta^2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{s\\in[t_k,t_{k+1}]}|f(X_s,s)-f(X_{t_k},t_k)|^2.$$</div>\n<p>由 (H1) 与布朗运动的 Hölder 连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{s}|X_s-X_{t_k}|^2\\le C\\Delta$</span>（标准估计，由 (H1)(H2) 的线性增长与 Gronwall 得到）。故漂移项的一阶展开误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 均方，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|\\cdot|^2=O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。</p>\n<p>对扩散项，用 Itô–Taylor 展开到一阶：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k:=g(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Fréchet 导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span> 处的取值（由 (H2) Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 几乎处处可微，且导数有界）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s=g_k\\Delta W_k+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\bigl(g(X_s,s)-g_k\\bigr)dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_s,s)-g_k=\\int_{t_k}^s \\mathcal{L}g\\,du+\\int_{t_k}^s g'_k g\\,dW_u+o(\\Delta)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 为 Itô 生成元。代入并用 Itô 等距，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl|\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\bigl(g(X_s,s)-g_k\\bigr)dW_s-\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k\\bigl((\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta\\bigr)\\Bigr|^2=O(\\Delta^3).$$</div>\n<p>此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(\\Delta W_k)^4=3\\Delta^2$</span> 与增量独立性 (H4)。关键点：Heun 的两阶段平均恰好复现了 Itô–Taylor 展开中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k((\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta)$</span> 这一项。具体验证：预测点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{k+1}=X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+f_k\\Delta+g_k\\Delta W_k$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})-g_k=g'_k\\bigl(f_k\\Delta+g_k\\Delta W_k\\bigr)+O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12\\bigl(g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})-g_k\\bigr)\\Delta W_k=\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k(\\Delta W_k)^2+\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k+O(\\Delta^{5/2}).$$</div>\n<p>而 Euler 的扩散项只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k\\Delta W_k$</span>，缺少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k((\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta)$</span> 项，这正是 Euler 强阶仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的根源。Heun 通过平均补上了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 部分，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span> 项仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 均方，需在下一步与漂移项合并处理。</p>\n<p>综合漂移与扩散，局部误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\bigl|X_{t_{k+1}}-X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}\\bigr|^2\\le C\\Delta^3.$$</div>\n<p><em>第二步：离散 Gronwall.</em> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{k+1}$</span> 分解为局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k$</span> 与传播项。由 (H1)(H2) 的 Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|e_{k+1}|\\le |e_k|+L_f\\Delta|e_k|+L_f\\Delta|\\bar X_{k+1}-X_{t_{k+1}}|+L_g\\|\\Delta W_k\\||e_k|+L_g\\|\\Delta W_k\\||\\bar X_{k+1}-X_{t_{k+1}}|+|\\eta_k|.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{k+1}-X_{t_{k+1}}=e_k+O(\\Delta)+g_k\\Delta W_k+O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|\\bar X_{k+1}-X_{t_{k+1}}|^2\\le C(\\mathbb{E}|e_k|^2+\\Delta)$</span>。取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}|e_{k+1}|^2\\le (1+C\\Delta)\\mathbb{E}|e_k|^2+C\\Delta^3.$$</div>\n<p>此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta W_k\\|^2=\\Delta m$</span> 与 (H3) 的矩界。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}|e_k|^2\\le C\\Delta^3\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1+C\\Delta)^j\\le C\\Delta^2\\bigl((1+C\\Delta)^N-1\\bigr)/C\\Delta\\cdot\\Delta\\le C'\\Delta^2,$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+C\\Delta)^N\\le e^{CT}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k(\\mathbb{E}|e_k|^2)^{1/2}\\le C\\Delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.2.3（Heun 的弱收敛阶）.</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C^4$</span>（四阶连续可微、各阶导数有界）下，对任意多项式检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 满足多项式增长，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^{\\mathrm{H}}_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)\\bigr|\\le C_\\varphi\\,\\Delta^2.$$</div>\n<p>即 Heun 弱收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路.</strong> 弱误差由 Itô–Taylor 展开到二阶决定。Heun 的两阶段平均精确匹配了二阶 Itô–Taylor 项中不含 Lévy 面积的部分；含 Lévy 面积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{j_1j_2}=\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\int_{t_k}^{s_1}dW^{j_1}_{s_2}dW^{j_2}_{s_1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j_1\\ne j_2$</span>）的项在期望下为零（由 (H4) 增量独立性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}L_{j_1j_2}=0$</span>），故不影响弱阶。剩余三阶项期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。完整展开见第 5 节弱收敛阶的一般框架，本节只给出阶数结论并标注其依赖的平滑性假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.2.4（单步恒等式：Heun 与 Itô–Taylor 的匹配）.</strong> 在 (H1)(H2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，Heun 单步增量与 Itô–Taylor 一阶展开之差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}-X_{t_{k+1}}=\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\bigl(\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k\\bigr)+R_k,\\qquad \\mathbb{E}|R_k|^2=O(\\Delta^3),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span> 处关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的导数。该恒等式表明：Heun 的残差主项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>，恰为强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 所允许的单步误差；而 Euler 的残差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k((\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta)$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，只能给出强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由第一步展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{k+1}}-X_{t_k}=f_k\\Delta+g_k\\Delta W_k+\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k((\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta)+\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k+O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 均方。而 Heun 增量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}-X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k=\\tfrac12(f_k+f(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1}))\\Delta+\\tfrac12(g_k+g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1}))\\Delta W_k.$$</div>\n<p>展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})=f_k+f'_k(f_k\\Delta+g_k\\Delta W_k)+O(\\Delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 同理。代入并整理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k$</span>，与 Itô–Taylor 一致；剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f'_k g_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span> 合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_k$</span> 的主部。逐项比较即得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维线性 SDE 的精确验证）.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=ax$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=b$</span>（常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>。此时 SDE 为 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=e^{at}x_0+b\\int_0^t e^{a(t-s)}dW_s$</span>，精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t=e^{at}x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=\\frac{b^2}{2a}(e^{2at}-1)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ne0$</span>）。Heun 迭代为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar X_{k+1}=(1+a\\Delta)X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+b\\Delta W_k,\\qquad X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}=X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+\\tfrac12\\bigl(aX^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+a\\bar X_{k+1}\\bigr)\\Delta+b\\Delta W_k.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{k+1}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}=\\bigl(1+a\\Delta+\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2\\bigr)X^{\\mathrm{H}}_k+\\bigl(1+\\tfrac12 a\\Delta\\bigr)b\\Delta W_k.$$</div>\n<p>与精确解的一步传播 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t+\\Delta}=e^{a\\Delta}X_t+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{a(t+\\Delta-s)}b\\,dW_s$</span> 比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{a\\Delta}=1+a\\Delta+\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，Heun 的乘子精确到二阶；扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(1+\\tfrac12 a\\Delta\\bigr)b$</span> 与精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{a(t+\\Delta-s)}b\\,dW_s$</span> 的均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(\\frac{e^{2a\\Delta}-1}{2a}\\bigr)^{1/2}b=b\\sqrt{\\Delta}\\bigl(1+\\tfrac12 a\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2)\\bigr)$</span> 匹配到一阶。故该例中 Heun 的强误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，与定理 23.2.2 和推论 23.2.3 一致。数值验证见下方代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef heun_ou(a, b, x0, T, N, rng):\n    dt = T / N\n    x = np.zeros(N + 1)\n    x[0] = x0\n    for k in range(N):\n        dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt))\n        xbar = x[k] + a * x[k] * dt + b * dW\n        x[k+1] = x[k] + 0.5 * (a * x[k] + a * xbar) * dt + b * dW\n    return x\n\ndef exact_ou_mean(a, x0, T):\n    return np.exp(a * T) * x0\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\na, b, x0, T = -1.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.0\nfor N in [16, 64, 256]:\n    traj = heun_ou(a, b, x0, T, N, rng)\n    assert traj.shape == (N + 1,)\n    err = abs(traj[-1] - exact_ou_mean(a, x0, T))\n    print(f&quot;N={N}, shape={traj.shape}, |X_N - E[X_T]|={err:.6f}&quot;)\n# 预期：误差随 N 增大而减小，量级约 O(1/N)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-两阶段平均的代数结构-为何复用同一增量\">两阶段平均的代数结构：为何复用同一增量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-两阶段平均的代数结构-为何复用同一增量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的恒等式揭示了 Heun 阶数提升的来源，但尚未说明为何两阶段必须复用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>。本节给出一个代数命题，把这一设计选择刻画为 Itô–Taylor 展开系数的唯一匹配条件。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'_k$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t g_k$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_0=\\partial_t+f\\cdot\\nabla_x$</span> 为 Itô 生成元的漂移部分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.2.5（增量复用的必要性）.</strong> 在 (H1)(H2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2$</span>（二阶连续可微、各阶导数有界）下，考虑形如</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{k+1}=X_k+\\bigl(\\theta_1 f(X_k,t_k)+\\theta_2 f(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})\\bigr)\\Delta+\\bigl(\\theta_3 g(X_k,t_k)+\\theta_4 g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})\\bigr)\\Delta W_k$$</div>\n<p>的两阶段显式格式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{k+1}=X_k+\\alpha f_k\\Delta+\\beta g_k\\Delta W_k$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_i,\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>。若要求该格式的单步均方残差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>（即与 Itô–Taylor 一阶展开匹配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span> 均方量级），则必须有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_3+\\theta_4=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4\\beta=\\tfrac12$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4\\alpha=\\tfrac12$</span>，且两阶段共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>。若两阶段各用独立增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W^{(1)}_k,\\Delta W^{(2)}_k$</span>，则无论权重如何选取，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 项的期望无法被正确复现，单步残差至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 均方，强阶退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_k,t_k)$</span> 处展开到一阶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g(\\bar X_{k+1},t_{k+1})=g_k+g'_k\\bigl(\\alpha f_k\\Delta+\\beta g_k\\Delta W_k\\bigr)+\\partial_t g_k\\Delta+O(\\Delta).$$</div>\n<p>代入格式的扩散部分，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta_3 g_k\\Delta W_k+\\theta_4\\Bigl(g_k+g'_k\\beta g_k\\Delta W_k+g'_k\\alpha f_k\\Delta+\\partial_t g_k\\Delta\\Bigr)\\Delta W_k.$$</div>\n<p>按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span> 的幂次整理：零阶项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta_3+\\theta_4)g_k$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4\\beta g'_k g_k$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span> 项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4 g'_k\\alpha f_k+\\theta_4\\partial_t g_k$</span>。Itô–Taylor 一阶展开的扩散部分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_k\\Delta W_k+\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k\\bigl((\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta\\bigr)+\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k+\\partial_t g_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k+O(\\Delta^{3/2}).$$</div>\n<p>逐项匹配：零阶要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_3+\\theta_4=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4\\beta=\\tfrac12$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项（来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 g'_k g_k\\Delta$</span>）要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4\\beta=\\tfrac12$</span>，与上一条件一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4\\alpha=\\tfrac12$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t g_k$</span> 项系数须为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_4=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_3=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\beta=\\tfrac12$</span>，即 Heun 的权重配置。若两阶段用独立增量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W^{(1)}_k)^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W^{(2)}_k)^2$</span> 的期望各为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，交叉项期望为零，无法拼出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2-\\Delta$</span> 的正确系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项残差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 均方，强阶退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：Heun 的两阶段平均不是任意加权，而是被 Itô–Taylor 系数唯一确定的代数结构；复用增量是保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 项系数的必要条件。这为第 6 节指数积分器中“漂移精确积分、扩散保留增量结构”的设计提供了代数原型。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强收敛阶证明中的矩估计细节\">强收敛阶证明中的矩估计细节<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强收敛阶证明中的矩估计细节\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 23.2.2 的第一步用到了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{s\\in[t_k,t_{k+1}]}|X_s-X_{t_k}|^2\\le C\\Delta$</span> 这一估计。本节补足其证明，因为它同时是 Euler 与 Heun 误差分析的公共基础，且其常数依赖于 (H1)(H2) 的线性增长系数。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 23.2.6（局部 Hölder 矩界）.</strong> 在 (H1)(H2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|x_0|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L_f,L_g,K_f,K_g,T)$</span>，使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{u\\in[s,t]}|X_u-X_s|^2\\le C\\,(t-s).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 SDE 积分形式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{u\\in[s,t]}|X_u-X_s|^2\\le 2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl|\\int_s^t f(X_r,r)\\,dr\\Bigr|^2+2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{u\\in[s,t]}\\Bigl|\\int_s^u g(X_r,r)\\,dW_r\\Bigr|^2.$$</div>\n<p>漂移项：由 (H1) 线性增长与 (H3) 矩界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|\\int_s^t f\\,dr|^2\\le (t-s)\\int_s^t\\mathbb{E}|f(X_r,r)|^2dr\\le C(t-s)^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>扩散项：用 Burkholder–Davis–Gundy 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 情形），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{u\\in[s,t]}\\Bigl|\\int_s^u g\\,dW\\Bigr|^2\\le C_{\\mathrm{BDG}}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t\\|g(X_r,r)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2dr\\le C_{\\mathrm{BDG}}\\,C(t-s),$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个不等号用 (H2) 线性增长与 (H3) 矩界。合并两项即得引理。BDG 不等式的适用条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_r,r)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 可料且平方可积，这由 (H2) 与 (H3) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该引理在定理 23.2.2 第一步中用于控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_s,s)-f(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span> 的均方，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_f,L_g,K_f,K_g,T)$</span> 与二阶矩界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span>，与步长无关，故 Gronwall 迭代中的常数一致有界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-与-Euler-的单步误差对比-一个显式的均方计算\">与 Euler 的单步误差对比：一个显式的均方计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与-Euler-的单步误差对比-一个显式的均方计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使阶数差异可检验，本节在一维线性 SDE 上直接计算 Euler 与 Heun 的单步均方误差，给出闭式表达式。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=ax$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=b$</span> 常数，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=x$</span> 确定性。</p>\n<p>Euler 单步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{E}}_{k+1}=(1+a\\Delta)x+b\\Delta W_k$</span>。精确解条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_k}=x$</span> 的一步传播为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{k+1}}=e^{a\\Delta}x+b\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}e^{a(t_{k+1}-s)}dW_s$</span>。两者之差的均方为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\bigl|X^{\\mathrm{E}}_{k+1}-X_{t_{k+1}}\\bigr|^2=\\bigl(1+a\\Delta-e^{a\\Delta}\\bigr)^2x^2+b^2\\Bigl(\\Delta-\\frac{e^{2a\\Delta}-1}{2a}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n<p>展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+a\\Delta-e^{a\\Delta}=-\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，故第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^4)$</span>；第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta-\\frac{e^{2a\\Delta}-1}{2a}=\\Delta-\\bigl(\\Delta+a\\Delta^2+\\tfrac23 a^2\\Delta^3+O(\\Delta^4)\\bigr)=-a\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，故第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。因此 Euler 单步均方误差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2|a|\\Delta^2$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span>，均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，与强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的单步要求（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 均方根）不符，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后误差均方根为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p>Heun 单步：由上小节已算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_{k+1}=(1+a\\Delta+\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2)x+(1+\\tfrac12 a\\Delta)b\\Delta W_k$</span>。与精确解之差的均方为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl(1+a\\Delta+\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2-e^{a\\Delta}\\bigr)^2x^2+b^2\\Bigl(\\bigl(1+\\tfrac12 a\\Delta\\bigr)^2\\Delta-\\frac{e^{2a\\Delta}-1}{2a}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n<p>展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+a\\Delta+\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2-e^{a\\Delta}=O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^6)$</span>；第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(1+\\tfrac12 a\\Delta\\bigr)^2\\Delta=\\Delta+a\\Delta^2+\\tfrac14 a^2\\Delta^3$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{e^{2a\\Delta}-1}{2a}=\\Delta+a\\Delta^2+\\tfrac23 a^2\\Delta^3+O(\\Delta^4)$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac5{12}a^2\\Delta^3+O(\\Delta^4)$</span>，故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。Heun 单步均方误差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac5{12}b^2a^2\\Delta^3$</span>，均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>，恰为强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 所允许的单步量级；累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。这一显式计算把定理 23.2.2 与 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的差异落实为可验证的常数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef single_step_mse(a, b, x, dt, n_samples, rng):\n    dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=n_samples)\n    euler = (1 + a * dt) * x + b * dW\n    heun = (1 + a * dt + 0.5 * a * a * dt * dt) * x + (1 + 0.5 * a * dt) * b * dW\n    exact_mean = np.exp(a * dt) * x\n    exact_var = b * b * (np.exp(2 * a * dt) - 1) / (2 * a)\n    mse_e = np.mean((euler - exact_mean) ** 2) + exact_var  # 近似：用样本均值代替条件期望\n    mse_h = np.mean((heun - exact_mean) ** 2) + exact_var\n    return mse_e, mse_h\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\na, b, x = -1.0, 0.5, 1.0\nfor dt in [0.1, 0.01, 0.001]:\n    mse_e, mse_h = single_step_mse(a, b, x, dt, 200000, rng)\n    assert mse_e &gt; 0 and mse_h &gt; 0\n    print(f&quot;dt={dt:.4f}, Euler MSE={mse_e:.3e}, Heun MSE={mse_h:.3e}, ratio={mse_e/mse_h:.2f}&quot;)\n# 预期：Euler MSE 约 O(dt^2)，Heun MSE 约 O(dt^3)，比值随 dt 减小而增大\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>该代码用大样本近似条件期望，验证单步均方误差的阶数差异；断言只检查正性，阶数由打印的比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt$</span> 变化的趋势读出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-稳定域与步长上界\">稳定域与步长上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-稳定域与步长上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>强收敛阶描述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 的渐近行为，但实际采样器在有限步长下还需稳定性。对线性测试方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=ax$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&lt;0$</span>），Heun 的乘子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(a\\Delta)=1+a\\Delta+\\tfrac12 a^2\\Delta^2$</span>。要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R(a\\Delta)|\\le1$</span> 给出稳定域</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|1+z+\\tfrac12 z^2\\bigr|\\le1,\\qquad z=a\\Delta&lt;0.$$</div>\n<p>解不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+z+\\tfrac12 z^2\\ge-1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 z^2+z+2\\ge0$</span>，判别式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-4&lt;0$</span>，对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+z+\\tfrac12 z^2\\le1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(1+\\tfrac12 z)\\le0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in[-2,0]$</span> 成立。故 Heun 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\Delta\\in[-2,0]$</span> 上稳定，而 Euler 的稳定域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\Delta\\in[-2,0]$</span> 亦同（Euler 乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+z|\\le1$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in[-2,0]$</span>）。两者稳定域相同，但 Heun 的乘子更接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{a\\Delta}$</span>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=-1$</span> 处，Euler 乘子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，Heun 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span>，精确值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1}\\approx0.368$</span>；Heun 的偏差更小。这说明 Heun 在相同步长下既有更高阶又有更小的相位误差，代价是每步两次函数求值。</p>\n<p>对一般非线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，稳定性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Jacobian 谱决定：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Jacobian 最大特征值实部（负），则要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}\\Delta\\in[-2,0]$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le2/|\\lambda_{\\max}|$</span>。这一上界将在第 8 节步长选择中作为硬约束出现，并与第 10 节大步长导致分布偏移的反例相衔接。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-非自治漂移与时间显式依赖的处理\">非自治漂移与时间显式依赖的处理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-非自治漂移与时间显式依赖的处理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，Heun 的预测步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处的值，校正步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}$</span> 处的值，这与确定性 Heun 的时间配置一致。但 SDE 中时间显式依赖会引入额外的 Itô–Taylor 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t g_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span>，命题 23.2.5 的匹配条件已将其系数固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 Heun 自动复现该项。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的时间依赖，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t f_k\\Delta^2$</span> 项量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span>，不影响强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，但在弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的分析中需保留；推论 23.2.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^4$</span> 假设已覆盖这一项。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的时间依赖在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上仅一致连续而不 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t g_k$</span> 不存在，命题 23.2.5 的展开失效，Heun 的强阶仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（定理 23.2.2 只用 Lipschitz 性），但弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的证明需改用差商估计，此时弱阶可能降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；这一边界情形在第 10 节反例中给出具体构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-多步复合的误差传播算子\">多步复合的误差传播算子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-多步复合的误差传播算子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将 Heun 的单步映射记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{H}}_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_N=\\Phi^{\\mathrm{H}}_{N-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Phi^{\\mathrm{H}}_0(x_0)$</span>。误差传播由复合的 Jacobian 乘积控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Phi^{\\mathrm{H}}_k/\\partial x=I+\\tfrac12(f'_k+f'_{k+1}(I+f'_k\\Delta))\\Delta+O(\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k)$</span>。在 (H1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f'\\|_\\infty\\le L_f$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial\\Phi^{\\mathrm{H}}_k/\\partial x\\|\\le1+L_f\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_k\\|\\partial\\Phi^{\\mathrm{H}}_k\\|\\le e^{L_fT}$</span>。这一界与 Gronwall 迭代中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+C\\Delta)^N\\le e^{CT}$</span> 一致，说明 Heun 的误差传播不引入额外的指数放大；相比之下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增长，则需在第 9 节误差累积中用时变 Gronwall 处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-与后续节的接口\">与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节确立的三个对象将在后续节直接使用。其一，命题 23.2.5 的系数匹配条件是第 3 节 Runge–Kutta 方法阶数条件的 SDE 版本：确定性 RK 的阶数条件（Butcher 表）在 SDE 中需补充 Lévy 面积项的处理，而 Heun 恰好是无需 Lévy 面积即可达到强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的最简格式。其二，Heun 的单步残差主项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span> 将在第 4 节强收敛阶的一般定理中被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 余项，其常数由 (H1)(H2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span> 显式给出。其三，稳定域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}\\Delta\\in[-2,0]$</span> 将在第 8 节步长选择中与弱误差容忍度联合确定步长，并在第 11 节自适应步长中作为拒绝步长的判据。Heun 的两阶段结构也是第 6 节指数积分器的对照：指数积分器用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\int f}$</span> 精确积分漂移，扩散部分保留 Heun 式的增量结构，从而在刚性漂移下仍保持强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Heun 方法定义为显式两阶段平均，两阶段复用同一布朗增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span>，从而与 Itô 积分相容；其单步计算量为 Euler 的两倍。</li>\n<li>在漂移与扩散全局 Lipschitz、线性增长与二阶矩有界的假设下，Heun 强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（定理 23.2.2），弱收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（推论 23.2.3，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^4$</span> 平滑性）；单步残差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'_k f_k\\Delta\\,\\Delta W_k$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>（命题 23.2.4）。</li>\n<li>与 Euler 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 相比，Heun 通过平均补上了 Itô–Taylor 展开中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 项，这是阶数提升的代数根源；该结构将在第 6 节指数积分器与第 7 节 DPM-Solver 中被进一步推广。</li>\n<li>命题 23.2.5 证明 Heun 的两阶段权重被 Itô–Taylor 系数唯一确定，复用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span> 是复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_k)^2$</span> 项的必要条件；两阶段用独立增量会使强阶退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</li>\n<li>引理 23.2.6 给出局部 Hölder 矩界，其常数只依赖线性增长系数与二阶矩界，为定理 23.2.2 的 Gronwall 迭代提供一致有界的传播常数；一维线性 SDE 的显式均方计算把 Euler 与 Heun 的单步误差主项分别落实为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。</li>\n<li>Heun 的稳定域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\Delta\\in[-2,0]$</span>，与 Euler 相同，但乘子在稳定域内更接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{a\\Delta}$</span>；该上界将在第 8 节作为步长硬约束，并与第 6 节指数积分器的刚性漂移处理相衔接。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-Runge-Kutta\">Runge–Kutta<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Runge-Kutta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 21 节（Euler）与第 22 节（Heun）已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>；前向扩散过程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a:=gg^\\top\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>。Euler 与 Heun 的数值格式已在前两节给出，本节不再重复其定义，只引用其符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{Eu}}_{n}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{Heu}}_{n}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>符号表</strong>：</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 1}$</span>：Runge–Kutta 方法的级数（stage 数）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$A=(a_{ij})_{i,j=1}^{s}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{s\\times s}$</span>：Butcher 系数矩阵，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{ij}=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ge i$</span>（显式方法）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$b=(b_i)_{i=1}^{s}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{s}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=(c_i)_{i=1}^{s}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{s}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i=\\sum_{j=1}^{i-1}a_{ij}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i^{(n)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 级的漂移增量估计。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$G_i^{(n)}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 级的扩散增量估计。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_f,\\Phi_g$</span>：方法对应的增量映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n+1}=X_n+\\Phi_f(\\{K_i\\})+\\Phi_g(\\{G_i\\})\\Delta W_n$</span> 的缩写。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_b^{k}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶连续可微且各阶导数有界的函数空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L)$</span>：Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的函数类。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设（在命题中逐条引用，缺一不可）：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)（漂移与扩散的正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal{C}_b^{3}(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in\\mathcal{C}_b^{3}(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T];\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 关于空间变量全局 Lipschitz，常数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span>。此假设保证 SDE 强解存在唯一（标准 Picard 迭代），且解的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶矩有限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)（系数的增长控制）</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x,t)\\|+\\|g(x,t)\\|\\le C(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>。此条在 (H1) 的有界性下自动成立，列出是为了在矩估计中显式引用常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)（时间可微性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t f,\\partial_t g$</span> 有界。用于 Itô–Taylor 展开中时间导数的存在性。</p>\n<p>以下所有命题均在 (H1)–(H3) 下陈述；若某命题只需其中一部分，会在假设栏中注明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-显式-Runge-Kutta-的一般形式与级相容性\">显式 Runge–Kutta 的一般形式与级相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-显式-Runge-Kutta-的一般形式与级相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 23.3.1（显式 Runge–Kutta 格式）</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span>，一步数值格式定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_i^{(n)}=f\\Big(X_n+\\Delta\\sum_{j=1}^{i-1}a_{ij}K_j^{(n)},\\ t_n+c_i\\Delta\\Big),\\qquad i=1,\\dots,s,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_i^{(n)}=g\\Big(X_n+\\Delta\\sum_{j=1}^{i-1}a_{ij}K_j^{(n)},\\ t_n+c_i\\Delta\\Big),\\qquad i=1,\\dots,s,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{n+1}=X_n+\\Delta\\sum_{i=1}^{s}b_iK_i^{(n)}+\\sum_{i=1}^{s}b_iG_i^{(n)}\\,\\Delta W_n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n=W_{t_{n+1}}-W_{t_n}\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Delta I_m)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_n}$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：Euler 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s,A,b,c)=(1,0,1,0)$</span>；Heun 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=(0,1)$</span>。Runge–Kutta 的一般定义把这两者作为特例纳入，区别在于级数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge 2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i$</span> 之间通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 耦合，从而在单步内多次评估 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.3.2（经典阶条件）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span> 满足<strong>确定性阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span></strong> 条件，若对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal{C}_b^{q+1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv 0$</span>）有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{x}\\Big\\|x+\\Delta\\sum_{i}b_iK_i(x)-x-\\int_0^\\Delta f(\\phi_t(x))\\,dt\\Big\\|=O(\\Delta^{q+1}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=f(x)$</span> 的流。称其满足<strong>随机阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span></strong> 条件，若对 (H1)–(H3) 下的 SDE，强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|X_N-X_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}=O(\\Delta^{p})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.3.3（级相容性恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i b_i=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i=\\sum_j a_{ij}$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv 0$</span> 的确定性情形，单步局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，即该方法至少为确定性 1 阶。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i^{(n)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0$</span> 处展开。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i=\\sum_j a_{ij}$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_i^{(n)}=f(X_n,t_n)+O(\\Delta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 的常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_{\\mathcal{C}_b^1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>。代入增量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta\\sum_i b_iK_i^{(n)}=\\Delta\\Big(\\sum_i b_i\\Big)f(X_n,t_n)+O(\\Delta^2)=\\Delta f(X_n,t_n)+O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n<p>末步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i b_i=1$</span>。而精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n+\\Delta}=X_n+\\int_{t_n}^{t_n+\\Delta}f(X_s,s)\\,ds=X_n+\\Delta f(X_n,t_n)+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的有界性与 Lipschitz 性，被积函数在区间上偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_n,t_n)$</span> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f\\|X_s-X_n\\|\\le L_f C\\Delta$</span>）。两式相减即得局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.3.4（全局阶）</strong> 在命题 23.3.3 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。证明用离散 Grönwall：局部误差每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot O(\\Delta^2)=O(\\Delta)$</span>，且 Lipschitz 性保证误差传播不放大超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_fT}$</span>。细节与 Euler 节同构，不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-随机-Runge-Kutta-的-Itô-Taylor-展开与阶条件\">随机 Runge–Kutta 的 Itô–Taylor 展开与阶条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-随机-Runge-Kutta-的-Itô-Taylor-展开与阶条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>确定性阶条件不足以保证随机阶。原因在于：随机情形下，单步误差的主导项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 的幂次，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 的量级是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 大。因此需要匹配 Itô–Taylor 展开中随机项的系数。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 23.3.5（单步 Itô–Taylor 展开）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，精确解从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_n,t_n)$</span> 出发一步满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{n+1}}=X_n+f(X_n,t_n)\\Delta+g(X_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{L}^0 g(X_n,t_n)\\,(\\Delta W_n^{\\otimes 2}-\\Delta I)\\cdot\\text{(收缩)}+\\cdots$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，按 Itô–Taylor 展开到含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 二次项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 一次项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{n+1}}=X_n+f\\Delta+g\\,\\Delta W_n+\\frac12\\big(\\partial_t g+\\mathcal{L}g\\big)(\\Delta W_n^{\\otimes 2}-\\Delta I)+\\big(\\partial_t f+\\mathcal{L}f\\big)\\frac{\\Delta^2}{2}+\\mathcal{L}g\\,\\Delta W_n\\Delta+\\cdots,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}=\\sum_{k}f_k\\partial_{x_k}+\\frac12\\sum_{k,l}a_{kl}\\partial_{x_k}\\partial_{x_l}$</span> 为生成元，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}g$</span> 表示逐分量作用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n^{\\otimes 2}$</span> 为外积矩阵，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 相减后按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的列指标收缩。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 用 Itô 公式展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_t,t)$</span>，再把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_s$</span> 的积分代回。关键等式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s=g(X_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\int_{t_n}^{s}\\mathcal{L}g(X_r,r)\\,dr\\,dW_s+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\int_{t_n}^{s}\\partial_t g\\,dr\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n<p>以及</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}f(X_s,s)\\,ds=f(X_n,t_n)\\Delta+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\int_{t_n}^{s}\\big(\\mathcal{L}f+\\partial_t f\\big)(X_r,r)\\,dr\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>对第一式中的二重随机积分，用 Itô 等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\int\\!\\int \\mathcal{L}g\\,dr\\,dW\\|^2=\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\mathbb{E}\\|\\int_{t_n}^{s}\\mathcal{L}g\\,dr\\|^2ds\\le C\\Delta^3$</span>，故该项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>；对第二式，二重 Lebesgue 积分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{L}f+\\partial_t f\\|_\\infty\\Delta^2/2$</span> 控制，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。保留到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta W\\cdot\\Delta)$</span> 的项即得上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.3.6（随机阶条件）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，显式 Runge–Kutta 格式的强阶至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 当且仅当它匹配 Itô–Taylor 展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{p})$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下），即：对展开中每个量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{k/2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,1,\\dots,2p$</span>）的项，数值格式的对应系数与精确解一致。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span> 满足相应阶条件。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n=X_{n+1}-X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 由引理 23.3.5 与格式定义逐项相减得到。若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{k/2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le 2p$</span>）项系数匹配，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon_n\\|^2=O(\\Delta^{2p+1})$</span>（最低未匹配项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(2p+1)/2}$</span>，其平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{2p+1}$</span>）。再用离散 Grönwall（随机版本：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_n-X_{t_n}\\|^2$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性控制传播），得全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_N-X_T\\|^2\\le C\\Delta^{2p}$</span>。反向（必要性）由：若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{k/2}$</span> 项系数不匹配，该项在单步误差中贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\Delta^{k/2})$</span>，其平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\Delta^{k})$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\Delta^{k-1})$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le 2p$</span> 时该量级不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{2p}$</span>，故强阶不可能高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 23.3.7（与 Euler/Heun 的衔接）</strong> 命题 23.3.6 立即给出前两节 canonical 结论的机制：Euler 匹配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 项（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\Delta W$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项（漂移）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W^2-\\Delta$</span> 项不匹配，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span>；Heun 通过第二级评估补上了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}g(\\Delta W^{\\otimes2}-\\Delta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t f+\\mathcal{L}f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2/2$</span> 项，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>。本节不重复这两个证明，只把它们作为命题 23.3.6 的特例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-二阶随机-Runge-Kutta-的构造与主定理\">二阶随机 Runge–Kutta 的构造与主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-二阶随机-Runge-Kutta-的构造与主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 23.3.8（二阶强收敛 Runge–Kutta 的存在性与形式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span> 的显式 Runge–Kutta 格式，其强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（即匹配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项），且不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le 2$</span> 的显式格式达到强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span> 以上。达到强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的一个充分条件是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i b_i=1,\\qquad \\sum_i b_ic_i=\\frac12,\\qquad \\sum_i b_ia_{ij}=\\frac12\\ \\text{对每个 }j\\text{ 使 }b_j\\neq0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证充分性。由命题 23.3.6，只需逐项匹配。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i b_iG_i^{(0)}=\\sum_i b_ig(X_n,t_n)=g(X_n,t_n)$</span>，用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_i=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_i^{(0)}=g(X_n,t_n)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{ij}$</span> 项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时消失）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项分两部分：漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\sum_i b_iK_i^{(0)}$</span> 需匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\Delta$</span>，同样由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_i=1$</span> 得；随机修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i b_iG_i^{(1)}\\Delta W_n$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_i^{(1)}=g+\\Delta\\sum_j a_{ij}\\mathcal{L}_j g+\\cdots$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_j$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 级方向导数），需匹配引理 23.3.5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}g\\,\\Delta W\\Delta$</span> 的系数。逐项比对给出上述三个条件。再证不可能性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 只有一个自由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{21}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,c$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=a_{21}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_1+b_2=1$</span> 约束，可调参数共 2 个（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{21},b_1$</span>），而强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span> 需要匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span> 项（含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W^3$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W\\Delta$</span> 两类），至少 3 个独立条件，故欠定，不存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（验证公式）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=(0,1)$</span> 即 Heun。验证条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_i=1$</span> ✓；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_ic_i=(1/2)\\cdot0+(1/2)\\cdot1=1/2$</span> ✓；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i b_ia_{i1}=(1/2)\\cdot0+(1/2)\\cdot1=1/2$</span> ✓；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_2=1/2\\neq0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i b_ia_{i2}=0\\neq1/2$</span> ✗。故 Heun 满足前两条但不满足第三条，这解释了为何 Heun 的强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而非更高：它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}g$</span> 的随机修正上只匹配了一半系数。若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=(1,0)$</span> 退化为 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=1$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_2=0$</span>，第三条对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2$</span> 自动满足（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_2=0$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_ic_i=0\\neq1/2$</span>，故 Euler 连 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项都不匹配，强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-稳定域与刚性情形下的限制\">稳定域与刚性情形下的限制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-稳定域与刚性情形下的限制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Runge–Kutta 的阶条件只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 的渐近行为，不保证有限步长下的稳定性。对生成模型而言，反向 SDE 的漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 附近可能具有大负特征值（得分函数在低噪声区陡峭），此时显式方法的稳定域成为实际约束。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.3.9（稳定函数）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span>，稳定函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(z)=1+zb^\\top(I-zA)^{-1}\\mathbf{1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb{C}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>。数值格式作用于测试方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=\\lambda x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n+1}=R(\\lambda\\Delta)X_n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.3.10（A-稳定性与阶的权衡）</strong> 显式 Runge–Kutta 方法的稳定域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z:|R(z)|\\le1\\}$</span> 有界；因此对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda|\\Delta$</span> 落在稳定域外。特别地，显式方法不可能 A-稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：无（纯代数事实）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(z)$</span> 为多项式（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 严格下三角，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(I-zA)^{-1}$</span> 为多项式），次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le s$</span>。非零多项式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z|\\to\\infty$</span> 时模趋于无穷，故稳定域有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.3.11（生成模型中的步长下界）</strong> 设反向 SDE 漂移的 Jacobian 在某个区域有特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}&lt;0$</span>，则显式 Runge–Kutta 的步长须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le C/|\\lambda_{\\min}|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为稳定域边界。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_{\\min}|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 发散时（得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在低噪声极限下爆破），显式方法被迫取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>，这与少步生成的目标直接冲突。此冲突的定量刻画属于第 8 节（步长选择）与第 10 节（反例），本节只指出其来源是命题 23.3.10。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>显式 Runge–Kutta 的一般形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span> 刻画，Euler 与 Heun 是其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span> 的特例；级相容性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_i=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i=\\sum_j a_{ij}$</span> 保证确定性 1 阶，命题 23.3.3 给出局部截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 的逐步证明。</li>\n<li>随机阶由 Itô–Taylor 展开的逐项匹配决定（命题 23.3.6）：Euler 只匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 项故强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，Heun 匹配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项故强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；定理 23.3.8 给出二阶格式的三个充分条件并用 Heun 的具体系数验证了第三条的失败，从而解释了强阶不高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的机制。</li>\n<li>阶条件只描述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 的渐近行为；显式方法的稳定域有界（命题 23.3.10），当反向 SDE 漂移的负特征值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 增大时，步长被迫缩小，这与少步生成的目标冲突，其定量分析留给步长选择与反例节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-随机-Runge-Kutta-的均方误差递推与常数显式化\">随机 Runge–Kutta 的均方误差递推与常数显式化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-随机-Runge-Kutta-的均方误差递推与常数显式化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出了阶条件的匹配原则，但阶条件只说明误差的量级，不说明误差累积的常数。对生成模型而言，常数决定了在有限步数下实际可达的精度，因此需要把离散 Grönwall 的每一步写清楚，使误差递推中的常数可以显式追踪。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 23.3.12（单步均方误差的分解）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n$</span> 为数值解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 为精确解且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n=X_{t_n}$</span>（即从同一初值出发），则显式 Runge–Kutta 的单步均方误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{n+1}-X_{t_{n+1}}\\|^2\\le C_1\\Delta^{2p+1}+C_2\\Delta\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|X_n-X_{t_n}\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为该格式的强阶，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_b^{p+1}$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span> 满足强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的匹配条件。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 23.3.6，单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n=X_{n+1}-X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_n=\\sum_{k=0}^{2p}\\big(\\text{系数差}\\big)\\cdot\\Delta^{k/2}\\cdot(\\text{Itô 张量})+\\text{余项},$$</div>\n<p>其中系数差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le 2p$</span> 时为零，余项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{(2p+1)/2})$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon_n\\|^2\\le C_1\\Delta^{2p+1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 来自余项中各 Itô 张量的二阶矩估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta W_n^{\\otimes j}\\|^2\\le C_j\\Delta^{j}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le 2p+1$</span>），常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_j$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。第二项来自数值格式与精确解对初值的 Lipschitz 依赖：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n+1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n$</span> 为初值，两者之差对初值扰动的敏感度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+L\\Delta$</span> 控制，平方后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+C_2\\Delta)$</span> 因子，减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2\\Delta$</span> 项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 23.3.13（全局均方误差的显式上界）</strong> 在引理 23.3.12 的条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta=T$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le n\\le N}\\mathbb{E}\\|X_n-X_{t_n}\\|^2\\le C_1\\Delta^{2p}\\cdot\\frac{e^{C_2T}-1}{C_2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同引理 23.3.12。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_n-X_{t_n}\\|^2$</span>。由引理 23.3.12 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n\\neq X_{t_n}$</span> 时误差传播的 Lipschitz 性（把初值差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n-X_{t_n}$</span> 视为扰动，单步误差分解为“同初值误差”加“扰动传播”），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{n+1}\\le (1+C_2\\Delta)e_n+C_1\\Delta^{2p+1}.$$</div>\n<p>展开递推：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_n\\le C_1\\Delta^{2p+1}\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(1+C_2\\Delta)^k=C_1\\Delta^{2p+1}\\cdot\\frac{(1+C_2\\Delta)^n-1}{C_2\\Delta}.$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+C_2\\Delta)^n\\le e^{C_2n\\Delta}=e^{C_2T}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\Delta\\le T$</span>），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_n\\le C_1\\Delta^{2p}\\cdot\\frac{e^{C_2T}-1}{C_2}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\le N$</span> 取上确界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.3.14（强阶的定量含义）</strong> 在定理 23.3.13 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2T\\ll1$</span>（即漂移扩散的 Lipschitz 常数与时间跨度之积小），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{e^{C_2T}-1}{C_2}\\approx T$</span>，全局均方误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx C_1T\\Delta^{2p}$</span>，即误差与步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 成反比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{2p}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2T\\gg1$</span>，指数因子放大误差，此时减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的收益被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{C_2T}$</span> 抵消，这解释了为何在长区间或强 Lipschitz 系数下，单纯提高阶数不如控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span>（即控制系数的 Lipschitz 常数）有效。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（数值验证常数）</strong>：取一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=-X_t\\,dt+\\sigma\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2\\approx1$</span>。精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\frac{1-e^{-2T}}{2})$</span>。用 Euler（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span>）与 Heun（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>）分别取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2^k$</span> 步，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条独立路径的均方误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1M\\sum_{j}\\|X_N^{(j)}-X_T^{(j)}\\|^2$</span>（用同一布朗路径的精确解与数值解配对，即耦合实现），可检验误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{2p}$</span> 下降且常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1T$</span> 同量级。此验证的代码属于第 14 节（收敛阶的数值测量），本节只给出理论常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-隐式与半隐式-Runge-Kutta-在扩散生成中的角色\">隐式与半隐式 Runge–Kutta 在扩散生成中的角色<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-隐式与半隐式-Runge-Kutta-在扩散生成中的角色\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>显式方法的稳定域有界（命题 23.3.10），当反向 SDE 漂移刚性时被迫缩小步长。一个自然的补救是隐式方法：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i$</span> 定义为隐式方程的解，从而获得无界稳定域。但隐式方法在随机情形下引入新的困难：隐式方程的解是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 可测的，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 可测的，这破坏了显式格式中“先采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 再算增量”的因果结构，需要在漂移与扩散的耦合上做特殊处理。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.3.15（漂移隐式、扩散显式的半隐式 Runge–Kutta）</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(A,b,c)$</span>，半隐式格式定义为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_i^{(n)}$</span> 仍按显式定义 23.3.1 计算（扩散显式），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i^{(n)}$</span> 满足隐式方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_i^{(n)}=f\\Big(X_n+\\Delta\\sum_{j=1}^{i}a_{ij}K_j^{(n)},\\ t_n+c_i\\Delta\\Big),\\qquad i=1,\\dots,s,$$</div>\n<p>末步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n+1}=X_n+\\Delta\\sum_i b_iK_i^{(n)}+\\sum_i b_iG_i^{(n)}\\Delta W_n$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为严格下三角时称其为对角隐式（DIRK），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 有非零对角元时称其为全隐式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.3.16（半隐式格式的适定性与强阶保持）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于空间变量 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta L_f\\max_i|a_{ii}|&lt;1$</span>，则隐式方程有唯一解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i^{(n)}$</span>，且半隐式格式的强阶与对应的显式格式相同（扩散显式部分决定随机阶，漂移隐式部分只改变稳定性）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta L_f\\max_i|a_{ii}|&lt;1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：适定性由 Banach 不动点定理：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_i(K)=f(X_n+\\Delta\\sum_j a_{ij}K_j,t_n+c_i\\Delta)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上是压缩的，压缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta L_f|a_{ii}|&lt;1$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j&lt;i$</span> 的项已由前级确定，不参与压缩估计）。强阶保持：由命题 23.3.6，随机阶只由 Itô–Taylor 展开中随机项的匹配决定，而扩散显式部分的展开与显式格式完全相同；漂移隐式部分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i^{(n)}\\to f(X_n,t_n)$</span>，其展开与显式格式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_i$</span> 在首阶相同，高阶差异只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 及以上的确定性项，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{k/2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 奇数）的随机项系数。故强阶不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 23.3.17（与指数积分器的关系）</strong> 半隐式格式的稳定域包含整个左半平面（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的对角元取适当值时），这缓解了命题 23.3.10 的限制。但半隐式格式仍未利用扩散生成中漂移常具有线性结构这一事实；第 6 节（指数积分器）将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的线性部分精确积分，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int f}x_t+\\int e^{\\int f}g\\,dW$</span> 的结构，从而在保持强阶的同时获得对线性刚性的无条件稳定。本节不展开该构造，只指出半隐式 Runge–Kutta 是显式与指数积分之间的中间形态。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-级数与计算代价的权衡\">级数与计算代价的权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-级数与计算代价的权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Runge–Kutta 的级数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 决定了每步评估 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的次数。在生成模型中，每次评估 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 通常需要一次神经网络前向传播（得分网络或漂移网络），因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 直接对应采样成本。阶条件与级数之间存在已知的权衡关系，需要明确陈述以便在少步生成中做选择。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.3.18（显式格式的级数下界）</strong> 对确定性阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，显式 Runge–Kutta 所需级数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge q$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\le4$</span>）；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge6$</span>。对随机强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge1$</span>，显式格式所需级数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge2$</span>（Heun 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2,p=1$</span>）；若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge3/2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge3$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：无（组合事实，证明为计数论证）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：确定性情形下，阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 要求匹配 Taylor 展开中所有树到阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，树的数量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 增长，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 级格式的自由参数数目为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^2/2+s$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的下三角元加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,c$</span>），参数计数给出下界。随机情形下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 需匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项，前者只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_i=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1$</span> 即可），后者需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_ic_i=1/2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum b_ia_{ij}=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=0$</span> 使第二条件不可能，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=3/2$</span> 需匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span> 项（含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W^3$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W\\Delta$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span> 的自由参数不足以同时满足，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge3$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.3.19（少步生成的代价下界）</strong> 若生成模型要求强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 且总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 很小（少步生成），则每步至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=2$</span> 次网络评估，总评估次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge2N$</span>。若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=3/2$</span>，总评估次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge3N$</span>。这与第 12 节（与少步生成的接口）中“少步生成需要在单步内做更多评估以补偿步数”的观察一致，但本节给出的是级数下界而非经验观察。</p>\n<p><strong>注 23.3.20（与 DPM-Solver 的衔接）</strong> DPM-Solver 属于指数积分器族（第 7 节），其单步评估次数可以少于同阶 Runge–Kutta，因为它利用了扩散 SDE 漂移的线性结构做精确积分，把非线性部分的评估集中到少数几个点。本节不展开 DPM-Solver 的构造，只指出：Runge–Kutta 的级数下界是“不利用漂移结构”时的代价，而指数积分器通过结构利用绕过了这一下界。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-强收敛阶\">强收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1–3 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值 Itô 扩散，满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t = f(X_t)\\,dt + g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>。数值格式在网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span> 上产生逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Y_{t_k}\\}$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=t_{k+1}-t_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\max_k\\Delta_k$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k=\\Delta_k$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t=\\sigma(W_s:s\\le t)$</span> 为布朗 filtration，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_k}$</span>-可测的。</li>\n<li>强误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)=\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|X_t-Y_t\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}$</span>（左连续插值）。</li>\n<li>强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>）使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)\\le C\\Delta^{p}$</span>，则称格式具强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)/\\Delta^{p}\\to c&gt;0$</span>，称精确强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</li>\n<li>弱误差：对检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\Delta)=\\sup_{\\varphi:\\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^{4}}\\le 1}\\big|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(Y_T)\\big|$</span>。</li>\n<li>局部截断误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|X_{t_{k+1}}-\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}\\|^2\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal{F}_{t_k}\\big]^{1/2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}$</span> 为初值、按格式单步推进所得。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A（全局正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C_b^{4}(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>（各分量四阶连续可微且各阶导数有界），从而存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x)-f(y)\\|\\le L_f\\|x-y\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g(x)-g(y)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le L_g\\|x-y\\|$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 各阶导数有界。此假设保证 SDE 强解存在唯一、矩有限、Itô–Taylor 展开逐项可积（由 Dominated Convergence 与 Fubini 验证）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 B（格式可定义）</strong>：Euler 与 Heun 格式中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(Y_{t_k})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y_{t_k})$</span> 均良定义，增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k=W_{t_{k+1}}-W_{t_k}\\sim N(0,h_k I_m)$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_k}$</span>。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在假设 A、B 下陈述；凡需额外条件者单独列出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶的定义与局部-全局分解\">强阶的定义与局部–全局分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶的定义与局部-全局分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（强阶）</strong>：如符号表所述，强阶度量的是轨道逼近：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 期望。它与弱阶的区别在于：强阶要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在同一概率空间上由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 驱动、逐轨道接近；弱阶只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时刻边缘分布接近，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 用不同噪声实现。这一区别是本节与第 5 节的分界：本节所有估计都保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1（局部–全局分解）</strong>：设格式单步满足局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_L h_k^{q+1/2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为局部强阶指数），且格式增量满足线性增长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Y_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_k}\\|^2\\le C_G h_k$</span>，则全局强误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)^2\\le C\\Big(\\Delta^{2q}+\\sum_{k}\\tau_k^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k}\\|^2$</span>。由三角不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k+1}\\le 2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_{k+1}}-\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}\\|^2+2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}}\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\tau_k^2$</span>。第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_k$</span> 驱动、初值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}$</span>，由假设 A 的 Lipschitz 性（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 同时用）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}}\\|^2\\le (1+C h_k)\\delta_k$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k+1}\\le (1+C h_k)\\delta_k+2\\tau_k^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 归纳并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+C h_k\\le e^{C h_k}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_k e^{C h_k}=e^{CT}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_N\\le e^{CT}\\big(\\delta_0+2\\sum_k\\tau_k^2\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 的期望，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=Y_{t_k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_t-Y_t\\|^2\\le 2\\|X_t-X_{t_k}\\|^2+2\\|X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k}\\|^2$</span>，第一项由假设 A 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_t-X_{t_k}\\|^2\\le C h_k$</span>，求和后并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta$</span> 项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 1 把强阶问题化归为局部截断误差的阶：全局阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=O(h_k^{p+1/2})$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\tau_k^2=O(\\Delta^{2p})$</span>（等步长时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k h_k^{2p+1}=N h^{2p+1}=T h^{2p}$</span>）。注意指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1/2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1$</span>：因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数，而单步误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数含随机项时其平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{2p+1})$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Euler-的强阶-1-2\">Euler 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Euler-的强阶-1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Euler 局部误差）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，Euler 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_{k+1}}=Y_{t_k}+f(Y_{t_k})h_k+g(Y_{t_k})\\Delta W_k$</span> 的局部截断误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_E h_k$</span>，即局部强阶指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}$</span> 为初值的精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}=Y_{t_k}+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}f(\\hat X_s)\\,ds+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g(\\hat X_s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>与 Euler 步相减，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_s=\\hat X_s-Y_{t_k}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}}=\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\big(f(\\hat X_s)-f(Y_{t_k})\\big)ds+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\big(g(\\hat X_s)-g(Y_{t_k})\\big)dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>由 Itô 等距，第二项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\mathbb{E}\\|g(\\hat X_s)-g(Y_{t_k})\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2\\,ds\\le L_g^2\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_s-Y_{t_k}\\|^2\\,ds$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_s-Y_{t_k}=\\int_{t_k}^s f(\\hat X_u)du+\\int_{t_k}^s g(\\hat X_u)dW_u$</span>，由假设 A 的有界性与 Itô 等距得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_s-Y_{t_k}\\|^2\\le C(s-t_k)$</span>。故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C L_g^2 h_k^2$</span>。第一项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 Lipschitz 性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le h_k\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\mathbb{E}\\|f(\\hat X_s)-f(Y_{t_k})\\|^2ds\\le C L_f^2 h_k^2$</span>。两项合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_E h_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 1（Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，Euler 格式的全局强误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)\\le C\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>，且一般情形下不能改进为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_E h_k$</span>，代入引理 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\tau_k^2\\le C_E^2\\sum_k h_k^2\\le C_E^2 T\\Delta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)^2\\le C\\Delta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le C\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>。不可改进性：考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>，Euler 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}=\\sum_{j&lt;k}\\Delta W_j=W_{t_k}$</span>，在网格点上无误差；但左连续插值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=W_{t_k}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|X_t-Y_t|\\ge\\sup_{t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})}|W_t-W_{t_k}|$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{h}$</span> 增长（布朗运动的模连续性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\asymp\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的根源不在漂移离散，而在扩散项在步内的随机涨落无法被左连续插值捕捉；若只在网格点比较，Euler 对纯扩散可精确，但强阶定义含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span>，故阶降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。这与 canonical claim“Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>”一致：弱阶在网格点度量，无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 惩罚。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Heun-的强阶-1\">Heun 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Heun-的强阶-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Heun 局部误差）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，Heun 格式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\tilde Y&amp;=Y_{t_k}+f(Y_{t_k})h_k+g(Y_{t_k})\\Delta W_k,\\\\\nY_{t_{k+1}}&amp;=Y_{t_k}+\\tfrac12\\big(f(Y_{t_k})+f(\\tilde Y)\\big)h_k+\\tfrac12\\big(g(Y_{t_k})+g(\\tilde Y)\\big)\\Delta W_k\n\\end{aligned}$$</div>\n<p>的局部截断误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_H h_k^{3/2}$</span>，即局部强阶指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 作 Itô–Taylor 展开至含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g\\,dW$</span> 的一阶项。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W=\\Delta W_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=h_k$</span>。由假设 A 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C_b^4$</span>，Itô 公式给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}=Y_{t_k}+f(Y_{t_k})h+g(Y_{t_k})\\Delta W+R,$$</div>\n<p>其中余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\int_{t_k}^{s}(\\cdots)\\,du\\,ds$</span> 型与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\int_{t_k}^{s}(\\cdots)\\,dW_u\\,dW_s$</span> 型积分。逐项估计：漂移–漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>；漂移–扩散交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h\\,dW$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{3/2}$</span>）；扩散–扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\int_{t_k}^{s}L_g g\\,dW_u\\,dW_s$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|R\\|_{L^2}=O(h^{3/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p>另一方面，Heun 步可写为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的梯形平均。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\tilde Y)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}$</span> 处展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Y-Y_{t_k}=f h+g\\Delta W$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\tilde Y)=f(Y_{t_k})+f'(Y_{t_k})(f h+g\\Delta W)+O(\\|f h+g\\Delta W\\|^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\Delta W\\|^2$</span> 的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>）。同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\tilde Y)=g(Y_{t_k})+g'(Y_{t_k})(f h+g\\Delta W)+O(h)$</span>。代入 Heun 步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y_{t_{k+1}}=Y_{t_k}+f h+g\\Delta W+\\tfrac12 f'(f h+g\\Delta W)h+\\tfrac12 g'(f h+g\\Delta W)\\Delta W+O(h^{3/2}).$$</div>\n<p>而精确解的 Itô–Taylor 展开中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f'(g\\Delta W)h$</span>（漂移–扩散交叉，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{3/2}$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'(g\\Delta W)\\Delta W$</span>（扩散–扩散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>）以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f'f h^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span>）。比较可见，Heun 步与精确解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span> 以下一致，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|R\\|_{L^2}=O(h^{3/2})$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_H h^{3/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2（Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，Heun 格式的全局强误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)\\le C\\Delta$</span>，且一般情形下不能改进为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_H h_k^{3/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\tau_k^2\\le C_H^2\\sum_k h_k^3\\le C_H^2 T\\Delta^2$</span>，代入引理 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le C\\Delta$</span>。不可改进性：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=x$</span>（几何布朗运动），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x_0 e^{W_t-t/2}$</span>。Heun 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的梯形平均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(g(Y_{t_k})+g(\\tilde Y))\\Delta W=\\tfrac12(Y_{t_k}+\\tilde Y)\\Delta W$</span>，而精确解在步内的扩散–扩散项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\int g'g\\,dW\\,dW$</span>，其与梯形近似之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 量，累积后给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 阶而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（Euler 与 Heun 的阶差恒等式）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，对同一网格与同一噪声实现，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Y^{\\mathrm{Heun}}_{t_k}-Y^{\\mathrm{Euler}}_{t_k}\\|^2\\le C h_k^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_k}-Y^{\\mathrm{Heun}}_{t_k}\\|^2\\le C h_k^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_k}-Y^{\\mathrm{Euler}}_{t_k}\\|^2$</span> 一般仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_k)$</span>。故 Heun 相对 Euler 的改进恰为把网格点强误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1}$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{2}$</span>（平方意义），对应强阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由命题 2 的展开直接相减：Heun 步与 Euler 步之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(f(\\tilde Y)-f(Y_{t_k}))h+\\tfrac12(g(\\tilde Y)-g(Y_{t_k}))\\Delta W$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})+O(h)=O(h)$</span>，平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>。第二式由定理 2。第三式由定理 1 的不可改进性例。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶与弱阶的分离-为何本节只证强阶\">强阶与弱阶的分离：为何本节只证强阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶与弱阶的分离-为何本节只证强阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺强收敛阶，故只证强阶；弱阶在第 5 节展开。但需在此说明二者的数学分界，以免混淆：强阶的局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数，含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的随机项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 量级；弱阶的局部误差是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 取期望后的偏差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\Delta W=0$</span> 消去奇次项，故 Euler 弱局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>、全局弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。canonical claim“Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、Heun 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>”正是这一消去的后果：Heun 的梯形平均在期望意义下匹配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^3)$</span>。本节不重复该推导，仅指出：强阶证明中保留的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 耦合项，在弱阶证明中被期望消去，这是两个阶数不同的唯一根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的强误差\">具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的强误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的强误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma$</span>（常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\sigma\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t^2=\\sigma^2(1-e^{-2\\theta t})/(2\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p>Euler 步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_{k+1}}=(1-\\theta h)Y_{t_k}+\\sigma\\Delta W_k$</span>。等步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/N$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_k}=\\sigma\\sum_{j&lt;k}(1-\\theta h)^{k-1-j}\\Delta W_j$</span>。网格点强误差平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}(X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k})^2=\\sigma^2\\sum_{j&lt;k}\\Big(e^{-\\theta(t_k-t_j)}-(1-\\theta h)^{k-1-j}\\Big)^2 h.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_h-Y_h=\\sigma\\int_0^h e^{-\\theta(h-s)}dW_s-\\sigma\\Delta W_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(\\cdot)^2=\\sigma^2\\int_0^h(e^{-\\theta(h-s)}-1)^2ds=\\sigma^2 h^3\\theta^2/3+O(h^4)$</span>，即单步强误差平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^3)$</span>，对应局部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=O(h^{3/2})$</span>？此处需注意：Euler 对常数扩散的局部误差仅来自漂移离散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=O(h^{3/2})$</span> 而非命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，因为扩散项精确匹配。但全局网格点误差平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^3\\cdot N=Th^2$</span>），即网格点强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；而含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 的左连续插值在步内引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的扩散涨落，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}=O(h^{1/2})$</span>。这验证了定理 1 的不可改进性来自插值而非网格点。</p>\n<p>Heun 对同一过程：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，梯形平均退化为 Euler 的扩散项，漂移用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(f(Y)+f(\\tilde Y))h$</span>，展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t_{k+1}}=(1-\\theta h+\\tfrac12\\theta^2h^2)Y_{t_k}+\\sigma\\Delta W_k+O(h^{3/2})$</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\theta h}=1-\\theta h+\\tfrac12\\theta^2h^2+O(h^3)$</span> 比较，网格点强误差平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^4)$</span>，全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^3)$</span>，即网格点强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span>；含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，与定理 2 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶的数值测量接口\">强阶的数值测量接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶的数值测量接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>强阶不能由单条轨道估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 与期望，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条独立噪声实现取样本平均。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，用同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个布朗样本驱动精细参考解（步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta/2^r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 足够大使参考误差低于被测阶）与粗格式，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e(\\Delta)=\\big(\\frac1M\\sum_{i=1}^M\\sup_k\\|X^{(i)}_{t_k}-Y^{(i)}_{t_k}\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\hat e$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta$</span> 作最小二乘得斜率。代码节（第 14 节）给出可运行实现；本节只声明测量协议，不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>强阶由局部–全局分解刻画：全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 当且仅当局部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=O(h_k^{p+1/2})$</span>，指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1/2$</span> 来自随机项平方期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 因子。</li>\n<li>Euler 的局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>、全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，其不可改进性源于左连续插值在步内丢失扩散涨落；Heun 的局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span>、全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，梯形平均匹配了 Itô–Taylor 展开的交叉项。</li>\n<li>强阶与弱阶的分界在于是否对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 取期望：强阶保留噪声耦合、度量逐轨道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 误差；弱阶消去奇次项、只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时刻度量分布偏差。本节所有估计均在假设 A（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C_b^4$</span>）与假设 B（增量独立）下成立，缺一则局部展开的逐项可积性失效。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶的精确常数-从局部误差到全局误差的传递\">强阶的精确常数：从局部误差到全局误差的传递<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶的精确常数-从局部误差到全局误差的传递\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面已给出阶的估计，但工程上更关心常数。引理 1 的证明给出了显式传递因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{CT}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数。下面把该常数精确化，得到一个可检验的恒等式，用于判断有限步长下哪种格式更优。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（误差传递恒等式）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k}\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=L_f^2+L_g^2$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k+1}\\le (1+L h_k)\\delta_k+2\\tau_k^2+\\rho_k,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k=2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\langle X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k},\\ \\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}}-(X_{t_{k+1}}-\\hat X_{t_{k+1}})\\rangle\\big]$</span> 为交叉项，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\rho_k|\\le 2\\sqrt{\\delta_k}\\,\\tau_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{k+1}=\\mathbb{E}\\|(X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k})+(\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}})-(X_{t_{k+1}}-\\hat X_{t_{k+1}})\\|^2$</span> 展开得三项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}}\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2$</span> 与两个交叉项。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_{k+1}}\\|^2\\le (1+L h_k)\\delta_k$</span> 由假设 A 的 Lipschitz 性与 Itô 等距逐项估计（漂移项用 Cauchy–Schwarz，扩散项用 Itô 等距，交叉项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2ab\\le a^2+b^2$</span> 吸收）。交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k$</span> 由 Cauchy–Schwarz 界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sqrt{\\delta_k}\\cdot\\tau_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的意义：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\delta_k}$</span> 同阶时交叉项不可忽略，误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\delta_k}$</span> 线性增长而非平方增长，这正是强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的代数根源。对 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=O(h_k)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\delta_k}=O(h_k^{1/2})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k=O(h_k^{3/2})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2=O(h_k^2)$</span> 同量级以下，传递主项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+Lh_k)\\delta_k$</span> 控制；对 Heun，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=O(h_k^{3/2})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\delta_k}=O(h_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k=O(h_k^{5/2})$</span>，主项仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+Lh_k)\\delta_k$</span>。两种格式的传递因子相同，差别全在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的幂次，这解释了为何 Heun 的改进是“局部阶提升”而非“稳定性提升”。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（有限步长下的格式比较）</strong>：设等步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，Euler 与 Heun 的全局强误差平方分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{\\mathrm{E}}_N$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{\\mathrm{H}}_N$</span>。在假设 A、B 下存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T,L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的导数界）使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta^{\\mathrm{E}}_N\\le C_1 h,\\qquad \\delta^{\\mathrm{H}}_N\\le C_2 h^2.$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;C_1/C_2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{\\mathrm{H}}_N&lt;\\delta^{\\mathrm{E}}_N$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;C_1/C_2$</span> 时不等式反向。故“Heun 总优于 Euler”不成立，交叉步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\ast=C_1/C_2$</span> 由漂移与扩散的导数界决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：两式由定理 1、定理 2 的证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\tau_k^2$</span> 的估计直接给出，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=C_E^2T e^{LT}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=C_H^2T e^{LT}$</span>。比较即得交叉步长。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 8 节步长选择的数学依据之一：格式选择与步长选择不可分离，大步长下低阶格式的常数优势可能压过高阶格式的阶优势。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶在非全局-Lipschitz-系数下的失效边界\">强阶在非全局 Lipschitz 系数下的失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶在非全局-Lipschitz-系数下的失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C_b^4$</span>。若仅有局部 Lipschitz 与线性增长，定理 1、定理 2 的证明中 Itô–Taylor 展开的逐项可积性需额外的矩有界性。下面给出一个可检验的充分条件，并指出缺哪条会失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（局部 Lipschitz 下的强阶保持）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、线性增长（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x)\\|\\le K(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g(x)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le K(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C^4$</span> 在紧集上。若对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ge 1$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_T\\|^{2q}&lt;\\infty$</span> 且格式满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Y_{t_k}\\|^{2q}\\le C_q$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_q$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k,\\Delta$</span>），则定理 1、定理 2 的强阶结论仍成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：Itô–Taylor 展开的每一项在事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sup_t\\|X_t\\|\\le R\\}$</span> 上由紧集上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^4$</span> 界控制，在补事件上用线性增长界与 Markov 不等式控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(R^{-2q})$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 并用 Dominated Convergence（控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(1+\\|X_t\\|)^{2q}$</span>，可积）得逐项期望的极限。格式矩有界性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的估计中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\tilde Y\\|^{2q}$</span> 一致有界，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\tilde Y)$</span> 的展开余项可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>失效边界：若格式矩无界（如显式 Euler 对超线性漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Lh&gt;2$</span> 时爆炸），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 估计失效，命题 4 不适用；此时强阶无意义，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 本身不收敛。第 10 节反例节将给出具体构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶与生成动力学目标的关系\">强阶与生成动力学目标的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶与生成动力学目标的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的轨道距离，但生成动力学的最终目标是分布。需明确：强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 蕴含弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p$</span>（由 Cauchy–Schwarz，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 有界 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(Y_T)|\\le \\mathrm{Lip}(\\varphi)\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|X_T-Y_T\\|\\le \\mathrm{Lip}(\\varphi)\\,e^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span>），但反之不成立。故强阶是比弱阶更强的要求，工程上若只关心分布，弱阶才是正确度量；强阶的价值在于它保证同一噪声实现下的轨道可比，这是方差缩减、路径wise 控制与一致性模型蒸馏（第 15 节接口）所需的性质。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（强阶到弱阶的传递）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，Euler 的弱阶至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，Heun 的弱阶至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。结合第 5 节的弱阶精确结果（Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、Heun 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>），可见强阶到弱阶的传递是松的，差距恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>：弱阶比强阶高 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，因为期望消去了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的奇次贡献。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由上述 Cauchy–Schwarz 与定理 1、定理 2 直接得下界；精确弱阶由第 5 节给出，此处只引用其结论作为对照，不重复推导。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶估计中的鞅结构-为何-sup_t-可取\">强阶估计中的鞅结构：为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 可取<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶估计中的鞅结构-为何-sup_t-可取\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>引理 1 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 的处理用了“在步内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=Y_{t_k}$</span>”的粗界。更精细的做法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_t-Y_t\\|^2$</span> 在步内看作半鞅，用 Doob 不等式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 的期望转化为终端时刻的期望。下面给出这一改进，它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 的常数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>，对有限样本测量有意义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（步内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 的 Doob 界）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span>，过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\|X_t-Y_{t_k}\\|^2-\\int_{t_k}^t\\big(2\\langle X_s-Y_{t_k},f(X_s)\\rangle+\\|g(X_s)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2\\big)ds$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-鞅。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})}\\|X_t-Y_{t_k}\\|^2\\le 4\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_{k+1}}-Y_{t_k}\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Itô 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\|X_t-Y_{t_k}\\|^2=2\\langle X_t-Y_{t_k},f(X_t)\\rangle dt+\\|g(X_t)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2dt+2\\langle X_t-Y_{t_k},g(X_t)dW_t\\rangle$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 为随机积分，是鞅（被积过程平方可积由假设 A 保证）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 用 Doob 不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_t M_t^2\\le 4\\mathbb{E}M_{t_{k+1}}^2$</span>，再注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_t-Y_{t_k}\\|^2=M_t+$</span>有界变差项，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2ab\\le a^2+b^2$</span> 吸收得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 的惩罚在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下至多是常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>，不改变阶；阶的损失来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t-Y_{t_k}$</span> 在步内的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 涨落，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 本身。这澄清了一个常见误解：并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 把阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，而是左连续插值丢失了步内扩散涨落；若改用步内线性插值（Milstein 型），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t$</span> 的阶可回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-一个可检验的恒等式-强误差的方差分解\">一个可检验的恒等式：强误差的方差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-一个可检验的恒等式-强误差的方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个用于诊断数值实现的恒等式：把强误差平方分解为“偏差平方”与“轨道方差”，二者分别对应格式的系统性偏差与噪声实现间的离散度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（强误差的偏差–方差分解）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y_{t_k}=\\mathbb{E}Y_{t_k}$</span>（对噪声取期望），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_{t_k}-Y_{t_k}\\|^2=\\|\\mathbb{E}X_{t_k}-\\bar Y_{t_k}\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|(X_{t_k}-\\mathbb{E}X_{t_k})-(Y_{t_k}-\\bar Y_{t_k})\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>右端第一项为偏差平方，第二项为轨道方差。对 Euler 与 Heun，偏差平方分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^4)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\Delta W=0$</span>，格式的期望恰为确定性 Euler/Heun 对漂移的离散），而轨道方差项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>。故强误差平方的主项是轨道方差而非偏差，这与弱阶（只度量偏差）高出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶的事实一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|A-B\\|^2=\\|\\mathbb{E}A-\\mathbb{E}B\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|(A-\\mathbb{E}A)-(B-\\mathbb{E}B)\\|^2$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=X_{t_k}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=Y_{t_k}$</span> 即得。偏差项：Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Y_{t_{k+1}}=(I+h f)\\mathbb{E}Y_{t_k}$</span> 是确定性 Euler，其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X$</span> 的偏差由确定性 Euler 的局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 累积得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>？此处需注意：确定性 Euler 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X$</span> 的偏差平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X$</span> 满足常微分方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\bar X=f(\\bar X)dt$</span> 加 Itô 修正项，Euler 忽略修正项，局部偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>、全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>）。Heun 匹配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 局部，全局偏差平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^4)$</span>。轨道方差项由命题 1、命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 中随机部分给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式在代码节（第 14 节）中可直接用于分离两种误差来源：固定噪声样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，分别估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\frac1M\\sum_i Y^{(i)}-\\frac1M\\sum_i X^{(i)}\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1M\\sum_i\\|(Y^{(i)}-\\bar Y)-(X^{(i)}-\\bar X)\\|^2$</span>，验证二者随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的幂次与命题 6 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶估计的维度依赖性\">强阶估计的维度依赖性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶估计的维度依赖性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2$</span> 均含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的因子。对高维生成模型（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为图像维度量级），强阶的常数可能极大，导致有限步长下高阶格式不占优。下面给出维度依赖的显式界，作为第 8 节步长选择与第 12 节少步生成接口的输入。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（维度依赖的常数界）</strong>：在假设 A、B 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f'\\|_\\infty\\le L_f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g'\\|_\\infty\\le L_g$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f''\\|_\\infty\\le M_f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g''\\|_\\infty\\le M_g$</span>。则定理 1、定理 2 中的常数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_1\\le T e^{LT}\\big(L_f^2+L_g^2\\big)\\big(1+\\|g\\|_\\infty^2\\big)d,\\qquad C_2\\le T e^{LT}\\big(M_f^2+M_g^2\\big)\\big(1+\\|g\\|_\\infty^2\\big)^2 d^2.$$</div>\n<p>故 Heun 相对 Euler 的常数优势随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 增大而缩小：交叉步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\ast=C_1/C_2$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/d$</span> 衰减，即高维下需更小步长才能体现 Heun 的阶优势。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 1 的证明中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2$</span> 的估计含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|g(\\hat X_s)-g(Y_{t_k})\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2$</span>，其按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\cdot m$</span> 个分量求和，每分量由 Lipschitz 界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g^2\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat X_s-Y_{t_k}\\|^2$</span> 控制，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 因子。命题 2 的证明中，二阶展开项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f',g'$</span> 的乘积与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W\\Delta W^\\top$</span> 的迹，迹的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m h$</span>，但二阶导数的 HS 范数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d^2$</span> 求和，故得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d^2$</span> 因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题不改变阶，只改变常数；它说明强阶的“阶”是渐近性质，有限步长下的格式选择必须结合维度与系数界，不能只看阶数。这正是第 8 节步长选择与第 9 节误差累积要处理的问题，本节只提供常数界的数学形式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-弱收敛阶\">弱收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>；漂移系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动；数值逼近记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}$</span>，精确解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span>。前序节已建立 Euler 与 Heun 的强收敛阶，本节只讨论弱收敛阶。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在本节开头定义并仅在本节使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上有界且各阶偏导有界的实值函数空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_\\infty=\\sup_x|\\varphi(x)|$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(f),\\mathrm{Lip}(g)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的全局 Lipschitz 常数。</li>\n<li>弱误差：对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\Delta;\\varphi):=\\big|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\\big|.$$</div></li>\n<li>弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>：若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\varphi,T)$</span> 使得对充分小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\Delta;\\varphi)\\le C(\\varphi,T)\\,\\Delta^\\beta,$$</div>\n则称该数值格式关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 具有弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>；若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^\\infty$</span> 中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 一致成立（常数可依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 但与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关），则称格式具有弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设（H1）–（H4），逐条列出并在本节情境下验证其成立性：</p>\n<p>（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|f(x)-f(y)|+|g(x)-g(y)|\\le L|x-y|,\\qquad |f(x)|^2+|g(x)|^2\\le L^2(1+|x|^2).$$</div>\n该假设保证 SDE 强解存在唯一且各阶矩有限，是前序节强收敛分析已使用的条件，本节沿用。</p>\n<p>（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in C_b^\\infty$</span> 的局部版本：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 具有直到四阶的有界连续偏导。此条件用于对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]$</span> 作 Itô–Taylor 展开到四阶余项，保证展开中出现的所有迭代积分期望有限。</p>\n<p>（H3）测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。此条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的各阶导数有界，从而 Itô 公式中出现的复合项可逐项控制。</p>\n<p>（H4）扩散系数满足一致椭圆条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top(x)\\succeq \\lambda I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>。此条件保证转移密度存在且光滑，使得弱展开中的对偶算子具有足够的正则性；若仅需弱阶而不涉及密度比较，可放宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化，但本节保留一致椭圆以便使用 Leibniz 法则对密度积分求导。</p>\n<p>以上四条在本节情境下均成立：生成模型的反向 SDE 漂移与扩散由得分函数与噪声日程给出，实践中得分网络经 Lipschitz 正则化训练，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 由日程解析给定且非退化，故（H1）（H4）自然满足；（H2）（H3）是分析弱阶的标准技术假设，用于控制展开余项，不改变格式本身的定义。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义是弱收敛阶，它与强收敛阶的区别在于：强阶衡量路径逐点逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|X^\\Delta_T-X_T|$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 误差，弱阶衡量分布经测试函数积分后的误差。强阶控制弱阶（强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 蕴含弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X^\\Delta)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X)|\\le \\mathrm{Lip}(\\varphi)\\mathbb{E}|X^\\Delta-X|$</span>），反之不成立；Euler 的强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 而弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，正是这一区别的典型体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱误差的-Itô-Taylor-展开结构\">弱误差的 Itô–Taylor 展开结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱误差的-Itô-Taylor-展开结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱收敛阶的分析不追踪单条路径，而是追踪 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]$</span> 随时间的演化。由 Itô 公式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t+\\Delta})]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_t)]\n=\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(X_s)]\\,ds,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 为生成元\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^d f_i(x)\\partial_i\\varphi(x)+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j=1}^d (gg^\\top)_{ij}(x)\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.5.1（Euler 弱阶一：单步展开）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，Euler 格式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta}=X^\\Delta_t+f(X^\\Delta_t)\\Delta+g(X^\\Delta_t)\\Delta W_t,\\qquad \\Delta W_t\\sim N(0,\\Delta I_m)$$</div>\n满足单步弱误差展开\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta})\\mid X^\\Delta_t=x]\n=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\,\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\,\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi(x)+R_3(x,\\Delta),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_3(x,\\Delta)|\\le C_\\varphi(1+|x|^4)\\Delta^3$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处作三阶 Taylor 展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta})=\\varphi(x)+\\sum_i\\partial_i\\varphi(x)\\,\\delta_i+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi(x)\\,\\delta_i\\delta_j+\\frac16\\sum_{i,j,k}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\partial_k\\varphi(\\xi)\\,\\delta_i\\delta_j\\delta_k,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta}-x=f(x)\\Delta+g(x)\\Delta W_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 位于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta}$</span> 之间。取条件期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_t]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_t^i\\Delta W_t^j]=\\Delta\\delta_{ij}$</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 独立：</p>\n<p>一阶项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\sum_i\\partial_i\\varphi(x)f_i(x)\\Delta]= \\Delta\\sum_i f_i\\partial_i\\varphi(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p>二阶项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathbb{E}[\\sum_{i,j}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi(x)(f_i\\Delta+g_{ik}\\Delta W^k)(f_j\\Delta+g_{jl}\\Delta W^l)]$</span>。展开后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的一次项期望为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\Delta^2\\sum_{i,j}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi f_if_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W\\Delta W$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\Delta\\sum_{i,j,k}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi g_{ik}g_{jk}=\\frac12\\Delta\\sum_{i,j}(gg^\\top)_{ij}\\partial_i\\partial_j\\varphi$</span>。</p>\n<p>合并一阶与二阶的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)$</span>；二阶的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 项与三阶余项合并记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_3$</span>。三阶余项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 等项，但由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|\\Delta W|^{2k}]\\le C_k\\Delta^k$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 三阶导有界，可逐项估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_3|\\le C_\\varphi(1+|x|^4)\\Delta^3$</span>（交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\cdot\\Delta W$</span> 的期望为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W^3$</span> 的期望为零，剩余项阶数不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^3$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.5.1 的关键在于：单步弱误差的主项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 量级（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 项已被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi$</span> 吸收），这预示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步累积后弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta^2=T\\Delta$</span>，即弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-主定理-Euler-与-Heun-的弱收敛阶\">主定理：Euler 与 Heun 的弱收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-主定理-Euler-与-Heun-的弱收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 23.5.2（Euler 弱阶一）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\varphi,T)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\\big|\\le C(\\varphi,T)\\,\\Delta.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 满足倒向 Kolmogorov 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u+\\mathcal{L}u=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T,\\cdot)=\\varphi$</span>。由（H2）（H4），<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 具有直到四阶的有界连续导数，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 具有直到二阶的有界连续导数（一致椭圆保证正则性提升）。</p>\n<p>将 Euler 单步误差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 比较：由命题 23.5.1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X^\\Delta_{t_n}=x]\n=u(t_{n+1},x)+\\Delta\\mathcal{L}u(t_{n+1},x)+\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\mathcal{L}^2u(t_{n+1},x)+R_3,$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t_n,x)=u(t_{n+1},x)-\\Delta\\partial_t u(t_{n+1},x)+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u=-\\mathcal{L}u$</span>，两式相减得单步局部误差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})-u(t_n,X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\mid X^\\Delta_{t_n}=x]\n=\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\big(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2 u\\big)(t_{n+1},x)+O(\\Delta^3),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 的常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的四阶导与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的导数界，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 一致（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 各阶导有界）。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 求和并取期望，望远镜消去：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u(T,X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[u(0,X^\\Delta_0)]\n=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\tfrac12\\Delta^2(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u)(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\big]+N\\cdot O(\\Delta^3).$$</div>\n右端第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot\\frac12\\Delta^2\\cdot O(1)=O(\\Delta)$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T,\\cdot)=\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_0=X_0$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]=O(\\Delta),$$</div>\n即弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 23.5.3（Heun 弱阶二）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，Heun 格式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde X=X^\\Delta_{t_n}+f(X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\Delta+g(X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\Delta W_n,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}}=X^\\Delta_{t_n}+\\tfrac12\\big(f(X^\\Delta_{t_n})+f(\\tilde X)\\big)\\Delta+\\tfrac12\\big(g(X^\\Delta_{t_n})+g(\\tilde X)\\big)\\Delta W_n$$</div>\n满足对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\\big|\\le C(\\varphi,T)\\,\\Delta^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 证明分两步。第一步，计算 Heun 单步的条件弱误差展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^3$</span> 阶。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\tilde X)$</span> 并作 Taylor 展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\tilde X)=f(x)+Df(x)(f(x)\\Delta+g(x)\\Delta W)+\\tfrac12 D^2f(x)[\\delta,\\delta]+O(|\\delta|^3),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=f(x)\\Delta+g(x)\\Delta W$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\tilde X)$</span> 同理。代入 Heun 更新式，合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的同阶项。关键观察：Heun 的漂移与扩散增量恰为 Euler 增量与\"校正增量\"的平均，校正增量的一阶部分与 Euler 增量的一阶部分相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 阶项仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)\\Delta$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 阶项中，Euler 格式多出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\Delta^2\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi$</span> 被校正项中的对应部分抵消。逐项计算可得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t+\\Delta})\\mid X^\\Delta_t=x]\n=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi(x)+\\tfrac16\\Delta^3\\mathcal{L}^3\\varphi(x)+R_4(x,\\Delta),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_4|\\le C_\\varphi(1+|x|^6)\\Delta^4$</span>。与精确解的单步展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t+\\Delta})\\mid X_t=x]=\\varphi(x)+\\Delta\\mathcal{L}\\varphi(x)+\\frac12\\Delta^2\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi(x)+\\frac16\\Delta^3\\mathcal{L}^3\\varphi(x)+O(\\Delta^4)$</span> 逐项吻合到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^3$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步，与定理 23.5.2 相同地用倒向 Kolmogorov 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 作望远镜求和。此时单步局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 项已匹配），<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot O(\\Delta^3)=O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。故弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 23.5.3 的证明中，Heun 格式的\"预测–校正\"结构使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 阶的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi$</span> 项被精确抵消，这是弱阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的代数根源；而强阶仅从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，因为强误差由路径层面的 Brownian 增量波动主导，校正项无法消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的高阶矩波动。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-可检验推论-弱阶的叠加恒等式\">可检验推论：弱阶的叠加恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-可检验推论-弱阶的叠加恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 23.5.4（弱误差的步数分解）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta$</span> 为 Euler 格式，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\n=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathcal{E}_n(X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\big]+O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n(x)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X^\\Delta_{t_n}=x]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X_{t_n}=x]$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步的局部弱误差，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n(x)=\\frac12\\Delta^2(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u)(t_{n+1},x)+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由全期望公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\n=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\Big(\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})]\\Big)$$</div>\n不成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 分布不同，不能直接望远镜。正确做法是引入桥接：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_n$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}$</span> 出发、按精确 SDE 演化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}$</span> 的随机变量，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(Y_n)]\n=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathcal{E}_n(X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\big],$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(Y_n)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})]$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 的分布差异累积。将后者按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n=O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 的一致界，得总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{E}_n]+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 23.5.4 的意义在于：弱误差可分解为逐步局部误差之和，每步局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 量级，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步叠加为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 量级。这为第 8 节步长选择与第 9 节误差累积提供了可直接引用的恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的弱阶验证\">具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的弱阶验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的弱阶验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。精确解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_T=x_0 e^{-\\theta T}+\\sigma\\int_0^T e^{-\\theta(T-s)}\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T\\sim N\\big(x_0 e^{-\\theta T},\\ \\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta T})\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p>取测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span>。精确期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[X_T^2]=x_0^2 e^{-2\\theta T}+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta T}).$$</div></p>\n<p>Euler 格式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}}=(1-\\theta\\Delta)X^\\Delta_{t_n}+\\sigma\\Delta W_n$</span>。递推得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^\\Delta_T=(1-\\theta\\Delta)^N x_0+\\sigma\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{N-1-n}\\Delta W_n.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 独立，方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(X^\\Delta_T)=\\sigma^2\\Delta\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2k}\n=\\sigma^2\\Delta\\,\\frac{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2N}}{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2}.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta\\Delta)^N=e^{-\\theta T}+O(\\Delta)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta=T$</span>），分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2=2\\theta\\Delta-\\theta^2\\Delta^2$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(X^\\Delta_T)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta T})+O(\\Delta).$$</div>\n均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta\\Delta)^N x_0=x_0 e^{-\\theta T}+O(\\Delta)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]+O(\\Delta)$</span>，验证弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p>Heun 格式：对线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span>，Heun 更新为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}}=X^\\Delta_{t_n}+\\tfrac12\\big(-\\theta X^\\Delta_{t_n}-\\theta\\tilde X\\big)\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W_n,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X=X^\\Delta_{t_n}-\\theta X^\\Delta_{t_n}\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W_n$</span>。代入化简得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}}=\\big(1-\\theta\\Delta+\\tfrac12\\theta^2\\Delta^2\\big)X^\\Delta_{t_n}+\\sigma(1-\\tfrac12\\theta\\Delta)\\Delta W_n.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1-\\theta\\Delta+\\frac12\\theta^2\\Delta^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\sigma(1-\\frac12\\theta\\Delta)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_T=a^N x_0+b\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}a^{N-1-k}\\Delta W_k$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2\\Delta\\frac{1-a^{2N}}{1-a^2}$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln a=-\\theta\\Delta+O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^N=e^{-\\theta T}+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2=\\sigma^2(1-\\theta\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-a^2=2\\theta\\Delta-\\frac32\\theta^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(X^\\Delta_T)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta T})+O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n均值同样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0 e^{-\\theta T}+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，验证弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<p>此例同时说明：弱阶的验证只需比较分布的矩（对多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>），无需路径耦合；这与强阶验证需构造公共 Brownian 驱动的耦合形成对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶与强阶的分离机制\">弱阶与强阶的分离机制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶与强阶的分离机制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.5.5（强阶不蕴含更高弱阶）</strong> 存在满足（H1）的 SDE 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty$</span>，使得 Euler 格式的强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 而弱阶严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（不能提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_T=\\sum_{n}\\Delta W_n=W_T$</span>（Euler 对纯扩散精确）。此时弱误差为零，不构成反例。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=1+x^2$</span> 的有界化版本与非线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，Euler 的单步弱展开中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi$</span> 无法被抵消，故弱阶恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；而强误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 波动给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 阶。完整构造与失效边界见第 10 节反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.5.5 表明弱阶与强阶是独立定义的量，不能互相替代；在生成模型中，我们关心的是分布层面的逼近（弱阶），而非单条采样路径的逼近（强阶），因此第 7 节 DPM-Solver 的分析将以弱阶为主要指标。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>弱收敛阶定义为测试函数期望的误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\Delta;\\varphi)\\le C(\\varphi,T)\\Delta^\\beta$</span>，与强收敛阶（路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 误差）是独立概念；强阶控制弱阶，反之不成立。</li>\n<li>在（H1）–（H4）下，Euler 格式弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（定理 23.5.2），Heun 格式弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（定理 23.5.3）；证明核心是倒向 Kolmogorov 方程的正则性与单步 Itô–Taylor 展开的逐项匹配，Heun 的预测–校正结构精确抵消 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 阶的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2\\varphi$</span> 项。</li>\n<li>推论 23.5.4 给出弱误差的步数分解恒等式，将总误差表为局部弱误差之和加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 余项，为后续步长选择与误差累积分析提供可直接引用的代数结构；一维 OU 过程的矩计算验证了两种格式的弱阶。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶的加性泛函刻画与对偶恒等式\">弱阶的加性泛函刻画与对偶恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶的加性泛函刻画与对偶恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 23.5.2 与 23.5.3 的证明依赖倒向 Kolmogorov 方程的正则性，这一路径在（H4）一致椭圆下成立。若希望绕开密度的光滑性、仅用测试函数本身的代数性质得到弱阶，可引入如下对偶恒等式，它把弱误差写成对生成元迭代作用的一个显式泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.5.6（对偶恒等式）</strong> 在（H1）–（H3）下（不要求（H4）），设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 为倒向 Kolmogorov 方程的解，则对 Euler 格式，弱误差可表为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\n=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\big(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u\\big)(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_n})\\Big]+N\\cdot O(\\Delta^3),$$</div>\n其中余项常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的三阶导数界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的一、二阶导数界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 与定理 23.5.2 的望远镜求和相同，但此处不引用（H4）来断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的四阶正则性，而是直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 使用 Itô 公式。由（H1）（H3），<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 具有直到三阶的有界连续导数（这是 SDE 解对初值可微性的标准结论，仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的光滑性，不需要椭圆性）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}=x$</span> 处作 Taylor 展开至二阶，取条件期望，利用 Euler 增量的矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W^i\\Delta W^j]=\\Delta\\delta_{ij}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[u(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})\\mid x]=u(t_{n+1},x)+\\Delta\\mathcal{L}u(t_{n+1},x)+\\tfrac12\\Delta^2\\mathcal{L}^2u(t_{n+1},x)+O(\\Delta^3),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 的常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的三阶导与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的二阶导控制，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 一致。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t_n,x)=u(t_{n+1},x)-\\Delta\\partial_t u(t_{n+1},x)+\\frac12\\Delta^2\\partial_t^2u(t_{n+1},x)+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u=-\\mathcal{L}u$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 阶项，两式相减即得单步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\Delta^2(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u)+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 求和并取期望，望远镜消去中间项，即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.5.6 与推论 23.5.4 的区别在于：推论 23.5.4 把误差写成桥接随机变量的局部弱误差之和，需要构造精确 SDE 的桥接；命题 23.5.6 则直接给出可计算的泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u$</span>，它在 OU 例子中可显式算出，从而把弱阶的验证化为一个确定性的求和估计。这一对偶恒等式是第 9 节误差累积分析的代数基础：误差累积的本质就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u)(t_{n+1},X^\\Delta_{t_n})]$</span> 这一和式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时的极限行为。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶对测试函数类的依赖性\">弱阶对测试函数类的依赖性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶对测试函数类的依赖性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱收敛阶的定义中，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\varphi,T)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>。一个自然的问题是：弱阶是否对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^\\infty$</span> 中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 一致？下面的命题说明，弱阶的阶数本身与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 无关，但常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的高阶导数界增长；若把测试函数类缩小到多项式，则弱阶可能提高。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.5.7（弱阶的测试函数不变性）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，Euler 格式对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty$</span> 的弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 导数界的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，使得定理 23.5.2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\varphi,T)\\le K\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\le4}\\sup_x|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 23.5.6，弱误差的主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[\\frac12\\Delta^2(\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 决定，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial^\\alpha u\\|_\\infty\\le K_\\alpha\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^{|\\alpha|}}$</span>（这是倒向方程解对终端数据的标准估计，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\alpha$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的导数界）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2u+\\partial_t^2u$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}$</span> 控制，求和给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot\\frac12\\Delta^2\\cdot K\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}=O(\\Delta\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4})$</span>。余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 同样被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}$</span> 控制。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\varphi,T)\\le K\\|\\varphi\\|_{C^4}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.5.7 说明：弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^\\infty$</span> 的一致阶数，但误差常数随测试函数的光滑度增长。这对生成模型有直接含义：若我们用低阶矩（如均值、协方差）衡量采样质量，误差常数较小；若用高阶矩或光滑核密度估计，误差常数较大，需要更小步长才能达到同等精度。这也解释了为何第 8 节步长选择不能仅依赖一个标量误差界，而必须针对具体测试函数类给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶与强阶的插值不等式\">弱阶与强阶的插值不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶与强阶的插值不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>强阶与弱阶并非完全独立：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^p$</span> 范数下，弱误差被强误差的一个上界控制，而强误差又被弱误差的一个下界约束（通过选取特定测试函数）。下面的插值不等式把两者的关系定量化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.5.8（强–弱插值）</strong> 在（H1）–（H3）下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\\big|\n\\le \\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[|X^\\Delta_T-X_T|\\big].$$</div>\n若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|X^\\Delta_T-X_T|^2]\\le C\\Delta^{2\\alpha}$</span>（强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>），则弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\sqrt{C}\\,\\Delta^\\alpha$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由中值定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)-\\varphi(X_T)=\\int_0^1\\nabla\\varphi(X_T+s(X^\\Delta_T-X_T))\\cdot(X^\\Delta_T-X_T)\\,ds$</span>。取绝对值并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty$</span> 控制梯度，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)-\\varphi(X_T)|\\le\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty|X^\\Delta_T-X_T|$</span>。取期望即得第一式。第二式由 Cauchy–Schwarz：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|X^\\Delta_T-X_T|]\\le(\\mathbb{E}[|X^\\Delta_T-X_T|^2])^{1/2}\\le\\sqrt{C}\\Delta^\\alpha$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.5.8 表明：强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 通过梯度界转化为弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的上界，但这一上界通常不是紧的。Euler 的强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，插值不等式只给出弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1/2$</span> 的上界，而实际弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>——这说明弱阶可以严格高于强阶给出的上界，因为弱误差在期望层面发生了抵消。这一现象在生成模型中至关重要：单条采样路径的逐点误差可能较大，但分布层面的误差可以小得多，因此以弱阶为指标的采样器设计（如 DPM-Solver）能够在较少步数下获得可接受的分布精度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶的局部化-从全局到单步\">弱阶的局部化：从全局到单步<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶的局部化-从全局到单步\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 23.5.2 与 23.5.3 给出的是全局弱阶，其证明通过望远镜求和把全局误差化为局部误差之和。一个自然的反向问题是：局部弱阶与全局弱阶之间是否存在精确的对应？下面的命题给出肯定回答，并说明局部弱阶的阶数决定了全局弱阶的阶数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.5.9（局部–全局对应）</strong> 在（H1）–（H3）下，设数值格式满足：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X^\\Delta_{t_n}=x]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_{t_{n+1}})\\mid X_{t_n}=x]\\big|\\le C_\\varphi(1+|x|^q)\\Delta^{\\beta+1},$$</div>\n即单步局部弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\beta+1}$</span> 阶。则全局弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\beta$</span> 阶，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)]\\big|\\le C_\\varphi'\\,\\Delta^\\beta,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\varphi'$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\varphi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 阶矩界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 23.5.4 的桥接分解，全局误差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{E}_n(X^\\Delta_{t_n})]$</span> 加上分布差异项。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n(x)\\le C_\\varphi(1+|x|^q)\\Delta^{\\beta+1}$</span>。取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 阶矩界（由（H1）的线性增长保证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|X^\\Delta_{t_n}|^q]\\le K_q(1+|x_0|^q)$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{E}_n]\\le C_\\varphi K_q\\Delta^{\\beta+1}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot C_\\varphi K_q\\Delta^{\\beta+1}=T C_\\varphi K_q\\Delta^\\beta$</span>。分布差异项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\Delta_{t_n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 的弱差异累积，其阶数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\beta$</span>（因为每步差异为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\beta+1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\beta$</span>）。故全局弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.5.9 把全局弱阶的分析归结为单步局部弱误差的阶数，这正是定理 23.5.2 与 23.5.3 证明的实际结构：Euler 的单步局部弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>），Heun 的单步局部弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^3$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=2$</span>）。这一对应关系是第 6 节指数积分器与第 7 节 DPM-Solver 分析的模板：只要算出单步局部弱误差的阶数，全局弱阶即由命题 23.5.9 给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶在生成模型中的含义-分布逼近而非路径逼近\">弱阶在生成模型中的含义：分布逼近而非路径逼近<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶在生成模型中的含义-分布逼近而非路径逼近\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在扩散生成模型中，采样器的目标是产生与数据分布匹配的样本，而非复现某条特定的反向 SDE 路径。因此弱阶而非强阶才是采样器精度的正确度量。具体地，设反向 SDE 的精确解在终端时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span>，数值采样器产生的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\Delta_T$</span>，则对任意有界连续测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\varphi\\,d\\mu^\\Delta_T-\\int\\varphi\\,d\\mu_T=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X^\\Delta_T)]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(X_T)],$$</div>\n这正是本节定义的弱误差。命题 23.5.9 说明，若采样器的单步局部弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\beta+1}$</span>，则终端分布与真实分布的弱距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\beta$</span> 阶。这一结论不依赖路径耦合的构造，因此适用于任何以离散时间步进方式实现的采样器，包括 Euler、Heun 与第 7 节的 DPM-Solver。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，弱阶的阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 与测试函数类有关：对多项式测试函数，弱阶可能高于对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^\\infty$</span> 测试函数的弱阶；对指示函数类（如总变差距离），弱阶的估计需要额外的密度正则性。本节在（H4）一致椭圆下保证了转移密度的光滑性，从而多项式测试函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^\\infty$</span> 测试函数给出相同的弱阶阶数，仅常数不同（命题 23.5.7）。若放弃（H4），则密度可能退化，弱阶对指示函数类的估计将需要单独处理，这属于第 10 节反例节的边界情形。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了弱收敛阶的定义、Euler 与 Heun 弱阶的主定理证明、对偶恒等式与局部–全局对应两个可检验推论，以及一维 OU 过程的显式验证。这些结果构成第 6 节指数积分器与第 7 节 DPM-Solver 弱阶分析的直接前提：指数积分器的单步局部弱误差将由其对线性部分的精确积分与对非线性部分的截断误差共同决定，而 DPM-Solver 的弱阶则由其指数积分结构与系数选择决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-指数积分器\">指数积分器<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-指数积分器\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 22 章已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为反向时间变量（从噪声端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 走向数据端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值扩散过程，满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t = f(X_t,t)\\,dt + g(t)\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，扩散标量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}$</span>（本节只处理标量扩散系数情形，矩阵扩散的推广在注记中说明），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(W_t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_f(t,s;x)$</span> 为漂移场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的确定性流，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\Phi_f(t,s;x)=f(\\Phi_f(t,s;x),t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_f(s,s;x)=x$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>积分因子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t,s):=\\exp\\!\\big(\\int_s^t a(u)\\,du\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(u)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 是漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 沿参考轨道的线性化系数（见定义 6.1 的分解式）。</li>\n<li><strong>线性化分解</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=a(t)\\,x + b(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为剩余非线性项。</li>\n<li><strong>指数积分器一步映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{\\Delta}(x,t)$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t+\\Delta\\le T$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>强收敛阶</strong>与<strong>弱收敛阶</strong>沿用第 4、5 节的定义：对步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 与网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>，数值解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{t_n}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar X_T-X_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C\\Delta^{p}$</span> 称强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^4(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(\\bar X_T)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)|\\le C\\Delta^{q}$</span> 称弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 阶。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 6.A（漂移正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}|a(t)|\\le L_a&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(0,t)$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 6.B（扩散正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续、有界、下有正界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;g_{\\min}\\le g(t)\\le g_{\\max}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 6.C（矩条件）</strong>：初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_T\\|^{2p}&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 2$</span>；在假设 6.A、6.B 下这保证 SDE 强解存在唯一且各阶矩有限（标准结果，不展开）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 6.D（测试函数正则性）</strong>：弱收敛分析中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^4(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，各阶偏导有界。</p>\n<p>上述四条假设在本节情境下为何成立：生成模型的反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 在数据分布紧支撑、得分估计 Lipschitz 的常规假设下满足 6.A；噪声日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 通常取连续正函数（如 VP-SDE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)$</span> 平方根），满足 6.B。凡本节命题只用到其中一部分，均在命题前显式列出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-1-指数积分器的定义与相邻概念的区别\">6.1 指数积分器的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-1-指数积分器的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 6.1（线性化分解与指数积分器）</strong>。设假设 6.A 成立。给定参考点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 与步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，将漂移在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t,t+\\Delta]$</span> 上按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(u)$</span> 线性化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(y,u)=a(u)\\,y+b(y,u),\\qquad y\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,\\ u\\in[t,t+\\Delta].$$</div>\n<p><strong>指数积分器一步映射</strong>定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t):=E(t+\\Delta,t)\\,x+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,b\\big(\\Psi_\\Delta^{(u)}(x,t),u\\big)\\,du+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,g(u)\\,dW_u,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta^{(u)}(x,t)$</span> 表示同一映射在中间时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的值（隐式定义，实际实现中用显式近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,t)$</span> 或一阶预测代替，见 6.4）。等价的微分形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\bar X_u=a(u)\\bar X_u\\,du+b(\\bar X_u,u)\\,du+g(u)\\,dW_u,\\qquad \\bar X_t=x,$$</div>\n<p>其解恰为上式（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(e^{-\\int a}\\bar X_u)$</span> 用 Itô 公式即得，见命题 6.2）。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>。（i）与 Euler 方法的区别：Euler 把整个漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 冻结在左端点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{t+\\Delta}=x+f(x,t)\\Delta+g(t)\\Delta W$</span>；指数积分器把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的线性部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(u)y$</span> 精确积分掉，只对非线性残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 做数值近似。（ii）与 Heun/Runge–Kutta 的区别：后者对全漂移做多级求积，不区分线性与非线性；指数积分器对线性部分无截断误差（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span> 时映射精确），这是它在扩散模型少步采样中低误差的结构性来源。（iii）与概率流 ODE 数值解的区别：指数积分器作用于 SDE 的强解，含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_u$</span> 项；ODE 情形只是去掉随机积分项的特例，两者不可混同。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.2（线性部分的精确性）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，假设 6.A 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 可积。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,t,\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t)=E(t+\\Delta,t)\\,x$</span> 恰为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot y=a(u)y$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 出发的精确解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(u):=e^{-\\int_t^u a(r)dr}\\,y(u)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot z=e^{-\\int_t^u a}\\big(\\dot y-a(u)y\\big)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(t)=x$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t+\\Delta)=e^{\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}a}\\,x=E(t+\\Delta,t)x$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.2 说明：指数积分器的截断误差完全来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的求积近似与随机项的离散化，而非线性漂移。这与 Euler 方法形成对照——后者即便 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span> 也有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 的局部截断误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-2-主定理-指数积分器的强收敛阶\">6.2 主定理：指数积分器的强收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-2-主定理-指数积分器的强收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 6.3（指数积分器强阶）</strong>。设假设 6.A、6.B、6.C 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 中残差项用左端点显式近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_\\Delta^{\\mathrm{exp}}(x,t):=E(t+\\Delta,t)\\,x+E(t+\\Delta,t)\\,b(x,t)\\,\\Delta+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,g(u)\\,dW_u.$$</div>\n<p>则在网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta=T$</span> 上，数值解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{t_n}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar X_T-X_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C\\,\\Delta^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>即强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(T,L_a,L_b,g_{\\max},g_{\\min},\\mathbb{E}\\|X_T\\|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>第一步：局部误差分解</em>。记真实解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t+\\Delta}=\\Phi^{\\mathrm{SDE}}_{t+\\Delta,t}(X_t)$</span>。由定义 6.1 的微分形式与 Itô 公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t+\\Delta}=E(t+\\Delta,t)X_t+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,b(X_u,u)\\,du+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,g(u)\\,dW_u .$$</div>\n<p>（验证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_u:=E(t+\\Delta,u)^{-1}X_u$</span> 用 Itô 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dY_u=E^{-1}\\big(f(X_u,u)-a(u)X_u\\big)du+E^{-1}g\\,dW_u=E^{-1}b\\,du+E^{-1}g\\,dW_u$</span>，积分回代即得。）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span> 相减，确定性部分的一步误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}^{\\mathrm{det}}_n:=\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\big[b(X_u,u)-b(X_t,t)\\big]\\,du .$$</div>\n<p>随机部分两者完全相同（同一 Brownian 增量驱动），故一步均方误差只来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}^{\\mathrm{det}}_n$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>第二步：估计确定性误差</em>。由假设 6.A，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b(X_u,u)-b(X_t,t)\\|\\le L_b\\|X_u-X_t\\|+\\omega_b(|u-t|)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_b$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的连续模。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t,t+\\Delta]$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_u-X_t\\|^2\\le C_1\\Delta$</span>（由 SDE 解的矩估计：漂移有界线性增长、扩散有界，标准 Krylov 估计给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{u\\in[t,t+\\Delta]}\\|X_u-X_t\\|^2\\le C_1\\Delta$</span>）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,u)\\le e^{L_a\\Delta}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\mathcal{E}^{\\mathrm{det}}_n\\|^2\\le e^{2L_a\\Delta}\\Delta^2\\Big(L_b^2 C_1\\Delta+\\omega_b(\\Delta)^2\\Big)\\le C_2\\Delta^3 .$$</div>\n<p><em>第三步：误差累积</em>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n:=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar X_{t_n}-X_{t_n}\\|^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\le e^{L_a\\Delta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>）与一步误差，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{n+1}\\le(1+L_a\\Delta+L_b\\Delta)^2\\,e_n+C_2\\Delta^3\\le(1+C_3\\Delta)e_n+C_2\\Delta^3 .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+C_3\\Delta\\le e^{C_3\\Delta}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}e^{C_3k\\Delta}\\Delta\\le C_4$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N\\le e^{C_3T}e_0+C_2\\Delta^3\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}e^{C_3k\\Delta}\\le C_5\\Delta^2 .$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar X_T-X_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C_5^{1/2}\\Delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>第四步：随机项的阶数下界</em>。上述分析中随机积分项被精确模拟，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span> 与真实解共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>，故强误差仅由确定性部分贡献，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^1$</span> 阶。然而若将随机积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)dW_u$</span> 用左端点近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,t)g(t)\\Delta W$</span>（这是实际实现中为节省计算常用的做法），则随机部分的误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\big(E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)-E(t+\\Delta,t)g(t)\\big)dW_u\\Big\\|^2=\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\|E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)-E(t+\\Delta,t)g(t)\\|^2du\\le C_6\\Delta^2,$$</div>\n<p>其均方根为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1}$</span>，累积后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 阶——这正是定理陈述的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶来源。若保留精确随机积分（如对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 可提出），则强阶提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。定理陈述取实际实现中左端点近似随机积分的保守情形。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注记 6.4</strong>。定理 6.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶与 Euler 方法的强阶一致，但两者的误差结构不同：Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶来自漂移与扩散的双重离散化，指数积分器的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶仅来自随机积分近似；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 可提出随机积分时，指数积分器达到强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，优于 Euler。这一区别在 DPM-Solver 的设计中被显式利用（见第 7 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-3-弱收敛阶与一个可检验的恒等式\">6.3 弱收敛阶与一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-3-弱收敛阶与一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.5（指数积分器弱阶）</strong>。设假设 6.A–6.D 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta^{\\mathrm{exp}}$</span> 如定理 6.3。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^4(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(\\bar X_T)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_T)\\big|\\le C_\\varphi\\,\\Delta^{1},$$</div>\n<p>即弱收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>。弱误差由一步弱局部误差累积。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 用 Itô–Taylor 展开至二阶：一步弱局部误差的主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathcal{E}^{\\mathrm{det}}_n\\cdot\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)\\big]+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\mathcal{E}^{\\mathrm{det}}_n=O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[b(X_u,u)-b(X_t,t)]$</span> 的漂移部分贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>）。随机积分近似的弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（因对称随机积分与左端点积分在期望下同阶）。累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。关键交换步骤：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>-积分交换用 Fubini，被积函数有界（假设 6.D 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界，假设 6.A 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> Lipschitz），条件满足。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.6（线性漂移的精确恒等式）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv g_0$</span> 常数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\equiv a_0$</span> 常数。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span> 与任意步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(\\bar X_T)\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X_T)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>即指数积分器在该情形下<strong>无弱误差</strong>（对任意步长精确匹配边缘分布）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_T=E(T,0)X_T+\\int_0^T E(T,u)g_0\\,dW_u$</span>，而真实解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=E(T,0)X_T+\\int_0^T E(T,u)g_0\\,dW_u$</span>（由命题 6.2 的积分形式），两者作为随机变量逐路径相等（同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 驱动、同一初值），故任意泛函的期望相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6.6 是可检验的：对 OU 过程（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数），指数积分器任意步长下边缘分布精确，数值实验可直接验证（见第 14 节代码）。这与 Euler 方法形成鲜明对照——后者即便对 OU 过程也有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 的弱误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-4-具体例子-OU-过程的指数积分器\">6.4 具体例子：OU 过程的指数积分器<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-4-具体例子-OU-过程的指数积分器\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>（此处时间正向，仅为验证公式，与生成模型的反向时间无关）。线性化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)=-\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,t)=e^{-\\theta\\Delta}$</span>。指数积分器一步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar X_{t+\\Delta}=e^{-\\theta\\Delta}\\bar X_t+\\sigma\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{-\\theta(t+\\Delta-u)}\\,dW_u .$$</div>\n<p>该积分是 Gaussian，均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{-2\\theta(t+\\Delta-u)}du=\\sigma^2\\frac{1-e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}}{2\\theta}$</span>。真实解在同一区间上的转移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}\\big(e^{-\\theta\\Delta}x,\\ \\sigma^2\\frac{1-e^{-2\\theta\\Delta}}{2\\theta}\\big)$</span>。两者转移核逐点相等，故任意步长下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_T\\stackrel{d}{=}X_T$</span>。这验证了推论 6.6，并给出可运行的数值检验目标：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，样本均值与方差应与真实边缘一致到蒙特卡洛误差内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-5-与-Euler-Heun-阶数的对照表\">6.5 与 Euler/Heun 阶数的对照表<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-5-与-Euler-Heun-阶数的对照表\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由前序节已证结论（Euler 强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；Heun 强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>）与本节定理 6.3、命题 6.5，汇总如下（同一 SDE、同一网格、同一 Brownian 驱动）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>强阶</th>\n<th>弱阶</th>\n<th>线性漂移精确</th>\n<th>每步漂移求值次数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Euler</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Heun</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数积分器（左端点残差+左端点随机积分）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数积分器（左端点残差+精确随机积分）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>表中“线性漂移精确”指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span> 时一步映射无截断误差（命题 6.2）。指数积分器以与 Euler 相同的每步求值次数，换取了线性部分的精确性与（在精确随机积分下）更高的强阶，这是其在扩散模型少步采样中替代 Euler 的结构性理由。表中强阶的提升依赖随机积分能否精确计算；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化时，精确随机积分需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)$</span> 的 Itô 积分，实现代价高于左端点近似，第 7 节的 DPM-Solver 正是通过对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的特殊日程（如 VP-SDE 的指数型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>）使该积分有闭式而绕开此代价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-6-残差求积的高阶变体-二阶指数积分器\">6.6 残差求积的高阶变体：二阶指数积分器<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-6-残差求积的高阶变体-二阶指数积分器\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 6.3 的强阶受限于随机积分近似，而确定性残差项的求积精度独立于随机项。本节给出残差用二阶求积（梯形型）的变体，并证明它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 满足额外正则性时把确定性局部误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^4)$</span>，从而在随机积分精确计算的情形下把强阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span>。这一变体是第 7 节 DPM-Solver 二阶结构的直接前身。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 6.7（二阶指数积分器）</strong>。设假设 6.A 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的一阶偏导存在、全局 Lipschitz（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b^{(1)}$</span>），关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的一阶偏导存在、有界（界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_b^{(1)}$</span>）。定义一步映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_\\Delta^{(2)}(x,t):=E(t+\\Delta,t)\\,x+\\frac{\\Delta}{2}\\Big(E(t+\\Delta,t)\\,b(x,t)+E(t+\\Delta,t+\\Delta)\\,b(\\hat x,t+\\Delta)\\Big)+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,g(u)\\,dW_u,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span> 为预测子，取 Euler 型预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x:=E(t+\\Delta,t)x+E(t+\\Delta,t)b(x,t)\\Delta$</span>（随机项在预测子中省略，因其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的求值只引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 的路径偏差，在下面的误差估计中被吸收）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,t+\\Delta)=1$</span>，故第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(\\hat x,t+\\Delta)$</span> 不带积分因子。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.8（二阶指数积分器的确定性局部误差）</strong>。在定义 6.7 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>（纯 ODE 情形以隔离确定性误差），则一步确定性局部误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\Psi_\\Delta^{(2)}(x,t)-\\Phi_f(t+\\Delta,t;x)\\big\\|\\le C\\,\\Delta^3,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L_a,L_b,L_b^{(1)},M_b^{(1)})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_f$</span> 为全漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的流。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。记真实流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(u):=\\Phi_f(u,t;x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t)=x$</span>。由定义 6.1 的积分形式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y(t+\\Delta)=E(t+\\Delta,t)x+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)\\,b(y(u),u)\\,du .$$</div>\n<p>将右端积分用梯形公式近似，节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,t+\\Delta$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)b(y(u),u)\\,du=\\frac{\\Delta}{2}\\Big(E(t+\\Delta,t)b(y(t),t)+b(y(t+\\Delta),t+\\Delta)\\Big)+R_1,$$</div>\n<p>其中梯形公式的余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_1$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|R_1\\|\\le\\frac{\\Delta^3}{12}\\sup_{u\\in[t,t+\\Delta]}\\big\\|\\tfrac{d^2}{du^2}\\big[E(t+\\Delta,u)b(y(u),u)\\big]\\big\\|$</span>。被求导函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\cdot b$</span> 的复合，其一阶导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-aE)b+E(\\partial_u b+\\nabla b\\cdot f)$</span>，二阶导由假设 6.A 与定义 6.7 的正则性逐项估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|R_1\\|\\le C_1\\Delta^3$</span>。</p>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta^{(2)}$</span> 的确定性部分用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t+\\Delta)$</span> 求值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的一步展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t+\\Delta)=E x+E b(x,t)\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（此展开由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(u)-x=O(\\Delta)$</span> 得），有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x-y(t+\\Delta)\\|\\le C_2\\Delta^2$</span>。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|b(\\hat x,t+\\Delta)-b(y(t+\\Delta),t+\\Delta)\\big\\|\\le L_b\\|\\hat x-y(t+\\Delta)\\|\\le L_b C_2\\Delta^2 .$$</div>\n<p>乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta/2$</span> 后该项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。合并两项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Psi_\\Delta^{(2)}-\\Phi_f\\|\\le(C_1+L_bC_2/2)\\Delta^3$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.9（二阶指数积分器的强阶）</strong>。设假设 6.A–6.C 与定义 6.7 的正则性成立，且随机积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)dW_u$</span> 被精确模拟（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E g$</span> 的 Itô 积分有闭式）。则二阶指数积分器在网格上的强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。一步均方误差由确定性局部误差与随机项离散误差组成；后者在精确模拟下为零。由命题 6.8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\mathcal{E}^{\\mathrm{det}}_n\\|^2\\le C^2\\Delta^6$</span>。代入定理 6.3 第三步的累积不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{n+1}\\le(1+C_3\\Delta)e_n+C^2\\Delta^6$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N\\le C_5\\Delta^5$</span>，故均方根误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{5/2}$</span>？核对如下阶数：局部均方误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^6$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 步，每步放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+C_3\\Delta$</span> 的总放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{C_3T}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N\\le e^{C_3T}\\cdot C^2\\Delta^6\\cdot N=e^{C_3T}C^2\\Delta^5$</span>，均方根为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{5/2}$</span>。但强阶定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar X_T-X_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的幂次，此处得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5/2$</span>，高于命题陈述的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span>。更精确地说，上述累积中每步误差并非独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的求值依赖前一步数值解，误差传播中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span> 的偏差含前步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n^{1/2}$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b\\Delta$</span> 后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{n+1}$</span> 的贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b^2\\Delta^2 e_n$</span>，已含在放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+C_3\\Delta)$</span> 中；而命题 6.8 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 是对<strong>精确初值</strong>的局部误差，累积时每步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2\\Delta^2$</span> 偏差中有一部分正比于当前误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n^{1/2}$</span>，这部分已被放大因子吸收，剩余部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 的“新”偏差，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 后贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 的局部均方误差，累积得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 的总均方误差，均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^1$</span>。因此精确的强阶需重新界定局部误差中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n$</span> 无关的部分。</p>\n<p>为避免阶数混淆，直接给出保守结论：在精确随机积分下，二阶指数积分器的强阶至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的求值不引入前步误差放大的理想情形（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）下达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span>。完整阶数分析依赖误差传播的精细结构，其严格上界证明超出本节范围，此处只陈述可验证的部分：确定性局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 相比一阶变体的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 提升一阶，这是二阶结构的确定收益。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注记 6.10</strong>。推论 6.9 的证明暴露了一个一般现象：局部截断误差的阶数与全局强阶之间并非简单相加，误差传播中“新误差”与“旧误差放大”的分离决定最终阶数。第 9 节（误差累积）将系统处理这一分离；本节只确认二阶残差求积把确定性局部误差降一阶这一事实，作为 DPM-Solver 二阶公式的数学依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-7-矩阵扩散系数的推广与坐标表述\">6.7 矩阵扩散系数的推广与坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-7-矩阵扩散系数的推广与坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节至此只处理标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span>。生成模型的反向 SDE 中扩散系数常为矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>，此时指数积分器的结构需在矩阵层面重述，且积分因子的交换性成为关键约束。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 6.11（矩阵扩散的指数积分器）</strong>。设漂移线性化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(y,u)=A(u)y+b(y,u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(u)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>，扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(u)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>。定义矩阵积分因子（时间有序指数）</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(t,s):=\\mathcal{T}\\exp\\Big(\\int_s^t A(u)\\,du\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 为时间排序算子（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(u)$</span> 在不同时刻不可交换时必需；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(u)$</span> 两两交换，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(t,s)=\\exp(\\int_s^t A)$</span>）。一步映射为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t)=\\mathcal{E}(t+\\Delta,t)x+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\mathcal{E}(t+\\Delta,u)\\,b(\\Psi^{(u)},u)\\,du+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\mathcal{E}(t+\\Delta,u)\\,G(u)\\,dW_u,$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_u\\in\\mathbb{R}^m$</span>，被积矩阵-向量乘积按指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\mathcal{E}_{ik}G_{kj}dW_u^j$</span>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的指标，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 同范围，重命名避免冲突：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{k\\ell}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.12（交换性条件）</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上两两交换（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[A(u),A(v)]=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(t,s)=\\exp(\\int_s^t A(u)du)$</span>，且命题 6.2 的精确性结论对矩阵情形逐字成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0,G\\equiv0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t)=\\mathcal{E}(t+\\Delta,t)x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot y=A(u)y$</span> 的精确解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。两两交换时时间排序算子退化为普通指数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}\\exp=\\exp$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(u):=\\mathcal{E}(t,u)^{-1}y(u)$</span> 求导，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{du}\\mathcal{E}(t,u)^{-1}=-\\mathcal{E}(t,u)^{-1}A(u)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(t,u)\\mathcal{E}(t,u)^{-1}=I$</span> 求导得，交换性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可交换），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot z=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t+\\Delta)=\\mathcal{E}(t+\\Delta,t)x$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注记 6.13</strong>。生成模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(u)$</span> 常取标量乘单位阵（如 VP-SDE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta(u)I$</span>），此时交换性自动满足，命题 6.12 适用；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(u)$</span> 为一般矩阵且不同时刻不可交换，时间排序指数无闭式，指数积分器的实现需用 Magnus 展开或分段常值近似，其误差分析归入第 9 节的误差累积框架。本节不展开不可交换情形的阶数证明，只确认：标量扩散系数与标量乘单位阵的线性漂移是本节全部命题的适用域，也是扩散模型实际使用的域。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-8-随机积分近似的两种误差机制\">6.8 随机积分近似的两种误差机制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-8-随机积分近似的两种误差机制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 6.3 把强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 归因于随机积分的左端点近似。此处把该近似拆成两个独立机制，分别估计，以说明为何精确随机积分能把强阶提到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>机制一：积分因子的时间变化</strong>。左端点近似用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,t)g(t)$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)$</span>。两者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E(t+\\Delta,u)g(u)-E(t+\\Delta,t)g(t)=\\int_t^u\\frac{d}{dv}\\big[E(t+\\Delta,v)g(v)\\big]dv,$$</div>\n<p>被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t+\\Delta,v)\\big(-a(v)g(v)+g'(v)\\big)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 可微时）。其绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_a\\Delta}(L_a g_{\\max}+M_g)$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_g:=\\sup|g'|$</span>。故差的一致界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta$</span>，平方积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 的均方误差，均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>——单步随机误差的这一部分累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 阶，与定理 6.3 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>机制二：Brownian 增量的条件期望结构</strong>。左端点近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n:=W_{t+\\Delta}-W_t$</span> 与真实积分共享同一增量，故两者之差的条件期望为零（Itô 积分与左端点积分在可预测简单函数上期望相等）。这意味着机制一只影响强误差，不影响弱误差——这正是命题 6.5 弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的原因。若改用右端点或中点近似，条件期望结构改变，弱阶会受影响；左端点近似在弱阶上的无害性是它在扩散模型采样器中被广泛采用的技术理由。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.14（两机制的独立性）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_g&lt;\\infty$</span>，假设 6.A、6.B 成立。则左端点随机积分近似的一步强均方误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，一步弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，两者分别由机制一与机制二控制，互不干扰。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。强误差：由机制一的差的一致界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}(\\cdots)dW_u\\|^2=\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\|E g-E(t+\\Delta,t)g(t)\\|^2du\\le C^2\\Delta^3$</span>。弱误差：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(\\bar X_{t+\\Delta})-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(X_{t+\\Delta})$</span> 中随机积分近似项的条件期望为零（机制二），故弱误差只来自确定性残差项，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（命题 6.5 的局部版本）。两估计分别只用到机制一的一致界与机制二的条件期望性质，互不交叉。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注记 6.15</strong>。命题 6.14 解释了对照表中“精确随机积分”一行的强阶提升而弱阶不变：精确随机积分消除机制一，强阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；机制二本就无弱误差贡献，故弱阶保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这一不对称是扩散模型采样器设计中“强误差决定路径偏差、弱误差决定分布偏差”这一分工的数学根源，第 10 节的反例将展示大步长下弱误差虽小但强误差导致的路径偏移如何累积成分布偏移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-9-一个可检验的恒等式-指数积分器的离散流性质\">6.9 一个可检验的恒等式：指数积分器的离散流性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-9-一个可检验的恒等式-指数积分器的离散流性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.16（半群性质）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 可积。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_{t-s}(x,s)=\\Psi_{t-r}\\big(\\Psi_{r-s}(x,s),r\\big),\\qquad s\\le r\\le t,$$</div>\n<p>即指数积分器的确定性部分构成流（半群）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 6.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{t-s}(x,s)=E(t,s)x$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t,s)=E(t,r)E(r,s)$</span>（指数因子的可乘性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t a=\\int_s^r a+\\int_r^t a$</span> 得）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{t-r}(\\Psi_{r-s}(x,s),r)=E(t,r)E(r,s)x=E(t,s)x=\\Psi_{t-s}(x,s)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.16 是可检验的：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>、任意三段区间，数值上验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t,s)$</span> 的可乘性即可。它说明指数积分器的确定性部分不引入“步长依赖的流扭曲”——任意细分网格给出同一流映射，这与 Euler 方法不同（Euler 的确定性部分不满足半群性质，细分改变映射）。这一性质是第 11 节自适应步长讨论中“步长可任意细分而不改变确定性极限”的技术前提。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>指数积分器把漂移分解为线性部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)x$</span> 与残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,t)$</span>，对线性部分用积分因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(t,s)=\\exp(\\int_s^t a)$</span> 精确积分，一步映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t+\\Delta}=E(t+\\Delta,t)x_t+\\int E\\,b\\,du+\\int E\\,g\\,dW$</span>，其截断误差仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的求积与随机积分近似（命题 6.2）。</li>\n<li>在假设 6.A–6.C 下，左端点残差近似加左端点随机积分近似的指数积分器强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（定理 6.3），与 Euler 同阶但误差结构不同；若随机积分精确计算，强阶提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。弱阶在假设 6.A–6.D 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（命题 6.5），线性漂移情形下对任意步长弱误差为零（推论 6.6）。</li>\n<li>与 Euler（强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）、Heun（强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>）对照，指数积分器的优势在于线性部分的精确性与每步单次漂移求值，其强阶提升受随机积分可实现性制约；这一制约构成第 7 节 DPM-Solver 指数积分结构的出发点。</li>\n<li>二阶残差求积（梯形型）把确定性局部误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>（命题 6.8），是 DPM-Solver 二阶结构的数学依据；其全局强阶的提升受误差传播中“新误差”与“旧误差放大”分离的制约，精确阶数归入第 9 节处理（推论 6.9 与注记 6.10）。</li>\n<li>矩阵扩散系数情形下指数积分器需用时间排序指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}\\exp$</span>；当线性漂移两两交换（含标量乘单位阵这一生成模型实际使用的域）时退化为普通指数且精确性结论逐字成立（命题 6.12、注记 6.13）。</li>\n<li>随机积分左端点近似的误差分解为两个独立机制：积分因子时间变化贡献强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 单步、累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>；Brownian 增量的条件期望结构使弱误差不受该近似影响（命题 6.14）。精确随机积分消除机制一，强阶升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而弱阶不变，这解释了对照表中强阶提升与弱阶保持的不对称（注记 6.15）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-DPM-Solver\">DPM-Solver<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-DPM-Solver\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为扩散过程的时间变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为标量扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为标准布朗运动。反向过程的概率流 ODE 速度场记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x_t,t)$</span>，反向 SDE 漂移记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x_t,t)$</span>，二者在前序节中已明确区分，本节不再混用。得分函数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。数值步长记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta = t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}_{n=0}^{N}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，逐一给出定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>半线性形式</strong>：将概率流 ODE 写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dx_t}{dt} = f(x_t,t) + g(t)\\,\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为线性部分（在扩散模型中通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x$</span> 或更一般的线性漂移），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 为非线性部分。定义<strong>积分因子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\exp\\!\\big(\\int_0^t f_{\\text{lin}}(s)\\,ds\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\text{lin}}(s)$</span> 为线性漂移的标量系数（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=a(t)x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\text{lin}}=a$</span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>精确指数积分表示</strong>：对半线性 ODE，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}$</span> 的精确解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}} = e^{\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}} a(s)\\,ds}\\,x_{t_n} + \\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}} e^{\\int_{s}^{t_{n+1}} a(r)\\,dr}\\,g(s)\\,\\nabla\\log p_s(x_s)\\,ds.$$</div>\n此式与本章 canonical claim 中指数积分器公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int f}x_t+\\int e^{\\int f}g\\,dW$</span> 结构一致：线性部分精确指数化，非线性部分做积分近似。</li>\n<li><strong>DPM-Solver 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶近似</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)=e^{\\int_0^t a(s)ds}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)=\\int_0^t e^{-\\int_0^s a(r)dr}g(s)\\,ds$</span>（噪声调度下的信噪比参数化），并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\log\\alpha(t)$</span>。DPM-Solver 将解写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha(t)\\hat{x}(t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{x}$</span> 满足关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的积分方程，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 Taylor 展开近似该积分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}$</span> 连续且平方可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> Hölder 连续（指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;1/2$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（线性漂移结构）</strong>：概率流 ODE 的漂移可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=a(t)x+g(t)\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 为标量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标量扩散系数。此分解在方差保持（VP）与方差爆炸（VE）两类调度下均成立，前序节已给出验证。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（矩有界）</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^p&lt;\\infty$</span>，保证 Taylor 余项中的高阶矩可控。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-半线性结构与指数积分恒等式\">半线性结构与指数积分恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-半线性结构与指数积分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DPM-Solver 的出发点不是把 ODE 当作一般向量场做 Runge–Kutta，而是识别其<strong>半线性结构</strong>：线性部分可精确积分，非线性部分（得分项）才需要数值近似。这与前序节指数积分器的 canonical 公式完全一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.1（指数积分恒等式）</strong> 在假设 A1、A2 下，概率流 ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}$</span> 的精确解满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}} = \\alpha_{n+1}\\,\\hat{x}_{t_n} + \\alpha_{n+1}\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}} e^{-\\lambda}\\,g(\\lambda)\\,\\nabla\\log p_{\\lambda}(x_{\\lambda})\\,d\\lambda,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_n=\\alpha(t_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n=\\log\\alpha_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{x}_{t_n}=x_{t_n}/\\alpha_n$</span>，且积分变量已从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\alpha(t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由假设 A2，ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_t=a(t)x_t+g(t)\\nabla\\log p_t(x_t)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\alpha(t)\\hat{x}_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_t=\\dot\\alpha\\hat{x}_t+\\alpha\\dot{\\hat{x}}_t$</span>。代入并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha=a\\alpha$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a\\alpha\\hat{x}_t+\\alpha\\dot{\\hat{x}}_t = a\\alpha\\hat{x}_t+g(t)\\nabla\\log p_t,$$</div>\n<p>消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\alpha\\hat{x}_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\hat{x}}_t=\\alpha(t)^{-1}g(t)\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span> 积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{x}_{t_{n+1}}=\\hat{x}_{t_n}+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}\\alpha(s)^{-1}g(s)\\nabla\\log p_s(x_s)\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>两边乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}$</span> 并换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\alpha(s)$</span>，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\lambda=\\dot\\alpha/\\alpha\\,ds=a(s)ds$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(s)^{-1}=e^{-\\lambda}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s)=g(\\lambda)$</span>，即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式的意义：<strong>线性部分的指数因子被精确提取</strong>，数值误差只来自对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{-\\lambda}g\\nabla\\log p\\,d\\lambda$</span> 的近似。这与 Euler/Heun 直接对全向量场做差分有本质区别——后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 量级较大时会把指数衰减误当成线性增长，产生刚性误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-DPM-Solver-的-Taylor-展开构造\">DPM-Solver 的 Taylor 展开构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-DPM-Solver-的-Taylor-展开构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DPM-Solver 的核心操作：把命题 23.7.1 中的积分用被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n$</span> 处的 Taylor 展开近似，展开阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 决定求解器阶数。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.7.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 近似）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\lambda^{(j)}=\\frac{d^j}{d\\lambda^j}\\big[e^{-\\lambda}g(\\lambda)\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)\\big]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM}} = \\alpha_{n+1}\\hat{x}_{t_n} + \\alpha_{n+1}\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}D_\\lambda^{(j)}\\Big|_{\\lambda_n}\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}e^{-\\lambda}\\frac{(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^j}{j!}\\,d\\lambda.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.3（局部截断误差）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 具有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶连续导数且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶导数有界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{k+1})$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{exact}}-x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM}}\\| = O\\big((\\lambda_{n+1}-\\lambda_n)^{k+1}\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 将命题 23.7.1 的积分记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}h(\\lambda)\\,d\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\lambda)=e^{-\\lambda}g(\\lambda)\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span>。Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\lambda)=\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}\\frac{h^{(j)}(\\lambda_n)}{j!}(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^j+R_k(\\lambda)$</span>，其中余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_k(\\lambda)=\\frac{h^{(k)}(\\xi)}{k!}(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in[\\lambda_n,\\lambda]$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I-\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}\\frac{h^{(j)}(\\lambda_n)}{j!}\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}e^{-\\lambda}(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^j\\,d\\lambda = \\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}R_k(\\lambda)\\,d\\lambda.$$</div>\n<p>由假设 A3 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{(k)}$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_k(\\lambda)|\\le C|\\lambda-\\lambda_n|^k$</span>，故余项积分绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}|\\lambda-\\lambda_n|^k d\\lambda=C(\\lambda_{n+1}-\\lambda_n)^{k+1}/(k+1)$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}$</span> 即得局部误差阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.7.4（全局阶）</strong> 若网格满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_n(\\lambda_{n+1}-\\lambda_n)\\le C/N$</span>，且局部误差按命题 23.7.3 累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的全局误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-k})$</span>，即关于步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N\\le\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\|$</span>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步局部误差<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span>传播因子<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|$</span>。由命题 23.7.3，每步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_1N^{-(k+1)}$</span>。线性部分的传播因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}/\\alpha_n=e^{\\int a}\\le e^{\\|a\\|_\\infty\\Delta}\\le 1+C_2/N$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\le0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>）。累加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N\\le C_1N^{-(k+1)}\\cdot N\\cdot e^{C_2}=O(N^{-k})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维线性得分场\">具体例子：一维线性得分场<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维线性得分场\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)\\equiv a&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)\\equiv g&gt;0$</span>，得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 常数，对应高斯稳态）。此时 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_t=ax_t-g\\theta x_t=(a-g\\theta)x_t$</span>，精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}=e^{(a-g\\theta)\\Delta}x_{t_n}$</span>。</p>\n<p>验证命题 23.7.1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)=e^{at}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=at$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\lambda)=e^{-\\lambda}g(-\\theta x_\\lambda)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\lambda=\\alpha(\\lambda)\\hat{x}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\lambda)=-g\\theta e^{-\\lambda}e^{a\\lambda}\\hat{x}=-g\\theta\\hat{x}$</span> 为常数。故积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}h\\,d\\lambda=-g\\theta\\hat{x}(\\lambda_{n+1}-\\lambda_n)=-g\\theta\\hat{x}a\\Delta$</span>。代回恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}=e^{a\\Delta}\\hat{x}_{t_n}+e^{a\\Delta}(-g\\theta\\hat{x}a\\Delta)=e^{a\\Delta}\\hat{x}_{t_n}(1-g\\theta a\\Delta).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{x}_{t_n}=x_{t_n}e^{-at_n}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}=x_{t_n}e^{a\\Delta}(1-g\\theta a\\Delta)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{a\\Delta}(1-g\\theta a\\Delta)\\to e^{(a-g\\theta)\\Delta}$</span>（一阶 Taylor 吻合），与精确解一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。此例说明：<strong>当得分场线性时，DPM-Solver 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶展开恰好复现指数解的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 Taylor 截断</strong>，误差可显式计算，无需数值实验即可验证阶数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-与-Euler-Heun-的结构差异\">与 Euler/Heun 的结构差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与-Euler-Heun-的结构差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。DPM-Solver 的阶数不是通过增加函数评估次数（如 Heun 用两次）获得，而是通过<strong>利用半线性结构的解析积分</strong>获得。具体地：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Euler 直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 做前向差分，误差项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)x$</span> 的线性增长误估，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|$</span> 大时刚性显著。</li>\n<li>Heun 做预测–校正，仍不提取指数因子，强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的证明依赖漂移的全局 Lipschitz 常数，该常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|$</span> 大时爆炸。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的误差常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{(k)}$</span> 的界（即得分场对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶导），不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|$</span> 本身，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}$</span> 因子已把刚性吸收进解析积分。这正是 DPM-Solver 在少步数下可用的数学原因，也是后续“与少步生成的接口”一节的形式化基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.5（误差常数对刚性的独立性）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的局部误差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\le C_0\\sup_\\lambda\\|h^{(k)}(\\lambda)\\|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|a|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 23.7.3 的证明，余项界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}\\int|\\lambda-\\lambda_n|^k\\|h^{(k)}\\|d\\lambda/(k!)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}=e^{\\lambda_{n+1}}$</span>，而积分中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}$</span> 已被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的定义，故整个表达式只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的幂次与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|h^{(k)}\\|$</span> 的界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的跨度进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长与误差累积的接口\">步长与误差累积的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长与误差累积的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只给出 DPM-Solver 自身的局部误差结构；步长选择策略与误差累积的完整分析留给后续节。此处仅指出接口所需的两个量：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>局部误差估计子</strong>：由命题 23.7.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k-1)$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 之差可作为局部误差的估计，因为两者共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{x}_{t_n}$</span> 与同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}$</span>，差值恰为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span> 项 Taylor 余项的主部。</li>\n<li><strong>累积传播</strong>：由推论 23.7.4，全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-k})$</span> 的常数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\int\\|a\\|)$</span> 因子；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\le0$</span>（扩散模型的标准调度）时该因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>，误差不放大。此性质是后续“误差累积”节讨论分布偏移的前提。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>DPM-Solver 的数学本质是对半线性 ODE 做指数积分：线性漂移精确指数化，得分项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\log\\alpha$</span> 坐标下做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 Taylor 展开，局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{k+1})$</span>、全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-k})$</span>，证明只依赖得分场对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶导有界，不依赖漂移刚性。</li>\n<li>与 Euler（强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）和 Heun（强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>）相比，DPM-Solver 的阶数来自解析积分结构而非函数评估次数，其误差常数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|$</span> 的独立性由命题 23.7.5 形式化，构成少步生成的数学依据。</li>\n<li>本节给出的局部误差估计子（相邻阶 DPM-Solver 之差）与累积传播因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\int a)$</span> 是后续步长选择、误差累积与自适应步长节的直接输入；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\le0$</span> 时传播因子有界，分布偏移的反例只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span> 或大步长破坏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标单调性时出现。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-二阶-DPM-Solver-的显式系数与可检验恒等式\">二阶 DPM-Solver 的显式系数与可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-二阶-DPM-Solver-的显式系数与可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.7.3 只给出了阶数，未给出可执行的系数。为使公式自洽并可直接实现，本节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,2$</span> 的积分权重显式写出，并验证其与命题 23.7.1 的恒等式相容。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.7.6（积分权重）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda=\\lambda_{n+1}-\\lambda_n$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,1,\\dots,k-1$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_j(\\lambda_n,\\lambda_{n+1}) = \\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}} e^{-\\lambda}\\frac{(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^j}{j!}\\,d\\lambda .$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM}}=\\alpha_{n+1}\\hat{x}_{t_n}+\\alpha_{n+1}\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}w_j\\,h^{(j)}(\\lambda_n)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.7（权重的闭式）</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\lambda-\\lambda_n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}=e^{-\\lambda_n}e^{-u}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_j = \\frac{e^{-\\lambda_n}}{j!}\\int_{0}^{\\Delta\\lambda} e^{-u}u^j\\,du .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}e^{-u}du=1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0=e^{-\\lambda_n}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda})$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span>：利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}e^{-u}u\\,du=1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(1+\\Delta\\lambda)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=e^{-\\lambda_n}\\big(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(1+\\Delta\\lambda)\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接换元并分部积分。<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span> 时令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(u)=e^{-u}u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}F\\,du=\\big[-e^{-u}(1+u)\\big]_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}=1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(1+\\Delta\\lambda)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.7.8（一阶 DPM-Solver 即指数 Euler）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM1}} = \\alpha_{n+1}\\hat{x}_{t_n} + \\alpha_{n+1}e^{-\\lambda_n}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda})\\,g(\\lambda_n)\\nabla\\log p_{\\lambda_n}(x_{t_n}).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}e^{-\\lambda_n}=e^{\\lambda_{n+1}-\\lambda_n}=e^{\\Delta\\lambda}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM1}} = e^{\\Delta\\lambda}x_{t_n} + e^{\\Delta\\lambda}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda})\\,g(\\lambda_n)\\nabla\\log p_{\\lambda_n}(x_{t_n}).$$</div>\n<p>这与前序节指数积分器 canonical 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int f}x_t+\\int e^{\\int f}g\\,dW$</span> 的确定性对应形式一致：线性因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\Delta\\lambda}$</span> 精确，非线性项用左端点值乘解析积分权重。<strong>注意</strong>：此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\Delta\\lambda}=e^{\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}a(s)ds}$</span> 正是线性漂移的精确指数，而非 Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+a\\Delta$</span> 近似，二者相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，这正是 DPM-Solver 一阶在刚性下优于 Euler 的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.7.9（二阶 DPM-Solver 的显式更新）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{(1)}(\\lambda_n)=\\frac{d}{d\\lambda}\\big[e^{-\\lambda}g(\\lambda)\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)\\big]\\big|_{\\lambda_n}$</span>。由乘积法则，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h^{(1)}(\\lambda) = e^{-\\lambda}\\Big[\\big(g'(\\lambda)-g(\\lambda)\\big)\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda) + g(\\lambda)\\frac{d}{d\\lambda}\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\lambda}\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)$</span> 沿轨迹求全导数，含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2\\log p_\\lambda\\cdot\\dot{x}_\\lambda$</span> 两项。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0,w_1$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM2}} = e^{\\Delta\\lambda}x_{t_n} + e^{\\Delta\\lambda}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda})\\,h(\\lambda_n) + e^{\\Delta\\lambda}\\big(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(1+\\Delta\\lambda)\\big)\\,h^{(1)}(\\lambda_n).$$</div>\n<p>此式即为可实现的二阶更新；实现时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{(1)}$</span> 用得分场的 Jacobian-向量积与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}$</span> 的当前估计计算，无需额外网络评估。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.10（权重相容性恒等式）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge1$</span>，权重满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}w_j\\,h^{(j)}(\\lambda_n)\\Big|_{\\Delta\\lambda\\to0} = e^{-\\lambda_n}\\Delta\\lambda\\,h(\\lambda_n)+O(\\Delta\\lambda^2).$$</div>\n<p>即当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 退化为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\lambda_n)$</span> 为被积函数的一阶矩形近似，与命题 23.7.1 的积分在零步长极限下吻合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 23.7.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0=e^{-\\lambda_n}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda})=e^{-\\lambda_n}(\\Delta\\lambda-\\tfrac12\\Delta\\lambda^2+\\cdots)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=e^{-\\lambda_n}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(1+\\Delta\\lambda))=e^{-\\lambda_n}(\\tfrac12\\Delta\\lambda^2+\\cdots)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0h(\\lambda_n)+w_1h^{(1)}(\\lambda_n)=e^{-\\lambda_n}\\Delta\\lambda h(\\lambda_n)+O(\\Delta\\lambda^2)$</span>，高阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=O(\\Delta\\lambda^{j+1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{(j)}$</span> 相乘后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\lambda^2)$</span> 及以上。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式的作用：它把 DPM-Solver 与命题 23.7.1 的精确积分在连续极限下对齐，排除了“权重构造与恒等式不一致”的可能，是公式自洽性的可检验判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-得分场导数有界性的验证途径\">得分场导数有界性的验证途径<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-得分场导数有界性的验证途径\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.7.3 与 23.7.5 均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\lambda\\|h^{(k)}(\\lambda)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 为前提。本节需说明该前提在本节情境下为何成立，而非以“适当条件下”搪塞。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A4（得分场导数界）</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_k&lt;\\infty$</span>，使得对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>、所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[\\lambda_{\\min},\\lambda_{\\max}]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\nabla^j\\log p_\\lambda(x)\\big\\|\\le M_j,\\qquad j=1,\\dots,k,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^k([\\lambda_{\\min},\\lambda_{\\max}])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|g^{(j)}|&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.11（A4 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{(k)}$</span> 有界）</strong> 在假设 A2、A4 下，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_1,\\dots,M_k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|g^{(j)}|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|\\dot{x}_\\lambda\\|$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\lambda\\|h^{(k)}(\\lambda)\\|\\le B_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\lambda)=e^{-\\lambda}g(\\lambda)\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)$</span> 是三个因子的乘积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}$</span>（各阶导数有界，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 在紧区间）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\lambda)$</span>（由 A4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^k$</span> 与有界导数）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)$</span>（沿轨迹的全导数）。对后者用链式法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\lambda}\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda) = \\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda + \\nabla^2\\log p_\\lambda\\cdot\\dot{x}_\\lambda .$$</div>\n<p>由 A4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^2\\log p_\\lambda\\|\\le M_2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_\\lambda$</span> 由 ODE 右端有界（假设 A3 的矩有界加 A4 的梯度界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\dot{x}_\\lambda\\|\\le|a|\\|x_\\lambda\\|+\\sup|g|M_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\lambda$</span> 在紧时间区间上路径连续故局部有界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 由 A1 的 Hölder 连续性给出有界。高阶导数逐次用 Leibniz 法则与链式法则展开，每一项都是有限个有界因子的乘积，故总和有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 23.7.12（A4 在扩散模型中的可验证性）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\lambda$</span> 为高斯或高斯混合时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^j\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 的各阶导数有显式界；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\lambda$</span> 为一般光滑密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\lambda_{\\min},\\lambda_{\\max}]$</span> 的紧区间（扩散模型的标准调度满足此条件，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>）时，A4 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\lambda$</span> 的紧支撑光滑性给出。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\lambda$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 处退化（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时数据分布为经验测度），则 A4 失效，命题 23.7.3 的阶数保证不成立——此边界情形归入反例节处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-局部误差估计子的构造与相容性\">局部误差估计子的构造与相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-局部误差估计子的构造与相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续“步长选择”与“自适应步长”节需要本节提供一个可计算的局部误差估计子。此处给出其定义并证明它与命题 23.7.3 的相容性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.7.13（相邻阶差估计子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}^{(k-1)}$</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k-1)$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 从同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 出发的更新。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{e}_n = \\big\\|x_{t_{n+1}}^{(k)}-x_{t_{n+1}}^{(k-1)}\\big\\| .$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.14（估计子与真实局部误差的同阶）</strong> 在假设 A1–A4 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{e}_n = \\big\\|w_{k-1}h^{(k-1)}(\\lambda_n)\\big\\| + O(\\Delta\\lambda^{k+1}),$$</div>\n<p>且真实局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{exact}}-x_{t_{n+1}}^{(k)}\\|=O(\\Delta\\lambda^{k+1})$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{e}_n$</span> 与真实局部误差同阶，可作为步长控制的可计算代理。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两更新共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}\\hat{x}_{t_n}$</span> 项，相减得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x^{(k)}-x^{(k-1)} = \\alpha_{n+1}w_{k-1}h^{(k-1)}(\\lambda_n).$$</div>\n<p>由命题 23.7.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{k-1}=O(\\Delta\\lambda^k)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{e}_n=O(\\Delta\\lambda^k)$</span>。而真实局部误差由命题 23.7.3 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\lambda^{k+1})$</span>。二者相差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 因子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{e}_n/\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 与真实局部误差同阶。<strong>注意</strong>：估计子本身不是真实误差，而是真实误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda^{-1}$</span> 倍缩放；步长控制器须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{e}_n/\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 或等价缩放，否则会把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶估计误当成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 阶误差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实践含义：相邻阶差给出的是<strong>误差率</strong>而非<strong>误差量</strong>，控制器须显式除以步长。这一区分在后续“自适应步长”节的形式化中必须保留，否则会得到错误的阶数匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-与本章-canonical-公式的对齐检查\">与本章 canonical 公式的对齐检查<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与本章-canonical-公式的对齐检查\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有推导须与本章 canonical claims 一致。逐条核对：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></strong>：本节未重新证明，仅在“与 Euler/Heun 的结构差异”中引用；DPM-Solver 一阶（推论 23.7.8）与 Euler 的区别在于线性因子的精确指数化，不改变 Euler 自身的阶数声明。</li>\n<li><strong>Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span></strong>：同上，仅作对比引用。</li>\n<li><strong>指数积分器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int f}x_t+\\int e^{\\int f}g\\,dW$</span></strong>：推论 23.7.8 给出的确定性对应形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}=e^{\\Delta\\lambda}x_{t_n}+e^{\\Delta\\lambda}(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda})g\\nabla\\log p$</span> 正是该 canonical 公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW$</span> 替换为确定性得分项、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{\\int f}g$</span> 用左端点乘解析权重近似后的实例。本节未改写该公式的符号，仅在其框架内做 Taylor 展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.15（canonical 对齐）</strong> 在假设 A1–A4 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的更新可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM}} = e^{\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}a(s)ds}\\,x_{t_n} + e^{\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}a(s)ds}\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}w_j\\,h^{(j)}(\\lambda_n),$$</div>\n<p>其中第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}e^{\\int_s^{t_{n+1}}a(r)dr}g(s)\\nabla\\log p_s(x_s)\\,ds$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶近似。此式与 canonical 指数积分器公式逐项对应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\int f}$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\int a}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{\\int f}g\\,dW$</span> 的确定性对应项对应求和。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 23.7.1 的恒等式与定义 23.7.6 的直接代入；<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}a}=e^{\\Delta\\lambda}=\\alpha_{n+1}/\\alpha_n$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}\\hat{x}_{t_n}=e^{\\Delta\\lambda}x_{t_n}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题完成了本节与本章 canonical claims 的符号一致性检查：DPM-Solver 不是新公式，而是 canonical 指数积分器在得分项上做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 Taylor 近似的具体化。后续“与少步生成的接口”节将在此基础上讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的权衡，本节不提前展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-高阶导数的沿轨计算与得分场-Jacobian-向量积\">高阶导数的沿轨计算与得分场 Jacobian-向量积<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-高阶导数的沿轨计算与得分场-Jacobian-向量积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 23.7.9 的显式更新中出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\lambda}\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)$</span>，这是沿轨迹的全导数，实现时必须用得分场的 Jacobian-向量积（JVP）而非有限差分。本节给出其精确分解，并证明它不引入额外网络评估。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.7.16（沿轨全导数）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\lambda=\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)$</span> 为沿概率流 ODE 轨迹的得分函数。定义其一阶沿轨导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\lambda\\phi_\\lambda = \\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x_\\lambda) + J_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)\\,\\dot{x}_\\lambda,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\lambda(x)=\\nabla_x\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda(x)\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 为得分场的空间 Jacobian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_\\lambda$</span> 为轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 坐标下的速度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 为固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 时得分场对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的偏导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.17（JVP 可计算性）</strong> 在假设 A1、A4 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\lambda\\phi_\\lambda$</span> 可由一次 Jacobian-向量积与一次偏导评估得到，无需对轨迹做差分。具体地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{x}_\\lambda$</span> 已知（由 ODE 右端直接给出），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)\\dot{x}_\\lambda$</span> 是单次 JVP，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 由得分网络对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 输入的偏导给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 23.7.16 的直接分解，两项各自独立可算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\lambda(x_\\lambda)\\dot{x}_\\lambda$</span> 是矩阵-向量积，在自动微分框架下以 JVP 模式一次前向即得；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\lambda\\nabla\\log p_\\lambda$</span> 是网络对时间嵌入的偏导，同样一次前向可得。两项相加即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\lambda\\phi_\\lambda$</span>，无需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\lambda$</span> 做有限差分。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：二阶 DPM-Solver 的额外计算量是一次 JVP，而非一次完整网络评估，这与 Heun 需要两次完整评估形成对比。<strong>注意</strong>：这里计算的是确定性得分项的沿轨导数，与反向 SDE 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x_t,t)$</span> 的导数无关；后者含扩散系数项，不可与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\lambda\\phi_\\lambda$</span> 混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-二阶更新的相容性检验-与精确解的-Taylor-匹配\">二阶更新的相容性检验：与精确解的 Taylor 匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-二阶更新的相容性检验-与精确解的-Taylor-匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 23.7.9 给出的二阶更新必须与精确解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda\\to0$</span> 时匹配到二阶。本节用一个可检验的恒等式验证这一点，避免“权重凑对了但阶数错了”的隐患。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.18（二阶 Taylor 匹配）</strong> 在假设 A1–A4 下，二阶 DPM-Solver 更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM2}}$</span> 与精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{exact}}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{exact}} - x_{t_{n+1}}^{\\text{DPM2}} = \\alpha_{n+1}\\Big[\\tfrac{1}{2}w_2\\,h^{(2)}(\\lambda_n)+O(\\Delta\\lambda^3)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=e^{-\\lambda_n}\\big(1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(1+\\Delta\\lambda+\\tfrac12\\Delta\\lambda^2)\\big)=O(\\Delta\\lambda^3)$</span>。因此二阶更新的局部误差确实为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\lambda^3)$</span>，与命题 23.7.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span> 情形一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 精确解由命题 23.7.1 给出，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的 Taylor 展开到二阶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(\\lambda)=h(\\lambda_n)+h^{(1)}(\\lambda_n)(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)+\\tfrac12h^{(2)}(\\xi)(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^2 .$$</div>\n<p>代入积分并逐项与定义 23.7.6 的权重对比：<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0$</span> 项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span> 项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span>，余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int_{\\lambda_n}^{\\lambda_{n+1}}e^{-\\lambda}(\\lambda-\\lambda_n)^2h^{(2)}(\\xi)\\,d\\lambda$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda}=e^{-\\lambda_n}e^{-u}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\lambda-\\lambda_n$</span> 代入，余项主部为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12e^{-\\lambda_n}h^{(2)}(\\lambda_n)\\int_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}e^{-u}u^2du=\\tfrac12w_2h^{(2)}(\\lambda_n)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2$</span> 的定义恰为该积分乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda_n}$</span>）。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{n+1}$</span> 即得所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题排除了“二阶更新实际只有一阶精度”的可能：权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0,w_1$</span> 精确吸收了一阶与二阶 Taylor 项，余项从三阶开始，阶数声明自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-权重递推与数值稳定性\">权重递推与数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-权重递推与数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.7.7 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0,w_1$</span> 的闭式，但高阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 需要一般递推。本节给出递推关系并说明其数值稳定性，供后续代码节直接实现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.19（权重递推）</strong> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_j=\\int_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}e^{-u}u^j\\,du$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=e^{-\\lambda_n}I_j/j!$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_j$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_0=1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda},\\qquad I_j=jI_{j-1}-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(\\Delta\\lambda)^j,\\quad j\\ge1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_j$</span> 分部积分：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^j=d(-\\tfrac{u^{j+1}}{j+1})$</span> 不便于此，改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{-u}u^j\\,du=-e^{-u}u^j+j\\int e^{-u}u^{j-1}du$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\Delta\\lambda]$</span> 上取值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_j=\\big[-e^{-u}u^j\\big]_0^{\\Delta\\lambda}+jI_{j-1}=jI_{j-1}-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(\\Delta\\lambda)^j .$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$I_0$</span> 直接积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.7.20（小步长下的相对精度）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda\\ll1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_j\\approx(\\Delta\\lambda)^{j+1}/(j+1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j\\approx e^{-\\lambda_n}(\\Delta\\lambda)^{j+1}/((j+1)j!)$</span>。递推式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_j=jI_{j-1}-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}(\\Delta\\lambda)^j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\lambda$</span> 小时出现两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\lambda^j)$</span> 量相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\lambda^{j+1})$</span>，存在灾难性抵消风险；实现时应改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_j$</span> 的级数展开或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}$</span> 做 <code>expm1</code> 处理，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}=-\\text{expm1}(-\\Delta\\lambda)$</span>，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\Delta\\lambda}$</span> 的直接相减。</p>\n<p>此推论是后续代码节的数值实现依据：权重的解析式正确不代表浮点实现正确，抵消误差会把二阶更新退化为零阶。<strong>注意</strong>：这是浮点实现问题，不是数学阶数问题；命题 23.7.18 的阶数声明在精确算术下成立，推论 23.7.20 只约束实现方式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-与少步生成接口的阶数-步数权衡-仅形式化接口-不展开策略\">与少步生成接口的阶数–步数权衡（仅形式化接口，不展开策略）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与少步生成接口的阶数-步数权衡-仅形式化接口-不展开策略\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续“与少步生成的接口”节将讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的权衡。本节只给出该接口所需的一个形式化事实：在固定总计算预算下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 的误差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.7.21（预算约束下的误差下界）</strong> 设总函数评估预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶 DPM-Solver 每步需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 次评估（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,k-1$</span> 各一次 JVP 或得分评估），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=B/k$</span>。由推论 23.7.4，全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\le C(k)(B/k)^{-k}=C(k)k^kB^{-k}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(k)$</span> 为命题 23.7.5 的误差常数。因此对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的增大以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^k$</span> 因子恶化常数、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^{-k}$</span> 改善阶数，存在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^\\ast$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(k)k^kB^{-k}$</span> 最小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=B/k$</span> 与推论 23.7.4 的界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C(k)$</span> 由命题 23.7.5 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 无关。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log E\\le\\log C(k)+k\\log k-k\\log B$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求驻点即得最优阶数存在的条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题只给出接口的形式化框架，不给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^\\ast$</span> 的显式值——后者依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(k)$</span> 的具体形状与得分场的光滑性，属于后续节的策略讨论。本节到此为止，不越界展开步长选择与自适应控制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-步长选择\">步长选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta = T/N$</span>，离散网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k = k\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>；前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t = f(x_t,t)\\,dt + g(t)\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span> 为扩散矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t) := g(t)g(t)^\\top \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 为协方差速率矩阵。数值采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t_k}, t_k)$</span> 映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k+1}}$</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar x_k$</span> 为数值解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 为精确解。强误差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}} := \\mathbb{E}\\| \\bar x_k - x_{t_k}\\|$</span>，弱误差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k^{\\mathrm{weak}} := \\sup_{\\varphi\\in C_b^2(\\mathbb{R}^d),\\,\\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}\\le 1} |\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(\\bar x_k) - \\mathbb{E}\\varphi(x_{t_k})|$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需的步长选择分析引入以下<strong>步长剖面</strong>符号：给定单调递增的步数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N = T/N$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，称采样器具有<strong>强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span></strong> 若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{s}}$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关、可依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g,T,d$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数）使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N} e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}} \\le C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta_N^{\\,p};$$</div>\n具有<strong>弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span></strong> 若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{w}}$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N} e_k^{\\mathrm{weak}} \\le C_{\\mathrm{w}}\\Delta_N^{\\,q}.$$</div>\n本节的核心对象是<strong>误差—代价函数</strong>：给定目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k e_k \\le \\varepsilon$</span>，并考察所需计算量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}(N)$</span>（每次迭代调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的次数乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>）。</p>\n<p>本节假设（H1）—（H4）贯穿全节，且每条在后续命题中显式引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1) 漂移正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>；关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\|f(0,t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2) 扩散正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上一致正定，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min},\\lambda_{\\max}&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}I \\preceq a(t)\\preceq \\lambda_{\\max}I$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3) 矩有界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t\\|^{2r}&lt;\\infty$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge 2$</span> 成立；数值解满足同样的矩界（由 (H1)(H2) 与显式 Euler 的矩估计可得）。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4) 测试函数正则性</strong>：弱误差中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^2\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\le 1$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>(H1)(H2) 在本章情境下成立，因为扩散生成模型的反向 SDE 漂移由得分函数给出，而得分网络在训练分布支撑上被假设为 Lipschitz；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 通常取标量日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)I$</span>，其 Lipschitz 性与一致正定性由日程的光滑性与非退化性保证。(H3) 由反向 SDE 的 Lyapunov 函数估计给出。(H4) 是弱收敛分析的标准测试类。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长选择的误差-代价标度律\">步长选择的误差—代价标度律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长选择的误差-代价标度律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.1（强阶采样器的步长—代价标度）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H3) 成立，采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 具有强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，且每次迭代的计算代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关）。则对任意目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，选择\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N(\\varepsilon) = \\left\\lceil \\left(\\frac{C_{\\mathrm{s}}}{\\varepsilon}\\right)^{1/p}\\right\\rceil,\\qquad \\Delta(\\varepsilon)=\\frac{T}{N(\\varepsilon)}$$</div>\n可保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le \\varepsilon$</span>，且总代价满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}(\\varepsilon) = c\\,N(\\varepsilon) = \\Theta\\!\\left(\\varepsilon^{-1/p}\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由强阶定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta^p$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{s}}(T/N)^p\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge (C_{\\mathrm{s}}/\\varepsilon)^{1/p}T$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta = T/N$</span>，故条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge T(C_{\\mathrm{s}}/\\varepsilon)^{1/p}$</span>。取上取整即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)$</span>。总代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$cN(\\varepsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{-1/p}$</span> 同阶，上下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)-1$</span> 夹逼得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.8.2（Euler 与 Heun 的代价阶）</strong></p>\n<p>在 (H1)—(H3) 下，Euler 采样器强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，故其达到精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-2})$</span>；Heun 采样器强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-1})$</span>。若以弱误差为准则，Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 给出代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-1})$</span>，Heun 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-1/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　直接代入命题 23.8.1，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>；弱误差情形将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k^{\\mathrm{weak}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，代价标度相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：<strong>强误差准则下，Euler 的代价关于精度是二次的，而 Heun 是线性的</strong>；这是步长选择中“阶数换代价”的基本权衡。注意弱误差准则下的代价指数减半，因为弱阶通常是强阶的两倍（本章第 4、5 节已证）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-局部截断误差与步长的匹配条件\">局部截断误差与步长的匹配条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-局部截断误差与步长的匹配条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>步长选择不能只看全局阶，还需检查<strong>局部误差是否被全局误差吸收</strong>。定义单步局部强误差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_k := \\mathbb{E}\\big\\| x_{t_{k+1}} - \\Psi_\\Delta(x_{t_k},t_k)\\big\\|.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.3（局部—全局匹配）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 的局部强误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Delta^{p+1}$</span>，且单步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 关于初值 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+L_\\Psi\\Delta$</span>。则全局强误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N} e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}} \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Delta^{p}\\,\\frac{e^{L_\\Psi T}-1}{L_\\Psi T}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k := \\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar x_k - x_{t_k}\\|$</span>。由三角不等式与单步 Lipschitz 性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k+1} \\le \\mathbb{E}\\|\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar x_k,t_k)-\\Psi_\\Delta(x_{t_k},t_k)\\| + \\rho_k \\le (1+L_\\Psi\\Delta)\\delta_k + C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Delta^{p+1}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代，利用离散 Grönwall 不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_N \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Delta^{p+1}\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}(1+L_\\Psi\\Delta)^j \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Delta^{p+1}\\frac{(1+L_\\Psi\\Delta)^N-1}{L_\\Psi\\Delta}.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+L_\\Psi\\Delta)^N\\le e^{L_\\Psi T}$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_N \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\Delta^{p}\\frac{e^{L_\\Psi T}-1}{L_\\Psi T}.$$</div>\n对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le N$</span> 同样的界成立，取上确界即得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键点</strong>：命题 23.8.3 表明，全局阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 来自局部阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1$</span> 与 Grönwall 因子的乘积；步长选择若只匹配局部误差而忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_\\Psi T}$</span> 因子，会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 较大时低估所需步数。<strong>步长下界</strong>由此给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta \\le \\left(\\frac{\\varepsilon\\, L_\\Psi T}{C_{\\mathrm{loc}}(e^{L_\\Psi T}-1)}\\right)^{1/p}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\Psi T\\gg 1$</span> 时，该下界比朴素估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le(\\varepsilon/C_{\\mathrm{loc}})^{1/p}$</span> 严格更小，这是长时程生成中“步长必须更细”的定量来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维-OU-过程的-Euler-步长选择\">具体例子：一维 OU 过程的 Euler 步长选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维-OU-过程的-Euler-步长选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。精确解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t = e^{-\\theta t}x_0 + \\sigma\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n其方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_t) = \\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>。Euler 格式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar x_{k+1} = \\bar x_k - \\theta\\Delta\\,\\bar x_k + \\sigma\\,\\Delta W_k = (1-\\theta\\Delta)\\bar x_k + \\sigma\\Delta W_k.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\bar x_k=0$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\bar x_k) = \\sigma^2\\Delta\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2j} = \\sigma^2\\Delta\\,\\frac{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2k}}{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2k}\\to e^{-2\\theta t_k}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2 = 2\\theta\\Delta - \\theta^2\\Delta^2$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\bar x_k) \\to \\sigma^2\\Delta\\,\\frac{1-e^{-2\\theta t_k}}{2\\theta\\Delta-\\theta^2\\Delta^2}\\cdot\\Delta \\to \\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t_k}),$$</div>\n与精确方差一致。<strong>弱误差的一阶项</strong>可由展开得到：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\bar x_k) - \\mathrm{Var}(x_{t_k}) = \\frac{\\sigma^2\\theta\\Delta}{2}(1-e^{-2\\theta t_k}) + O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n故弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，与 Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 一致。若要求弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le 2\\varepsilon/(\\sigma^2\\theta(1-e^{-2\\theta T}))$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge T\\sigma^2\\theta(1-e^{-2\\theta T})/(2\\varepsilon)$</span>，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-1})$</span>，与推论 23.8.2 的弱误差情形吻合。该例同时验证了命题 23.8.3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\Psi=\\theta$</span> 的 Grönwall 因子：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta T\\gg1$</span> 时，所需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta T}$</span> 放大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-指数积分器的步长约束\">指数积分器的步长约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-指数积分器的步长约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出指数积分器\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int_t^{t+\\Delta} f}\\,x_t+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta} e^{\\int_s^{t+\\Delta} f}g\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n在步长选择中，指数积分器的优势是<strong>精确处理线性漂移</strong>，其局部误差仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的非线性部分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的时间变化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=A x + b(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为常数矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 满足 (H1) 且 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b$</span>。则指数积分器的局部强误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{2})$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 足够光滑），对应全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<strong>步长选择的条件</strong>为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta \\le \\min\\left\\{\\frac{\\varepsilon\\,L_b T}{C_{\\mathrm{loc}}(e^{L_bT}-1)},\\ \\frac{1}{\\|A\\|}\\right\\},$$</div>\n第二个约束来自矩阵指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A\\Delta}$</span> 的数值计算：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|\\Delta\\gg1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A\\Delta}$</span> 的条件数急剧增大，数值实现中的舍入误差会淹没离散误差。该约束在扩散生成模型中对应日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 的刚性区间（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 变化剧烈），此时指数积分器必须缩小步长以保持矩阵指数的数值稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.4（指数积分器的步长—精度权衡）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=Ax+b(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|\\le M$</span>。则指数积分器达到强精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的步长需满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta \\le \\min\\left\\{\\left(\\frac{\\varepsilon}{C_{\\mathrm{loc}}e^{L_bT}}\\right)^{1},\\ \\frac{1}{M}\\right\\},$$</div>\n总代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-1})$</span>，与 Heun 同阶，但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|$</span> 较大时避免了 Euler 的刚性步长限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le 2/\\|A\\|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性给出；全局误差由命题 23.8.3 的 Grönwall 论证得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。数值稳定性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|\\Delta\\le1$</span> 来自矩阵指数计算的截断误差分析：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|\\Delta&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A\\Delta}$</span> 的 Padé 逼近误差不再被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 控制。两约束取交即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长选择的决策规则\">步长选择的决策规则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长选择的决策规则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，本节给出<strong>步长选择的显式决策规则</strong>，作为后续“误差累积”“自适应步长”节的接口：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>确定误差准则</strong>：强误差用于路径级采样（如需要匹配单条轨迹），弱误差用于分布级采样（如生成任务只关心边缘分布）。</li>\n<li><strong>确定阶数</strong>：Euler 强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；Heun 强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>；指数积分器强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（线性部分精确）；DPM-Solver 的阶数由前序节给出。</li>\n<li><strong>计算步长上界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta \\le \\min\\{\\Delta_{\\mathrm{err}},\\Delta_{\\mathrm{stab}}\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{err}}$</span> 由命题 23.8.1 与 23.8.3 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{stab}}$</span> 由刚性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|\\Delta\\le1$</span> 或扩散矩阵的条件数给出。</li>\n<li><strong>计算步数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N = \\lceil T/\\Delta\\rceil$</span>，并检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 是否落在少步生成的可接受范围内（该接口在第 12 节展开）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>该规则的关键在于：<strong>步长不是单一标量，而是由误差阶、Grönwall 因子与数值稳定性三者共同确定的下界</strong>。忽略任一约束都会导致采样器在长时程或刚性日程下失效，其失效模式在第 10 节的反例中集中处理。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>步长选择的核心是误差—代价标度律：强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的采样器达到精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\varepsilon^{-1/p})$</span>，Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 对应二次代价，Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 对应线性代价。</li>\n<li>全局误差由局部误差与 Grönwall 因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_\\Psi T}$</span> 共同决定，步长上界必须包含该因子；长时程生成中步长下界比朴素估计严格更小。</li>\n<li>指数积分器通过精确处理线性漂移将刚性约束从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le 2/\\|A\\|$</span> 放宽到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le 1/\\|A\\|$</span>，但其步长仍受矩阵指数数值稳定性与非线性部分 Lipschitz 常数的双重约束。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>前述命题以强误差为准则给出代价标度。弱误差准则下的步长选择需额外处理测试函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}$</span> 的选取：弱阶的定义依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span> 的一致界，但生成任务真正关心的是边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\mu_N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span> 在特定可积函数类上的差异。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}$</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span> 更大（如包含无界函数或仅可测函数），则弱阶可能退化。以下命题量化这一退化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.5（弱误差的测试类稳定性）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H4) 成立，采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 具有弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}\\le1$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(\\bar x_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\varphi(x_T)|\\le C_{\\mathrm{w}}\\Delta^q$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}\\supset C_b^2$</span> 且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{\\mathcal{H}}$</span> 使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in\\mathcal{H}$</span> 可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi = \\psi_1 + \\psi_2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_1\\in C_b^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\psi_1\\|_{C_b^2}\\le B_{\\mathcal{H}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\mathbb{E}|\\psi_2(x_t)|^{2}\\le B_{\\mathcal{H}}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{k}\\mathbb{E}|\\psi_2(\\bar x_k)|^{2}\\le B_{\\mathcal{H}}^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{\\psi\\in\\mathcal{H}}\\big|\\mathbb{E}\\psi(\\bar x_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\psi(x_T)\\big| \\le B_{\\mathcal{H}} C_{\\mathrm{w}}\\Delta^{q} + 2B_{\\mathcal{H}}\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\|^{2}\\big)^{1/2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi=\\psi_1+\\psi_2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\mathbb{E}\\psi(\\bar x_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\psi(x_T)| \\le |\\mathbb{E}\\psi_1(\\bar x_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\psi_1(x_T)| + |\\mathbb{E}\\psi_2(\\bar x_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\psi_2(x_T)|.$$</div>\n第一项由弱阶定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\psi_1\\|_{C_b^2}\\le B_{\\mathcal{H}}$</span> 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{\\mathcal{H}}C_{\\mathrm{w}}\\Delta^q$</span>。第二项用 Cauchy–Schwarz：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\nu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar x_N,x_T$</span> 的分布，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\mathbb{E}_\\mu\\psi_2-\\mathbb{E}_\\nu\\psi_2| \\le \\int|\\psi_2|\\,|\\mu-\\nu| \\le \\|\\psi_2\\|_{L^2(\\mu+\\nu)}\\,\\|\\mu-\\nu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^{1/2}\\cdot 2^{1/2},$$</div>\n更直接地用耦合：存在耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar x_N,x_T)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\| = W_1(\\mu,\\nu)$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\mathbb{E}\\psi_2(\\bar x_N)-\\mathbb{E}\\psi_2(x_T)| \\le \\mathbb{E}|\\psi_2(\\bar x_N)-\\psi_2(x_T)| \\le 2B_{\\mathcal{H}}\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\|^{2}\\big)^{1/2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2,$$</div>\n最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\psi_2(\\bar x_N)-\\psi_2(x_T)|\\le|\\psi_2(\\bar x_N)|+|\\psi_2(x_T)|$</span> 与 Cauchy–Schwarz 分别控制两项，各得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{\\mathcal{H}}(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\cdot\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span> 的因子，合并即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2B_{\\mathcal{H}}(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的要点：<strong>弱误差对测试类的依赖不是免费的</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}$</span> 含无界函数，则弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 被强误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 项污染；由于 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，可能主导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 的弱误差项。因此<strong>步长选择在弱准则下必须同时检查强误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 界</strong>，否则测试类扩大后弱阶名义值失效。这一现象在生成任务中对应“分布匹配指标对尾部敏感”的情形：尾部由强误差控制，而非弱阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长序列的几何剖分与日程匹配\">步长序列的几何剖分与日程匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长序列的几何剖分与日程匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>扩散生成模型的日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t)$</span> 通常在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 两端变化剧烈，均匀步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span> 在这两端过粗。前序节 DPM-Solver 已利用日程的解析结构做变量替换；本节从步长选择角度给出<strong>非均匀网格</strong>的误差界，作为第 11 节自适应步长的理论接口。</p>\n<p>设网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k := t_{k+1}-t_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\max}:=\\max_k h_k$</span>。定义<strong>日程敏感度</strong>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(t) := \\|f(\\cdot,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{Lip}} + \\|g'(t)\\| + \\|a'(t)\\|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(\\cdot,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{Lip}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的取值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g',a'$</span> 为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数（在 (H2) 下存在且几乎处处连续）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.6（非均匀网格的强误差界）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可积，采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 的局部强误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k\\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}h_k^{p+1}(1+S(t_k))$</span>。则全局强误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N} e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}} \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\,e^{L_\\Psi T}\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}h_j^{\\,p+1}\\big(1+S(t_j)\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　与命题 23.8.3 的 Grönwall 迭代相同，但局部误差界含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j^{p+1}(1+S(t_j))$</span>。迭代得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_N \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}(1+L_\\Psi h_j)^{N-1-j}\\,h_j^{p+1}(1+S(t_j)).$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+L_\\Psi h_j)^{N-1-j}\\le e^{L_\\Psi(T-t_j)}\\le e^{L_\\Psi T}$</span> 逐项放大，得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.8.7（等误差剖分）</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 23.8.6 的条件下，若选择网格使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_j^{p+1}\\big(1+S(t_j)\\big) = \\text{常数},\\qquad j=0,\\dots,N-1,$$</div>\n则全局强误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-p})$</span>，且该剖分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 大的区间自动加密。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)\\sim t^{-\\alpha}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j\\propto (1+t_j^{-\\alpha})^{-1/(p+1)}$</span>，靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的步长按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j^{\\alpha/(p+1)}$</span> 缩小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　等误差条件使求和项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j h_j^{p+1}(1+S(t_j)) = N\\cdot\\text{常数}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j h_j=T$</span> 确定常数，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j^{p+1}(1+S(t_j)) = T^{p+1}\\big/\\big(\\sum_j(1+S(t_j))^{-1/(p+1)}\\big)^{p+1}$</span>，故求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot T^{p+1}\\big/\\big(\\sum_j(1+S(t_j))^{-1/(p+1)}\\big)^{p+1}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 大时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j(1+S(t_j))^{-1/(p+1)}\\sim N\\int_0^T(1+S(t))^{-1/(p+1)}dt$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim N^{-p}T^{p+1}\\big/\\big(\\int_0^T(1+S)^{-1/(p+1)}dt\\big)^{p+1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-p})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)\\sim t^{-\\alpha}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+S)^{-1/(p+1)}\\sim t^{\\alpha/(p+1)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j^{\\alpha/(p+1)}$</span> 同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出<strong>日程匹配步长的解析形式</strong>：步长不应均匀，而应按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+S(t))^{-1/(p+1)}$</span> 加权。对 Euler（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span>），指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span>；对 Heun（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>），指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。这与 DPM-Solver 的变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)=\\log\\sigma(t)$</span> 在结构上一致：后者将日程的非均匀性吸收进积分变量，而推论 23.8.7 则在原时间轴上给出等效的步长剖分。二者是同一误差控制原则的两种坐标表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长选择的数值验证协议\">步长选择的数值验证协议<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长选择的数值验证协议\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>理论界的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{loc}},L_\\Psi$</span> 通常不可显式计算，工程中需通过<strong>收敛阶的数值测量</strong>反推有效阶，再据此选步长。本节给出可检验的协议，作为第 14 节代码节的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 23.8.8（观测收敛阶）</strong></p>\n<p>给定步数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_1&lt;N_2&lt;\\dots&lt;N_M$</span>，对应强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(N_i)$</span>（用同一布朗路径的精确解或高精度参考解估计），定义相邻观测阶\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p_i := \\frac{\\log e(N_i)-\\log e(N_{i+1})}{\\log N_{i+1}-\\log N_i},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,M-1.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i\\to p$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i\\to\\infty$</span>，称采样器的<strong>观测强阶</strong>为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.9（观测阶与理论阶的一致性）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H3) 成立，采样器具有强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，且误差展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(N)=C N^{-p}(1+o(1))$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i\\to p$</span>。若误差含次阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(N)=CN^{-p}+C'N^{-p'}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p'&gt;p$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i = p + O(N_i^{-(p'-p)})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(N)=CN^{-p}(1+o(1))$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p_i = \\frac{\\log(CN_i^{-p}(1+o(1)))-\\log(CN_{i+1}^{-p}(1+o(1)))}{\\log N_{i+1}-\\log N_i} = p + \\frac{o(1)}{\\log(N_{i+1}/N_i)}\\to p.$$</div>\n次阶项情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log e(N) = -p\\log N + \\log C + \\log(1+(C'/C)N^{-(p'-p)})$</span>，展开对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i = p + (C'/C)\\frac{N_i^{-(p'-p)}-N_{i+1}^{-(p'-p)}}{\\log(N_{i+1}/N_i)}$</span>，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N_i^{-(p'-p)})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>实践含义</strong>：若在中等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 处观测阶低于理论阶，说明次阶项尚未衰减，步长选择应保守地取更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>。反之，若观测阶高于理论阶，可能是参考解精度不足导致的假象，需用更高精度参考解复核。该协议在第 14 节以可运行代码实现，并用一维 OU 过程的解析解作为参考。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长下界与浮点精度的交互\">步长下界与浮点精度的交互<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长下界与浮点精度的交互\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，步长选择存在<strong>下界</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 小到使单步增量与状态量级相当时，浮点舍入误差主导，继续缩小步长不再改善精度。设状态量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|\\sim X$</span>，单步漂移增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|\\Delta$</span>，浮点相对精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx2^{-52}$</span>。则有效误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{\\mathrm{eff}}(\\Delta) \\approx C\\Delta^{p} + \\frac{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}X}{\\Delta}\\cdot T,$$</div>\n第二项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 步累积的舍入误差（每步相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}X$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步）。<strong>最优步长</strong>由两项平衡给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^\\star = \\left(\\frac{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}XT}{pC}\\right)^{1/(p+1)}.$$</div>\n对 Euler（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star\\propto\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{2/3}$</span>；对 Heun（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star\\propto\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&lt;\\Delta^\\star$</span> 时，总误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 减小而增大。该下界在双精度下约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span>—<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级（取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,T,C$</span>），意味着<strong>步数超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^5$</span>—<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^6$</span> 后继续加密无益</strong>。这一事实与少步生成的目标不冲突：生成任务所需精度远高于此下界对应的误差，故实际步长由误差阶而非浮点精度决定。</p>\n<p>前述命题将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\Psi$</span> 视为与步长无关的常数，但在扩散生成模型中，反向 SDE 的漂移由得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 给出，其 Lipschitz 常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，且通常随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 增大。步长选择若用全局上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f=\\sup_t\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|_{\\mathrm{Lip}}$</span>，会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大处过度加密。以下命题给出<strong>时变 Lipschitz 常数下的步长条件</strong>，作为第 11 节自适应步长的理论接口。</p>\n<p>设反向漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-f^{\\mathrm{fwd}}(x,t)+g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{fwd}}$</span> 为前向漂移。定义时变 Lipschitz 剖面\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(t) := \\big\\|f(\\cdot,t)\\big\\|_{\\mathrm{Lip}},\\qquad \\ell_{\\sup}:=\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\ell(t)&lt;\\infty.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.10（时变 Lipschitz 下的全局误差界）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可积，采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 的局部强误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k\\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}h_k^{p+1}$</span>，且单步映射关于初值的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\ell(t_k)h_k$</span>。则全局强误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le k\\le N} e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}} \\le C_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}h_j^{\\,p+1}\\exp\\!\\Big(\\int_{t_j}^{T}\\ell(s)\\,ds\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　与命题 23.8.6 的 Grönwall 迭代相同，但放大因子改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{l=j+1}^{N-1}(1+\\ell(t_l)h_l)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\ell(t_l)h_l\\le e^{\\ell(t_l)h_l}$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\prod_{l=j+1}^{N-1}(1+\\ell(t_l)h_l)\\le \\exp\\!\\Big(\\sum_{l=j+1}^{N-1}\\ell(t_l)h_l\\Big)\\le \\exp\\!\\Big(\\int_{t_j}^{T}\\ell(s)\\,ds\\Big),$$</div>\n最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的可积性与网格的 Riemann 和收敛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 分段连续即可）。代入局部误差界并逐项放大即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.8.11（时变步长的等误差条件）</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 23.8.10 的条件下，若选择网格使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_j^{\\,p+1}\\exp\\!\\Big(\\int_{t_j}^{T}\\ell(s)\\,ds\\Big)=\\text{常数},\\qquad j=0,\\dots,N-1,$$</div>\n则全局强误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-p})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)\\equiv\\ell$</span> 为常数时，该条件退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j^{\\,p+1}e^{\\ell(T-t_j)}=\\text{常数}$</span>，即步长随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而<strong>放大</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j\\propto e^{-\\ell(T-t_j)/(p+1)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　等误差条件使求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot\\text{常数}$</span>，常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j h_j=T$</span> 确定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 为常数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j^{\\,p+1}e^{\\ell(T-t_j)}=c$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j=c^{1/(p+1)}e^{-\\ell(T-t_j)/(p+1)}$</span>，即步长随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j$</span> 增大按指数放大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论与前节推论 23.8.7 方向相反：那里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 大，步长在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 处加密；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 大（若得分在数据端更陡），步长在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 处加密。<strong>实际步长剖面是两者的乘积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_j\\propto(1+S(t_j))^{-1/(p+1)}e^{-\\int_{t_j}^{T}\\ell/(p+1)}$</span>。这解释了为何扩散生成模型的最优网格通常在两端都加密、中间稀疏，而非单调剖分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长选择的不确定性量化\">步长选择的不确定性量化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长选择的不确定性量化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>步长选择的目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 通常是<strong>分布级</strong>的，而命题 23.8.1 给出的是<strong>路径级</strong>上界。二者之间的差距由强误差到弱误差的转换控制。以下命题给出从强误差界到分布级误差界的显式转换，用于在给定分布精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{dist}}$</span> 时反推所需步长。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\mu_N$</span> 为数值采样器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时刻的边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span> 为精确边缘分布。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Wasserstein 距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1(\\bar\\mu_N,\\mu_T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.8.12（强误差到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 的转换）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 (H1)—(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k e_k^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta^{p}$</span>，且存在耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar x_N,x_T)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\|=W_1(\\bar\\mu_N,\\mu_T)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_1(\\bar\\mu_N,\\mu_T)\\le C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta^{p}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 的对偶表示与耦合构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1(\\bar\\mu_N,\\mu_T)=\\inf_{\\gamma}\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\|$</span>。取由采样器与精确解在同一布朗路径上构造的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^\\star}\\|\\bar x_N-x_T\\|=e_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta^p$</span>。由下确界不超过任一可行耦合的期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1\\le e_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.8.13（分布精度反推步长）</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 23.8.12 的条件下，若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1(\\bar\\mu_N,\\mu_T)\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{dist}}$</span>，则充分条件为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta\\le\\left(\\frac{\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{dist}}}{C_{\\mathrm{s}}}\\right)^{1/p},\\qquad N\\ge T\\left(\\frac{C_{\\mathrm{s}}}{\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{dist}}}\\right)^{1/p}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta^p\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{dist}}$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta$</span> 得步数下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：<strong>分布级精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{dist}}$</span> 与路径级精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在步长选择中扮演相同角色</strong>，代价标度不变。但需注意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 界是保守的：实际分布误差可能远小于强误差上界，因为强误差的路径级偏差在取边缘分布时可能相互抵消。因此以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 为准则选步长会<strong>高估</strong>所需步数，这是工程中“少步生成”与理论界之间的固有间隙。该间隙的定量刻画需要弱误差的高阶展开，超出本节范围，在第 12 节“与少步生成的接口”中处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长选择的复合误差预算\">步长选择的复合误差预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长选择的复合误差预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，步长选择需与采样器的其他误差源（得分估计误差、离散化误差、浮点误差）共同构成<strong>误差预算</strong>。设总误差预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{tot}}$</span>，各误差源独立可加（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{tot}}^2 \\approx \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{disc}}^2 + \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{score}}^2 + \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{float}}^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{disc}}=C_{\\mathrm{s}}\\Delta^p$</span> 为离散化误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{score}}$</span> 为得分网络逼近误差（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{float}}$</span> 为浮点累积误差。<strong>最优步长</strong>由最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{disc}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{float}}$</span> 的权衡给出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{score}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关，不影响最优步长）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^\\star = \\arg\\min_{\\Delta&gt;0}\\Big(C_{\\mathrm{s}}^2\\Delta^{2p}+\\frac{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2X^2T^2}{\\Delta^2}\\Big).$$</div>\n求导令其为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$2pC_{\\mathrm{s}}^2\\Delta^{2p-1} - 2\\frac{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2X^2T^2}{\\Delta^3}=0\n\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\Delta^{2p+2}=\\frac{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2X^2T^2}{pC_{\\mathrm{s}}^2},$$</div>\n即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^\\star=\\left(\\frac{\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}XT}{\\sqrt{p}\\,C_{\\mathrm{s}}}\\right)^{1/(p+1)}.$$</div>\n这与前节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star$</span> 的表达式一致（常数因子不同），验证了误差预算框架的自洽性。<strong>关键结论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{score}}\\gg\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{disc}}(\\Delta^\\star)$</span> 时，继续缩小步长无益，因为总误差被得分误差主导；此时步长选择应停在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star$</span> 附近，而非追求理论阶的极限精度。这一判据在工程中对应“得分网络精度决定采样精度上限”的经验法则，本节将其纳入误差预算的定量框架。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-误差累积\">误差累积<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-误差累积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>；前向 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0,$$</div>\n其 Euler 离散为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{E}}=X_n^{\\mathrm{E}}+\\Delta f(X_n^{\\mathrm{E}},t_n)+\\sqrt{\\Delta}\\,g(X_n^{\\mathrm{E}},t_n)\\xi_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立；Heun 离散、Runge–Kutta 离散、指数积分器离散与 DPM-Solver 离散均按前序节记号，分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{H}}_n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{RK}}_n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{exp}}_n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{DPM}}_n$</span>。记精确流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}=X_{t_n}(x_0)$</span>，单步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=\\mathbb E\\big[\\|X_{t_{n+1}}-X_{n+1}\\|^2\\,\\big|\\,X_n\\big]^{1/2}$</span>，全局强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}=\\big(\\mathbb E\\|X_T-X_N\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>，弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{weak}}=\\big|\\mathbb E[\\varphi(X_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\varphi(X_N)]\\big|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为检验函数。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设（H1）–（H4）显式列出，且在本章情境下逐条说明为何成立：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1)（漂移与扩散的 Lipschitz 与线性增长）</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x,t)-f(y,t)\\|+\\|g(x,t)-g(y,t)\\|\\le L\\|x-y\\|$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f(x,t)\\|^2+\\|g(x,t)\\|^2\\le L^2(1+\\|x\\|^2)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 一致。本章所有采样器均在此类 SDE 上定义，故 (H1) 是本章的 standing assumption。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2)（漂移的光滑性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{2,1}(\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T])$</span>，二阶空间导数与一阶时间导数有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^{2,1}$</span> 且其空间导数有界。Heun、RK 与 DPM-Solver 的强阶证明需要此条；Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 只需 (H1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的空间 Lipschitz。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3)（检验函数的光滑性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^4(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 及其至四阶导数多项式增长。弱阶证明中需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varphi(X_T)]$</span> 作 Itô–Taylor 展开，故要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 足够光滑；生成模型采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 通常取有界连续函数（如指示函数的磨光），可用稠密性论证延拓。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4)（非退化扩散）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)g(x,t)^\\top$</span> 一致正定，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi^\\top g g^\\top\\xi\\ge\\lambda\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span>。此条保证反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的适定性，亦使弱误差展开中的抛物型正则化估计可用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节引入一个新符号：<strong>累积误差算子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N$</span>，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathfrak E_N:=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathcal L_n,$$</div>\n即各步局部误差的算术和。它与全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 的关系由下面的主定理刻画。另引入<strong>稳定因子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa:=\\exp(LT)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为 (H1) 中的 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p>本节与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n$</span> 是单步离散与精确流的偏差；全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 是终端分布偏差；累积误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N$</span> 是局部误差之和，它<strong>不是</strong>全局误差的上界本身，而是通过离散 Gronwall 不等式与稳定因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 相乘后控制全局误差。三者的关系正是本节的核心内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-误差累积的离散-Gronwall-估计\">误差累积的离散 Gronwall 估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-误差累积的离散-Gronwall-估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.1（累积误差控制全局强误差）</strong> 在 (H1) 下，对任意采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_n\\}$</span>，若其单步满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\|X_{t_{n+1}}-X_{n+1}\\|^2\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal F_n\\big]\\le \\mathcal L_n^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_n=\\sigma(X_0,\\xi_0,\\dots,\\xi_{n-1})$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb E\\|X_T-X_N\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le \\kappa\\,\\mathfrak E_N,\\qquad \\kappa=e^{LT}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n=X_{t_n}-X_n$</span>。由三角不等式与 (H1)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_{n+1}\\|\\le\\|X_{t_{n+1}}-X_{t_n}-\\Delta f(X_n,t_n)-\\sqrt\\Delta g(X_n,t_n)\\xi_n\\|+\\|X_{t_n}-X_n\\|+\\Delta\\|f(X_{t_n},t_n)-f(X_n,t_n)\\|+\\sqrt\\Delta\\|g(X_{t_n},t_n)-g(X_n,t_n)\\|\\,\\|\\xi_n\\|.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_n$</span> 取条件期望并用 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|\\xi_n\\|^2]=d$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\|e_{n+1}\\|^2\\,|\\,\\mathcal F_n]\\le(1+L\\Delta)^2\\|e_n\\|^2+\\mathcal L_n^2+2(1+L\\Delta)\\|e_n\\|\\,\\mathcal L_n.$$</div>\n对右端用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2ab\\le a^2+b^2$</span> 并整理，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_L$</span>（仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T$</span>）使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\|e_{n+1}\\|^2]\\le(1+C_L\\Delta)\\mathbb E[\\|e_n\\|^2]+\\mathcal L_n^2.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代并用离散 Gronwall 不等式（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{n+1}\\le(1+C_L\\Delta)a_n+b_n$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_N\\le e^{C_LT}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}b_n$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=\\mathcal L_n^2$</span>），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\|e_N\\|^2]\\le e^{C_LT}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathcal L_n^2\\le e^{C_LT}\\Big(\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathcal L_n\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n取平方根并吸收常数即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=e^{LT}$</span>（必要时重定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.9.2（阶的传递）</strong> 若某采样器的局部误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n\\le C\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span>（强意义下单步均方根误差），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le C\\kappa T\\Delta^{p}$</span>，即全局强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。特别地：Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=O(\\Delta)$</span> 给出强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；Heun 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span> 给出强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；这与本章 canonical claims 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N\\le N\\cdot C\\Delta^{p+1/2}=C T\\Delta^{p-1/2}\\cdot\\Delta=C T\\Delta^{p}$</span>，代入命题 23.9.1 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<strong>误差累积的阶等于局部误差阶减半再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span></strong>，即全局阶 = 局部阶（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的幂计）当局部误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span> 计时。这正是强收敛阶节已建立的一般原理，本节将其与累积误差算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N$</span> 显式挂钩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-累积误差的加性分解与偏差-方差二分\">累积误差的加性分解与偏差—方差二分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-累积误差的加性分解与偏差-方差二分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.3（累积误差的偏差—方差分解）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，对任意采样器，记单步条件偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=\\mathbb E[X_{n+1}-X_{t_{n+1}}\\,|\\,\\mathcal F_n]$</span>、单步条件协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_{n+1}-X_{t_{n+1}}\\,|\\,\\mathcal F_n)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_T-X_N\\|^2=\\Big\\|\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E[b_n]\\Big\\|^2+\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\|\\Sigma_n\\|_F+\\text{(交叉项)},$$</div>\n其中交叉项由各步偏差与后续噪声的协方差构成，在 (H1) 下被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\kappa\\sum_n\\|b_n\\|\\,\\mathcal L_n$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T-X_N=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}(X_{t_{n+1}}-X_{n+1})$</span> 展开，对每一项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2=\\|\\mathbb E Y\\|^2+\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(Y)$</span>。交叉项来自不同步之间的相关性，由 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性与条件期望的塔性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\langle b_n,b_m\\rangle]$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b_n\\|\\,\\mathcal L_m$</span> 控制（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;n$</span>），求和即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解的工程含义是显式的：<strong>偏差项随步数线性累积，方差项随步数线性累积但每步贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span></strong>。对 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=O(\\Delta^2)$</span>（弱意义），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_n=O(\\Delta)$</span>，故总偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、总方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对 Heun，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。这与弱收敛阶节的结论一致，但此处给出了累积结构的显式表达。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-指数积分器的累积误差结构\">指数积分器的累积误差结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-指数积分器的累积误差结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.4（指数积分器的累积误差恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=A x$</span> 为线性漂移（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 常矩阵），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数。指数积分器离散为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{exp}}_{n+1}=e^{A\\Delta}X^{\\mathrm{exp}}_n+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}e^{A(t_{n+1}-s)}g\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n则其单步局部误差恒为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对线性 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=AX_t\\,dt+g\\,dW_t$</span>，精确解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{n+1}}=e^{A\\Delta}X_{t_n}+\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}e^{A(t_{n+1}-s)}g\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{exp}}_n$</span>（归纳假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{exp}}_n=X_{t_n}$</span>），右端与离散式逐项相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{exp}}_{n+1}=X_{t_{n+1}}$</span> 几乎必然。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>指数积分器对线性漂移是精确的</strong>，误差累积完全来自非线性漂移的线性化残差。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n$</span> 处展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_n,t_n)+J_n(X_t-X_n)+O(\\|X_t-X_n\\|^2)$</span>，指数积分器丢弃高阶项，其单步局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>（强意义），故强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；若进一步对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 作指数积分并保留二阶项，可得强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/2$</span>。DPM-Solver 正是利用此结构：它将反向 SDE 的漂移拆为线性部分（得分函数的线性化）与非线性部分，对线性部分用指数积分精确求解，对非线性部分用低阶 Runge–Kutta，从而在少步数下达到高阶。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.9.5（DPM-Solver 的累积误差界）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H2) 下，设 DPM-Solver 的线性部分指数积分精确，非线性部分用二阶 Runge–Kutta，则其单步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=O(\\Delta^{5/2})$</span>，全局强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，累积误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N=O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 线性部分精确（命题 23.9.4），非线性部分的二阶 RK 局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{5/2})$</span>（由 (H2) 的光滑性与 Itô–Taylor 展开，见 Runge–Kutta 节的局部误差估计），叠加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维线性-SDE-的误差累积显式计算\">具体例子：一维线性 SDE 的误差累积显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维线性-SDE-的误差累积显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。Euler 离散为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{E}}_{n+1}=(1-\\theta\\Delta)X^{\\mathrm{E}}_n+\\sigma\\sqrt\\Delta\\,\\xi_n$</span>。精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=e^{-\\theta T}x_0+\\sigma\\int_0^T e^{-\\theta(T-s)}dW_s$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_T)=\\sigma^2(1-e^{-2\\theta T})/(2\\theta)$</span>。Euler 解的方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(X^{\\mathrm{E}}_N)=\\sigma^2\\Delta\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2k}=\\sigma^2\\Delta\\frac{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2N}}{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta)^2}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta\\Delta)^{2N}\\to e^{-2\\theta T}$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to2\\theta\\Delta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X^{\\mathrm{E}}_N)\\to\\sigma^2(1-e^{-2\\theta T})/(2\\theta)$</span>，与精确方差一致，验证弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（此处检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> 的弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>）。而强误差由命题 23.9.1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le\\kappa\\,\\mathfrak E_N$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=O(\\Delta)$</span>（线性漂移下 Euler 的局部均方根误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的线性化残差为零但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的离散引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt\\Delta$</span> 尺度的噪声，单步误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N=O(\\Delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}=O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，与 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>累积误差算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N=\\sum_n\\mathcal L_n$</span> 通过离散 Gronwall 不等式与稳定因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=e^{LT}$</span> 控制全局强误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le\\kappa\\,\\mathfrak E_N$</span>；局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{p+1/2})$</span> 传递为全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，与 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 一致。</li>\n<li>累积误差可作偏差—方差二分：偏差项随步数线性累积（Euler <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、Heun <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>），方差项每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，由此弱阶分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>；指数积分器对线性漂移局部误差恒为零，非线性残差决定其阶，DPM-Solver 借此结构在少步数下达到强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</li>\n<li>一维线性 SDE 的显式计算给出 Euler 方差的精确收敛与强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span> 的验证；可运行代码以经验收敛率复核了 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 与 Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，并检查了累积误差界的数值一致性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-累积误差的非渐近界与步数-阶的权衡\">累积误差的非渐近界与步数—阶的权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-累积误差的非渐近界与步数-阶的权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的阶传递是渐近陈述：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}=O(\\Delta^{p})$</span>。生成模型的实际采样常在固定步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=10$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$50$</span>）下进行，此时渐近常数不可忽略，须给出非渐近界。本小节在 (H1)–(H3) 下推导累积误差的显式非渐近上界，并由此得到步数与阶的权衡关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.6（非渐近累积误差界）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设采样器的单步局部误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n\\le c_p\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span>，其中常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{p+1}$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le c_p\\,\\kappa\\,T\\,\\Delta^{p}=c_p\\,\\kappa\\,T^{1-p}N^{-p}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 23.9.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le\\kappa\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathcal L_n\\le\\kappa N c_p\\Delta^{p+1/2}=\\kappa c_p T\\Delta^{p}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span> 得第二式。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p$</span> 的存在性由 Itô–Taylor 展开的余项估计给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶格式的局部误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p+1)$</span> 重随机积分截断产生，其均方根被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{p+1}$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 一致控制（见强收敛阶节的局部误差引理）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于<strong>常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 增长</strong>：高阶格式的局部误差常数通常含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的高阶导数范数，而低阶格式的常数只含低阶导数。因此在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，并非阶越高误差越小；存在一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-p}$</span> 竞争决定的最优阶。这一现象在少步生成中尤为显著：DPM-Solver 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=20$</span> 时优于 Euler 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大到某阈值后，两者的差距由常数比决定而非阶比决定。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.9.7（步数—阶权衡的临界步数）</strong> 设两格式的阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1&lt;p_2$</span>，常数比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=c_{p_2}/c_{p_1}$</span>。则当\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N&lt;N^\\star:=\\rho^{1/(p_2-p_1)}$$</div>\n时高阶格式的误差上界反而更大；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;N^\\star$</span> 时高阶格式占优。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 比较两上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{p_1}N^{-p_1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{p_2}N^{-p_2}$</span>，令其相等解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{p_2-p_1}=c_{p_2}/c_{p_1}=\\rho$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star=\\rho^{1/(p_2-p_1)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可操作的判据：若已知两格式的局部误差常数比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>，则可预先判断在目标步数下应选哪一格式。对 Euler（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=1/2$</span>）与 Heun（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=1$</span>），若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\approx4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star=16$</span>；即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&lt;16$</span> 时 Euler 的非渐近界更紧，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;16$</span> 时 Heun 占优。这与少步生成中“低阶格式在极少步数下反而稳定”的经验现象在数学上一致，但此处给出的是上界比较而非分布偏移的断言——后者属反例节的范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-累积误差的方差-偏差交叉项估计\">累积误差的方差—偏差交叉项估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-累积误差的方差-偏差交叉项估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.9.3 的分解中交叉项此前只给出控制界，本小节将其显式计算，以说明为何在弱误差分析中可以忽略交叉项的主阶。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.8（交叉项的二阶小性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设单步条件偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n$</span> 与单步条件均方根误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b_n\\|\\le c_b\\Delta^{q}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n\\le c_p\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ge p+1$</span>（即偏差阶不低于局部误差阶）。则命题 23.9.3 中的交叉项被\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C\\kappa\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\|b_n\\|\\,\\mathcal L_n\\le C\\kappa c_b c_p T\\Delta^{p+q-1/2}$$</div>\n控制，其阶严格高于主偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sum_n\\mathbb E[b_n]\\|^2=O(\\Delta^{2q})$</span> 与主方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma_n=O(\\Delta^{p})$</span> 中的较小者。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由条件期望的塔性质与 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;n$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\langle b_n,b_m\\rangle]\\le\\|b_n\\|\\,\\mathbb E\\|b_m\\|\\le\\|b_n\\|\\,\\mathcal L_m,$$</div>\n其中第二步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|b_m\\|\\le\\mathbb E\\|X_{m+1}-X_{t_{m+1}}\\|\\le\\mathcal L_m$</span>（Jensen 不等式）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n,m$</span> 求和并乘以稳定因子即得所述界。阶的比较：主偏差项阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2q$</span>，主方差项阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，交叉项阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+q-1/2$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ge p+1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+q-1/2\\ge2p+1/2&gt;p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+q-1/2\\ge2q-1/2&gt;2q$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ge p+1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2q-1/2&gt;2q$</span> 不成立，故交叉项阶介于两者之间，但严格高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(2q,p)$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;p+1/2$</span>，此由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ge p+1$</span> 保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实质是：<strong>当偏差阶足够高时，交叉项不改变弱误差的主阶</strong>。对 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=O(\\Delta^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=O(\\Delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=2,p=1/2$</span>，交叉项阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{2}$</span>，与主偏差项同阶但常数更小；对 Heun，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n=O(\\Delta^3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n=O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>，交叉项阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{4}$</span>，严格低于主偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{6}$</span> 与主方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span> 中的方差项。这解释了为何弱阶分析中只需追踪偏差与方差两项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-累积误差在反向-SDE-采样中的坐标表述\">累积误差在反向 SDE 采样中的坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-累积误差在反向-SDE-采样中的坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>生成模型的采样在反向 SDE 上进行，其时间方向与本章前序节的前向 SDE 相反。本小节将累积误差算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N$</span> 在反向时间坐标下重新表述，以确保与 DPM-Solver 节的符号自洽。</p>\n<p>设前向 SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上定义，反向 SDE 在反向时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span> 上定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[0,T]$</span>。记反向网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n=n\\Delta$</span>，对应前向时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=T-n\\Delta$</span>。反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}(x,\\tau)=-f(x,T-\\tau)+\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau}(x)$</span>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span> 为得分函数，按反向 SDE 节的记号），反向扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{\\mathrm{rev}}(x,\\tau)=g(x,T-\\tau)$</span>。反向采样器的单步局部误差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span>，累积误差算子\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathfrak E_N^{\\mathrm{rev}}:=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\mathcal L_n^{\\mathrm{rev}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.9（反向累积误差的坐标不变性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，反向累积误差算子与前向累积误差算子满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathfrak E_N^{\\mathrm{rev}}=\\mathfrak E_N+O(\\Delta^{p+1/2}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O$</span> 项的常数依赖得分函数的 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化（(H4)）时得分函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上一致 Lipschitz。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 反向 SDE 的漂移含得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{T-\\tau}$</span>，由 (H4) 与抛物型正则化估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 一致 Lipschitz，常数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_s$</span>。将反向漂移拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span> 两部分，前者与前向漂移的 Lipschitz 常数相同，后者引入额外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_s$</span>。单步局部误差的差异仅来自得分项的离散：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span> 的 Euler 离散局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，Heun 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 项的阶相同但常数相加。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_n^{\\mathrm{rev}}=\\mathcal L_n+O(\\Delta^{p+1/2})$</span>，求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题保证：<strong>前向节推导的阶与累积误差界在反向采样中逐字成立</strong>，只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span> 并将 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L+L_s$</span>。稳定因子相应变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{\\mathrm{rev}}=e^{(L+L_s)T}$</span>。这为 DPM-Solver 节与少步生成接口节提供了统一的误差记账框架。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-一个可检验的恒等式-累积误差与得分匹配误差的分离\">一个可检验的恒等式：累积误差与得分匹配误差的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-一个可检验的恒等式-累积误差与得分匹配误差的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在生成模型中，采样器的漂移并非精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，而是由神经网络估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)$</span>。设得分估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(x,t):=s_\\theta(x,t)-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\varepsilon(x,t)\\|\\le\\varepsilon_0$</span>。本小节给出累积误差在此情形下的恒等式，将数值离散误差与得分估计误差分离。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.9.10（误差分离恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设反向采样器用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span>，则其全局强误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le\\kappa^{\\mathrm{rev}}\\big(\\mathfrak E_N^{\\mathrm{rev}}+\\varepsilon_0 T\\big),$$</div>\n且右端两项可分别估计：第一项为数值离散的累积误差，第二项为得分估计误差的累积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将反向漂移写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}=f^{\\mathrm{rev}}_{\\mathrm{exact}}+\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{\\mathrm{rev}}_{\\mathrm{exact}}$</span> 含精确得分。对采样器与精确反向 SDE 的解作差，得分误差项在每步贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\|\\varepsilon\\|\\le\\Delta\\varepsilon_0$</span>，由 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 性与离散 Gronwall 迭代，总贡献被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{\\mathrm{rev}}T\\varepsilon_0$</span> 控制；数值离散项由命题 23.9.9 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{\\mathrm{rev}}\\mathfrak E_N^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span>。两项相加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式的工程含义是：<strong>总误差 = 离散误差 + 得分误差</strong>，两者通过同一稳定因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{\\mathrm{rev}}$</span> 放大。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N^{\\mathrm{rev}}\\to0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0 T$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 减小；因此存在一个由得分估计精度决定的总误差下界，增大步数无法突破。这解释了为何少步生成中“步数增加到某点后分布偏移不再改善”的现象，其数学根源即此下界，而非采样器本身的阶失效。该下界的定量刻画与分布偏移的构造属反例节，此处只给出恒等式与上界。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.9.11（最优步数的存在性）</strong> 在命题 23.9.10 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak E_N^{\\mathrm{rev}}=c_pT^{1-p}N^{-p}$</span>，则总误差上界在\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathrm{opt}}=\\Big(\\frac{p\\,c_pT^{1-p}}{\\varepsilon_0 T}\\Big)^{1/(p+1)}$$</div>\n处取极小（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 连续化后求导）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(N)=c_pT^{1-p}N^{-p}+\\varepsilon_0T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(N)=-p\\,c_pT^{1-p}N^{-p-1}$</span>，令其为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span> 表达式；二阶导为正，故为极小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可操作的步数选择准则：当得分估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0$</span> 已知（可由验证集上的得分匹配损失估计），可预先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span>，超过此步数后增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 只减小离散项而不减小得分项，总误差趋于平台。这与步长选择节的结论互补：步长选择节给出单步稳定性与截断误差的权衡，本小节给出累积误差与得分误差的权衡。</p>\n<p>至此，本节的论证链条完整：命题 23.9.1 建立累积误差到全局误差的 Gronwall 控制，推论 23.9.2 传递阶，命题 23.9.3 与 23.9.8 给出偏差—方差分解及交叉项的二阶小性，命题 23.9.4 与推论 23.9.5 刻画指数积分器与 DPM-Solver 的累积结构，命题 23.9.6 与推论 23.9.7 给出非渐近界与步数—阶权衡，命题 23.9.9 保证反向坐标下的不变性，命题 23.9.10 与推论 23.9.11 分离数值误差与得分误差并给出最优步数。所有命题均在 (H1)–(H4) 下陈述，交换期望与求和处均引用 Fubini 或塔性质并验证了可积性（由 (H1) 的线性增长保证各阶矩有限）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-反例-大步长导致分布偏移\">反例：大步长导致分布偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-反例-大步长导致分布偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t = f(x_t,t)\\,dt + g(t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad x_0\\sim p_0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}$</span> 给定；反向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y_s\\}_{s\\in[0,T]}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=T-t$</span>）满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dy_s = \\big[-f(y_s,T-s)+g(T-s)^2\\,\\nabla\\log p_{T-s}(y_s)\\big]\\,ds + g(T-s)\\,d\\bar W_s,$$</div>\n其得分项由前向边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 给出。数值采样器以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span> 离散该反向 SDE 或对应的概率流 ODE。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h$</span> 为步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 下采样器输出的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star$</span> 为精确反向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=T$</span> 时刻的边缘分布（即目标分布）。本节只讨论“大步长导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star$</span> 的偏移”，不重复前面已给出的强/弱收敛阶定义与误差累积的一般估计。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号：\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h) := \\sup_{\\varphi\\in C_b^2(\\mathbb{R}^d),\\ \\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}\\le 1}\\big|\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[\\varphi]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu^\\star}[\\varphi]\\big|$</span>，弱误差；\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_h$</span>：单步转移算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(L_h\\varphi)(y)=\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(y+h\\,b(y)+g\\,\\xi)]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\sim N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 为反向漂移；\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>：反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于空间变量的 Lipschitz 常数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\max}:=\\sup_{s\\in[0,T]}g(T-s)$</span>。</p>\n<p>假设 (A1)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf g&gt;0$</span>；前向 SDE 有唯一强解且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>、具有有限二阶矩。假设 (A2)：反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(y,s)=-f(y,T-s)+g(T-s)^2\\nabla\\log p_{T-s}(y)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>-Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>-Hölder，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_s\\|b(\\cdot,s)\\|_{C_b^2}&lt;\\infty$</span>。假设 (A3)：采样器为显式 Euler–Maruyama，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-反例构造-一维高斯族上的精确偏移\">反例构造：一维高斯族上的精确偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-反例构造-一维高斯族上的精确偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，前向过程为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t = -\\theta x_t\\,dt + \\sqrt{2\\theta}\\,dW_t,\\qquad x_0\\sim N(0,1),\\ \\theta&gt;0 .$$</div>\n该过程为 OU 过程，边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=N(0,\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta t}+(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta t}))=N(0,1)$</span>，对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（因初值方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且平稳分布方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x$</span>，反向漂移为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(y,s)=-\\big(-\\theta y\\big)+2\\theta\\cdot(-y)=\\theta y-2\\theta y=-\\theta y .$$</div>\n反向 SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dy_s=-\\theta y_s\\,ds+\\sqrt{2\\theta}\\,d\\bar W_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0\\sim N(0,1)$</span>，其解在任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 处仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star=N(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>Euler–Maruyama 单步为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_{k+1}=y_k-\\theta h\\,y_k+\\sqrt{2\\theta h}\\,\\xi_k=(1-\\theta h)y_k+\\sqrt{2\\theta h}\\,\\xi_k,\\qquad \\xi_k\\sim N(0,1)\\ \\text{i.i.d.}$$</div>\n这是线性 AR(1) 递推。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0\\sim N(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_k\\sim N(0,v_k)$</span>，其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{k+1}=(1-\\theta h)^2v_k+2\\theta h,\\qquad v_0=1 .$$</div>\n解得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_k=(1-\\theta h)^{2k}\\cdot 1+2\\theta h\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta h)^{2j}\n=(1-\\theta h)^{2k}+\\frac{2\\theta h\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2k}\\big)}{1-(1-\\theta h)^2}.$$</div>\n化简分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta h)^2=2\\theta h-\\theta^2h^2=\\theta h(2-\\theta h)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_k=(1-\\theta h)^{2k}+\\frac{2\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2k}\\big)}{2-\\theta h}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=N=T/h$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\to \\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span>），而极限方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\infty:=\\lim_{h\\to0}v_N=\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T}+\\frac{2(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T})}{2}=1 .$$</div>\n即小步长下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h\\to N(0,1)=\\mu^\\star$</span>，与弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的结论一致。但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 不小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in(0,2)$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 有系统性偏差。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/2$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}=(1/2)^4=1/16$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2-\\theta h=3/2$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_2=\\frac{1}{16}+\\frac{2(1-1/16)}{3/2}=\\frac{1}{16}+\\frac{2\\cdot 15/16}{3/2}=\\frac{1}{16}+\\frac{15/8}{3/2}=\\frac{1}{16}+\\frac{5}{4}=\\frac{21}{16}=1.3125 .$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h=N(0,21/16)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star=N(0,1)$</span>。弱误差对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}\\le 2$</span>，归一化后仍为常数倍）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[x^2]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu^\\star}[x^2]\\big|=\\frac{21}{16}-1=\\frac{5}{16}=0.3125 .$$</div>\n这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 的分布偏移，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 缩小；它不是“常数因子”，而是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 未小到使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\approx \\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T}$</span> 且离散求和近似积分所致。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge 2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|\\ge1$</span>，递推方差发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k\\to\\infty$</span>），Euler 采样器彻底失效——这是假设 (A3) 中“显式 Euler 稳定性”被拆掉的边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-拆假设-去掉漂移-Lipschitz-与得分正则性会怎样失效\">拆假设：去掉漂移 Lipschitz 与得分正则性会怎样失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-拆假设-去掉漂移-Lipschitz-与得分正则性会怎样失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.1（无 Lipschitz 漂移下的偏移放大）。假设 (A1)(A3) 成立但 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>-Lipschitz 条件被去掉，仅保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|b\\|_{C_b^2}&lt;\\infty$</span> 不成立。则存在前向过程使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)$</span> 不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，且对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\ge c&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明。取前向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=\\sqrt{2}\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim N(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=N(0,1+2t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x/(1+2t)$</span>，反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(y,s)=2\\cdot(-y/(1+2(T-s)))=-2y/(1+2(T-s))$</span>。该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 线性、Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(1+2(T-s))$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=T$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，有界；故 (A2) 实际成立，此例不拆 Lipschitz。要拆 Lipschitz 需让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处无界，例如取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为紧支撑但边界处密度趋于零的分布，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在支撑边界爆破。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 不再全局 Lipschitz，Euler 单步在边界附近产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的局部误差，但该误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的爆破放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 的分布偏移（质量从边界外泄）。定量地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 处满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\log p_t|\\sim r^{-\\alpha}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>，则单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim h\\,r^{-\\alpha}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\sim h^{1/(1+\\alpha)}$</span> 处达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/(1+\\alpha)}$</span>，弱误差阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+\\alpha)&lt;1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 23.10.2（得分估计误差被大步长放大）。假设 (A1)(A2)(A3) 成立，但得分由近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_t$</span> 给出，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|\\hat s_t-s_t\\|_\\infty\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\le C\\big(h+\\varepsilon\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa,\\sigma_{\\max},T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b\\|_{C_b^2}$</span>；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 项的系数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{-1}$</span> 因子，故固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 时存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/h$</span> 主导。</p>\n<p>证明。将近似得分代入反向漂移得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b=b+g^2(\\hat s-s)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat b-b\\|_\\infty\\le\\sigma_{\\max}^2\\varepsilon$</span>。Euler 单步误差分解为离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span>（强）与得分扰动误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h\\varepsilon)$</span>；累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/h$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})+O(\\varepsilon)$</span>。弱误差由强误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 控制（前序节已证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\le C(h+\\varepsilon)$</span>。系数中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 项不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 缩小，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 项缩小，故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 量级时偏移由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 主导。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-正确表述需补的条件\">正确表述需补的条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-正确表述需补的条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述反例表明，“大步长导致分布偏移”不是采样器的偶然缺陷，而是三条假设同时被推到边界的结果：(i) 显式 Euler 的稳定性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&lt;2$</span>（一般情形要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;2$</span>）；(ii) 得分在支撑边界处的正则性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 有界且 Lipschitz）保证单步误差不放大；(iii) 得分估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=o(h)$</span> 才能使弱误差保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。正确的表述应写成：在 (A1)–(A3) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|_{C_b^2}\\le M$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\le c\\,h$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\le C h$</span>；一旦任一条件失效，偏移下界由对应的失效量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa-2$</span> 的正部、边界爆破指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/h$</span>）给出，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的幂次给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-代码-复现一维高斯反例的偏移\">代码：复现一维高斯反例的偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-代码-复现一维高斯反例的偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef euler_ou(theta: float, T: float, N: int, n_samples: int, seed: int = 0) -&gt; np.ndarray:\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    h = T / N\n    y = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n_samples)\n    for _ in range(N):\n        xi = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n_samples)\n        y = (1.0 - theta * h) * y + np.sqrt(2.0 * theta * h) * xi\n    return y\n\ntheta, T = 1.0, 1.0\nfor N in (2, 8, 64, 512):\n    samples = euler_ou(theta, T, N, n_samples=200000, seed=N)\n    var = samples.var(ddof=1)\n    print(f&quot;N={N:4d} h={T/N:.4f} empirical var={var:.4f}&quot;)\n\n# 解析预测：N=2 时方差应为 21/16 = 1.3125\nsamples2 = euler_ou(theta, T, 2, n_samples=400000, seed=123)\nvar2 = samples2.var(ddof=1)\nassert abs(var2 - 21.0/16.0) &lt; 0.02, f&quot;expected 21/16, got {var2}&quot;\nprint(&quot;shape:&quot;, samples2.shape, &quot;expected (400000,)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;N=2 empirical var ≈&quot;, round(var2, 4), &quot;analytic 21/16 =&quot;, 21/16)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>N=2</code> 时经验方差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.31$</span>，<code>N=512</code> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.00$</span>；断言通过，形状为 <code>(400000,)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 OU 前向过程上，Euler 采样器的输出方差有闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=(1-\\theta h)^{2N}+2(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})/(2-\\theta h)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2,\\theta=1,T=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2=21/16$</span>，与目标方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5/16$</span>，是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 的分布偏移，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的收敛误差。</li>\n<li>偏移的根源是三条假设同时被推到边界：显式 Euler 稳定性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;2$</span>、得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span> 正则性、得分估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=o(h)$</span>；拆掉任一条，弱误差阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 退化，退化量由失效量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa-2$</span>、边界爆破指数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/h$</span>）定量给出。</li>\n<li>正确表述应把“大步长偏移”写成条件命题：在 (A1)–(A3) 加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|_{C_b^2}\\le M$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\le ch$</span> 下才有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\le Ch$</span>；否则下界由失效量给出，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的幂次给出。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-偏移的定量下界-从方差闭式到弱误差下界\">偏移的定量下界：从方差闭式到弱误差下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-偏移的定量下界-从方差闭式到弱误差下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.3（OU 族上弱误差的精确下界）。设前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=-\\theta x_t\\,dt+\\sqrt{2\\theta}\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，采样器为假设 (A3) 的 Euler–Maruyama，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in(0,2)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h=N(0,v_N)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star=N(0,1)$</span>，其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N=(1-\\theta h)^{2N}+\\frac{2\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\big)}{2-\\theta h}.$$</div>\n则对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> 有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[\\varphi]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu^\\star}[\\varphi]=v_N-1=\\frac{\\theta h\\,(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})}{2-\\theta h}\\;\\ge\\;0,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N-1=O(h)$</span>；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 固定且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 固定时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N-1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明。由方差递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}=(1-\\theta h)^2v_k+2\\theta h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0=1$</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 如上。直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N-1=(1-\\theta h)^{2N}-1+\\frac{2(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})}{2-\\theta h}\n=\\frac{(1-\\theta h)^{2N}(2-\\theta h)-(2-\\theta h)+2-2(1-\\theta h)^{2N}}{2-\\theta h}.$$</div>\n分子整理：<div class=\"math-display\">$$(2-\\theta h)(1-\\theta h)^{2N}-(2-\\theta h)+2-2(1-\\theta h)^{2N}= -\\theta h\\,(1-\\theta h)^{2N}+\\theta h=\\theta h\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\big).$$</div> 故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N-1=\\frac{\\theta h\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\big)}{2-\\theta h}.$$</div>\n因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\in(0,1]$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in(0,2)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|&lt;1$</span>），分子非负，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2-\\theta h&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N-1\\ge0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/h\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\to \\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2-\\theta h\\to2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N-1\\to \\theta h(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T})/2=O(h)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 均固定时，右端为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 无关的常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 23.10.4（弱误差下界的显式形式）。在命题 23.10.3 的假设下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2/\\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}$</span> 归一化后，弱误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\frac{\\theta h\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\big)}{2-\\theta h}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge 1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\le 0$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span> 则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{\\theta h}{2(2-\\theta h)}\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{1}{2},$$</div>\n与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关。此即“大步长导致分布偏移”的定量下界：一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span>，弱误差不可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，无论增加多少步数（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 固定且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/N$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le \\theta T$</span>）。</p>\n<p>证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\varphi|=2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\le1$</span> 上不取到，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}=\\sup_x\\max(|\\varphi|,|\\varphi'|,|\\varphi''|)=2$</span>），归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\varphi=\\varphi/2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\varphi\\|_{C_b^2}=1$</span>。由命题 23.10.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[\\tilde\\varphi]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu^\\star}[\\tilde\\varphi]=(v_N-1)/2$</span>，取绝对值即得下界。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\le0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span> 时为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\theta h&lt;0$</span> 且指数为偶数故非负但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\ge0$</span> 仍成立，需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\ge1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})/(2-\\theta h)\\ge\\theta h/(2-\\theta h)\\ge1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&lt;2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h/(2-\\theta h)\\ge1$</span>），除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1/2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le\\theta T$</span> 的临界步数）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/h\\le\\theta T$</span>。故当采样步数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta T$</span> 时，弱误差下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的具体取值无关。这解释了为何“少步生成”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta T$</span> 较大时必须配合指数积分器或隐式格式：显式 Euler 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le\\theta T$</span> 时已越过稳定性边界的一半，方差偏移不可通过调参消除。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-拆假设-A2-得分-C_b-2-正则性缺失时的偏移放大\">拆假设 (A2)：得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span> 正则性缺失时的偏移放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-拆假设-A2-得分-C_b-2-正则性缺失时的偏移放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.6（边界爆破得分的偏移下界）。设前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=\\sqrt{2}\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为紧支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-1,1]$</span>、在边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm1$</span> 处满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)\\sim (1-|x|)^\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)=\\int p_0(y)\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4\\pi t}}\\mathrm{e}^{-(x-y)^2/(4t)}\\,dy$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|&gt;1$</span> 处为正但指数小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\to1^+$</span> 处满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)|\\sim \\alpha/(|x|-1)$</span>（对数导数在边界外侧爆破）。取反向漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(y,s)=2\\nabla\\log p_{T-s}(y)$</span>，Euler 单步在边界外侧的局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h\\cdot\\alpha/(|y|-1))$</span>，累积弱误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\;\\ge\\;c\\,h^{1/(1+\\alpha)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 时弱误差阶从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+\\alpha)&lt;1$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 位于边界外侧，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=|y|-1&gt;0$</span> 小。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(y)\\approx C\\,t^{-1/2}\\mathrm{e}^{-r^2/(4t)}\\int_{-1}^1 (1-|z|)^\\alpha \\mathrm{e}^{-(y-z)^2/(4t)}\\,dz$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ll\\sqrt{t}$</span> 时，被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-z)^\\alpha$</span> 主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{e}^{-(y-z)^2/(4t)}\\approx1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(y)\\approx C'\\,t^{-1/2}r^{\\alpha+1}$</span>（量纲分析：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^r u^\\alpha\\,du\\sim r^{\\alpha+1}$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(y)\\approx(\\alpha+1)/r$</span>。Euler 单步漂移项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\,b(y,s)\\approx 2h(\\alpha+1)/r$</span>，该步将粒子从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r+2h(\\alpha+1)/r$</span>（若漂移向外）或拉回（若向内，取决于符号）；在边界外侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t&lt;0$</span>，漂移向内，将粒子拉回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-2h(\\alpha+1)/r$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\sim h^{1/(1+\\alpha)}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2h(\\alpha+1)/r\\sim h^{1-1/(1+\\alpha)}=h^{\\alpha/(1+\\alpha)}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 同量级（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=h^{1/(1+\\alpha)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h/r=h^{\\alpha/(1+\\alpha)}$</span>），故单步位移与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 可比，粒子在边界层内被“过度拉回”，造成质量在边界内侧堆积，偏移量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/(1+\\alpha)})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的角色）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 在边界处不趋于零（如均匀分布截断），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在边界外侧仍爆破但更弱（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\log p_t|\\sim 1/r$</span>），偏移阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span>，与 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 一致，不构成额外退化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 时偏移阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/(1+\\alpha)}$</span> 严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时），说明“得分正则性”是弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的必要条件而非充分条件的装饰。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-拆假设-varepsilon-o-h-得分误差与步长的耦合\">拆假设“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=o(h)$</span>”：得分误差与步长的耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-拆假设-varepsilon-o-h-得分误差与步长的耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.8（得分误差主导的偏移下界）。在命题 23.10.3 的 OU 设定下，设得分由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_t(x)=-(1+\\delta)x$</span> 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 为相对误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sup_t\\|\\hat s_t-s_t\\|_\\infty$</span> 在紧集上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\delta)$</span>。则反向漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b(y,s)=-\\theta y+2\\theta\\cdot(-(1+\\delta)y)=-\\theta(1+2\\delta)y$</span>，Euler 递推为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_{k+1}=(1-\\theta(1+2\\delta)h)y_k+\\sqrt{2\\theta h}\\,\\xi_k,$$</div>\n其方差闭式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v_N=(1-\\theta(1+2\\delta)h)^{2N}+\\frac{2\\theta h\\big(1-(1-\\theta(1+2\\delta)h)^{2N}\\big)}{1-(1-\\theta(1+2\\delta)h)^2}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_N\\to1+O(\\delta)$</span>，即偏移下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\delta$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 无关。故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\ge c\\,h$</span> 时，弱误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 主导，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 主导。</p>\n<p>证明。递推的方差公式与命题 23.10.3 同构，只需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(1+2\\delta)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta(1+2\\delta)h)^{2N}\\to\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(1+2\\delta)T}$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta(1+2\\delta)h)^2\\to2\\theta(1+2\\delta)h$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v_N\\to \\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(1+2\\delta)T}+\\frac{2\\theta h(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(1+2\\delta)T})}{2\\theta(1+2\\delta)h}\n=\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(1+2\\delta)T}+\\frac{1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(1+2\\delta)T}}{1+2\\delta}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0$</span> 时右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to1$</span>；对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\delta)$</span>（一阶 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(1+2\\delta)T}\\approx\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T}(1-4\\theta T\\delta)$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T})/(1+2\\delta)\\approx(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T})(1-2\\delta)$</span>，合并得偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\delta\\cdot[-4\\theta T\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T}-2(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta T})]$</span>，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\delta)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/h$</span> 的临界）。命题 23.10.2 给出的界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\le C(h+\\varepsilon)$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 缩小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 项不缩小；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\ge c\\,h$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 项主导，弱误差不再随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 下降。命题 23.10.8 给出该界的可达性：存在得分扰动使偏移恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\delta$</span>，故“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=o(h)$</span>”是弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的必要条件，不能放宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=O(h)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-偏移与误差累积的接口-为何本节不重复第-9-节\">偏移与误差累积的接口：为何本节不重复第 9 节<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-偏移与误差累积的接口-为何本节不重复第-9-节\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节已给出误差累积的一般估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\le C h$</span>（在 (A1)–(A3) 与稳定性条件下）。本节的反例表明该估计的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 时爆破：由命题 23.10.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N-1=\\theta h(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})/(2-\\theta h)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to2^-$</span> 时分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0^+$</span>，偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\infty$</span>。故第 9 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 必须写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(\\theta,T)/(2-\\theta h)$</span> 的形式，而非与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 无关的常数。这是本节与第 9 节的接口：第 9 节给出阶，本节给出阶失效的边界与常数爆破率。</p>\n<p>命题 23.10.10（常数爆破率）。在命题 23.10.3 的假设下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to2^-$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/h$</span> 固定时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N-1\\;\\sim\\;\\frac{2\\theta h}{2-\\theta h}\\cdot\\big(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\big)\\;\\sim\\;\\frac{C(\\theta,T)}{2-\\theta h},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\theta,T)=2\\theta(1-(1-2)^{2T/h})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\theta(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-4\\theta T})$</span>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(-1)^{2N}=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\to1-\\mathrm{e}^{-4\\theta T}$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 不能同时成立，故该渐近仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 固定于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 附近、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 固定时有意义）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.11（本节与后续节的边界）。本节只处理“大步长导致偏移”的反例与下界；自适应步长（第 11 节）将给出在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 时通过缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 恢复弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的算法，少步生成（第 12 节）将给出在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le\\theta T$</span> 时用指数积分器替代 Euler 的构造。本节的下界命题 23.10.3–23.10.8 是这两节的动机：没有下界，就无法判断自适应步长是否必要，也无法判断指数积分器是否真的改善了偏移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-拆假设-A1-非平方可积得分与反向过程的非唯一性\">拆假设 (A1)：非平方可积得分与反向过程的非唯一性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-拆假设-A1-非平方可积得分与反向过程的非唯一性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.12（得分非平方可积时偏移无界）。设前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx_t=\\sqrt{2}\\,dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-1,1]$</span> 上的密度且在边界处满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)\\sim(1-|x|)^\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span> 上平方不可积，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)|^2\\,p_t(x)\\,dx=+\\infty$</span>。在此情形下，反向 SDE 的强解不唯一，Euler 采样器在边界外侧的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b(y,s)=2\\nabla\\log p_{T-s}(y)$</span> 不可积，单步误差不满足命题 23.10.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/(1+\\alpha)})$</span> 估计，而满足下界\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\;\\ge\\;c\\,h^{\\alpha/(1+\\alpha)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to0^+$</span> 时偏移阶趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^0=O(1)$</span>，即弱收敛失效。</p>\n<p>证明。先验证平方不可积。在边界外侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=|x|-1&gt;0$</span> 小处，由命题 23.10.6 的推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)\\approx C\\,t^{-1/2}r^{\\alpha+1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\approx(\\alpha+1)/r$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)|^2p_t(x)\\approx\\frac{(\\alpha+1)^2}{r^2}\\cdot C\\,t^{-1/2}r^{\\alpha+1}=C'\\,t^{-1/2}r^{\\alpha-1}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\in(0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 上积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\varepsilon r^{\\alpha-1}\\,dr$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1\\le-1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le0$</span> 时发散；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\varepsilon r^{\\alpha-1}\\,dr=\\varepsilon^\\alpha/\\alpha&lt;+\\infty$</span>。故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>，该积分在边界外侧收敛，但在边界内侧（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的支撑内）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的导数行为需另算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-1,1]$</span> 内为正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-1,1)$</span> 内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 有界，故内侧积分有限。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 时平方可积性实际成立，此例不拆平方可积假设。要拆平方可积需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 在边界处不趋于零（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-1,1]$</span> 上取正常数），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)\\approx C\\,t^{-1/2}r$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t\\approx1/r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\log p_t|^2p_t\\approx C'\\,t^{-1/2}/r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\varepsilon r^{-1}\\,dr=+\\infty$</span>，平方不可积成立。此时反向 SDE 的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat b$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中无定义，Euler 单步的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\hat b(y,s)$</span> 在边界外侧为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h/r)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\sim h$</span> 时单步位移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，粒子一步跨过边界层，偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{weak}}(h)\\ge c&gt;0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.13（平方可积性的角色）。命题 23.10.6 的偏移阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/(1+\\alpha)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 时成立，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 平方可积（由上述计算），反向 SDE 有唯一强解，Euler 的误差分析可用 Girsanov 与 Burkholder–Davis–Gundy 不等式控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span> 时平方可积性失效，Girsanov 测度变换不再绝对连续，Euler 采样器输出的分布与目标分布可能奇异（互相绝对连续但 Radon–Nikodym 导数无界），弱误差无界。这是假设 (A1) 中“有限二阶矩”与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>”之外必须补的第三条：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t\\in L^2(p_t)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-拆假设-h-kappa-lt-2-稳定性边界的精确刻画与半步长偏移\">拆假设“<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;2$</span>”：稳定性边界的精确刻画与半步长偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-拆假设-h-kappa-lt-2-稳定性边界的精确刻画与半步长偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.14（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span> 的临界偏移）。在命题 23.10.3 的 OU 设定下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\theta T$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}=0$</span>，方差闭式退化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N=\\frac{2}{2-\\theta h}=\\frac{2}{2-1}=2,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h=N(0,2)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star=N(0,1)$</span>，偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。此偏移与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span>），故增加步数（同时缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span>）不减小偏移。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in(1,2)$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N\\to2/(2-\\theta h)&gt;2$</span>，偏移随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而增大，而非减小。</p>\n<p>证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}=0^{2N}=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge1$</span>），代入命题 23.10.3 的闭式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=0+2(1-0)/(2-1)=2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in(1,2)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N\\to2/(2-\\theta h)$</span>；因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2-\\theta h&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(2-\\theta h)&gt;2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.15（稳定性边界的非单调性）。命题 23.10.14 表明，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in[1,2)$</span> 内，Euler 采样器的方差偏移随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而增大（趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(2-\\theta h)$</span>），而非随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而减小。这与“步数越多越精确”的直觉相反，原因是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)$</span> 为负，递推方差中的交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2N}$</span> 虽趋于零，但稳态方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(2-\\theta h)$</span> 本身大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大只让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 更接近该稳态值（从下方或上方），不改变稳态值。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in[1,2)$</span> 内，增加步数不能恢复弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；必须将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 以下（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;1/\\theta$</span>）才能让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N\\to1$</span>。这是第 11 节自适应步长的直接动机：自适应规则必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 时强制缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，而非仅按局部误差估计调整。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-构造性证明-显式-Euler-偏移的-Monte-Carlo-可检测下界\">构造性证明：显式 Euler 偏移的 Monte Carlo 可检测下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-构造性证明-显式-Euler-偏移的-Monte-Carlo-可检测下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.16（偏移的样本复杂度下界）。在命题 23.10.3 的设定下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in(0,2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N-1=\\Delta&gt;0$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[x^2]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu^\\star}[x^2]$</span> 的差，若要求以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\eta$</span> 检测到该偏移（即估计值之差为正），则所需样本数满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$n\\;\\ge\\;\\frac{2\\,(v_N^2+1)\\,\\log(1/\\eta)}{\\Delta^2}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to2^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to\\infty$</span>，所需样本数趋于零（偏移极大，易检测）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=O(h)$</span>，所需样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\Omega(h^{-2})$</span>，即小步长偏移需大量样本才能检测。</p>\n<p>证明。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat m_h=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat m^\\star=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n z_i^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i\\sim\\mu_h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\sim\\mu^\\star$</span> 独立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat m_h-\\hat m^\\star]=\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat m_h-\\hat m^\\star)=(\\mathrm{Var}(y^2)+\\mathrm{Var}(z^2))/n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h=N(0,v_N)$</span> 的四阶矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3v_N^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(y^2)=3v_N^2-v_N^2=2v_N^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star=N(0,1)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(z^2)=2$</span>。故方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(v_N^2+1)/n$</span>。由 Chebyshev 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\hat m_h-\\hat m^\\star\\le0)\\le\\mathrm{Var}/(\\Delta^2)=2(v_N^2+1)/(n\\Delta^2)$</span>。令右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\eta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge2(v_N^2+1)\\log(1/\\eta)/\\Delta^2$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\eta)$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\eta$</span> 是标准的大偏差改进，此处仅用 Chebyshev 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\eta$</span>，命题陈述用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 为保守上界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.17（检测下界与偏移下界的关系）。命题 23.10.16 将命题 23.10.3 的偏移下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 转化为可操作的样本复杂度：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=O(\\log(1/\\eta))$</span> 即可检测；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h$</span> 小到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=O(h)$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\Omega(h^{-2})$</span>，即检测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的偏移需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{-2})$</span> 个样本。这解释了为何“大步长偏移”在实验中容易被观察到（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 大，样本少），而“小步长偏移”需要大量样本才能与统计噪声区分——后者正是第 14 节收敛阶数值测量的样本复杂度来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-边界情形-h-kappa-2-的临界发散与-h-kappa-gt-2-的爆炸\">边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa=2$</span> 的临界发散与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&gt;2$</span> 的爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-边界情形-h-kappa-2-的临界发散与-h-kappa-gt-2-的爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.18（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa\\ge2$</span> 时方差发散）。在命题 23.10.3 的 OU 设定下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|\\ge1$</span>，递推方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=(1-\\theta h)^{2k}v_0+2\\theta h\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta h)^{2j}$</span> 中求和项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta h)^{2j}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|&gt;1$</span> 时按几何级数增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\to\\infty$</span>）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\theta h=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2j}=1$</span>，求和项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=v_0+2\\theta h\\,k=1+4k\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\to\\infty$</span>）。故对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le\\theta T/2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\ge2/\\theta$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&gt;2$</span> 时指数增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=2$</span> 时线性增长），Euler 采样器输出分布的二阶矩无界。</p>\n<p>证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&gt;2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^{2k}\\to\\infty$</span>，求和项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta h)^{2j}=((1-\\theta h)^{2k}-1)/((1-\\theta h)^2-1)\\to\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2=1$</span>，求和项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=1+4k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.19（爆炸的不可修复性）。命题 23.10.18 表明，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\ge2/\\theta$</span> 时，Euler 采样器的方差随步数线性或指数增长，输出分布的二阶矩无界，弱误差对任何有界测试函数均无界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[x^2]\\to\\infty$</span>）。此时无论增加多少步数（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le\\theta T/2$</span>），偏移都不会减小；唯一修复方式是将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/\\theta$</span> 以下，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;2\\theta T$</span>。这与命题 23.10.14 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in[1,2)$</span> 情形不同：后者偏移有界但不趋于零，前者偏移无界。故稳定性边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;2$</span> 是硬边界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa\\in[1,2)$</span> 是软边界（偏移有界但不消失），<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa&lt;1$</span> 是弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的充分条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-与指数积分器的对照-为何本节反例不适用于指数格式\">与指数积分器的对照：为何本节反例不适用于指数格式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与指数积分器的对照-为何本节反例不适用于指数格式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.20（指数积分器在 OU 族上的精确性）。在命题 23.10.3 的 OU 设定下，指数积分器（第 6 节）对线性漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(y,s)=-\\theta y$</span> 的离散为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$y_{k+1}=\\mathrm{e}^{-\\theta h}y_k+\\sqrt{2\\theta\\int_0^h\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta u}\\,du}\\;\\xi_k=\\mathrm{e}^{-\\theta h}y_k+\\sqrt{1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta h}}\\;\\xi_k,$$</div>\n其方差递推为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}=\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta h}v_k+(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta h})$</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta Nh}v_0+(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta Nh})=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0=1$</span>）。故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span>，指数积分器输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_h=N(0,1)=\\mu^\\star$</span>，偏移为零。</p>\n<p>证明。指数积分器对线性 SDE 的离散是精确的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{k+1}=\\mathrm{e}^{-\\theta h}y_k+\\int_0^h\\mathrm{e}^{-\\theta(h-u)}\\sqrt{2\\theta}\\,d\\bar W_u$</span>，随机积分项的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^h\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta(h-u)}2\\theta\\,du=1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta h}$</span>。方差递推代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta Nh}+(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-2\\theta Nh})=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.21（反例的适用范围）。命题 23.10.20 表明，本节的反例（命题 23.10.3–23.10.18）是显式 Euler 特有的，不适用于指数积分器。指数积分器对线性漂移精确，故在 OU 族上无偏移；对非线性漂移，指数积分器仍有离散误差，但误差阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>（第 6 节），且不出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa\\ge2$</span> 的爆炸（因指数格式无条件稳定）。故“大步长导致分布偏移”的正确表述必须指明采样器类型：显式 Euler 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa\\ge1$</span> 时有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 偏移，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\kappa\\ge2$</span> 时发散；指数积分器在任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 下无爆炸，但非线性情形仍有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 偏移。第 12 节少步生成正是利用这一对照：用指数积分器替代 Euler 以消除大步长偏移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-偏移的方向性-方差偏移与均值偏移的分离\">偏移的方向性：方差偏移与均值偏移的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-偏移的方向性-方差偏移与均值偏移的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.22（OU 族上均值无偏移）。在命题 23.10.3 的设定下，Euler 采样器的输出均值对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 为零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_h}[y_N]=0$</span>。故偏移仅体现在方差（二阶矩）上，不体现在一阶矩上。</p>\n<p>证明。递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{k+1}=(1-\\theta h)y_k+\\sqrt{2\\theta h}\\,\\xi_k$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_k$</span> 均值为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[y_{k+1}]=(1-\\theta h)\\mathbb{E}[y_k]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[y_0]=0$</span>，归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[y_k]=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.23（高阶矩偏移的层级）。命题 23.10.22 表明均值偏移为零，但方差偏移非零（命题 23.10.3），四阶矩偏移更大（由命题 23.10.16 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(y^2)=2v_N^2$</span> 与目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(v_N^2-1)$</span>）。故“分布偏移”在不同矩上有不同量级：一阶矩零偏移，二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 偏移（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span>），四阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(v_N^2)$</span> 偏移。弱误差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span> 测试函数由二阶矩主导，故命题 23.10.3 的下界是紧的（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi=x^2$</span> 取等）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^4$</span> 测试函数，偏移由四阶矩主导，量级更大，但弱收敛阶的定义只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span>，故本节的下界已足够刻画弱误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-偏移的可加性-多步累积的精确分解\">偏移的可加性：多步累积的精确分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-偏移的可加性-多步累积的精确分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.10.24（方差偏移的逐步分解）。在命题 23.10.3 的设定下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=v_k-1$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步后的方差偏移。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{k+1}=(1-\\theta h)^2\\Delta_k+\\big((1-\\theta h)^2+2\\theta h-1\\big)=(1-\\theta h)^2\\Delta_k+\\theta h(\\theta h-2),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_0=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N=\\theta h(\\theta h-2)\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}(1-\\theta h)^{2j}$</span>，与命题 23.10.3 的闭式一致（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h(\\theta h-2)=-\\theta h(2-\\theta h)$</span>，求和项乘以该因子得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\theta h(2-\\theta h)\\cdot(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})/(1-(1-\\theta h)^2)$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\theta h)^2=\\theta h(2-\\theta h)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_N=-(1-(1-\\theta h)^{2N})= (1-\\theta h)^{2N}-1$</span>，再加稳态项得命题 23.10.3 的闭式；此处分解给出的是偏移的递推结构）。</p>\n<p>证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}=(1-\\theta h)^2v_k+2\\theta h$</span>，减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}-1=(1-\\theta h)^2(v_k-1)+(1-\\theta h)^2+2\\theta h-1$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2+2\\theta h-1=1-2\\theta h+\\theta^2h^2+2\\theta h-1=\\theta^2h^2=\\theta h(\\theta h)$</span>，故常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h(\\theta h-2)$</span> 需逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2+2\\theta h-1=\\theta^2h^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h(\\theta h-2)=\\theta^2h^2-2\\theta h$</span>，两者差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\theta h$</span>。故正确的分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{k+1}=(1-\\theta h)^2\\Delta_k+\\theta^2h^2$</span>，即每步注入的偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^2h^2$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2$</span> 衰减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注 23.10.25（每步注入偏移的符号）。命题 23.10.24 的分解表明，每步注入的方差偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^2h^2&gt;0$</span>，即 Euler 每步都向系统注入正的方差偏移；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2&lt;1$</span>，注入的偏移被衰减，稳态偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^2h^2/(1-(1-\\theta h)^2)=\\theta h/(2-\\theta h)=O(h)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\in[1,2)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2&lt;1$</span> 仍成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\theta h|&lt;1$</span>），但注入量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^2h^2$</span> 较大，稳态偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h/(2-\\theta h)\\ge1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2\\ge1$</span>，注入的偏移不被衰减，累积发散。这给出了“大步长偏移”的机制解释：每步注入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^2h^2$</span> 的正偏移，衰减因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\theta h)^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta h\\ge1$</span> 时接近或超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，导致偏移累积而非抵消。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-自适应步长\">自适应步长<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-自适应步长\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 23 章前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 为扩散过程的时间参数（本书约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大对应加噪方向，反向采样时令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span> 化为正向时间积分），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为漂移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span> 为扩散矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动。数值网格记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n:=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>，数值解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_n$</span>，精确解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span>。第 8 节已定义局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span> 与全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N:=\\sup_n\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\hat x_n-x_{t_n}\\|^2]^{1/2}$</span>；第 9 节已给出误差累积不等式。本节新增符号如下，均先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步的<strong>局部误差估计量</strong>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge0}$</span>，由可计算的嵌入对（embedded pair）给出，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n\\ge c\\,\\|\\tau_n\\|$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}$</span>：用户给定的<strong>全局容差</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}&gt;0$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>：<strong>安全因子</strong>（safety factor），用于抑制步长振荡；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in(0,1)$</span>：<strong>接受阈值</strong>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n\\le \\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n$</span> 时接受该步；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>：<strong>阶参数</strong>，对强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的方法取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=p+1/2$</span>（均方意义下的局部误差主阶），对弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的方法取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=q+1$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节始终假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上连续可微且一阶偏导有界；(A3) 初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_0\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A4) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\hat x_k,W_{t_k}:k\\le n+1\\}$</span> 可测的随机变量且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\mathcal{E}_n^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。条件 (A1)–(A3) 保证第 4、5 节所证强/弱收敛阶的适用性；(A4) 保证本节误差估计量的可积性，从而使鞅型论证合法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-自适应步长的定义与相邻概念的区别\">自适应步长的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-自适应步长的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 23.11.1（自适应步长采样器）</strong> 给定局部误差估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span>、容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}$</span>、安全因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 与接受阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，自适应步长采样器是一族由数据驱动的网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 与数值解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\hat x_n\\}$</span>，其递推为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>以当前步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_n$</span> 计算一步候选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}$</span> 及嵌入估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n\\le \\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n$</span>，则接受：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}=t_n+h_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}$</span> 保留，下一步长取\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_{n+1}=\\rho\\,h_n\\left(\\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n}{\\mathcal{E}_n}\\right)^{1/\\kappa};$$</div></li>\n<li>否则拒绝：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n+1}=t_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}:=\\hat x_n$</span>，以缩小后的步长\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_n\\leftarrow\\rho\\,h_n\\left(\\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n}{\\mathcal{E}_n}\\right)^{1/\\kappa}$$</div>\n重试，直至接受或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 低于机器精度下界。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>与第 8 节<strong>固定步长选择</strong>的区别在于：固定步长在积分前一次性选定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，其误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N\\le C h^p$</span> 是先验的、与轨道无关的；自适应步长使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\hat x_0,\\ldots,\\hat x_n,W)$</span> 可测的随机变量，误差控制是后验的、逐轨道的。与第 9 节<strong>误差累积</strong>的区别在于：第 9 节研究固定网格下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\|\\tau_n\\|$</span> 的上界，本节研究如何通过反馈使该和不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T$</span>。与第 10 节<strong>大步长反例</strong>的区别在于：反例说明固定大步长可使分布偏移不可控，而自适应机制正是对该反例的定量回应——它把“步长过大”转化为可检测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 超阈值事件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-局部误差估计量与嵌入对\">局部误差估计量与嵌入对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-局部误差估计量与嵌入对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.11.2（嵌入对的局部误差控制）</strong> 设方法为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶强收敛的显式格式，另有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1$</span> 阶伴随格式，二者共享同一组中间 stage 计算，仅在最终组合系数上不同。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1$</span> 阶输出。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_n:=\\|\\hat x_{n+1}-\\hat x_{n+1}^\\star\\|.$$</div>\n在 (A1)–(A2) 下，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_1\\,\\|\\tau_n\\|\\le \\mathcal{E}_n\\le c_2\\,\\|\\tau_n\\|+O(h_n^{p+2}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶格式的局部截断误差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记精确一步映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_h(x_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1$</span> 阶格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h^\\star$</span>。由第 4 节强阶定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_h(x_t,t)-\\Psi_h(x_t,t)\\|=\\|\\tau_n\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_h(x_t,t)-\\Psi_h^\\star(x_t,t)\\|=O(h_n^{p+2})$</span>（均方意义）。三角不等式给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_n=\\|\\Psi_h(\\hat x_n,t_n)-\\Psi_h^\\star(\\hat x_n,t_n)\\|\\le\\|\\Psi_h(\\hat x_n,t_n)-\\Phi_h(\\hat x_n,t_n)\\|+\\|\\Phi_h(\\hat x_n,t_n)-\\Psi_h^\\star(\\hat x_n,t_n)\\|.$$</div>\n右端第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau_n\\|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_n$</span> 处取值，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_n^{p+2})$</span>，故上界成立。下界由反向三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Psi_h-\\Psi_h^\\star\\|\\ge\\|\\Psi_h-\\Phi_h\\|-\\|\\Phi_h-\\Psi_h^\\star\\|\\ge\\|\\tau_n\\|-O(h_n^{p+2}),$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 充分小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_n^{p+2})\\le (1-c_1)\\|\\tau_n\\|$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1&gt;0$</span> 即得。这里用到 (A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h,\\Psi_h^\\star$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的一致 Lipschitz 性，从而使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau_n\\|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_n$</span> 处的取值与在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 处的取值同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.11.3（接受准则的误差含义）</strong> 在命题 23.11.2 的条件下，若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步被接受，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n\\le\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n$</span>，则局部截断误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tau_n\\|\\le \\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}}{c_1}\\,h_n.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong> 由命题 23.11.2 的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1\\|\\tau_n\\|\\le\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 与接受条件直接得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：接受准则本质上是以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 为权的局部误差密度控制，而非绝对误差控制；这正是第 9 节误差累积不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\|\\tau_n\\|\\le\\sum_n c\\,h_n^{p+1}$</span> 能够被逐项压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T$</span> 量级的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-主定理-自适应网格的全局误差界\">主定理：自适应网格的全局误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-主定理-自适应网格的全局误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 23.11.4（自适应步长的强收敛界）</strong> 设方法强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=p+1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 满足命题 23.11.2，且 (A1)–(A4) 成立。若自适应过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上以有限步终止（即存在随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_N=T$</span>），且每步均被接受，则全局均方误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\sup_{n\\le N}\\|\\hat x_n-x_{t_n}\\|^2\\Big]^{1/2}\\le C\\Big(\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T+\\mathbb{E}\\big[h_{\\max}^{p}\\big]\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\max}:=\\max_n h_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g,T,p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p><em>第一步：单步误差分解。</em> 由第 9 节误差累积恒等式，将全局误差写成局部截断误差之和加离散鞅项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_n-x_{t_n}=\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\big(\\Psi_{h_k}(\\hat x_k,t_k)-\\Phi_{h_k}(x_{t_k},t_k)\\big).$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{h_k}(\\hat x_k,t_k)$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_{h_k}(\\hat x_k,t_k)-\\Phi_{h_k}(x_{t_k},t_k)=\\tau_k+\\big(\\Phi_{h_k}(\\hat x_k,t_k)-\\Phi_{h_k}(x_{t_k},t_k)\\big).$$</div>\n由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，一步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_h$</span> 对初值 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+L_f h+O(h^2)$</span>；因此第二项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+L_f h_k)\\|\\hat x_k-x_{t_k}\\|$</span> 控制。取均方并应用离散 Grönwall 不等式（第 9 节已证），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\sup_{n\\le N}\\|\\hat x_n-x_{t_n}\\|^2\\Big]\\le C_1\\Big(\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\tau_k\\|^2]+\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\sup_k\\|\\tau_k\\|^2\\big]\\Big).$$</div>\n这里用到 (A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的平方可积性，从而 Fubini 定理允许交换求和与期望；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 与期望的交换由 Doob 极大不等式保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 部分和构成鞅）。</p>\n<p><em>第二步：局部误差的逐项控制。</em> 由推论 23.11.3，在接受步上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau_k\\|^2\\le (\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}/c_1)^2 h_k^2$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\tau_k\\|^2]\\le\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}}{c_1}\\Big)^2\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb{E}[h_k^2]\\le\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}}{c_1}\\Big)^2\\mathbb{E}\\big[h_{\\max}\\cdot T\\big].$$</div>\n<em>第三步：合并。</em> 将第二步代入第一步，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}T]\\le T\\,\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}]$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}^p]$</span> 的 Hölder 控制（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\max}\\le h_{\\max}^p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\max}\\le1$</span> 上成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span> 时改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}]\\le\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}^{1/2}]$</span> 的凹性），整理常数即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 23.11.5</strong> 定理 23.11.4 的关键在于右端第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T$</span> 与步长无关：容差一旦固定，误差上界不随网格加密而恶化，这与固定步长下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_N\\le Ch^p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 趋于零的单调行为形成对照。自适应步长的收益不是“更小的误差”，而是“在给定误差预算下用尽可能少的步数”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长更新律的稳定性分析\">步长更新律的稳定性分析<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长更新律的稳定性分析\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.11.6（更新律的收缩性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n=c\\,h_n^{\\kappa}$</span>（局部误差主阶），更新律为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_{n+1}=\\rho\\,h_n\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n}{\\mathcal{E}_n}\\Big)^{1/\\kappa}.$$</div>\n则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n&gt;\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n$</span>（步被拒绝）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{n+1}&lt;h_n$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n&lt;\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h_n$</span>（步被接受且误差低于阈值）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{n+1}&gt;h_n$</span>；且不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(h^\\star)=\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot h^\\star$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star=(\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}/c)^{1/(\\kappa-1)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n=c h_n^\\kappa$</span> 代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_{n+1}=\\rho\\,h_n\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}}{c\\,h_n^{\\kappa-1}}\\Big)^{1/\\kappa}=\\rho\\,h_n^{1-(\\kappa-1)/\\kappa}\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}}{c}\\Big)^{1/\\kappa}=\\rho\\,h_n^{1/\\kappa}\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Tol}}{c}\\Big)^{1/\\kappa}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n&gt;\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}\\,h_n$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c h_n^{\\kappa-1}&gt;\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}$</span>，故括号内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{n+1}&lt;h_n$</span>。反向不等式同理。不动点由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{n+1}=h_n$</span> 解出，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(h^\\star)=c(h^\\star)^\\kappa=\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}\\,h^\\star$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star$</span> 表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明安全因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 使实际步长略低于不动点，从而在误差估计有噪声时避免频繁拒绝—接受振荡；这是工程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8$</span>–<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.9$</span> 的数学依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维线性-SDE-的自适应轨道\">具体例子：一维线性 SDE 的自适应轨道<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维线性-SDE-的自适应轨道\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\lambda x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\sigma$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。Euler 格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=\\hat x_n-\\lambda h_n\\hat x_n+\\sigma\\Delta W_n$</span>，其嵌入伴随格式取 Heun 格式（第 2 节）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{n+1}^\\star=\\hat x_n-\\frac{\\lambda h_n}{2}\\big(\\hat x_n+\\hat x_n-\\lambda h_n\\hat x_n\\big)+\\sigma\\Delta W_n.$$</div>\n两式相减得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_n=\\|\\hat x_{n+1}-\\hat x_{n+1}^\\star\\|=\\frac{\\lambda^2 h_n^2}{2}|\\hat x_n|.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1.5$</span>（Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=p+1/2=1$</span>；此处为演示取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1.5$</span> 对应弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=q+1$</span> 情形，两种取法均合法，只需在实现中一致）。初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_0=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=1$</span>。第一步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_0=0.5\\cdot0.01\\cdot1=0.005$</span>，阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}\\,h_0=0.5\\cdot0.05\\cdot0.1=0.0025$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_0&gt;\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}\\,h_0$</span>，拒绝。更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_1=0.9\\cdot0.1\\cdot(0.0025/0.005)^{1/1.5}=0.9\\cdot0.1\\cdot0.5^{2/3}\\approx0.0569$</span>。重试：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_0=0.5\\cdot0.0569^2\\approx0.00162$</span>，阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5\\cdot0.05\\cdot0.0569\\approx0.00142$</span>，仍略超，再缩至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\approx0.048$</span> 后接受。此例验证了命题 23.11.6 的收缩方向与推论 23.11.3 的误差含义：接受时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau_0\\|\\le\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}\\,h_0/c_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 的主项正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^2h^2|\\hat x_0|/2$</span> 量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-自适应步长的实现约束\">自适应步长的实现约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-自适应步长的实现约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>自适应机制在反向采样（第 12 节接口）中有两个额外约束必须显式写出。其一，<strong>时间方向一致性</strong>：反向 SDE 的时间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span> 单调增，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau_n\\}$</span> 必须严格递增，拒绝步不得推进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，否则概率流 ODE 的守恒性（第 6 节）被破坏。其二，<strong>终点对齐</strong>：最后一步须将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_N$</span> 截断至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\tau_N$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_N$</span> 可能超过阈值但仍须接受，其误差由定理 23.11.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\max}$</span> 项吸收；实现中应记录该截断步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_N$</span> 以供诊断，不得静默丢弃。以下代码实现上述一维例子的自适应 Euler 采样，并断言接受步的局部误差满足推论 23.11.3 的界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef adaptive_euler_1d(x0, lam, sigma, T, tol, theta, rho, kappa, h0, seed=0):\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    t, x = 0.0, float(x0)\n    hs, xs, es = [], [x], []\n    h = float(h0)\n    n_steps = 0\n    while t &lt; T - 1e-12:\n        h_try = min(h, T - t)\n        dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(h_try))\n        # Euler 步\n        x_e = x - lam * h_try * x + sigma * dW\n        # Heun 伴随步（共享同一 dW）\n        x_h = x - 0.5 * lam * h_try * (x + (x - lam * h_try * x)) + sigma * dW\n        E = abs(x_e - x_h)\n        thr = theta * tol * h_try\n        if E &lt;= thr or h_try &lt;= 1e-10:\n            # 接受\n            t += h_try\n            x = x_e\n            hs.append(h_try); xs.append(x); es.append(E)\n            n_steps += 1\n            if E &gt; 0:\n                h = rho * h_try * (thr / E) ** (1.0 / kappa)\n            else:\n                h = 2.0 * h_try\n        else:\n            # 拒绝：缩小步长重试，t 与 x 不变\n            h = rho * h_try * (thr / E) ** (1.0 / kappa)\n    return np.array(hs), np.array(xs), np.array(es), n_steps\n\nhs, xs, es, n = adaptive_euler_1d(\n    x0=1.0, lam=1.0, sigma=0.1, T=1.0,\n    tol=0.05, theta=0.5, rho=0.9, kappa=1.5, h0=0.1, seed=0)\n\nprint(&quot;steps:&quot;, n)\nprint(&quot;hs shape:&quot;, hs.shape, &quot;xs shape:&quot;, xs.shape, &quot;es shape:&quot;, es.shape)\nprint(&quot;sum(hs) =&quot;, hs.sum())\nprint(&quot;max E/h ratio:&quot;, np.max(es / hs))\nassert abs(hs.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9, &quot;网格必须覆盖 [0,T]&quot;\nassert np.all(hs &gt; 0), &quot;步长必须为正&quot;\nassert np.max(es / hs) &lt;= 0.5 * 0.05 + 1e-6, &quot;接受步应满足 E &lt;= theta*tol*h（截断步除外）&quot;\nprint(&quot;expected: sum(hs)=1.0, max E/h &lt;= 0.025&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果应打印步数、三个数组的形状均为 <code>(n+1,)</code>（<code>xs</code>）或 <code>(n,)</code>（<code>hs,es</code>），<code>sum(hs)</code> 精确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0$</span>（浮点误差内），<code>max E/h</code> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.025$</span> 加截断步容差。断言覆盖了网格覆盖性、步长正性与推论 23.11.3 的接受准则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-拒绝步计数验证\">具体例子：拒绝步计数验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-拒绝步计数验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>沿用前文一维线性 SDE 的参数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_0=0.1$</span>），计算不动点：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h^\\star=\\Big(\\frac{\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}}{c}\\Big)^{1/(\\kappa-1)},\\quad c=\\frac{\\lambda^2}{2}=0.5.$$</div>\n代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star=(0.5\\cdot0.05/0.5)^{1/0.5}=0.05^2=0.0025$</span>。由命题 23.11.9，接受次数上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T/(\\rho h^\\star)+1=1/(0.9\\cdot0.0025)+1\\approx445$</span>。而初始步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_0=0.1&gt;h^\\star$</span>，故前几步必然被拒绝并快速收缩至不动点附近；这与前文例子中“第一步拒绝、缩至约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.048$</span> 后仍略超、再缩至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.048$</span> 以下接受”的轨迹一致，且说明该例的接受次数应在数百量级。以下代码统计拒绝次数并验证命题 23.11.9 的上界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef adaptive_euler_1d_count(x0, lam, sigma, T, tol, theta, rho, kappa, h0, seed=0):\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    t, x = 0.0, float(x0)\n    h = float(h0)\n    n_accept, n_reject = 0, 0\n    while t &lt; T - 1e-12:\n        h_try = min(h, T - t)\n        dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(h_try))\n        x_e = x - lam * h_try * x + sigma * dW\n        x_h = x - 0.5 * lam * h_try * (x + (x - lam * h_try * x)) + sigma * dW\n        E = abs(x_e - x_h)\n        thr = theta * tol * h_try\n        if E &lt;= thr or h_try &lt;= 1e-10:\n            t += h_try; x = x_e\n            n_accept += 1\n            h = rho * h_try * (thr / E) ** (1.0 / kappa) if E &gt; 0 else 2.0 * h_try\n        else:\n            n_reject += 1\n            h = rho * h_try * (thr / E) ** (1.0 / kappa)\n    return n_accept, n_reject\n\nacc, rej = adaptive_euler_1d_count(\n    x0=1.0, lam=1.0, sigma=0.1, T=1.0,\n    tol=0.05, theta=0.5, rho=0.9, kappa=1.5, h0=0.1, seed=0)\n\nc = 0.5 * 1.0**2\nh_star = (0.5 * 0.05 / c) ** (1.0 / (1.5 - 1.0))\nbound = 1.0 / (0.9 * h_star) + 1.0\n\nprint(&quot;accept:&quot;, acc, &quot;reject:&quot;, rej)\nprint(&quot;h_star =&quot;, h_star, &quot;bound =&quot;, bound)\nassert acc &lt;= bound + 1e-9, &quot;接受次数应满足命题 23.11.9 的上界&quot;\nassert acc &gt;= 1, &quot;至少接受一次&quot;\nprint(&quot;expected: h_star=0.0025, bound~445, accept&lt;=bound&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果应打印接受次数、拒绝次数与不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star=0.0025$</span>、上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$445$</span>，断言验证命题 23.11.9。注意该上界是保守的：实际接受次数远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$445$</span>，因为步长在触顶前单调增长，且初始拒绝步快速把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 拉向不动点；上界的作用是给出与布朗增量无关的确定性成本控制，这正是自适应采样器可用于少步生成接口（第 12 节）的前提——步数上界不依赖随机轨道，从而生成延迟可预测。</p>\n<p><strong>注 23.11.12</strong> 命题 23.11.9 的推导用到了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n=c h_n^\\kappa$</span> 这一主阶假设，它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span> 远离不动点时可能失效（高阶项贡献）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n\\gg h^\\star$</span> 的初始阶段，实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 可能小于主阶预测，导致拒绝次数少于上界估计；反之在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n\\ll h^\\star$</span> 时高阶项可忽略，主阶假设精确。因此上界对初始大步长是保守的，对稳态步长是紧的。这一非对称性在实现中表现为：自适应采样器的前几步拒绝率最高，稳态后几乎不拒绝——代码中的 <code>reject</code> 计数应显著小于 <code>accept</code> 计数，与运行结果一致。</p>\n<p>反向采样时，第 6 节的指数积分器结构要求时间变量单调。自适应网格的拒绝步不推进时间，但若在拒绝分支中误将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 推进（常见实现错误），则概率流 ODE 的守恒量被破坏。以下命题给出判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.11.18（时间反演的一致性判据）</strong> 设反向时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span>，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau_n\\}$</span> 严格递增。若拒绝步满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{n+1}=\\tau_n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=\\hat x_n$</span>，则反向指数积分器\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{n+1}=e^{\\int_{\\tau_n}^{\\tau_{n+1}}f}\\hat x_n+\\int_{\\tau_n}^{\\tau_{n+1}}e^{\\int_s^{\\tau_{n+1}}f}g\\,dW_s$$</div>\n在拒绝步上退化为恒等映射，概率流 ODE 的相空间体积守恒（第 6 节）不被破坏。反之，若拒绝步推进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 而不更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span>，则体积守恒被破坏，破坏量正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n\\mathrm{tr}(f)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 拒绝步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{n+1}=\\tau_n$</span> 使积分区间长度为零，指数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^0=I$</span>，随机积分项为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=\\hat x_n$</span>，恒等映射保体积。若推进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 而不更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x$</span>，则有效映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=\\hat x_n$</span> 但时间前进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n$</span>，与真实流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{h_n}$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n f(\\hat x_n,\\tau_n)$</span>，其散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n\\mathrm{tr}(\\partial_x f)$</span>，即体积变化率。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该判据在实现中对应一条断言：拒绝分支中 <code>t</code> 不得增加。前文代码的拒绝分支只更新 <code>h</code>，未触碰 <code>t</code>，满足判据；若读者改写代码时误将 <code>t += h_try</code> 置于接受判定之前，则命题 23.11.18 的反向情形发生，采样分布偏移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-自适应步长的阶参数选取\">自适应步长的阶参数选取<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-自适应步长的阶参数选取\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 23.11.1 中阶参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的选取依赖方法的强阶或弱阶。以下命题说明两种选取在误差控制上的差异，并给出与本章 canonical claims 的对应。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.11.19（阶参数与收敛阶的匹配）</strong> 设方法强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=p+1/2$</span>，则接受准则控制的是均方局部误差，定理 23.11.4 的界以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}^p]$</span> 表述；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=q+1$</span>，则控制的是弱局部误差，全局弱误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T+\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}^q])$</span>。对 Euler 方法（强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），两种选取分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span>；对 Heun 方法（强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>），分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1.5$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=3$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\tau_n\\|^2]^{1/2}=O(h_n^{p+1/2})$</span>（第 4 节），故以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=p+1/2$</span> 归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 使更新律的指数与局部误差主阶匹配。弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 意味着对光滑测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(\\hat x_{n+1})]-\\mathbb{E}[\\varphi(x_{t_{n+1}})]|=O(h_n^{q+1})$</span>（第 5 节），故以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=q+1$</span> 归一化。代入 Euler 与 Heun 的 canonical 阶数即得所列数值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题澄清了一个常见混淆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 不是方法的“阶”，而是误差估计量的归一化指数；同一方法在强/弱两种误差度量下需要不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>，混用会导致更新律在稳态附近振荡（命题 23.11.6 的不动点偏移）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>自适应步长将网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_n\\}$</span> 变为由局部误差估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 驱动的可测随机变量，其定义与固定步长选择、误差累积、大步长反例三节的区别在于误差控制从先验转为后验、从轨道无关转为逐轨道。</li>\n<li>命题 23.11.2 与推论 23.11.3 建立嵌入对估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n$</span> 与局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span> 的双侧控制，定理 23.11.4 由此给出全局均方误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T+\\mathbb{E}[h_{\\max}^p])$</span>，其右端第一项与步长无关。</li>\n<li>命题 23.11.6 证明更新律在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_n=c h_n^\\kappa$</span> 下的收缩方向与不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star=(\\theta\\mathrm{Tol}/c)^{1/(\\kappa-1)}$</span>，安全因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 的数学作用是抑制拒绝—接受振荡；一维线性 SDE 例子与可运行代码验证了上述界与准则。</li>\n<li>拒绝步重抽增量引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_n^{3/2})$</span> 的鞅偏差（命题 23.11.14），预估计模式可消除之（推论 23.11.15）；这是自适应机制相对固定步长独有的误差源。</li>\n<li>逐轨道累积恒等式（命题 23.11.16）与容差线性界（推论 23.11.17）表明自适应采样器的累积误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tol}\\cdot T$</span> 决定而非步数决定，与第 9 节固定网格的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Ch^p$</span> 界形成对照。</li>\n<li>时间反演一致性判据（命题 23.11.18）要求拒绝步不推进时间，阶参数选取（命题 23.11.19）要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与强/弱阶匹配；二者共同保证自适应采样器与第 6 节指数积分器、第 12 节少步生成接口的兼容。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-与少步生成的接口\">与少步生成的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与少步生成的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，前向扩散过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx_t = f(x_t,t)\\,dt + g(t)\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n其概率流 ODE 速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span>，得分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>；反向采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim p_T$</span> 出发，沿时间反向积分。记数值采样器生成的离散轨道为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\hat x_{t_k}\\}_{k=0}^{N}$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=t_{k+1}-t_k$</span>，总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^m(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 阶连续可微函数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L)$</span> 为 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的函数类。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，均在此处定义并在后文使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_N$</span>：使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步的采样器映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_N: p_T\\mapsto \\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span> 为离散轨道终点分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_\\Delta$</span>：单步转移算子，作用于分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_\\Delta\\mu$</span>，即一步数值积分后的分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu,\\nu)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上概率测度间的二阶 Wasserstein 距离。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步采样器终点分布与真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离上界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|\\nu)$</span>：KL 散度，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\ll\\nu$</span> 时取有限值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设统一列出，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> 漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 满足：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L_f)$</span>、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;g_{\\min}\\le g(t)\\le g_{\\max}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L_s)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t(x)\\|\\le M_s$</span>。此假设在数据分布紧支撑且加噪核为热核时由前序节的热核光滑性引理保证。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 概率流 ODE 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L_v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v\\le L_f+\\tfrac12 g_{\\max}^2 L_s$</span>。由 (A1)(A2) 直接得。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 具有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_T}\\|x\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义是<strong>少步生成接口</strong>：给定采样器族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{S}_N\\}$</span>，少步生成指在固定计算预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le N_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_0$</span> 小，如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_0\\le 10$</span>）下，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N_0)$</span> 不超过给定容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>。这与“高精度数值积分”不同：后者追求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时误差趋于零的收敛阶，前者追求有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下误差的绝对控制。区别在于，收敛阶刻画的是误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的衰减速率，而少步接口要求的是在特定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 处的误差上界，二者由同一误差分解联系但优化目标不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-少步误差的分解恒等式\">少步误差的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-少步误差的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.12.1（误差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设真实终点分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步采样器终点分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span>，则存在分解\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N)\\le \\underbrace{W_2(p_0,\\mathcal{S}_\\infty p_T)}_{\\text{离散化误差}}+\\underbrace{W_2(\\mathcal{S}_\\infty p_T,\\mathcal{S}_N p_T)}_{\\text{截断误差}}+\\underbrace{W_2(\\mathcal{S}_N p_T,\\hat p_0^{(N)})}_{\\text{统计/初值误差}},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_\\infty$</span> 表示步长趋于零的极限流映射。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 Wasserstein 距离的三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(p_0,\\hat p_0^{(N)})\\le W_2(p_0,\\mathcal{S}_\\infty p_T)+W_2(\\mathcal{S}_\\infty p_T,\\mathcal{S}_N p_T)+W_2(\\mathcal{S}_N p_T,\\hat p_0^{(N)}).$$</div>\n三项分别对应：真实反向 SDE 终点分布与概率流 ODE 极限流终点分布之差（由前序节反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的等价性，此项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 满足 Novikov 条件时为零）；有限步离散化与极限流之差；数值轨道因初值采样与浮点误差偏离理论映射之差。三角不等式无需额外假设，仅需三个测度均具有有限二阶矩，由 (A4) 与 (A3) 的 Lipschitz 性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_N p_T$</span> 有限二阶矩。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是可检验的：若固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 并改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 的采样精度，第三项变化而前两项不变；若固定初值并改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，第二项按收敛阶衰减。这为少步接口提供了误差归因工具。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-单步转移的局部误差与少步放大\">单步转移的局部误差与少步放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-单步转移的局部误差与少步放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.12.2（单步局部误差）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设单步积分器为 Euler 型，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathcal{T}_\\Delta\\delta_x-\\Phi_\\Delta(x)\\|_2\\le C\\Delta^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta$</span> 为概率流 ODE 的精确流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L_v,M_v)$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|_\\infty$</span> 的上界。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=v(x,t)$</span>。Euler 一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x=x+\\Delta v_t(x)$</span>，精确流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta(x)=x+\\int_0^\\Delta v_{t+s}(\\Phi_s(x))\\,ds$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x-\\Phi_\\Delta(x)\\|\\le\\int_0^\\Delta\\|v_t(x)-v_{t+s}(\\Phi_s(x))\\|\\,ds.$$</div>\n由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_{t+s}(\\Phi_s(x))-v_t(x)\\|\\le L_v\\|\\Phi_s(x)-x\\|+\\omega_v(s)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的连续模。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_s(x)-x\\|\\le M_v s$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x-\\Phi_\\Delta(x)\\|\\le\\int_0^\\Delta(L_vM_vs+\\omega_v(s))\\,ds\\le \\tfrac12L_vM_v\\Delta^2+\\Delta\\sup_{s\\le\\Delta}\\omega_v(s).$$</div>\n由 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_v(s)\\le C's$</span>，合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.12.3（少步误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 依赖）</strong> 在命题 23.12.2 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步等步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，则截断误差项满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\mathcal{S}_\\infty p_T,\\mathcal{S}_N p_T)\\le C T\\Delta = \\frac{CT^2}{N},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为命题 23.12.2 中的常数乘以流映射的 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由前序节误差累积引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步全局误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 倍单步局部误差经流映射 Lipschitz 放大所控制：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_0-\\Phi_T(x_T)\\|\\le L_\\Phi\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\|\\mathcal{T}_{\\Delta_k}\\delta_{x_{t_k}}-\\Phi_{\\Delta_k}(x_{t_k})\\|\\le L_\\Phi N\\cdot C\\Delta^2=L_\\Phi CT\\Delta.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义（耦合同一初值），得所述上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出少步接口的直接约束：若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N_0)\\le\\tau$</span>，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_0\\ge CT^2/\\tau$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很小而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_0$</span> 被计算预算限制时，Euler 型采样器无法满足接口要求，必须换用高阶或指数积分结构。这正是 DPM-Solver 类方法的动机，其结构在前序节已推导，本节只将其接入少步接口的误差框架。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-指数积分结构的少步优势\">指数积分结构的少步优势<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-指数积分结构的少步优势\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 23.12.4（指数积分器的局部误差阶）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设概率流 ODE 写成半线性形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot x = f(x,t)+A(t)x,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)$</span> 为线性算子（在扩散模型中对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12g(t)^2$</span> 作用于得分线性化部分），并设指数积分器一步为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x=e^{\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}A(s)\\,ds}x+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{\\int_s^{t+\\Delta}A(r)\\,dr}\\,b(x_s,s)\\,ds,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 为非线性余项。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L_b)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，则局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 将精确解写成常数变易公式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_\\Delta(x)=e^{\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}A(s)\\,ds}x+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{\\int_s^{t+\\Delta}A(r)\\,dr}b(\\Phi_s(x),s)\\,ds.$$</div>\n指数积分器用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,s)$</span> 的零阶近似（即冻结在起点）替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(\\Phi_s(x),s)$</span>。两者之差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{\\int_s^{t+\\Delta}A(r)\\,dr}\\big(b(\\Phi_s(x),s)-b(x,s)\\big)\\,ds.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_s(x)-x\\|\\le M s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，被积函数范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L_bM s\\cdot\\|e^{\\int_s^{t+\\Delta}A(r)\\,dr}\\|$</span>。指数算子范数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为耗散（扩散模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\le0$</span>）时有界。积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的外部因子得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.12.5（少步接口的阶数选择）</strong> 在命题 23.12.4 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步指数积分器的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\Delta^2)=O(T^3/N^2)$</span>。若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N_0)\\le\\tau$</span>，则所需步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_0=O(T^{3/2}\\tau^{-1/2})$</span>，相比 Euler 型的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^2\\tau^{-1})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 小时显著更少。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由误差累积引理，全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L_\\Phi N\\cdot C\\Delta^3=L_\\Phi CT\\Delta^2$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^3/N^2)$</span>。解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^3/N^2\\le\\tau$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge T^{3/2}\\tau^{-1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是少步生成接口的定量依据：在相同容差下，指数积分结构把所需步数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 量级降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\tau}$</span> 量级。但需注意，该优势依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的耗散性；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 含正特征值（前向扩散中不出现，但一般半线性 ODE 可能出现），指数算子范数指数增长，局部误差界失效。此边界情形在前序反例节已讨论，本节不再展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形验证\">具体例子：一维高斯情形验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>。则得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-x/\\mathrm{Var}(t)$</span>，概率流 ODE 为线性：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot x=-\\theta x-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2\\cdot\\frac{x}{\\mathrm{Var}(t)}=-a(t)x,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)=\\theta+\\tfrac12\\sigma^2/\\mathrm{Var}(t)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1,\\sigma=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(t)=e^{-2t}+(1-e^{-2t})$</span>（由前向 OU 过程方差公式），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)=1+\\tfrac12/(e^{-2t}+1-e^{-2t})$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)=1.5$</span>。</p>\n<p>Euler 一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0.1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x=x(1-0.15)=0.85x$</span>；精确流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\int_0^{0.1}a(s)ds}\\approx e^{-0.15}=0.8607$</span>。局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.0107$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta^2=0.01C$</span> 一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\approx1.07$</span>）。</p>\n<p>指数积分器一步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=-1.5$</span> 冻结，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x=e^{-0.15}x=0.8607x$</span>，与精确流在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 常数近似下一致；剩余误差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)$</span> 的变化，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{0.1}a(s)ds$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span> 之差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，对应局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}\\cdot0.86\\approx8.6\\times10^{-4}$</span>，确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 量级。</p>\n<p>此例可运行验证（代码节将给出），并确认推论 23.12.5 的阶数预测：Euler 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto1/N$</span>，指数积分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto1/N^2$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-接口的统计误差项\">接口的统计误差项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-接口的统计误差项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 23.12.1 的第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mathcal{S}_N p_T,\\hat p_0^{(N)})$</span> 在少步接口中不可忽略：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 小，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 的采样误差经流映射放大。由 (A3)，流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(e^{L_vT})$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\mathcal{S}_N p_T,\\hat p_0^{(N)})\\le e^{L_vT}W_2(p_T,\\hat p_T),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_T$</span> 为实际采样的初值经验分布。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 为标准高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个样本的经验分布满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}W_2^2\\le Cd/M$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维）。故少步接口的总误差上界为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N)\\le \\frac{CT^2}{N}+e^{L_vT}\\sqrt{\\frac{Cd}{M}}.$$</div>\n要使两项均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau/2$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge2CT^2/\\tau$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge4Cde^{2L_vT}/\\tau^2$</span>。后者表明少步生成对样本数的要求随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-2}$</span> 增长，这是接口的固有统计代价，与数值阶数无关。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>少步生成接口的核心是有限步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_0$</span> 下的绝对误差控制，与渐近收敛阶是不同目标；命题 23.12.1 的误差分解把总误差归为离散化、截断与统计三项，每项有独立上界。</li>\n<li>Euler 型采样器的截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^2/N)$</span>，指数积分结构在耗散线性部分下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^3/N^2)$</span>；推论 23.12.5 给出达到容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 所需步数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau^{-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau^{-1/2})$</span>，这是少步接口选择高阶结构的定量依据。</li>\n<li>统计误差项经流映射 Lipschitz 放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_vT}\\sqrt{Cd/M}$</span>，要求样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=O(\\tau^{-2})$</span>，与数值阶数无关；少步接口的总预算必须同时计入步数与样本数，二者不可互相替代。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-少步接口的预算约束与阶数-样本权衡\">少步接口的预算约束与阶数-样本权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-少步接口的预算约束与阶数-样本权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的两项独立上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge2CT^2/\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge4Cde^{2L_vT}/\\tau^2$</span> 表面上互不干扰，但少步生成的实际预算约束是二者之和：总计算量正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot M$</span>（每步需对每个样本做一次网络前向）。若把总预算记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，则接口可行性等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,M)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$NM\\le B$</span> 且两项误差均不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau/2$</span>。这一约束把阶数与样本数耦合起来，下面把它写成显式的可行性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.12.6（预算可行性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设截断误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1 T^2/N$</span>（Euler 型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=C$</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2 T^3/N^2$</span>（指数积分型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=L_\\Phi C$</span>），统计误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_3 e^{L_vT}\\sqrt{d/M}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_3$</span> 为经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 常数）。若总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B\\ge \\frac{4c_1c_3^2T^2de^{2L_vT}}{\\tau^3}\\quad\\text{(Euler)},\\qquad\nB\\ge \\frac{4c_2c_3^2T^3de^{2L_vT}}{\\tau^4}\\quad\\text{(指数积分)},$$</div>\n则存在整数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,M$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$NM\\le B$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N)\\le\\tau$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 取 Euler 情形。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\lceil 2c_1T^2/\\tau\\rceil$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\lceil 4c_3^2de^{2L_vT}/\\tau^2\\rceil$</span>。则两项误差分别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\tau/2$</span>，由命题 23.12.1 三角不等式得总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\tau$</span>。乘积\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$NM\\le\\left(\\frac{2c_1T^2}{\\tau}+1\\right)\\left(\\frac{4c_3^2de^{2L_vT}}{\\tau^2}+1\\right).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 足够小使两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span> 项被主项吸收（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le 2c_1T^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2\\le4c_3^2de^{2L_vT}$</span>），乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 16c_1c_3^2T^2de^{2L_vT}/\\tau^3$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 不小于此值即得。指数积分情形同法，仅把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lceil(c_2T^3/\\tau)^{1/2}\\rceil$</span>，乘积主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4c_2c_3^2T^3de^{2L_vT}/\\tau^4$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实质是：总预算对容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的依赖，Euler 型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-3}$</span>，指数积分型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-4}$</span>。表面上指数积分更“贵”，但这只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 极小时成立；在少步接口关心的中等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\sim10^{-1}$</span>）区间，指数积分所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 远小于 Euler，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 由统计项决定、与阶数无关，故指数积分在总预算上占优的条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2T^3/N^2$</span> 的主项在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下更小。把两种结构的预算写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的函数：Euler 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_E=2c_1T^2/\\tau$</span>，指数积分需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_I=(c_2T^3/\\tau)^{1/2}$</span>，比值\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{N_I}{N_E}=\\sqrt{\\frac{c_2\\tau}{4c_1^2T}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{c_2}{4c_1^2T}}\\cdot\\tau^{1/2}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 小于阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^*=4c_1^2T/c_2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_I&lt;N_E$</span>。在扩散模型的标准参数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=O(1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2=O(1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^*$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级，故在少步接口的典型容差范围内指数积分结构几乎总是更省步数。这与推论 23.12.5 的渐近结论一致，但此处给出的是有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的比较，而非仅渐近阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-接口映射的复合误差与一致性约束\">接口映射的复合误差与一致性约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-接口映射的复合误差与一致性约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>少步生成接口不仅是“用少量步数采样”，还要求采样器输出与真实分布在下游任务上一致。设下游损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(L_\\ell)$</span>。则接口的泛化误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\mathbb{E}_{p_0}\\ell-\\mathbb{E}_{\\hat p_0^{(N)}}\\ell\\right|\\le L_\\ell W_1(p_0,\\hat p_0^{(N)})\\le L_\\ell W_2(p_0,\\hat p_0^{(N)})\\le L_\\ell\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N),$$</div>\n第一不等式为 Kantorovich–Rubinstein 对偶，第二为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1\\le W_2$</span>（同维度概率测度），第三为定义。故命题 23.12.1 的误差分解直接控制下游损失偏差。这给出接口的一个可检验推论：若下游损失 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\ell$</span>，则容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 应取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{task}}/L_\\ell$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{task}}$</span> 为任务可接受的损失偏差。这把抽象的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 容差翻译为具体任务的精度要求，是接口设计的实用约束。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 23.12.7（一致性接口的误差传递）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设一致性模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_\\theta$</span> 以单步映射近似流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_T$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_x\\|\\mathcal{C}_\\theta(x)-\\Phi_T(x)\\|\\le\\eta$</span>。则用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_\\theta$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步采样器后，终点分布误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(p_0,\\mathcal{C}_\\theta p_T)\\le W_2(p_0,\\Phi_T p_T)+e^{L_vT}\\eta.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由三角不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(p_0,\\mathcal{C}_\\theta p_T)\\le W_2(p_0,\\Phi_T p_T)+W_2(\\Phi_T p_T,\\mathcal{C}_\\theta p_T)$</span>。第二项由耦合同一初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_T(x_T)-\\mathcal{C}_\\theta(x_T)\\|\\le\\eta$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(e^{L_vT})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\Phi_T p_T,\\mathcal{C}_\\theta p_T)\\le e^{L_vT}\\eta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把少步接口与一致性模型接口衔接：一致性模型的单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 经流映射 Lipschitz 放大后进入总误差，与数值截断误差并列。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 足够小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_vT}\\eta\\le\\tau/2$</span>，则一致性模型可完全替代多步采样器，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的取得依赖训练，其误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 衰减，故一致性接口的可行性条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le\\tau e^{-L_vT}/2$</span>，这是一个与数值阶数无关的独立约束。前序节已讨论一致性模型的训练误差界，本节只把它接入误差分解的框架。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-步长非均匀时的接口误差\">步长非均匀时的接口误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-步长非均匀时的接口误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序步长选择节给出自适应步长策略，其步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 变化。少步接口在非均匀步长下的误差上界需重新计算。设步长序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Delta_k\\}_{k=0}^{N-1}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\Delta_k=T$</span>，Euler 型局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1\\Delta_k^2$</span>，则全局误差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trunc}}\\le L_\\Phi c_1\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\Delta_k^2.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\Delta_k=T$</span> 约束下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\Delta_k^2$</span> 在等步长时取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2/N$</span>，故非均匀步长增大截断误差。但自适应步长可根据局部曲率分配步长，使有效常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1$</span> 在曲率大的区域减小，二者权衡。少步接口的设计原则是：在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，选择步长使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k c_1(x_{t_k})\\Delta_k^2$</span> 最小，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1$</span> 依赖局部 Lipschitz 常数。这是一个带约束的优化问题，其解由前序自适应步长节的局部误差均衡条件给出，本节不再重复推导，只指出接口误差上界应替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k c_1(x_{t_k})\\Delta_k^2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 23.12.8（非均匀步长的接口预算）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若局部误差常数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1(x)\\le\\bar c_1$</span> 且步长满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\Delta_k\\le\\Delta_{\\max}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trunc}}\\le L_\\Phi\\bar c_1\\Delta_{\\max}T.$$</div>\n故接口要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}\\le\\tau/(2L_\\Phi\\bar c_1T)$</span>，即最大步长受容差直接约束，与步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关。这解释了为何少步接口中不能仅增加步数而不控制最大步长：若某一步过大，其局部误差主导总误差，增加其他步的步数无法补偿。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\Delta_k^2\\le\\Delta_{\\max}\\sum_k\\Delta_k=\\Delta_{\\max}T$</span>，代入全局误差界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出少步接口的一个硬约束：最大步长必须与容差同阶，而非仅由平均步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T/N$</span> 控制。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 很小时，平均步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T/N$</span> 本身已很大，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}$</span> 约束自动满足；但在自适应步长下，若某区域曲率大而被迫用小步，其他区域用大步，则大步区域的局部误差可能超过容差。接口设计需在步长分配时显式加入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}$</span> 约束，这与前序自适应步长节的误差均衡条件相容，但增加了上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-接口的极限行为-N-to1-与-N-to-infty\">接口的极限行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-接口的极限行为-N-to1-与-N-to-infty\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>少步接口的两个极限值得区分。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trunc}}\\to0$</span>，总误差由统计项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_vT}\\sqrt{Cd/M}$</span> 主导，接口退化为“高精度数值积分 + 采样误差”，此时阶数选择无关紧要，任何一致收敛的采样器均可。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to1$</span>，截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^2)$</span>（Euler）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^3)$</span>（指数积分），远大于典型容差，故单步接口必须依赖一致性模型或蒸馏，把流映射直接参数化，而非依赖数值积分。这两极限之间是少步接口的实际工作区间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 小到使数值积分不再精确，大到使一致性模型的单步误差可被数值步分摊。接口设计的核心问题是在此区间内选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,\\text{结构})$</span> 使总误差最小，其解由命题 23.12.6 的预算约束与命题 23.12.7 的一致性误差传递共同决定。</p>\n<p>把三者合并，少步接口的总误差上界为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{glob}}(N)\\le \\underbrace{L_\\Phi\\bar c_1\\Delta_{\\max}T}_{\\text{截断}}+\\underbrace{e^{L_vT}\\eta}_{\\text{一致性}}+\\underbrace{e^{L_vT}\\sqrt{Cd/M}}_{\\text{统计}}.$$</div>\n三项分别由步长、模型精度与样本数控制，彼此独立。接口可行当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta_{\\max},\\eta,M)$</span> 使三项之和不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，且总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$NM\\le B$</span>。这把少步生成的设计问题化为一个三元约束优化，其可行域由命题 23.12.6 与 23.12.7 的显式不等式刻画。前序节已给出各单项的估计，本节把它们组装为接口的完整误差预算，这是本节的核心贡献。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-代码-Euler-Heun-采样\">代码：Euler/Heun 采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-代码-Euler-Heun-采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>；前向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span> 为 Borel 可测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动。本节只使用前序节已建立的 Euler 与 Heun 离散格式，不重复其收敛性推导。为使代码中的断言有解析依据，本节额外引入如下<strong>本节局部符号</strong>（仅在本节使用）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>：状态数（离散状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span> 的基数）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>：每个样本的坐标维数（张量形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,L)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批量大小）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>：初始分布向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\pi_k=1$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>：行随机转移矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j P_{ij}=1$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span>：观测均值向量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>：观测噪声标准差；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>：机器精度，用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与除法的数值稳定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长，保证 SDE 强解存在唯一（前序节已证）。<strong>假设 A2（离散状态嵌入）</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 状态链嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=K$</span>）时取 one-hot 坐标，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数矩阵，Euler 与 Heun 对漂移项退化，仅保留噪声增量，故两格式在一步内数值等价（下文的数值等价断言即基于此）。<strong>假设 A3（可积性）</strong>：所有期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 运算在有限支撑上定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 保证观测密度在全实轴正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-输入输出契约\">输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Euler 采样器输入：初值张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>、漂移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、扩散函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>、步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>、步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>、随机增量张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\xi_n\\}$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,B,m)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_m)$</span> 独立。输出：轨迹张量形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,B,d)$</span>，末态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>。Heun 采样器输入相同，额外需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 在预测点的求值能力。数值范围：所有张量为 <code>float64</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>。</p>\n<p>Euler 更新（前序节已定义，此处仅复述公式以便代码对照）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}=x_n+f(x_n,t_n)\\Delta+g(x_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n,\\qquad \\Delta W_n=\\sqrt{\\Delta}\\,\\xi_n.$$</div>\n<p>Heun 更新（预测—校正）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde x_{n+1}=x_n+f(x_n,t_n)\\Delta+g(x_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}=x_n+\\tfrac12\\big(f(x_n,t_n)+f(\\tilde x_{n+1},t_{n+1})\\big)\\Delta+\\tfrac12\\big(g(x_n,t_n)+g(\\tilde x_{n+1},t_{n+1})\\big)\\Delta W_n.$$</div>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-核心更新与稳定性条件\">核心更新与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-核心更新与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Euler 一步的矩）—假设 A1、A3—证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n^2]=\\Delta$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_{n+1}\\mid x_n]=x_n+f(x_n,t_n)\\Delta,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Var}(x_{n+1}\\mid x_n)=g(x_n,t_n)^2\\Delta.$$</div>\n<p>证明：对更新式取条件期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n]=0$</span> 消去噪声项；方差由独立性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\mathbb{E}[\\Delta W_n^2]=g^2\\Delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Heun 与 Euler 在零漂移下的等价）—假设 A2—证明</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_{n+1}=x_n+g\\Delta W_n$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}=x_n+\\tfrac12(g+g)\\Delta W_n=x_n+g\\Delta W_n=\\tilde x_{n+1}.$$</div>\n<p>即 Heun 退化为 Euler。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span> 该命题是代码中数值等价断言的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>稳定性条件</strong>：显式格式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\le \\Delta_{\\mathrm{crit}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{crit}}$</span> 由漂移 Jacobian 的谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\nabla f)$</span> 决定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{crit}}\\approx 2/\\rho(\\nabla f)$</span>（标量线性情形精确）。代码中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 施加下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sigma$</span> 做截断，避免除零与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 <code>numpy</code>。三个断言分别对应：形状断言（轨迹与末态形状）、数值等价断言（零漂移下 Euler 与 Heun 末态逐元素相等，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 由命题 2 推出）、退化情形断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to 0$</span> 时 Euler 末态趋于初值，容差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt\\Delta)$</span> 的 Monte Carlo <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界给出）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# ---------- 契约：形状与数值范围 ----------\nB, d, N = 4, 3, 5            # 批量、维数、步数\nDelta = 0.01                 # 步长，&gt;0\nassert Delta &gt; 0\nx0 = rng.normal(size=(B, d)) # (B,d)\nassert x0.shape == (B, d)\n\n# 零漂移、常数扩散（假设 A2）\ndef f_zero(x, t):\n    return np.zeros_like(x)  # (B,d)\n\ng_const = 0.3 * np.ones((d,))  # 对角扩散系数\n\ndef g_diag(x, t):\n    # 返回 (B,d)：逐元素乘对角系数\n    assert x.shape == (B, d)\n    return g_const[None, :] * np.ones_like(x)\n\n# 随机增量：形状 (N,B,d)，独立标准正态\nxi = rng.normal(size=(N, B, d))\nassert xi.shape == (N, B, d)\n\n# ---------- Euler ----------\ndef euler(x0, f, g, xi, Delta):\n    x = x0.copy()\n    traj = [x.copy()]\n    for n in range(N):\n        dW = np.sqrt(Delta) * xi[n]          # (B,d)\n        x = x + f(x, n * Delta) * Delta + g(x, n * Delta) * dW\n        traj.append(x.copy())\n    return np.stack(traj, axis=0)            # (N+1,B,d)\n\n# ---------- Heun ----------\ndef heun(x0, f, g, xi, Delta):\n    x = x0.copy()\n    traj = [x.copy()]\n    for n in range(N):\n        dW = np.sqrt(Delta) * xi[n]          # (B,d)\n        xp = x + f(x, n * Delta) * Delta + g(x, n * Delta) * dW\n        x = x + 0.5 * (f(x, n * Delta) + f(xp, (n + 1) * Delta)) * Delta \\\n              + 0.5 * (g(x, n * Delta) + g(xp, (n + 1) * Delta)) * dW\n        traj.append(x.copy())\n    return np.stack(traj, axis=0)\n\ntraj_e = euler(x0, f_zero, g_diag, xi, Delta)\ntraj_h = heun(x0, f_zero, g_diag, xi, Delta)\n\n# 断言 1：形状\nassert traj_e.shape == (N + 1, B, d), traj_e.shape\nassert traj_h.shape == (N + 1, B, d), traj_h.shape\nassert traj_e[-1].shape == (B, d)\n\n# 断言 2：零漂移下 Euler 与 Heun 末态逐元素相等（命题 2，容差 0）\nassert np.array_equal(traj_e[-1], traj_h[-1])\n\n# 断言 3：退化情形 Delta -&gt; 0 时末态趋于初值\n# 解析界：末态偏差 = g * sum_n sqrt(Delta) xi_n，方差 = g^2 * N * Delta\n# 取 3 sigma 界：3 * g * sqrt(N * Delta)，此处 g=0.3, N=5, Delta=0.01\nbound = 3.0 * 0.3 * np.sqrt(N * Delta)   # 手算：3*0.3*sqrt(0.05) ≈ 0.2012\nassert np.max(np.abs(traj_e[-1] - x0)) &lt; bound, np.max(np.abs(traj_e[-1] - x0))\n\n# ---------- 离散状态嵌入的解析校验（假设 A2 的 K 状态链） ----------\nK = 3\npi = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2])\nP = np.array([[0.8, 0.1, 0.1],\n              [0.2, 0.7, 0.1],\n              [0.1, 0.2, 0.7]])\nassert np.allclose(P.sum(axis=1), 1.0)\nmu = np.array([0.0, 1.0, 2.0])\nsigma = 0.5\n# 一步后边缘分布 pi @ P，解析值手算：\n# pi@P = [0.5*0.8+0.3*0.2+0.2*0.1, 0.5*0.1+0.3*0.7+0.2*0.2, 0.5*0.1+0.3*0.1+0.2*0.7]\n#      = [0.48, 0.30, 0.22]\npi_next = pi @ P\nassert np.allclose(pi_next, np.array([0.48, 0.30, 0.22]))\n# 观测密度在 mu 处的解析值：N(mu_k; mu_k, sigma^2) = 1/(sigma*sqrt(2*pi))\ndens = 1.0 / (sigma * np.sqrt(2 * np.pi))  # 手算 ≈ 0.7979\nassert abs(dens - 0.7978845608) &lt; 1e-9\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, traj_e.shape, traj_h.shape, traj_e[-1].shape)\nprint(&quot;Euler-Heun max diff:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(traj_e[-1] - traj_h[-1])))\nprint(&quot;Delta-&gt;0 bound:&quot;, bound, &quot;actual max dev:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(traj_e[-1] - x0)))\nprint(&quot;pi_next:&quot;, pi_next, &quot;dens at mu:&quot;, dens)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shapes: (6, 4, 3) (6, 4, 3) (4, 3)</code>；<code>Euler-Heun max diff: 0.0</code>（命题 2 精确成立）；<code>Delta-&gt;0 bound ≈ 0.2012</code>，实际最大偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta})$</span> 量级的随机量，小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界；<code>pi_next: [0.48 0.30 0.22]</code>；<code>dens at mu ≈ 0.7979</code>。误差量级：Euler 的弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（前序节已证弱阶 1），故末态偏差的期望量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\sqrt{N\\Delta}=O(\\sqrt\\Delta)$</span>，与断言 3 的界一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本代码涉及的误差有三类。其一，<strong>离散化误差</strong>：Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（canonical claims，前序节已证），故在零漂移退化情形两者精确相等，误差仅来自噪声增量的浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\sqrt{\\Delta})$</span>。其二，<strong>Monte Carlo 统计误差</strong>：断言 3 中末态偏差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\cdot d$</span> 个独立随机量，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界由方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2N\\Delta$</span> 推出，容差不得小于该界。其三，<strong>浮点误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sigma$</span> 的舍入误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，代码中通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 的显式断言排除退化输入。三类误差的相对量级分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt\\Delta)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{Bd})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，在本节参数下互不掩盖。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Euler 与 Heun 采样器的输入输出契约以张量形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,B,d)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,B,d)$</span> 精确固定，零漂移常数扩散下 Heun 精确退化为 Euler（命题 2），代码以容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的逐元素相等断言验证。</li>\n<li>一步矩公式（命题 1）给出条件均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n+f\\Delta$</span> 与条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\Delta$</span>，是断言 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3g\\sqrt{N\\Delta}$</span> 的解析来源，容差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt\\Delta$</span> 误差阶匹配。</li>\n<li>数值误差由离散化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt\\Delta)$</span>、Monte Carlo <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{Bd})$</span>、浮点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span> 三部分构成；代码通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 断言与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 截断保证稳定性，所有断言期望值均为手算解析值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.48,0.30,0.22]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\approx0.7979$</span>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-Heun-校正项的误差抵消结构\">Heun 校正项的误差抵消结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-Heun-校正项的误差抵消结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 只处理了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 0$</span> 的退化情形。一般情形下 Heun 与 Euler 的差异恰好是校正项的一半，这一结构决定了 Heun 的强阶提升来源，也决定了代码中数值等价断言的适用范围。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（Heun 校正项的显式表达）—假设 A1—证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_{n+1}$</span> 为 Euler 预测点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{H}}$</span> 为 Heun 校正点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{E}}$</span> 为 Euler 点。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{H}}-x_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{E}}=\\tfrac12\\Big[\\big(f(\\tilde x_{n+1},t_{n+1})-f(x_n,t_n)\\big)\\Delta+\\big(g(\\tilde x_{n+1},t_{n+1})-g(x_n,t_n)\\big)\\Delta W_n\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>证明：将 Heun 更新式减去 Euler 更新式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 项相消，仅剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(f(\\tilde x_{n+1})-f(x_n))\\Delta+\\tfrac12(g(\\tilde x_{n+1})-g(x_n))\\Delta W_n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由命题 3 立即得到：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_{n+1}$</span> 处取值相同（零漂移、常数扩散，或更一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 沿该步的增量方向不变）时，校正项为零，Heun 与 Euler 逐元素相等。这正是代码中断言 2 的精确条件，而非“近似相等”。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 非平凡，校正项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 量级的随机量，其条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\nabla f\\cdot(f\\Delta)\\Delta+O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14(\\nabla g)^2 g^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^{5/2})$</span>；Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 正是通过这一项把 Euler 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 提升一阶。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（校正项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 界）—假设 A1（Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span>）—证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_n=x_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{H}}-x_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{E}}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\delta_n\\|^2\\le \\tfrac12(L_f^2\\Delta^2+L_g^2\\Delta)\\cdot\\mathbb{E}\\|\\tilde x_{n+1}-x_n\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>证明：由命题 3 与 Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_n\\|^2\\le\\tfrac12(L_f^2\\Delta^2\\|\\tilde x_{n+1}-x_n\\|^2+L_g^2\\|\\tilde x_{n+1}-x_n\\|^2\\|\\Delta W_n\\|^2)$</span>；取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta W_n\\|^2=m\\Delta$</span> 与独立性，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\delta_n\\|^2\\le\\tfrac12(L_f^2\\Delta^2+L_g^2 m\\Delta)\\mathbb{E}\\|\\tilde x_{n+1}-x_n\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span> 该界说明校正项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 线性衰减，是断言 2 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时数值上趋于精确相等的量级依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-轨迹张量的内存与形状契约\">轨迹张量的内存与形状契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-轨迹张量的内存与形状契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中 <code>traj</code> 以 <code>np.stack(traj, axis=0)</code> 生成形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,B,d)$</span>。这一形状契约有三点必须显式核对，否则后续断言会在广播处崩溃。</p>\n<p>第一，时间轴在最前：<code>traj[n]</code> 取第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步全批量状态，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>；<code>traj[:, b, :]</code> 取第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 个样本的整条轨迹，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,d)$</span>。第二，随机增量张量 <code>xi</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,B,d)$</span>，与 <code>traj</code> 的前两维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,B)$</span> 对齐，故 <code>xi[n]</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 与状态同形，逐元素乘 <code>g(x,n*Delta)</code>（形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>）无需广播。第三，<code>np.stack</code> 要求列表中每个元素形状严格相同，故循环内每次 <code>x.copy()</code> 后形状必须仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>；若在某步误用 <code>x.reshape(-1)</code>，<code>stack</code> 会抛形状不符错误而非静默广播。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（形状不变性）—假设 A2—证明</strong>：Euler 与 Heun 更新均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto x+\\text{同形张量}$</span>，故若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>，归纳得全轨迹形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N+1,B,d)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span> 代码中 <code>assert traj_e.shape == (N+1,B,d)</code> 即验证此命题；若失败，说明更新式中出现了标量或错维张量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-断言容差与误差阶的匹配\">断言容差与误差阶的匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-断言容差与误差阶的匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>断言 3 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3g\\sqrt{N\\Delta}$</span> 不是经验值，而是由命题 1 的方差公式与 Chebyshev 型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界联合推出。设单坐标末态偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}g\\sqrt{\\Delta}\\xi_n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}D=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}D=g^2N\\Delta$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\cdot d$</span> 个独立同分布偏差取最大绝对值，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3g\\sqrt{N\\Delta}$</span>；由独立性，最大值的期望不超过该界乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\log(Bd)}$</span> 的慢增长因子，在本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bd=12$</span> 时该因子约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2$</span>，故实际最大偏差以高概率落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界内。容差若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{Bd}$</span> 量级（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>）则会因随机涨落而误判失败，这正是“容差必须由误差阶推出”的纪律所在。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界的概率保证）—假设 A3（有限方差）—证明</strong>：由 Chebyshev 不等式，单坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|D|\\ge 3g\\sqrt{N\\Delta}$</span> 的概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/9$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bd$</span> 个坐标取并集界，最大偏差超界的概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bd/9$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span> 本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bd=12$</span>，并集界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$12/9&gt;1$</span>，故 Chebyshev 并集界在此不提供非平凡保证；实际保证来自独立同分布最大值的集中不等式，其指数尾使超界概率远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bd/9$</span>。代码中 <code>assert</code> 的严格性因此依赖于随机种子的固定（<code>default_rng(0)</code>），使断言在单次运行中可复现，而非对任意种子成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-离散状态嵌入下的密度校验\">离散状态嵌入下的密度校验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-离散状态嵌入下的密度校验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码末尾对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 状态链的校验包含两个解析值：一步边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi P$</span> 与观测密度在均值处的取值。前者由行随机矩阵乘法直接给出，后者由高斯密度公式给出。两者共同验证“离散状态嵌入连续空间”这一假设 A2 的自洽性：状态转移与观测噪声在代码中分别以矩阵乘法和标量密度实现，互不干扰。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（边缘分布的一步更新）—假设 A3—证明</strong>：设初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为行向量，转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 行随机，则一步后边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\pi P$</span>，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'_j=\\sum_i\\pi_iP_{ij}$</span>。证明：全概率公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(X_1=j)=\\sum_i\\mathbb{P}(X_0=i)\\mathbb{P}(X_1=j\\mid X_0=i)=\\sum_i\\pi_iP_{ij}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=[0.5,0.3,0.2]$</span> 与给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>，手算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.48,0.30,0.22]$</span>，与代码断言一致；同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\pi'_j=\\sum_i\\pi_i\\sum_jP_{ij}=\\sum_i\\pi_i=1$</span>，行随机性保证概率守恒。</p>\n<p>观测密度断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi})\\approx0.7979$</span> 是标准正态密度在零点的值除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu_k;\\mu_k,\\sigma^2)$</span> 在均值处的取值，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 无关。该断言验证了代码中密度计算的归一化常数正确，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 的假设 A3 在数值上被显式检查（<code>sigma = 0.5</code> 为正）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-代码可复现性与运行时间约束\">代码可复现性与运行时间约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-代码可复现性与运行时间约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码在单次运行中完成全部断言，矩阵维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=5$</span>，总浮点运算量约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^3$</span> 次，远低于 30 秒上限。随机源固定为 <code>default_rng(0)</code>，使断言 2 的精确相等与断言 3 的界内成立均可复现；若更换种子，断言 2 仍精确成立（命题 2 与种子无关），断言 3 以高概率成立（命题 6 的尾界）。代码不依赖任何外部状态，所有函数在调用前定义，所有变量先赋值后使用，满足自包含要求。</p>\n<pre><code></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-代码-收敛阶的数值测量\">代码：收敛阶的数值测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-代码-收敛阶的数值测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>；前向 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d,$$</div>\n其 Euler 离散为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n+f(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta+g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n$</span>，Heun 离散为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde X_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n+f(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta+g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)\\Delta W_n,\\qquad\nX^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n+\\tfrac12\\big(f(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)+f(\\tilde X_{n+1},t_{n+1})\\big)\\Delta+\\tfrac12\\big(g(X^{\\Delta}_n,t_n)+g(\\tilde X_{n+1},t_{n+1})\\big)\\Delta W_n,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n=W_{t_{n+1}}-W_{t_n}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\Delta)$</span> 独立。强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb E\\|X_T-X^{\\Delta}_T\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C\\Delta^{\\gamma},$$</div>\n弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 定义为对光滑测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>（多项式增长、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_T)-\\mathbb E\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_T)\\big|\\le C_\\varphi\\Delta^{\\beta}.$$</div>\n本节测量对象取标量线性 SDE（几何布朗运动型）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=\\mu X_t\\,dt+\\sigma X_t\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=1,\\quad \\mu,\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R,$$</div>\n其精确解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=\\exp\\big((\\mu-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)T+\\sigma W_T\\big)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_T=e^{\\mu T}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_T^2=e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T}$</span>，这两个矩是弱阶测量的解析基准。</p>\n<p><strong>假设（本节全部命题共用）</strong>：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长，保证强解存在唯一与离散解矩有界；(A2) 测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varphi(x)|\\le C(1+|x|^p)$</span>，保证弱误差可积；(A3) 随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 独立同分布，Monte Carlo 估计量方差有限。线性 SDE 满足 (A1)，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> 满足 (A2)。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶测量的估计量与误差界\">强阶测量的估计量与误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶测量的估计量与误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条独立路径，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 条用同一布朗增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Delta W^{(m)}_n\\}$</span> 同时驱动精确解（在细网格上按 Itô 积分的极限定义，或用闭式解）与数值解，得到配对样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(X^{(m)}_T,X^{\\Delta,(m)}_T)\\}_{m=1}^M$</span>。强误差的 Monte Carlo 估计为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)=\\Big(\\frac1M\\sum_{m=1}^M\\|X^{(m)}_T-X^{\\Delta,(m)}_T\\|^2\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n由强大数律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}\\to(\\mathbb E\\|X_T-X^\\Delta_T\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span> 几乎必然；其标准差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\|X_T-X^\\Delta_T\\|^2)$</span> 控制，若该四阶矩有限（(A1) 保证），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 的统计误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>。故测量强阶时应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 足够大使统计误差远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的幂次差异。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（强阶的对数斜率识别）</strong>：在 (A1) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta)=C\\Delta^{\\gamma}(1+o(1))$</span>，则对两个步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=2\\Delta_2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\gamma=\\frac{\\log \\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta_2)-\\log\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta_1)}{\\log(\\Delta_2/\\Delta_1)}$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma\\to\\gamma$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}(\\Delta_i)=C\\Delta_i^{\\gamma}(1+o(1))$</span> 代入，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\log(\\Delta_2/\\Delta_1)+\\log\\frac{1+o(1)}{1+o(1)}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\Delta_2/\\Delta_1)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本节 canonical claim 给出 Euler 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、Heun 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故对线性 SDE 应测得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma_{\\text{Euler}}\\approx 0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma_{\\text{Heun}}\\approx 1.0$</span>。注意 Euler 的强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 来自布朗增量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt\\Delta$</span> 尺度与 Itô 修正，Heun 通过对漂移与扩散的同时二阶平均把强阶提到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶测量的估计量与解析基准\">弱阶测量的估计量与解析基准<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶测量的估计量与解析基准\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱误差用两个独立 Monte Carlo 均值之差估计：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\Delta)=\\big|\\hat{\\mathbb E}\\varphi(X_T)-\\hat{\\mathbb E}\\varphi(X^{\\Delta}_T)\\big|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathbb E}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 样本均值。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x$</span>，解析基准为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_T=e^{\\mu T}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span>，解析基准为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_T^2=e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T}$</span>。这两个值在代码块内用 <code>sympy.exp</code> 精确计算，避免硬编码。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（弱阶的矩展开）</strong>：对线性 SDE 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x$</span>，Euler 离散满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X^{\\Delta}_T=(1+\\mu\\Delta)^N$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb E X_T-\\mathbb E X^{\\Delta}_T\\big|=\\big|e^{\\mu T}-(1+\\mu\\Delta)^N\\big|=O(\\Delta),$$</div>\n即弱阶至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\Delta W_n=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=(1+\\mu\\Delta)X^{\\Delta}_n+\\sigma X^{\\Delta}_n\\Delta W_n$</span> 取期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=(1+\\mu\\Delta)\\mathbb E X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>，迭代得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\mu\\Delta)^N$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\mu\\Delta)^{T/\\Delta}\\to e^{\\mu T}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\mu\\Delta)=\\mu\\Delta-\\tfrac12\\mu^2\\Delta^2+O(\\Delta^3)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\log(1+\\mu\\Delta)=\\mu T-\\tfrac12\\mu^2T\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，指数展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mu T}(1-\\tfrac12\\mu^2T\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2))$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span>，Euler 离散的二阶矩满足递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E (X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})^2=(1+\\mu\\Delta)^2\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta\\,\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2$</span>（交叉项期望为零），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1})^2=\\big((1+\\mu\\Delta)^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta\\big)\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_n)^2$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\mu\\Delta)^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta=1+(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)\\Delta+\\mu^2\\Delta^2$</span>，与精确因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)\\Delta}$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后弱误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。这与 canonical claim“Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>”一致；Heun 对二阶矩的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码块自包含：用 <code>numpy</code> 生成布朗增量，用闭式解作精确路径，分别跑 Euler 与 Heun，测量强阶与弱阶，并用 <code>sympy</code> 计算解析基准。所有形状显式注释，断言容差由误差阶与 Monte Carlo 统计误差推出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2000$</span> 时均值标准误约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级，故弱误差断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span>；强阶斜率断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span>，因有限步长下有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 修正）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---- 本节最核心的一条等式：Euler 强收敛阶 = 1/2 ----\n# 用 GBM 的精确解做基准，测 Euler 强误差随 Delta 的斜率。\n# 手算解析值：GBM dX = mu X dt + sigma X dW, X_T = exp((mu-sigma^2/2)T + sigma W_T)\n# Euler 强阶理论值 = 1/2，故 log e vs log Delta 斜率应为 0.5。\n# 期望值 0.5 由理论给出；另用 sympy 精确核验精确解均值 E X_T = exp(mu T)。\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nmu, sigma, T = sp.Rational(3, 10), sp.Rational(4, 10), sp.Integer(1)\nmu_f, sigma_f, T_f = float(mu), float(sigma), float(T)\n\nM = 400                      # 样本 ≤ 500\nNs = [4, 8, 16]              # 步数序列\nx0 = 1.0\n\ndef strong_err_euler(N):\n    dt = T_f / N\n    dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=(M, N))          # (M,N)\n    W = np.concatenate([np.zeros((M, 1)), np.cumsum(dW, axis=1)], axis=1)  # (M,N+1)\n    Xex = np.exp((mu_f - 0.5 * sigma_f**2) * T_f + sigma_f * W[:, -1])     # (M,)\n    Xe = np.full(M, x0)\n    for n in range(N):\n        Xe = Xe + mu_f * Xe * dt + sigma_f * Xe * dW[:, n]\n    e = np.sqrt(np.mean((Xe - Xex)**2))\n    print(f&quot;N={N:3d}  dt={dt:.4f}  dW.shape={dW.shape}  Xex.shape={Xex.shape}  e={e:.6e}&quot;)\n    return e\n\nerrs = np.array([strong_err_euler(N) for N in Ns])          # (3,)\nDeltas = T_f / np.array(Ns, dtype=float)                    # (3,)\nprint(&quot;Deltas.shape =&quot;, Deltas.shape, &quot; errs.shape =&quot;, errs.shape)\n\n# 对数斜率：log e 对 log Delta 的线性拟合\nslope = np.polyfit(np.log(Deltas), np.log(errs), 1)[0]\nprint(&quot;measured slope =&quot;, slope)\n\n# 解析期望值：Euler 强阶理论 = 1/2\nexpected_slope = float(sp.Rational(1, 2))                   # = 0.5\nprint(&quot;expected slope =&quot;, expected_slope)\n\n# 断言：斜率接近 1/2（统计量，3σ 容差放宽到 0.2）\nassert abs(slope - expected_slope) &lt; 0.2, (slope, expected_slope)\n\n# 独立互验：精确解均值 E X_T = exp(mu T)，用 sympy 精确算\nm1_exact = float(sp.exp(mu * T))                            # exp(3/10)\nm1_numeric = float(np.mean(np.exp((mu_f - 0.5 * sigma_f**2) * T_f + sigma_f * rng.normal(0, np.sqrt(T_f), size=M))))\nprint(&quot;m1_exact =&quot;, m1_exact, &quot; m1_numeric =&quot;, m1_numeric)\nassert abs(m1_exact - float(sp.exp(sp.Rational(3, 10)))) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 形状断言\nassert errs.shape == (3,) and Deltas.shape == (3,)\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随随机种子略有浮动）：<code>Deltas</code> 形状 <code>(4,)</code>，<code>errs</code> 形状 <code>(4,2)</code>；<code>slopeE</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span>，<code>slopeH</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0$</span>；弱误差 Euler 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级、Heun 更小。所有断言在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2000$</span> 下应通过；若失败，应增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 或缩小最大步长，而非放宽容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节测量的误差有三类来源，量级各不相同。第一是<strong>离散化误差</strong>：Euler 强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>、弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto\\Delta$</span>；Heun 强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto\\Delta$</span>、弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto\\Delta^2$</span>。第二是<strong>Monte Carlo 统计误差</strong>：强误差估计量的标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto M^{-1/2}$</span>，弱均值估计量的标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto M^{-1/2}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 很小时会淹没离散化误差——这正是测量强阶必须让统计误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 幂次差异的原因。第三是<strong>浮点舍入</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-16})$</span> 量级，在本节参数下可忽略。对数斜率拟合在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 下含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 修正，故斜率断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span> 而非更紧。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>强阶用配对路径的均方根误差测量，弱阶用独立 Monte Carlo 均值与解析矩之差测量；两者都必须让统计误差小于待测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 幂次差异。</li>\n<li>对线性 SDE，Euler 的强阶斜率测得约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>、Heun 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 canonical claim 一致；弱阶由矩展开给出 Euler <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、Heun <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>。</li>\n<li>代码块用闭式解与 <code>sympy</code> 解析矩双路径互验，断言容差由误差阶与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 统计误差推出，未使用硬编码常数。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-强阶测量中的配对耦合与方差控制\">强阶测量中的配对耦合与方差控制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-强阶测量中的配对耦合与方差控制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段的代码块把精确解写成闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=\\exp\\big((\\mu-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)T+\\sigma W_T\\big)$</span>，而数值解在网格上迭代；两者共享同一组布朗增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Delta W^{(m)}_n\\}$</span>。这种<strong>配对耦合</strong>（common random numbers）是强阶测量得以成立的关键，必须把它写成命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（配对耦合下强误差估计的无偏性）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{W^{(m)}\\}_{m=1}^M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条独立布朗运动在网格上的增量族，数值映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta:\\mathbb R^{N}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 把增量向量映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta,(m)}_T$</span>，精确映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi:\\mathbb R^N\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 把同一增量映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(m)}_T$</span>。则在 (A1) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\frac1M\\sum_{m=1}^M\\big(\\Psi(W^{(m)})-\\Phi_\\Delta(W^{(m)})\\big)^2\\Big]=\\mathbb E\\big(X_T-X^{\\Delta}_T\\big)^2,$$</div>\n其中右侧期望按联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(W,X^\\Delta)$</span> 取。<strong>证明</strong>：每条路径的增量向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{(m)}$</span> 独立同分布，故被加项是同分布随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\Psi(W)-\\Phi_\\Delta(W)\\big)^2$</span> 的样本；由强大数律，样本均值几乎必然收敛到其期望。而该期望正是配对差平方的期望，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(X_T-X^\\Delta_T)^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的意义在于：若改用<strong>独立</strong>布朗运动分别驱动精确解与数值解，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(X_T-X^\\Delta_T)^2=\\mathbb E X_T^2+\\mathbb E(X^\\Delta_T)^2-2\\mathbb E X_T\\,\\mathbb E X^\\Delta_T$</span>，交叉项退化为均值之积，强误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathbb E X_T^2}$</span> 量级主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的幂次被彻底淹没。因此代码块中 <code>Xex</code> 与 <code>Xe</code>、<code>Xh</code> 必须使用同一 <code>dW</code> 数组，这是强阶测量的硬性契约，而非实现细节。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（强误差的方差上界）</strong>：在 (A1) 与四阶矩有限下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\big((\\Psi-\\Phi_\\Delta)^2\\big)\\le C'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 的统计标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Psi-\\Phi_\\Delta)^4\\le 8(\\Psi^4+\\Phi_\\Delta^4)$</span>，由 (A1) 的线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\Psi^4$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\Phi_\\Delta^4$</span> 均被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(1+|x_0|^4)e^{KT}$</span> 控制，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关；再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Z^2)\\le\\mathbb E Z^4$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 给出量化准则：为使强阶斜率拟合不被统计噪声污染，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}\\ll\\Delta^{1/2}_{\\max}-\\Delta^{1/2}_{\\min}$</span>。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\{8,16,32,64\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2000$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}\\approx 0.022$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{1/2}$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.354$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.125$</span>，差异 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.23$</span> 远大于统计噪声，斜率拟合稳定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-弱阶测量的独立性要求与矩递推\">弱阶测量的独立性要求与矩递推<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-弱阶测量的独立性要求与矩递推\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>与强阶相反，弱阶测量<strong>不能</strong>配对：弱误差是分布层面的差，若配对则测的是路径差而非分布差。代码块中弱阶部分重新抽取了 <code>dW</code>，且 <code>Xe</code>、<code>Xh</code> 与解析矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1^{ex},m_2^{ex}$</span> 独立比较，这是正确的契约。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（Euler 二阶矩的精确递推与弱阶）</strong>：对线性 SDE，Euler 离散满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big(X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}\\big)^2=\\Big((1+\\mu\\Delta)^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta\\Big)\\mathbb E\\big(X^{\\Delta}_n\\big)^2,$$</div>\n从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_N)^2=\\big((1+\\mu\\Delta)^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta\\big)^N$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E X_T^2-\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_N)^2\\Big|=O(\\Delta).$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=X^{\\Delta}_n(1+\\mu\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W_n)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\Delta W_n=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\Delta W_n)^2=\\Delta$</span>，展开平方取期望得递推。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_\\Delta=(1+\\mu\\Delta)^2+\\sigma^2\\Delta=1+(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)\\Delta+\\mu^2\\Delta^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_\\Delta^N=\\exp\\big(N\\log a_\\Delta\\big)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log a_\\Delta=(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)\\Delta+O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\log a_\\Delta=(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T+O(\\Delta)$</span>，指数展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T}\\big(1+O(\\Delta)\\big)$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明 Euler 的二阶矩弱误差确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，与 canonical claim“Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>”吻合；代码中 <code>weakE2</code> 的断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/32$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 量级加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 统计噪声，量级自洽。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（Heun 二阶矩的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 弱误差）</strong>：Heun 离散的二阶矩因子为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_\\Delta=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big(1+\\tfrac12(\\mu+\\mu(1+\\mu\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W))+\\tfrac12(\\sigma+\\sigma(1+\\mu\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W))\\Delta W\\big)^2\\Big],$$</div>\n展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的二阶得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_\\Delta=e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)\\Delta}\\big(1+O(\\Delta^3)\\big)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(X^{\\Delta}_N)^2=e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T}\\big(1+O(\\Delta^2)\\big)$</span>。<strong>证明思路</strong>：把 Heun 更新写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n+1}=X_n\\big(1+A\\Delta+B\\Delta W+C\\Delta^2+D\\Delta\\cdot\\Delta W+E(\\Delta W)^2\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A,B$</span> 与 Euler 相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C,D,E$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_{n+1}$</span> 展开给出；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 取期望用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\Delta W=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\Delta W)^2=\\Delta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\Delta W)^3=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\Delta W)^4=3\\Delta^2$</span>，逐项匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)\\Delta}$</span> 的 Taylor 系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 项系数相消，余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^3)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 是 canonical claim“Heun 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>”在标量线性情形下的具体化；代码中 <code>weakH2</code> 应显著小于 <code>weakE2</code>，但受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}\\approx0.022$</span> 统计噪声限制，两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=32$</span> 时可能同量级，故断言只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 而非严格排序，这是由统计误差而非误差阶决定的容差选择。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-指数积分器的离散结构与代码接口\">指数积分器的离散结构与代码接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-指数积分器的离散结构与代码接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出指数积分器的一般形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}f}\\,x_t+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{\\int_s^{t+\\Delta}f}g\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 视为线性算子（标量情形为乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\int f}$</span> 为矩阵指数。对线性 SDE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mu$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sigma$</span> 均为常数乘子，指数积分器退化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=e^{\\mu\\Delta}X^{\\Delta}_n+\\sigma\\int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}}e^{\\mu(t_{n+1}-s)}\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n随机积分项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{\\mu(t_{n+1}-s)}dW_s$</span> 是高斯变量，均值零、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\Delta e^{2\\mu(\\Delta-s)}ds=\\frac{e^{2\\mu\\Delta}-1}{2\\mu}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\neq0$</span>）。故可精确采样：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\Delta}_{n+1}=e^{\\mu\\Delta}X^{\\Delta}_n+\\sigma\\sqrt{\\frac{e^{2\\mu\\Delta}-1}{2\\mu}}\\;Z_n,\\qquad Z_n\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)\\ \\text{i.i.d.}$$</div>\n<strong>命题 7（线性 SDE 的指数积分器精确性）</strong>：上式给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_N$</span> 与精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T$</span> 同分布，即指数积分器对线性 SDE 的弱误差为零。<strong>证明</strong>：迭代得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\Delta}_N=e^{\\mu T}x_0+\\sigma\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}e^{\\mu(T-t_{n+1})}\\sqrt{\\tfrac{e^{2\\mu\\Delta}-1}{2\\mu}}Z_n$</span>。被加项独立高斯，方差求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\sum_{n}e^{2\\mu(T-t_{n+1})}\\tfrac{e^{2\\mu\\Delta}-1}{2\\mu}=\\sigma^2\\tfrac{e^{2\\mu T}-1}{2\\mu}$</span>（等比求和），恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\sigma\\int_0^T e^{\\mu(T-s)}dW_s\\big)$</span>，而精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=e^{\\mu T}x_0+\\sigma\\int_0^T e^{\\mu(T-s)}dW_s$</span>。两者均为高斯、均值相同、方差相同，故同分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：对线性 SDE，指数积分器不是“近似”而是“精确离散”，其弱阶为无穷（对多项式测试函数），强阶则受随机积分采样方式限制——若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_n$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{\\mu(\\cdot)}dW$</span> 而非精确高斯采样，强阶仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。代码块未实现指数积分器，因其精确性会使斜率拟合退化（误差为零，对数无定义）；这本身是一个边界情形，应在反例节处理，本节只指出接口：指数积分器的代码契约要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的矩阵指数可计算（<code>scipy.linalg.expm</code> 或标量 <code>np.exp</code>），且随机项方差须闭式可得，否则退回 Euler/Heun。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-斜率拟合的有限步长修正\">斜率拟合的有限步长修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-斜率拟合的有限步长修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码用 <code>np.polyfit(np.log(Deltas), np.log(errs), 1)</code> 取斜率，这在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 下含系统偏差。设真实误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(\\Delta)=C\\Delta^\\gamma(1+a\\Delta+o(\\Delta))$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log e(\\Delta)=\\log C+\\gamma\\log\\Delta+a\\Delta+o(\\Delta),$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta$</span> 的斜率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 不趋于零时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma+a\\Delta/\\log\\Delta$</span> 的加权平均，偏差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_{\\max}/|\\log\\Delta_{\\min}|)$</span>。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}=1/8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\min}=1/64$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\Delta_{\\min}|\\approx4.16$</span>，偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.125/4.16\\approx0.03$</span>，远小于容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span>，故斜率断言成立。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 扩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{4,8,16,32\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}=1/4$</span> 使偏差升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.06$</span>，仍在容差内；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 扩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{2,4,8,16\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\max}=1/2$</span> 使 Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 修正不可忽略，斜率会偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span>——这正是“大步长导致分布偏移”在数值测量层面的表现，其完整构造见反例节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（斜率偏差的显式界）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(\\Delta)=C\\Delta^\\gamma(1+a\\Delta)$</span> 且拟合点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=\\Delta_0 2^{-i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=0,\\dots,k-1$</span>，则最小二乘斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat\\gamma-\\gamma|\\le\\frac{|a|\\Delta_0}{\\log 2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sum_i|i-\\bar i|\\,2^{-i}}{\\sum_i(i-\\bar i)^2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的均值。<strong>证明</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log e(\\Delta_i)=\\log C+\\gamma\\log\\Delta_i+a\\Delta_i$</span> 代入最小二乘公式，线性项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\log\\Delta_i$</span> 精确贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，常数项贡献零，剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\Delta_i$</span> 项对斜率的贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta_i$</span> 的回归系数；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta_i=\\log\\Delta_0-i\\log2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=\\Delta_0 2^{-i}$</span>，回归系数即上式右端的组合，取绝对值得上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 把“容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span> 是否合理”变成可计算的问题：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>（由 SDE 系数与离散格式决定）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_0$</span>，可先验估计偏差上界，再决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的取值范围。这是代码节区别于理论节的地方——容差不是拍脑袋，而是由命题 8 的界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 统计噪声共同推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-测量协议的输入输出契约\">测量协议的输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-测量协议的输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把上述内容整理成可复用的测量协议，其输入输出契约如下。<strong>输入</strong>：SDE 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f,g)$</span>、初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、终端时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、步数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{N_j\\}$</span>、路径数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>、随机种子、测试函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varphi_k\\}$</span>、解析矩（若可得）。<strong>输出</strong>：强误差数组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}(N_j)$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J,2)$</span>（Euler/Heun 两列）、弱误差数组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{weak}}(N_j)$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J,K)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个测试函数）、斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma_{\\mathrm{strong}},\\hat\\gamma_{\\mathrm{weak}}$</span>、以及每个断言的通过标记。<strong>约束</strong>：(C1) 强阶必须配对，弱阶必须独立；(C2) 解析矩优先用 <code>sympy</code> 精确计算，禁止硬编码；(C3) 容差由命题 8 的偏差界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 统计噪声取最大值再加安全因子；(C4) 若某测试函数的解析矩不可得，改用两套独立 Monte Carlo（不同种子）之差作弱误差估计，此时容差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M^{-1/2}$</span> 计。</p>\n<p>代码块已实现 (C1)–(C3) 的核心部分：<code>strong_err</code> 内 <code>Xex</code> 与 <code>Xe</code>、<code>Xh</code> 共享 <code>dW</code> 满足 (C1) 强阶侧；弱阶部分重新抽 <code>dW</code> 满足 (C1) 弱阶侧；<code>m1_ex,m2_ex</code> 用 <code>sp.exp</code> 满足 (C2)；斜率容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span> 与弱误差容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-2}$</span> 满足 (C3)。(C4) 未在代码中触发，因线性 SDE 的矩闭式可得，但协议要求保留该分支以备非线性 SDE 使用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（协议的一致性）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，按上述协议得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma_{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma_{\\mathrm{weak}}$</span> 分别以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 收敛到真实强阶与弱阶，收敛速率受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 与命题 8 偏差界共同控制。<strong>证明</strong>：强阶侧由命题 1 与命题 3 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat e_{\\mathrm{strong}}\\to e_{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 几乎必然，再由命题 8 的偏差界得斜率收敛；弱阶侧由强大数律得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathbb E}\\varphi\\to\\mathbb E\\varphi$</span> 几乎必然，两均值之差收敛到弱误差，斜率同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 把本节从“跑一段代码看数字”提升为“有收敛保证的测量协议”，其证明只用了强大数律与命题 8 的代数界，未引入新假设，与前序节的误差累积分析自洽。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-与一致性模型的接口\">与一致性模型的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-与一致性模型的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)$</span>，扩散矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)$</span>，反向时间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=T-t$</span>，得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>，概率流 ODE 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span>，数值采样器步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，以及 Euler/Heun/DPM-Solver 的离散更新算子。本节新引入的符号如下，均在本节内定义并仅在本节使用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一致性映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta:(x_t,t)\\mapsto x_\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 为固定小时间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为可学习参数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 将任意时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的样本映到同一轨迹的早期时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的样本。要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>-Lipschitz，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,\\epsilon)=x$</span>（边界自洽性）。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性损失</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta)$</span>，定义为相邻时刻映射的均方误差。</li>\n<li><strong>采样算子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span>，表示以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 进行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步数值积分得到的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\Delta=T-\\epsilon$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>目标分布</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon$</span>，即前向过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的边缘分布。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性模型采样分布</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x_T,T)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim p_T$</span> 下的推送分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的全局假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)（漂移正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f$</span>-Lipschitz，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>-Hölder 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\|f(0,t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)（扩散正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g$</span>-Lipschitz，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>-Hölder 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|g(0,t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 一致正定，最小特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)（得分正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 存在、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_s$</span>-Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)（一致性映射正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>-Lipschitz，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>-Hölder 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,\\epsilon)=x$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5)（矩条件）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_T}\\|x_T\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\epsilon}\\|x_\\epsilon\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (A1)–(A5) 下陈述；每个命题只引用它实际需要的子集。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-1-一致性映射与数值采样器的范畴区别\">1. 一致性映射与数值采样器的范畴区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-1-一致性映射与数值采样器的范畴区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一致性模型与前序各节的数值积分器属于不同的数学对象，混用会导致错误的收敛阶断言。必须先把区别写成定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（一致性映射）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,T)$</span>。映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[\\epsilon,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 称为<strong>一致性映射</strong>，若：</p>\n<p>(i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[\\epsilon,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>-Lipschitz；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,\\epsilon)=x$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(iii) 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_F$</span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,s\\in[\\epsilon,T]$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_\\theta(x,t)-F_\\theta(x,s)\\|\\le C_F|t-s|^{1/2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（数值采样算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\lfloor (T-\\epsilon)/\\Delta\\rfloor$</span>。数值采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 是复合映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_{\\Delta,n}=\\Phi_{\\Delta}\\circ\\Phi_{\\Delta}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Phi_{\\Delta}\\quad(n\\text{ 次}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta$</span> 为前序节定义的 Euler 或 Heun 单步更新。<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 的输入是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{num}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>区别陈述（命题 1）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 的区别是结构性的，不是精度高低之别：</p>\n<p>(a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 的定义域是连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon,T]$</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 独立取值，不要求满足任何微分方程；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 是有限复合，其每一步由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 与得分决定。</p>\n<p>(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 的误差由映射逼近误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|F_\\theta(x,t)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}(x,t)\\|$</span> 度量，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}(x,t)$</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 出发的前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 时刻的值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 的误差由强/弱收敛阶度量。</p>\n<p>(c) 一致性映射的采样是<strong>单次前向传播</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1$</span> 次调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span>），其计算图深度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\epsilon$</span> 无关；数值采样器的计算图深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的幂律衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐条验证。(a) 由定义 1 与定义 2 直接读出：定义 1 只要求 Lipschitz 与 Hölder，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t F_\\theta=\\mathcal{L}F_\\theta$</span> 或任何 SDE/ODE；定义 2 的每一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta$</span> 由前序节显式给出，复合次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 有限。(b) 两种误差的度量空间不同：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty([\\epsilon,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上的逼近误差，后者是概率分布之间的 Wasserstein 距离或逐点均方误差，且误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的幂次变化。(c) 由定义 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta$</span> 调用；由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 只需一次调用即可从任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的要点是：一致性模型<strong>不是</strong>一个更高阶的积分器，而是一个把整个轨迹的端点映射压缩为单次评估的逼近器。把它的误差当作“阶数”来讨论是范畴错误；正确的接口问题是如何用数值采样器的误差界去约束一致性映射的逼近误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-2-主定理-一致性损失对采样分布的约束\">2. 主定理：一致性损失对采样分布的约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-2-主定理-一致性损失对采样分布的约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心接口是：一致性模型的训练损失（相邻时刻映射的均方误差）如何转化为采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 与目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon$</span> 之间的界。这个界必须显式依赖数值采样器的弱误差，才能与本章前序节的收敛阶衔接。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 1（一致性损失的分布界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 满足定义 1，且存在可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta:[\\epsilon,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_\\theta(x,t)=x+\\int_\\epsilon^t h_\\theta(x,s)\\,ds,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|h_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le H$</span>。定义一致性损失\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[\\epsilon,T]}\\ \\mathbb{E}_{x_t\\sim p_t}\\ \\mathbb{E}_{x_\\epsilon\\sim p_{\\epsilon|t}(\\cdot|x_t)}\\|F_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_\\epsilon\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\epsilon|t}$</span> 为前向过程从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的转移核。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(q_\\theta,p_\\epsilon)\\le \\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta)}+C_F\\,\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[\\epsilon,T]}\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|x_t-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|^2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 出发的前向过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 时刻的值，右端第二项由前向过程的强收敛阶控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步（耦合构造）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim p_T$</span>，沿前向过程反向积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}$</span>；同时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[\\epsilon,T]$</span>，沿同一轨迹取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。构造耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_T,x_t,x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}},F_\\theta(x_T,T))$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-F_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le L_F\\|x_T-x_t\\|+C_F|T-t|^{1/2}.$$</div>\n但更直接地，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,\\epsilon)=x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 的积分表示，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|\\le\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-F_\\theta(x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}},\\epsilon)\\|+\\|x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|.$$</div>\n第二项为零。第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 的积分表示与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,\\epsilon)=\\mathrm{id}$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_\\theta(x_T,T)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}=\\int_\\epsilon^T h_\\theta(x_T,s)\\,ds-\\big(x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}-x_T\\big).$$</div>\n这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}-x_T$</span> 是前向过程从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的增量，其条件期望由漂移与扩散给出。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数并用三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|_{L^2}\\le\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-F_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|_{L^2}+\\|F_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|_{L^2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>第二步（第一项的控制）</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Hölder 性与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 的耦合，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-F_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|_{L^2}\\le L_F\\|x_T-x_t\\|_{L^2}+C_F|T-t|^{1/2}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[\\epsilon,T]$</span> 下对右端取期望，第一项由前向过程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 连续性控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_T-x_t\\|^2\\le C(T-t)$</span>（由 (A1)(A2) 与 Gronwall），故其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((T-t)^{1/2})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_F|T-t|^{1/2}$</span> 同阶。合并记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_F\\mathbb{E}\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}\\|x_T-x_t\\|^2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步（第二项的控制与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 界）</strong> 由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|F_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|F_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_\\epsilon\\|^2=\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta),$$</div>\n其中第二个等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon\\sim p_{\\epsilon|t}(\\cdot|x_t)$</span> 的定义。于是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义（对耦合取下确界）与三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(q_\\theta,p_\\epsilon)\\le\\|F_\\theta(x_T,T)-x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|_{L^2}\\le\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta)}+C_F\\,\\mathbb{E}_{t}\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|x_T-x_t\\|^2}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 1 的接口含义是：一致性损失的平方根给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 误差的一个加项，而另一加项由前向过程的轨迹正则性（即数值采样器所逼近的对象）控制。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}$</span> 变为离散复合的误差，定理 1 的证明结构不变，但第二项变为本章前序节已证的弱收敛阶界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-3-推论-一致性模型与少步采样器的误差可加分解\">3. 推论：一致性模型与少步采样器的误差可加分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-3-推论-一致性模型与少步采样器的误差可加分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（误差可加分解）</strong> 在定理 1 的假设下，若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步数值采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>（即先以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\epsilon^{\\mathrm{num}}$</span>，再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon$</span> 比较），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(S_{\\Delta,n}\\sharp p_T,p_\\epsilon)\\le \\underbrace{W_2(S_{\\Delta,n}\\sharp p_T,q_\\theta)}_{\\text{采样器离散误差}}+\\underbrace{W_2(q_\\theta,p_\\epsilon)}_{\\text{一致性映射逼近误差}}.$$</div>\n右端第一项由本章前序节的弱收敛阶控制：对 Euler 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，对 Heun 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>；第二项由定理 1 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 满足三角不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 是度量）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}\\sharp p_T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon$</span> 三点，直接应用三角不等式。第一项的阶由前序节弱收敛阶命题给出：Euler 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，Heun 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>，在 (A1)–(A3) 下成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 是可检验的恒等式式分解：它把“一致性模型采样”的总误差拆成两个独立来源，二者可以分别测量。这正是一致性模型与数值积分器的正确接口——不是把一致性模型当作积分器，而是把它当作一个与积分器误差可加的逼近器。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-4-具体例子-一维线性情形下的显式计算\">4. 具体例子：一维线性情形下的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-4-具体例子-一维线性情形下的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\alpha x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。前向过程为 OU 过程，其转移核为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\epsilon|t}(x_\\epsilon|x_t)=\\mathcal{N}\\big(x_\\epsilon;\\,e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}x_t,\\ \\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{2\\alpha}(1-e^{-2\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)})\\big).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,t)=e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}x$</span>（即精确的条件均值映射）。验证定理 1 的右端。</p>\n<p><strong>计算</strong> 一致性损失：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}=\\mathbb{E}_{t}\\mathbb{E}_{x_t}\\mathbb{E}_{x_\\epsilon|x_t}\\|e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}x_t-x_\\epsilon\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_t\\ \\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{2\\alpha}(1-e^{-2\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[\\epsilon,T]$</span> 取平均，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}=\\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{2\\alpha}\\big(1-\\tfrac{1-e^{-2\\alpha(T-\\epsilon)}}{2\\alpha(T-\\epsilon)}\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_T-x_t\\|^2$</span> 对 OU 过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{2\\alpha}(1-e^{-2\\alpha(T-t)})$</span>，其平方根对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取平均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{T-\\epsilon})$</span>。由定理 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(q_\\theta,p_\\epsilon)\\le\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}}+C_F\\sqrt{\\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{2\\alpha}}\\,\\mathbb{E}_t\\sqrt{1-e^{-2\\alpha(T-t)}}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\epsilon\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}\\to0$</span>，第二项也 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，界自洽。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\epsilon$</span> 固定而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span>（强混合），<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 退化为零映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}\\to\\sigma^2/(2\\alpha)$</span>，界仍有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明定理 1 的界不是空的：两端都可显式计算，且在小时间极限下退化为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-接口的第二层-一致性映射对数值采样器输出的复合误差\">6. 接口的第二层：一致性映射对数值采样器输出的复合误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-接口的第二层-一致性映射对数值采样器输出的复合误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 1 把采样器误差与一致性映射误差当作两个独立加项处理，但这只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 分别作用于同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 时成立。实际部署中常见的是<strong>复合</strong>：先用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步采样器把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 推到某个中间时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span>，再用一致性映射从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>。此时误差不是简单相加，需要重新界定。本节给出复合误差的显式界，并说明它与前序节弱收敛阶的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（复合采样算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0\\in(\\epsilon,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\lfloor(T-t_0)/\\Delta\\rfloor$</span>。复合采样算子定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{\\Delta,n,\\theta}=F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\circ S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}$</span> 是以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 的数值采样算子（定义 2 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_0,T]$</span> 上的限制）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\Delta,n,\\theta}$</span> 的输出分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta}=C_{\\Delta,n,\\theta}\\sharp p_T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（复合误差界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 与定义 1、定义 3 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>-Lipschitz，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}$</span> 的弱误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}\\sharp p_T,\\,p_{t_0}\\big)\\le E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)$</span> 由前序节给出：Euler 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1\\Delta$</span>，Heun 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2\\Delta^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},\\,p_\\epsilon\\big)\\le L_F\\,E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)+\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}(\\theta)}+C_F\\,\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[t_0,T]}\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|x_t-x_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|^2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}(\\theta)$</span> 为一致性损失在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_0,T]$</span> 上的限制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分两步。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 在 Lipschitz 推送下的收缩）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}\\sharp p_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t_0}$</span> 之间的最优耦合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp\\pi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp p_{t_0}$</span> 之间的一个耦合。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>-Lipschitz 性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp\\pi\\big)^2\\le\\int\\|F_\\theta(x,t_0)-F_\\theta(y,t_0)\\|^2\\,d\\pi(x,y)\\le L_F^2\\int\\|x-y\\|^2\\,d\\pi(x,y)=L_F^2\\,W_2\\big(S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}\\sharp p_T,p_{t_0}\\big)^2.$$</div>\n对耦合取下确界得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},\\,F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp p_{t_0}\\big)\\le L_F\\,E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>第二步（一致性映射自身的逼近误差）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp p_{t_0}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon$</span> 应用定理 1，但把时间区间从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon,T]$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_0,T]$</span>：定理 1 的证明只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,\\epsilon)=x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 的积分表示与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz/Hölder 性，这些在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_0,T]$</span> 上同样成立（定义 1 的 (i)(ii)(iii) 对任意子区间继承）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp p_{t_0},\\,p_\\epsilon\\big)\\le\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}(\\theta)}+C_F\\,\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[t_0,T]}\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|x_t-x_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|^2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>第三步（三角不等式合并）</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},\\,p_\\epsilon\\big)\\le W_2\\big(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},\\,F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp p_{t_0}\\big)+W_2\\big(F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\sharp p_{t_0},\\,p_\\epsilon\\big).$$</div>\n代入第一步与第二步的界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的关键结构是：采样器误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> <strong>放大</strong>而非缩小。这与推论 1 的加性分解不同——推论 1 中两项独立，命题 2 中采样器误差乘上了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>。这解释了为什么一致性模型不能无条件地“修正”粗步长采样器的误差：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span>，粗采样器的误差在映射后可能被放大。接口的正确用法是：先用足够细的采样器把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)$</span> 压到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}}$</span> 同量级，再让一致性映射承担剩余误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-7-可检验恒等式-L_F-的显式估计与接口设计准则\">7. 可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 的显式估计与接口设计准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-7-可检验恒等式-L_F-的显式估计与接口设计准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 是接口设计的核心量。对一致性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 可由其参数化显式估计。本节给出一个可检验的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 与一致性损失联系起来，从而给出接口设计的定量准则。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 与一致性损失的下界关系）</strong> 在 (A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 的算子范数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处有界。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[\\epsilon,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_F\\ge\\sup_{x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(p_t)}\\|\\nabla_x F_\\theta(x,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\ge\\Big(\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|\\nabla_x F_\\theta(x,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^2\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 由一致性损失训练得到且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处等于精确条件均值映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\mathbb{E}[x_\\epsilon|x_t=x]$</span>，其 Jacobian 的算子范数由前向过程转移核的协方差矩阵决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一不等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 的定义（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x F_\\theta$</span> 算子范数的上确界）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_t)$</span> 上的上确界不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 范数直接得到。第二不等式是 Jensen 不等式。第三句：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}=0$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_{\\epsilon|t})$</span> 意义下等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_\\epsilon|x_t=x]$</span>（条件期望是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影，唯一极小元）。其 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\mathbb{E}[x_\\epsilon|x_t=x]$</span>，对 OU 过程即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}I$</span>，算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}\\le1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 给出接口设计准则：<strong>一致性映射的 Lipschitz 常数不应超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span></strong>，否则它会放大采样器误差。在 OU 例 1 中，精确条件均值映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F=e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}\\le1$</span>，满足准则。若训练得到的一致性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span>，则命题 2 的界中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)$</span> 项占主导，此时应优先细化采样器而非依赖一致性映射。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-8-与少步生成接口的定量衔接\">8. 与少步生成接口的定量衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-8-与少步生成接口的定量衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“与少步生成的接口”建立了少步采样器的误差累积公式。本节把该公式与命题 2 衔接，给出端到端的误差预算。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（端到端误差预算）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，设总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\Delta=T-t_0$</span>，且一致性映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_0,T]$</span> 上的损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}(\\theta)$</span>。则端到端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},\\,p_\\epsilon\\big)\\le L_F\\,E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)+\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}(\\theta)}+C_F\\sqrt{T-t_0}\\cdot\\sup_{t\\in[t_0,T]}\\big(\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|x_t-x_{t_0}^{\\mathrm{true}}\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F\\le1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)=C\\Delta^p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 对 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span> 对 Heun），则最优步长满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^\\star=\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}(\\theta)}}{L_F\\,C\\,p}\\Big)^{1/(p-1)}\\quad(p&gt;1),$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>（Euler）误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 线性增长而无内部极小，应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 尽可能小，直到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F C\\Delta$</span> 同量级。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 2 直接得到，其中第三项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{t\\sim\\mathcal{U}[t_0,T]}\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t-x_{t_0}\\|^2}\\le\\sqrt{T-t_0}\\cdot\\sup_t(\\cdot)^{1/2}$</span>（由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与上确界定义）。第二式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;1$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\Delta)=L_FC\\Delta^p+\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}}$</span>，求导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(\\Delta)=L_FCp\\Delta^{p-1}$</span>，令其为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star$</span> 的表达式；但注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span> 上单调递增（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\star$</span> 不是极小点而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与常数项相等的位置——正确的表述是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_FC\\Delta^p=\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}}$</span> 时两项平衡，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\big(\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}}/(L_FC)\\big)^{1/p}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 线性递增，无内部平衡点，只能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 的实用含义：一致性模型的接口不是“用一致性模型替代采样器”，而是“用一致性模型承担采样器无法承担的那部分误差”。当采样器步长已足够细使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_FC\\Delta^p\\ll\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}}$</span> 时，总误差由一致性损失主导；反之由采样器主导。接口设计应使两项同量级，避免任一项成为瓶颈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-9-一个反例边界-L_F-gt-1-时命题-2-的界不可改进\">9. 一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span> 时命题 2 的界不可改进<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-9-一个反例边界-L_F-gt-1-时命题-2-的界不可改进\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的界中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span> 时可能远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)$</span>。这不是技术性松弛，而是本质的：存在一致性映射使复合误差严格大于采样器误差。本节给出构造（完整反例论证归入本章反例节，此处只给出构造骨架与界）。</p>\n<p><strong>构造</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}$</span> 为恒等映射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 极小），<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x,t_0)=2x$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)=0$</span>，但\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},p_\\epsilon\\big)=W_2\\big(\\mathcal{N}(0,4),p_\\epsilon\\big),$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2=\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{4}-1)^2}=1$</span>，而命题 2 的界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F\\cdot0+\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}}+0$</span>。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}$</span> 非零（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 不是条件均值映射），界仍成立但不紧。这说明命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 因子不可去掉：任何只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{num}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}$</span> 的界都必须乘上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span>，否则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span> 时失效。</p>\n<p><strong>边界陈述</strong> 命题 2 的界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F\\le1$</span> 时是紧的（OU 例 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F=e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}&lt;1$</span>，界的两项均可显式计算且同阶）；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span> 时界仍成立但可能不紧，紧界的构造需要额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}$</span> 的联合结构，超出本节范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-10-接口的坐标无关表述\">10. 接口的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-10-接口的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述所有命题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的欧氏坐标下陈述。若前向过程定义在 Riemannian 流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{M},g)$</span> 上（前序节已建立该情形），一致性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta:\\mathcal{M}\\times[\\epsilon,T]\\to\\mathcal{M}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数应改为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_F=\\sup_{t\\in[\\epsilon,T]}\\sup_{x\\neq y}\\frac{d_g(F_\\theta(x,t),F_\\theta(y,t))}{d_g(x,y)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 诱导的测地距离。命题 2 的证明中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_g$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 替换为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_g$</span> 的 Wasserstein 距离，三角不等式与 Lipschitz 收缩论证逐字成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 在度量空间上仍有三角不等式，Lipschitz 推送的收缩性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_g$</span> 的三角不等式保证）。命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x F_\\theta$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 的微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dF_\\theta$</span>，算子范数取关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的算子范数。坐标无关表述的意义是：接口误差界不依赖于参数化，可在流形上直接使用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>一致性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 与数值采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Delta,n}$</span> 是结构不同的对象：前者是连续时间上的单次端点映射，后者是有限复合的离散积分；二者的误差度量与收敛阶不可互换。</li>\n<li>定理 1 在 (A1)–(A5) 下给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(q_\\theta,p_\\epsilon)\\le\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}(\\theta)}+C_F\\,\\mathbb{E}_t\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}\\|x_T-x_t\\|^2}$</span>，把一致性损失与采样分布误差显式连接，第二项由前向过程轨迹正则性控制。</li>\n<li>推论 1 给出可加分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(S_{\\Delta,n}\\sharp p_T,p_\\epsilon)\\le W_2(S_{\\Delta,n}\\sharp p_T,q_\\theta)+W_2(q_\\theta,p_\\epsilon)$</span>，采样器离散误差按本章前序节的弱收敛阶（Euler <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、Heun <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span>）衰减，一致性映射误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}}$</span> 衰减，二者可分别测量、独立优化。</li>\n<li>命题 2 给出复合采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\Delta,n,\\theta}=F_\\theta(\\cdot,t_0)\\circ S_{\\Delta,n}^{(t_0)}$</span> 的误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(q_{\\Delta,n,\\theta},p_\\epsilon)\\le L_F E_{\\mathrm{num}}(\\Delta)+\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}}+C_F\\mathbb{E}_t\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}\\|x_t-x_{t_0}\\|^2}$</span>，其中采样器误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 放大，这与推论 1 的加性分解不同，说明一致性模型不能无条件修正粗步长采样器。</li>\n<li>命题 3 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F\\ge(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla_x F_\\theta\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^2)^{1/2}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 等于条件均值映射、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F\\le1$</span>（OU 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F=e^{-\\alpha(t-\\epsilon)}$</span>）；由此得接口设计准则：一致性映射的 Lipschitz 常数不应超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，否则应优先细化采样器。</li>\n<li>推论 2 给出端到端误差预算与两项平衡条件：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_FC\\Delta^p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{cons}}^{(t_0)}}$</span> 同量级时总误差最小；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span> 的反例构造说明命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F$</span> 因子不可去掉，界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F\\le1$</span> 时紧、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_F&gt;1$</span> 时成立但可能不紧；所有命题可坐标无关地推广到 Riemannian 流形。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df23--h-本章推导链-数值误差的来源\">本章推导链：数值误差的来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-本章推导链-数值误差的来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机过程对象，只对误差分解所需的算子与范数作显式登记。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=T/N$</span>，节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=n\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N$</span>。精确解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_n}$</span>，数值解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_n$</span>。</li>\n<li>正向 SDE 写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动。</li>\n<li>系数正则性假设 <strong>(A1)</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|f(x,t)-f(y,t)\\|\\le L_f\\|x-y\\|,\\qquad \\|g(x,t)-g(y,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le L_g\\|x-y\\|,$$</div>\n并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}(\\|f(0,t)\\|+\\|g(0,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}})&lt;\\infty$</span>。该假设保证 SDE 强解存在唯一且二阶矩有界。</li>\n<li>单步演化算子：精确流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\Delta}$</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta(x,t)=X_{t+\\Delta}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span> 下的条件解；数值单步映射记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span>（Euler、Heun、指数积分器各自具体形式见前序节，本节只引用其已证阶数）。</li>\n<li>强误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n^{\\mathrm{strong}}=\\big(\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_n}-\\bar X_n\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>。弱误差：对检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n^{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\varphi)=\\big|\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_{t_n})-\\mathbb E\\varphi(\\bar X_n)\\big|$</span>。</li>\n<li>局部截断（强）误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n=\\big(\\mathbb E\\|\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_n,t_n)-\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_n,t_n)\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>；局部弱缺陷：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_n(\\varphi)=\\big|\\mathbb E[\\varphi(\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_n,t_n))-\\varphi(\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_n,t_n))]\\big|$</span>。</li>\n<li>全局误差累积算子记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_N$</span>，其定义在第四节给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把全局强/弱误差写成“局部缺陷 × 步数 × 稳定性放大因子”的显式链式不等式，并说明每一步用了哪条分析工具。所有命题均标注假设与证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-1-误差分解恒等式-从单步缺陷到全局误差\">1. 误差分解恒等式：从单步缺陷到全局误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-1-误差分解恒等式-从单步缺陷到全局误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（单步缺陷与传播算子）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n$</span>，定义强单步缺陷 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n(x)$</span> 如上；定义数值传播的 Lipschitz 放大因子\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$K_\\Delta:=\\sup_{x\\neq y}\\frac{\\|\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t_n)-\\Psi_\\Delta(y,t_n)\\|}{\\|x-y\\|}.$$</div>\n对 Euler 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta\\le 1+L_f\\Delta$</span>；对 Heun 与指数积分器，前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta\\le e^{C\\Delta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_f,L_g$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（强误差链式分解）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，且数值单步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_n^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le K_\\Delta^{\\,n}\\,e_0^{\\mathrm{strong}}+\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}K_\\Delta^{\\,n-1-k}\\,\\tau_k.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=X_{t_k}-\\bar X_k$</span>。由精确流与数值映射的定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k+1}=\\Phi_\\Delta(X_{t_k},t_k)-\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)\n=\\big[\\Phi_\\Delta(X_{t_k},t_k)-\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)\\big]+\\big[\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)-\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)\\big].$$</div>\n第一项用精确流的 Lipschitz 性（由 (A1) 与 Gronwall 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_\\Delta(x)-\\Phi_\\Delta(y)\\|\\le e^{C\\Delta}\\|x-y\\|$</span>，见前序强收敛节），第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的实现。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数与三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_{k+1}\\|_{L^2}\\le e^{C\\Delta}\\|\\delta_k\\|_{L^2}+\\tau_k.$$</div>\n递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta=e^{C\\Delta}$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（阶数传递）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_\\tau\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 一致，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta\\le e^{C\\Delta}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le e^{CT}e_0^{\\mathrm{strong}}+C_\\tau\\Delta^{p+1/2}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}e^{C(N-1-k)\\Delta}\\le e^{CT}\\Big(e_0^{\\mathrm{strong}}+\\frac{C_\\tau}{C}\\Delta^{p}\\Big).$$</div>\n故全局强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，与 canonical claim 中 Euler <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span>、Heun <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> 命题 1 分解的是“离散化误差”，不含“分布偏移”与“得分估计误差”。后者分别属于第 10 节与得分动力学章节；本节只处理确定性数值积分引入的误差链，不把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-2-局部缺陷的显式阶-Itô-Taylor-截断\">2. 局部缺陷的显式阶：Itô–Taylor 截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-2-局部缺陷的显式阶-Itô-Taylor-截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Euler 局部强缺陷）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 且有界二阶导。则 Euler 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t)=x+f(x,t)\\Delta+g(x,t)\\Delta W$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_n(x)\\le C\\Delta^{3/2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d,m,T$</span> 与系数的二阶导上界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong> 对精确解作 Itô–Taylor 展开至二阶：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t+\\Delta}=x+f\\Delta+g\\Delta W+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\!\\int_t^{s}L^0 f\\,du\\,ds+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\!\\int_t^{s}L^1 f\\,du\\,dW_s+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\!\\int_t^{s}L^0 g\\,du\\,dW_s+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}\\!\\int_t^{s}L^1 g\\,dW_u\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^0=\\partial_t+f\\cdot\\nabla_x+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla_x^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1=g\\cdot\\nabla_x$</span>。Euler 映射恰好保留前两项。逐项取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数：一重 Itô 积分项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数（因被积函数有界），二重项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>；合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\text{余项}\\|_{L^2}\\le C\\Delta$</span>。但需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的阶匹配：交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\!\\int L^1f\\,du\\,dW_s$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>，双重 Wiener 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\!\\int L^1g\\,dW_u\\,dW_s$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\le C\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（Heun 局部强缺陷）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，Heun 映射（预测–校正）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n(x)\\le C\\Delta^{2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> Heun 的校正步等价于对 Stratonovich 型积分作梯形近似；其 Itô–Taylor 余项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{3/2}$</span> 项被校正项抵消，剩余主导项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 阶的双重 Wiener 积分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^2$</span> 阶的漂移积分。逐项估计同命题 2，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\le C\\Delta^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（canonical 阶数自洽）</strong> 将命题 2、3 代入推论 1：Euler 得全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，Heun 得全局强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与本章 canonical claims 一致。弱阶由下一节给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-3-弱误差链-检验函数下的偏差传播\">3. 弱误差链：检验函数下的偏差传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-3-弱误差链-检验函数下的偏差传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（弱误差链式分解）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且数值映射的弱传播满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_x|\\mathbb E[\\varphi(\\Psi_\\Delta(x,t))]-\\varphi(x)|\\le C_\\varphi\\Delta$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N^{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\varphi)\\le e^{CT}e_0^{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\varphi)+\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}e^{C(N-1-k)\\Delta}\\rho_k(\\varphi).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k(x)=\\mathbb E[\\varphi(X_{t_k})|X_{t_k}=x]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N-1$</span> 递推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{k+1}(\\Phi_\\Delta(x,t_k))=u_k(x)$</span>（流性质）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{k+1}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span> 与 (A1) 的 Gronwall 估计），逐项作三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_{t_N})-\\mathbb E\\varphi(\\bar X_N)\\big|\\le \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\big|\\mathbb E[u_{k+1}(\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k))]-\\mathbb E[u_{k+1}(\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k))]\\big|+\\text{初值项}.$$</div>\n每项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k(\\varphi)$</span> 控制，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{k+1}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{C\\Delta}$</span>。递推即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（弱阶传递）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k(\\varphi)\\le C_\\varphi\\Delta^{q+1}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N^{\\mathrm{weak}}\\le e^{CT}(e_0^{\\mathrm{weak}}+C_\\varphi\\Delta^{q}/C)$</span>。Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k=O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 给出弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；Heun 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k=O(\\Delta^3)$</span> 给出弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，与 canonical claims 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>注（禁止把目标值相等当成梯度相等）</strong> 弱误差只约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\varphi$</span> 的偏差，不约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\mathbb E\\varphi$</span> 的偏差。若下游需要得分估计，必须另设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^3$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 重复命题 4，不能由弱阶直接推出得分误差阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-4-指数积分器的误差结构\">4. 指数积分器的误差结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-4-指数积分器的误差结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（指数积分器单步恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=A x$</span> 为常矩阵、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 满足 (A1)，则指数积分器\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t+\\Delta}=e^{A\\Delta}x_t+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{A(t+\\Delta-s)}g(x_s,s)\\,dW_s$$</div>\n的强局部缺陷满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\le C\\Delta^{3/2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong> 对精确解用常数变易法：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t+\\Delta}=e^{A\\Delta}x+\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{A(t+\\Delta-s)}g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n数值格式将积分项中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_s,s)$</span> 冻结为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)$</span> 并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{A(t+\\Delta-s)}dW_s$</span> 的近似。两者之差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_t^{t+\\Delta}e^{A(t+\\Delta-s)}\\big[g(X_s,s)-g(x,t)\\big]dW_s.$$</div>\n由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_s-x\\|_{L^2}\\le C\\Delta^{1/2}$</span>（漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>、扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>），被积函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{1/2})$</span>，积分区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\le C\\Delta$</span>。更精细地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_s,s)-g(x,t)$</span> 的均方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（DPM-Solver 的误差来源）</strong> DPM-Solver 将扩散模型的反向 SDE 化为半线性形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx=[f(x,t)+g(t)\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)]dt$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 作指数积分、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 作多步 Taylor 展开，其局部缺陷由两部分组成：(i) 指数积分对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的精确处理消除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的刚性导致的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 项；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 Taylor 截断给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{k+1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 为展开阶。故 DPM-Solver 的阶数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的光滑性与展开阶共同决定，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数单独决定。此即“指数积分结构”的误差来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-5-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的阶数验证\">5. 具体例子：一维 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的阶数验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-5-具体例子-一维-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的阶数验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\lambda x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=x_0e^{-\\lambda T}+\\sigma\\int_0^T e^{-\\lambda(T-s)}dW_s$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_T=x_0e^{-\\lambda T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_T)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda T})$</span>。</p>\n<p>Euler 格式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{n+1}=\\bar X_n-\\lambda\\bar X_n\\Delta+\\sigma\\Delta W_n=(1-\\lambda\\Delta)\\bar X_n+\\sigma\\Delta W_n$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\bar X_N=(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^Nx_0$</span>，与精确值之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^N-e^{-\\lambda T}|x_0=O(\\Delta)$</span>，验证弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\Delta\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^{2k}=\\frac{\\sigma^2\\Delta(1-(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^{2N})}{1-(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^2}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\lambda}(1-e^{-2\\lambda T})+O(\\Delta)$</span>，同样验证弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p>强误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\bar X_N-X_T)^2$</span> 的主导项来自离散 Wiener 积分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 逼近误差，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，故强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。此例可直接数值测量（见代码节），并作为命题 2、推论 2 的可检验实例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-6-误差来源的分类与本节推导链的闭合\">6. 误差来源的分类与本节推导链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-6-误差来源的分类与本节推导链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1–5，本章数值误差的来源可归为四类，且每类在前序节均有对应处理：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>截断误差</strong>：单步缺陷 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n,\\rho_n$</span>，由 Itô–Taylor 展开的余项阶决定（命题 2、3、5）。它只依赖系数的光滑性与格式的展开阶。</li>\n<li><strong>传播放大</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta^n$</span> 因子，由系数的 Lipschitz 常数与步数决定（命题 1、4）。它解释了为何局部高阶不自动给出全局高阶——需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta=T$</span> 固定。</li>\n<li><strong>刚性误差</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的特征值实部绝对值远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\Delta$</span> 时，显式 Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta$</span> 可能 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span> 甚至发散；指数积分器通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A\\Delta}$</span> 精确处理线性部分消除此项（命题 5 与推论 4）。</li>\n<li><strong>分布偏移</strong>：大步长下数值解的 invariant measure 与精确解不同，此非截断误差，不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\to0$</span> 推出，须由第 10 节的反例节单独处理；本节不展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>全局强/弱误差由命题 1、4 的链式不等式严格分解为“初值误差 + 局部缺陷的加权和”，权为数值传播的 Lipschitz 放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta^{n}$</span>；由此局部阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+1/2$</span>（强）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q+1$</span>（弱）传递为全局阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，与 Euler 强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、Heun 强 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 弱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的 canonical claims 自洽。</li>\n<li>指数积分器的误差结构由命题 5 给出：线性部分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{A\\Delta}$</span> 精确积分，剩余误差只来自扩散项系数的冻结近似，阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{3/2})$</span>；DPM-Solver 的阶数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 Taylor 展开阶与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的光滑性共同决定，而非由漂移的刚性单独决定。</li>\n<li>本节明确区分了截断误差、传播放大、刚性与分布偏移四类来源；弱误差只约束检验函数的期望偏差，不约束其梯度，故不能由弱阶直接推出得分误差阶，下游得分估计须另设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^3$</span> 检验函数并重复命题 4 的论证。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef ou_exact(x0, lam, sigma, T, n_paths, rng):\n    # Exact OU: X_T = x0 e^{-lam T} + sigma * integral_0^T e^{-lam(T-s)} dW_s\n    # Variance of the stochastic integral: sigma^2/(2 lam) (1 - e^{-2 lam T})\n    mean = x0 * np.exp(-lam * T)\n    var = sigma**2 / (2 * lam) * (1 - np.exp(-2 * lam * T))\n    return mean + np.sqrt(var) * rng.standard_normal(n_paths)\n\ndef euler_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, N, n_paths, rng):\n    dt = T / N\n    x = np.full(n_paths, x0, dtype=float)\n    for _ in range(N):\n        dW = np.sqrt(dt) * rng.standard_normal(n_paths)\n        x = x - lam * x * dt + sigma * dW\n    return x\n\ndef heun_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, N, n_paths, rng):\n    dt = T / N\n    x = np.full(n_paths, x0, dtype=float)\n    for _ in range(N):\n        dW = np.sqrt(dt) * rng.standard_normal(n_paths)\n        # predictor (Euler)\n        x_pred = x - lam * x * dt + sigma * dW\n        # corrector: average drift at x and x_pred; diffusion frozen at x (Itô)\n        x = x - 0.5 * lam * (x + x_pred) * dt + sigma * dW\n    return x\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nx0, lam, sigma, T = 1.0, 1.0, 0.5, 1.0\nn_paths = 200_000\n\n# weak error: compare E[X_T] for Euler and Heun at two step sizes\nfor N in [10, 40]:\n    e_mean = euler_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, N, n_paths, rng).mean()\n    h_mean = heun_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, N, n_paths, rng).mean()\n    exact_mean = x0 * np.exp(-lam * T)\n    print(f&quot;N={N}: Euler mean err={abs(e_mean-exact_mean):.6f}, Heun mean err={abs(h_mean-exact_mean):.6f}&quot;)\n\n# strong error: L2 distance between numerical and exact at same Brownian path is\n# not directly available here; instead check variance convergence (weak order 1)\nfor N in [10, 40]:\n    e_var = euler_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, N, n_paths, rng).var()\n    h_var = heun_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, N, n_paths, rng).var()\n    exact_var = sigma**2 / (2 * lam) * (1 - np.exp(-2 * lam * T))\n    print(f&quot;N={N}: Euler var err={abs(e_var-exact_var):.6f}, Heun var err={abs(h_var-exact_var):.6f}&quot;)\n\n# assertions: weak order 1 means error roughly halves when N quadruples (dt/4)\n# Euler mean error at N=10 vs N=40 should be ~4x smaller\nerr_N10 = abs(euler_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, 10, n_paths, rng).mean() - x0*np.exp(-lam*T))\nerr_N40 = abs(euler_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, 40, n_paths, rng).mean() - x0*np.exp(-lam*T))\nassert err_N10 &gt; err_N40, &quot;Euler weak error should decrease with smaller step&quot;\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, euler_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, 10, 5, rng).shape, heun_ou(x0, lam, sigma, T, 10, 5, rng).shape)\nprint(&quot;expected: (5,) (5,)&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-7-强误差的路径级实现-耦合与同步采样\">7. 强误差的路径级实现：耦合与同步采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-7-强误差的路径级实现-耦合与同步采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 给出的链式分解是期望意义下的不等式，它没有说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 如何在同一条布朗路径上与精确解耦合。若数值实验要在同一路径上测量强误差，必须显式构造耦合，否则测得的“强误差”只是两个边缘分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离，而非路径级误差。本节补足这一构造，并给出它与命题 1 的一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（同步耦合）</strong> 设精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 与数值解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_n$</span> 定义在同一概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span>、同一布朗运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 上。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_\\Delta,\\Psi_\\Delta)$</span> 为<strong>同步耦合</strong>，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{n+1}=\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_n,t_n;W_{t_n\\to t_{n+1}})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{n+1}}=\\Phi_\\Delta(X_{t_n},t_n;W_{t_n\\to t_{n+1}})$</span> 使用同一段布朗增量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（同步耦合下强误差的可测上界）</strong> 在 (A1) 与命题 1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_\\Delta,\\Psi_\\Delta)$</span> 为同步耦合，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_n\\|^2\\le 2e^{2CT}\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_0\\|^2+2\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}e^{2C(n-1-k)\\Delta}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\tau_k^{\\mathrm{path}}\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^{\\mathrm{path}}=\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)-\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)$</span> 是同一布朗增量下的路径级缺陷。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 与命题 1 相同的递推，但全程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 内进行，不取条件期望。关键步骤是：同步耦合保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)$</span> 的差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^{\\mathrm{path}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\Delta(X_{t_k},t_k)-\\Phi_\\Delta(\\bar X_k,t_k)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数由精确流的 Lipschitz 性控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{C\\Delta}\\|\\delta_k\\|_{L^2}$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span> 展开并递推即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与命题 1 的区别）</strong> 命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 是条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数，命题 6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^{\\mathrm{path}}$</span> 是联合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数；后者一般不小于前者，因为路径级缺陷包含了布朗增量的随机性。数值测量强阶时必须用命题 6 的耦合，否则测得的收敛阶会被边缘化稀释。代码节中的 <code>euler_ou</code> 与 <code>heun_ou</code> 各自独立采样布朗增量，因此只能测弱阶；若需测强阶，须改写为共享 <code>dW</code> 数组的版本。这是本节对前序代码节的一个明确接口约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-8-误差累积的乘性结构-为何局部高阶不等于全局高阶\">8. 误差累积的乘性结构：为何局部高阶不等于全局高阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-8-误差累积的乘性结构-为何局部高阶不等于全局高阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与推论 1 已给出阶数传递，但传递依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta^n$</span> 的有界性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta&gt;e^{C\\Delta}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增长，则局部高阶会被指数放大吞没。本节把这一现象写成显式判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（稳定性判据）</strong> 设局部强缺陷满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le C_\\tau\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span>，传播因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta=1+\\kappa\\Delta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 无关。则全局强误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le e^{\\kappa T}e_0^{\\mathrm{strong}}+\\frac{C_\\tau}{\\kappa}\\big(e^{\\kappa T}-1\\big)\\Delta^{p}.$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa T\\le 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le e\\,e_0^{\\mathrm{strong}}+2C_\\tau T\\Delta^{p}$</span>，阶数不被放大因子吞没。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta^{n-1-k}=(1+\\kappa\\Delta)^{n-1-k}\\le e^{\\kappa(n-1-k)\\Delta}$</span>。对几何和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}e^{\\kappa(n-1-k)\\Delta}$</span> 用等比求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=0}^{n-1}e^{\\kappa j\\Delta}=\\frac{e^{\\kappa n\\Delta}-1}{e^{\\kappa\\Delta}-1}\\le\\frac{e^{\\kappa T}-1}{\\kappa\\Delta}.$$</div>\n乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau\\Delta^{p+1/2}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau\\Delta^{p}(e^{\\kappa T}-1)/\\kappa$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（大步长的失效边界）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\Delta&gt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_\\Delta^n$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 指数增长，局部缺陷再小也无法保证全局收敛。对 Euler 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\lambda x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\lambda$</span>，故稳定条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\Delta&lt;2$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\Delta\\ge2$</span> 时数值解发散，这与第 10 节的反例节一致，本节只给出判据，不重复反例构造。</p>\n<p><strong>注（与 DPM-Solver 步长选择的关系）</strong> 前序步长选择节给出的启发式“步长随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 反比缩小”在本判据下获得严格解释：只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\Delta$</span> 保持在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 以下，局部阶才能传递为全局阶。DPM-Solver 通过指数积分把刚性部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 中移除（命题 5），故其允许的步长上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 决定，这是少步生成可行的数学原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-9-弱误差的可检验恒等式-特征函数判据\">9. 弱误差的可检验恒等式：特征函数判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-9-弱误差的可检验恒等式-特征函数判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱阶的测量在实践中常被简化为“均值与方差收敛”，但均值与方差只覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> 两个检验函数，不足以断言弱阶。本节给出一个覆盖全族的恒等式，使弱阶可在数值上被逐点检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（特征函数弱误差恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\xi(x)=e^{i\\langle\\xi,x\\rangle}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,X_{t_n}\\rangle}-\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,\\bar X_n\\rangle}\\big|\\le e^{CT}\\big|\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,X_0\\rangle}-\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,\\bar X_0\\rangle}\\big|+\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}e^{C(n-1-k)\\Delta}\\rho_k(\\varphi_\\xi),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k(\\varphi_\\xi)\\le C_\\xi\\Delta^{q+1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\xi$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\xi\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\xi$</span> 的二阶导上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\xi\\in C_b^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^2\\varphi_\\xi\\|=\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span>，故命题 4 直接适用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k(\\varphi_\\xi)$</span> 的阶由命题 4 的局部弱缺陷估计给出，常数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 的依赖通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span> 显式写出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（弱阶的逐点检验）</strong> 若对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k(\\varphi_\\xi)\\le C_\\xi\\Delta^{q+1}$</span>，则特征函数之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^q)$</span>。由于特征函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varphi_\\xi\\}_{\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^d}$</span> 分离概率测度（Lévy 连续性定理），弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 可由特征函数的逐点收敛速率检验，而不必枚举所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^2$</span> 函数。数值上，固定一组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 并测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,\\bar X_N\\rangle}-\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,X_T\\rangle}|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的衰减率，即得弱阶的下界估计。</p>\n<p><strong>注（与得分估计的接口）</strong> 特征函数判据只检验分布，不检验得分。若下游需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 的误差，须对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\xi$</span> 的梯度版本重复命题 8，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 的选取需覆盖得分估计的工作点；这属于得分动力学章节的接口，本节只登记该约束，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-10-一个可检验的恒等式-Euler-弱误差的一阶展开\">10. 一个可检验的恒等式：Euler 弱误差的一阶展开<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-10-一个可检验的恒等式-Euler-弱误差的一阶展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使推论 3 的阶数在具体格式上可被独立验证，本节给出 Euler 弱误差的一阶展开恒等式。它不依赖 Itô–Taylor 的一般余项估计，而是直接对 OU 过程算出主导项系数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（Euler 弱误差主导项）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\lambda x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sigma$</span> 常数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span> 确定，Euler 格式的弱误差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^3$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\varphi(\\bar X_N)-\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_T)=\\Delta\\cdot\\frac{\\lambda^2 x_0^2 e^{-2\\lambda T}}{2}\\varphi''(x_0e^{-\\lambda T})+O(\\Delta^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^2)$</span> 的常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varphi'''\\|_\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong> Euler 递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_{n+1}=(1-\\lambda\\Delta)\\bar X_n+\\sigma\\Delta W_n$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\bar X_N=(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^Nx_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\bar X_N)=\\frac{\\sigma^2\\Delta(1-(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^{2N})}{1-(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^2}$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda\\Delta)^N=e^{-\\lambda T}(1-\\frac{\\lambda^2T\\Delta}{2}+O(\\Delta^2))$</span>，得均值偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\lambda^2x_0Te^{-\\lambda T}}{2}\\Delta$</span>；方差偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 但系数与均值偏差不同。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 作三阶 Taylor 展开，一阶项被均值偏差占据，二阶项被方差偏差占据；合并后主导项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\lambda^2x_0^2e^{-2\\lambda T}}{2}\\varphi''(x_0e^{-\\lambda T})\\Delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（恒等式的数值可检验性）</strong> 命题 9 给出一个显式系数，可在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=x^2$</span> 时直接计算：主导项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^2x_0^2e^{-2\\lambda T}\\Delta$</span>。数值上测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\bar X_N^2-\\mathbb E X_T^2$</span> 并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，应趋于该系数。这比“误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 减小”的定性断言更强，因为它固定了常数。</p>\n<p><strong>注（与命题 8 的一致性）</strong> 命题 9 是命题 8 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\xi$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 小量时的局部化版本：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi''$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span> 的系数。两者不矛盾，命题 9 只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\xi$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\xi\\|^2$</span> 换成了具体的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi''$</span> 值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df23--h-11-误差来源之间的不可交换性\">11. 误差来源之间的不可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df23--h-11-误差来源之间的不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后登记一个结构性事实：截断误差、传播放大与分布偏移三者不能通过简单相加得到总误差，因为它们的控制范数不同。这一事实决定了本章后续节（自适应步长、与少步生成的接口）必须分别处理三类误差，而不能用一个标量“总误差”概括。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（范数不可交换性）</strong> 存在 (A1) 下的 SDE 与数值格式，使得强误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N^{\\mathrm{strong}}\\to0$</span> 而弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_N^{\\mathrm{weak}}(\\varphi)$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_b^2$</span> 不趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；反之亦然。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（构造思路）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T\\sim N(0,T)$</span>。Euler 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_N=\\sum\\Delta W_n$</span> 精确，强误差与弱误差均为零。若改用“每步将布朗增量替换为其绝对值”的格式，则强误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>（路径级偏离），但弱误差对偶函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为零（分布对称性保持）。反之，取一个保持边缘分布但打乱路径顺序的格式，弱误差为零而强误差非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（对本章推导链的含义）</strong> 命题 10 说明命题 1 与命题 4 是两条独立的链，不能互相推出。第 10 节的反例节处理的是分布偏移，它既不是截断误差也不是传播放大，而是数值格式的 invariant measure 与精确解不同；本节只登记这一分类，不重复反例构造。自适应步长节须同时监控 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span>（强链）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_n$</span>（弱链），因为二者可以独立失效。</p>", "cjk": 57376, "missing": []};
